17-5-inch-heavy-duty-square-umbrella-base-stand-of-30-lbs-for-outdoor,17.5 Inch Heavy Duty Square Umbrella Base Stand of 30 lbs for Outdoor,14259067,https://www.costway.com/17-5-inch-heavy-duty-square-umbrella-base-stand-of-30-lbs-for-outdoor.html?fee=152&fep=145&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This 17.5" heavy-duty round umbrella base is ideal for holding your beloved umbrella to beautify your surrounding environment.</p> <p> </p> <p>This is our 17.5" square umbrella base  which is ideal for holding your umbrella securely and evenly in place. It is a really practical addition to your backyard or your patio area. Includes a coupler to allow it to fit 38mm to 48mm (by removing the adapter) in diameter umbrella poles. Includes a hand-turn knob for securing the umbrella to the base.</p> <p> </p> <p>Don't hesitate to add this user base to your cart.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Brand new and good quality.</li> <li>Holding your umbrella securely and evenly in place</li> <li>Beautiful decorative pattern and bronze finish</li> <li>Steel upright and resin base construction</li> <li>Rust-resistant for long life-time</li> <li>Simple assembly required</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>●<strong> Classic Round Base:</strong> 17.5" square umbrella base is suitable for most outdoor umbrellas. Such a classic will never be out of time. Square decorative pattern plus bronze finish make your sun umbrellas much more attractive.<br />● <strong>Great Stability:</strong> The updated base is in particular designed to have two parts: steel umbrella holder and resin base. This construction is known for better stability. Further  prevent your umbrellas from falling down.<br />● <strong>Pole Adjustable in Diameter: </strong>The pole of this patio umbrella stand is adjustable in diameter from φ1.5" - 1.9". Plenty of umbrellas of various sizes can match our base. Much convenient.<br />● <strong>Highly Durability: </strong>This umbrella base is made of premium quality material to reinforce its structure. A high-density resin base is good at keeping shape  not easy to be chipped off or broken. It can hold your beautiful umbrellas well.<br />●<strong> Outdoor Use:</strong> The umbrella base can be used on plenty of occasions. Pretty practical and essential to sun umbrella. Our umbrella base will be a good companion for the garden  patio  terrace  balcony  barbecue bar  western restaurant  beauty salon  and so on.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Bronze</li> <li>Material: Steel upright and resin base</li> <li>Overall size: 17.5" x 17.5" x 13(L x W x H)</li> <li>Steel upright size: Φ57mm and 10" height</li> <li>Weight: 30 lbs</li> <li></li> <li>Package size: 23" x 20" x 5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x 17.5" square umbrella base</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Outdoor Umbrella Bases,,Overall size:17.5" x 17.5" x 13(L x W x H); Steel upright size:Φ57mm and 10" height; Package size:23" x 20" x 5" (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Umbrella Bases,,,Bronze,OP2263,shopify,481,1,deny,manual,42.99,70.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/2/_2_90_12.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/1/_1_79_17.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/i/file_188_15.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_3_15.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/i/file_187_21.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/3/_3_38_26.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_3_15.jpg,