: Black</li> <li>Material of heat unit: Stainless steel</li> <li>Package Size: 25" x 21" x 17"</li> <li>Height adjustable range: 49"-63"</li> <li>Owner manual included</li> <li>Caution:</li> <li>Please read the manual thoroughly before using the unit. vPlease retain this manual for future reference.</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Health & Beauty > Massage & Relaxation > Spa & Salon,,Package Size:25" x 21" x 17"; ,Spa & Salon,,,,HB80504-110V,shopify,108,1,deny,manual,115.99,115.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/a/Salon_Standing_Hair__1774236297952167_474340.jpeg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/a/Salon_Standing_Hair__1774236298853951_987558.jpeg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/a/Salon_Standing_Hair__1774236297055406_562159.jpeg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/z/2/z22.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/a/Salon_Standing_Hair__1774236304151160_221153.jpeg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/z/1/z11.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/z/3/z33.jpg,7
overbed-rolling-food-tray-table,Overbed Rolling Food Tray Table,10849675,https://www.costway.com/over-bed-food-tray-small-rolling-computer-table.html?piid=9229100&fee=152&fep=399&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● 20.5" x 13" spacious surface accommodates laptops and meals<br>● Adjustable height (27”MIN  44”MAX) for all ideas<br>● 360° rotating tabletop enables multi-directional access<br>● 2-way 180° tabletop angle for reading  writing and dining<br>● Low  wheeled base slides under sofas or beds<br>● 4 locking wheels provide mobility and stability<br>● Anti-slip edge strip secures items in place<br>● Safety rounded corners to keep users safe from bumps<br>● Under-table hook for hanging personal items<br>● Space-saving design by setting the tabletop at vertical position<br>● Ideal for home use  medical care  and also educational settings<br>● Low-maintenance tabletop wipes clean easily with a wet cloth<br>● Assembly needed</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>●<strong> Customizable for Your Needs: </strong>This overbed table features a substantial 20.5" x 13" surface. Its height adjust from 27” to 44”  catering to various needs whether you are sitting or standing. The tabletop rotates a full 360°  allowing it to fit both the left and right sides of the bed.</p> <p>● <strong>Space-saving Rotating Top: </strong>The tabletop of this mobile standing desk also tilts up to 180° in both directions to accommodate different activities. When not in use  it can be positioned vertically for easy storage beside a furniture or in room corners.</p> <p><strong>● Rolling-under Design: </strong>Equipped with a low-height wheeled base  the medical table rolls smoothly under sofas and beds. All 4 wheels include a locking device  ensuring the table locks firmly in place  providing a stable and reliable workspace or dining area.</p> <p><strong>● User-friendly Details: </strong>The side table is designed with safety in mind  featuring an anti-skid barrier strip to prevent items from slipping  and safe rounded corners to prevent accidental bumps. Plus  it includes a built-in hook under the tabletop for hanging extra items.</p> <p><strong>● Multi-Scene Applications:</strong> Ideal for a variety of settings  this overbed table can be used in the living room  home office  during hospital stays  or for home-based care. It doubles as a standing lectern  making it a great fit for classrooms and lecture rooms</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><table> <tbody> <tr> <td>Color</td> <td>Brown + Black/Gray + Black</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Material</td> <td>Metal + MDF</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Overall Dimension</td> <td>20.5" x 13" x 27"-44" (L x W x H)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Weight Capacity</td> <td>33 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Net Weight</td> <td>9 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Box Qty</td> <td>1(May vary by batch)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Package Includes</td> <td>1 x Overbed Table</td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td>1 x User Guide</td> </tr> </tbody> </table>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Laptop Tables & Printer Stands,,Overall Dimension:20.5" x 13" x 27"-44" (L x W x H); ,Laptop Tables & Printer Stands,Clearance,,Natural,HW66937NA,shopify,420,1,deny,manual,42.99,42.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/v/Overbed_Rolling_Food_1758606362315308_560060.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/v/Overbed_Rolling_Food_1758606363127916_995397.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/v/Overbed_Rolling_Food_1758606363831731_573576.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/v/Overbed_Rolling_Food_1758606364480767_418595.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/v/Overbed_Rolling_Food_1758606361622770_174241.jpg,5