hd-3-step-ladder-platform-lightweight-folding-stool,Folding 3-Step Ladder with Handgrip and Anti-Slip Platform,27083451,https://www.costway.com/hd-3-step-ladder-platform-lightweight-folding-stool.html?fee=152&fep=689&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<ul> <li>● Easy to fold for space-saving storage</li> <li>● The stable triangular structure prevents tipping over</li> <li>● Solid rivet reinforcement for enhanced sturdiness</li> <li>● Lightweight design  and easy to carry without much effort</li> <li>● Thickened iron tubes  durable  sturdy  and not easy to deform</li> <li>● Anti-Slip tread and foot pads help you step on the ladder with maximum security</li> <li>● Suitable for the home or office to clean the window  reach high cabinet and more</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Foldable and Lightweight Design:</strong> It is fairly easy to either fold or unfold the ladder with less required effort. In this way  you are capable of storing the folded ladder in a corner without occupying much space. Still be lightweight enough for easy carrying from one place to another  bringing much more convenience.<br /><strong>● Thickened Anti-Slip Steps:</strong> Convex pattern on each step shall prevent slipping when you step on it. The platform is also wide enough so that anyone can stand on it safely. And anti-slip foot pads increasing the friction with ground will extremely avoid tipping over  preventing floor scratching as well.<br /><strong>● Stable Structure with Solid Connection:</strong> Delicately crafted with thickened iron material  the 3-step ladder ensures a maximum load capacity up to 150 kg. Stable triangular structure keeps it steady all the time. And sturdy rivet reinforcement ensures solid connection for enhanced reliability.<br /><strong>● Superior Practicality and Great Versatility:</strong> The 3-tread heavy-duty ladder can be a practical helper in daily life  served in various occasions such as kitchen  garage an