gray-overbed-rolling-table-food-tray,Gray Overbed Rolling Table Food Tray,10849675,https://www.costway.com/over-bed-food-tray-small-rolling-computer-table.html?piid=9224700&fee=152&fep=1650&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● 20.5" x 13" spacious surface accommodates laptops and meals<br>● Adjustable height (27”MIN  44”MAX) for all ideas<br>● 360° rotating tabletop enables multi-directional access<br>● 2-way 180° tabletop angle for reading  writing and dining<br>● Low  wheeled base slides under sofas or beds<br>● 4 locking wheels provide mobility and stability<br>● Anti-slip edge strip secures items in place<br>● Safety rounded corners to keep users safe from bumps<br>● Under-table hook for hanging personal items<br>● Space-saving design by setting the tabletop at vertical position<br>● Ideal for home use  medical care  and also educational settings<br>● Low-maintenance tabletop wipes clean easily with a wet cloth<br>● Assembly needed</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>●<strong> Customizable for Your Needs: </strong>This overbed table features a substantial 20.5" x 13" surface. Its height adjust from 27” to 44”  catering to various needs whether you are sitting or standing. The tabletop rotates a full 360°  allowing it to fit both the left and right sides of the bed.</p> <p>● <strong>Space-saving Rotating Top: </strong>The tabletop of this mobile standing desk also tilts up to 180° in both directions to accommodate different activities. When not in use  it can be positioned vertically for easy storage beside a furniture or in room corners.</p> <p><strong>● Rolling-under Design: </strong>Equipped with a low-height wheeled base  the medical table rolls smoothly under sofas and beds. All 4 wheels include a locking device  ensuring the table locks firmly in place  providing a stable and reliable workspace or dining area.</p> <p><strong>● User-friendly Details: </strong>The side table is designed with safety in mind  featuring an anti-skid barrier strip to prevent items from slipping  and safe rounded corners to prevent accidental bumps. Plus  it includes a built-in hook under the tabletop for hanging extra items.</p> <p><strong>● Multi-Scene Applications:</strong> Ideal for a variety of settings  this overbed table can be used in the living room  home office  during hospital stays  or for home-based care. It doubles as a standing lectern  making it a great fit for classrooms and lecture rooms</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><table> <tbody> <tr> <td>Color</td> <td>Brown + Black/Gray + Black</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Material</td> <td>Metal + MDF</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Overall Dimension</td> <td>20.5" x 13" x 27"-44" (L x W x H)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Weight Capacity</td> <td>33 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Net Weight</td> <td>9 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Box Qty</td> <td>1(May vary by batch)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Package Includes</td> <td>1 x Overbed Table</td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td>1 x User Guide</td> </tr> </tbody> </table>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Laptop Tables & Printer Stands,,Overall Dimension:20.5" x 13" x 27"-44" (L x W x H); ,Laptop Tables & Printer Stands,Clearance,,Gray,HW66937GR,shopify,147,1,deny,manual,39.99,42.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/r/Gray_Overbed_Rolling_1758606553964943_321631.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/r/Gray_Overbed_Rolling_1758606554780866_165060.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/r/Gray_Overbed_Rolling_1758606555628935_836209.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/r/Gray_Overbed_Rolling_1758606556285752_373756.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/r/Gray_Overbed_Rolling_1758606553267274_1379