fireplace-fence-baby-safety-fence,115 Inch Length 5 Panel Adjustable Wide Fireplace Fence-Black,61402738,https://www.costway.com/115-inch-length-5-panel-adjustable-wide-fireplace-fence.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=1706&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This 5-panel metal fence can be used as a playpen for your toddlers or pets  a baby gate between rooms  or a safety barrier to section off areas.</p> <p> </p> <p>Crafted from heavy-duty steel with exclusive finish  this gate has sturdy and durable structure for long time service. Designed with a walk-through door with safety lock  it provides ultimate security and easy to open with one hand. It has 5 panels that can be made into any shape you want. This multifunctional gate is perfect for any indoor environment  such as doorway  hallway and grills. You can set it freely on floor or mounted to the wall in order to create space where the baby or pet can play safely by themselves.</p> <p> </p> <p>Do not hesitate for your family!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Powder-coated steel frame ensures sturdiness and durability</li> <li>Versatile usage as pet gate  portable playpen  baby gate or safety barrier</li> <li>Door will close automatically if the angle is less than 90 degrees</li> <li>Configurable design is easy to create variety of shape</li> <li>Wall mounted fence but also can stand on its own</li> <li>Locking system of door adds security to fence</li> <li>Foldable to save space when not in use</li> <li>Light weight for easy transportation</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>A Safety Guard for Your Baby:</strong> Constructed by durable tubular steel which prolongs its lifetime. The gate can be locked and opened easily for coming in and out. Create a special space for your baby to play freely on their own securely. It definitely is a great secure for babies.</li> <li><strong>Act as a Fireplace Fence:</strong> It is not only a baby safety gate but an ideal fireplace fence in winter. Suitable to use around fireplaces  grills  wood burning stoves  etc. Adjustable  rotating joints allow you to position the gate in just the right shape for your space.</li> <li><strong>Free-Standing Design:</strong> Position as a hexagon-shaped and this gate becomes a free-standing play yard ( 5 panels in total). This fence is either foldable or extensible. In this shape  it is 29 inches high  which is enough high for baby to hold for walking.</li> <li><strong>One Hand Operation for Convenience:</strong> The walk through door panel (29'' x 23'') is built with a child-proof double locking system allowing the easy access. One hand operation for your conveniently coming in or out while you holding the baby.</li> <li><strong>Include All Necessary Accessories:</strong> With all the necessary accessories included in the package  it supports for door gate as well. Hardware-mounted brackets secure panels from wall to wall. You can use this gate directly for your different requirements.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Steel</li> <li>Size of each panel: 29''x 23''(L x W)</li> <li>Net weight: 23 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Safety gate</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Pets > Dog Supplies > Pet Gate,,Size of each panel:29''x 23''(L x W); ,Pet Gate,,,Black,HW70513BK,shopify,328,1,deny,manual,99.99,109.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_389_24.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/1/_1_100_26.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_407_24.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_293_39.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thum