phone and Headphone Jack:</strong> Connecting a microphone allows your child to sing while playing the keyboard like a real performer! Through the recording and playback  you can playback the recording and appreciate your kid's work. It can also help your kid practice singing and playing  which is very helpful for improving skills.<br />● <strong>Dual Power Supply and Portable:</strong> Made of high-quality lightweight materials  this portable keyboard is light and easy to carry. It can be easily taken anywhere. Take the keyboard with an adapter and find a place with electricity  your kid can have lots of fun! Your kid also plays it if you have six batteries available on hand.</p> </div><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: PC</li> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Overall Dimensions: 25" x 7" x 2.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: About 2 lbs</li> <li>Output power: 4 W</li> <li>Rated voltage: DC 9 V</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Electronic keyboard</li> <li>1 x Microphone</li> <li>1 x Charger</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Musical Instruments > Pianos & Keyboards,,Overall Dimensions:25" x 7" x 2.5" (L x W x H); ,Pianos & Keyboards,,,Black,TY320925,shopify,839,1,deny,manual,29.99,49.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/111_2_7.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/112_2_3.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/l/electronic_music_piano-1.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/114_5.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/1/61tguxhh9wl._sl1200_.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/