nt sizes of drain holes  which can be adapted to different water pipe widths.<br /><strong>● Easy Solution for a Clean and Healthy Pond: </strong>This pressure filter is an effective sealed pressure filter system that uses biotechnology to keep your pond clean and healthy. The convenient handle allows for easy relocation  you can place it on the land or in the water.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Connections range (cone type): 3/4"  1"  1 1/4"  1-1/2"</li> <li>Suitable for ponds with normal fish load 2500 Gal</li> <li>Suitable for ponds with heavy fish load 1500 Gal</li> <li>Voltage: 120V / 60HZ</li> <li>IP rating: IP44</li> <li>Electric cord length: 15.5 FT</li> <li>UV power: 113 Watt</li> <li>Max flow rate: 4000 GPH</li> <li>rated pressure: 0.3 bar</li> <li>Filter capacity: 25 Liters</li> <li>Overall dimension: 18" x 18" x 20"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Package </li> <li>1 x Pressure filter with integrated uvc</li> <li>1 x Spiral stepped hose adapter 1 ½” transparent</li> <li>2 x Spiral stepped hose adapter 1 ½” black</li> <li>1 x Spiral stepped hose adapter 1 ½” threaded  black</li> <li>4 x Union nuts 1 ½”</li> <li>4 x Flat seal</li> <li>1 x Glass seal cover</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Garden > Garden Tools > Watering & Irrigation,,Overall dimension:18" x 18" x 20"(L x W x H); ,Watering & Irrigation,Drop Price,,Black,EP21559,shopify,488,1,deny,manual,169.99,169.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP21559/4000_Gallons_Pond_Pressure_Bio_Filter_with_13W_UV_Light-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP21559/4000_Gallons_Pond_Pressure_Bio_Filter_with_13W_UV_Light-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP21559/4000_Gallons_Pond_Pressure_Bio_Filter_with_13W_UV_Light-3.jpg,3,ht