shiatsu-kneading-rolling-vibration-heating-foot-massager,Shiatsu Kneading Rolling Vibration Heating Foot Massager-Red,57618239,https://www.costway.com/foot-and-calf-massager-with-heat-vibration-deep-kneading-and-shiatsu.html?piid=9210200&fee=152&fep=2321&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The brand-new calf and foot massager helps you relax muscles and relieve pain.</p> <p> </p> <p>To give you a better-personalized experience  this multifunctional foot massager is designed with kneading  vibration  and heating modes  as well as three speeds available. It effectively stimulates reflexology pressure points and soothes sore muscles in a targeted manner. The bracket also supports a tilting angle  allowing your feet and legs to be optimally relaxed. With advanced technology  this machine simulates and implements the techniques of massage therapists at home. Don't hesitate to enjoy the perfect foot relaxation after a long day with the foot massager!</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for a product like this  do not hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <p></p> <ul> <li>Speed can be adjusted from low  medium to high</li> <li>3 functions of kneading  vibration  and heating</li> <li>Automatic foot massager with 15 minutes duration</li> <li>Penetrate deep into muscles of the calves and feet</li> <li>Removable fabric cover for keeping good hygiene</li> <li>A control panel in the middle for easy operation</li> <li>Perfectly replicates ancient massage techniques</li> <li>8 massage discs for feet and 4 discs for calves</li> <li>The best gift for your family or friends</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>2-in-1 Foot and Leg Massage:</strong> This 2-in-1 foot and leg massager features 8-foot massage discs and 4 calf massage discs  which provides a powerful and targeted massage to reduce feet  ankles  and calves pain. The unique massage therapy and flexible angles effectively promote blood circulation and relax the whole body.<br />● <strong>Adjustable Multiple Functions:</strong> To meet different demands and offer ultimate comfort  the calf massager machine is designed with 3 customized options: Kneading  Heating  and Vibration. The synergistic combination of 3 modes delivers different intense pressure and penetrates into your muscles  which quickly relieves the fatigue of the leg and foot.<br />● <strong>Easy to Use:</strong> Equipped with a simple panel control  the foot massager is easy to operate for different user groups. The user can adjust the massage speed (low  medium  and high) and select the desired mode by pressing the button. The bottom bracket can be opened to adjust the support angle. 15 minutes automatic shutdown ensures safe use. <br />●<strong> Detachable and Washable Design:</strong> The interior zippered sleeves of the massager are detachable for easy daily cleaning  so you can keep the foot massager tidy and hygienic. After washing with the machine  the sleeves can be reinstalled for repeated use. These slots can fit most foot sizes  up to men size 12 and women size 16.5. <br />●<strong> A Healthy Gift:</strong> Busy work and heavy housework always bring too much pressure  but this 2-in-1 foot and calf massager is a perfect solution after a stressful day. The massager fully wraps the calves to create a professional massage experience. This is an ideal gift for your family  allowing them to enjoy optimal foot health while reading or watching TV.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black + red</li> <li>Material: Plastic + fabric</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 17.7" x 17.7" x 19.7" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Voltage: 110V</li> <li>Frequency: 60Hz</li> <li>Power: 850W KW/h</li> <li>Running time: 15mins</li> <li>Net weight: 24 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Foot and calf massager</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Health & Beauty > Massage & Relaxation > Foot Massagers,,Overall dimensions:17.7" x 17