 Outdoor Use:</strong> With portable design  this basketball hoop system can be used indoors or outdoors  allowing you to enjoy the sport fun anytime. You can put it at home or in the public area in neighborhood and invite your friends to play basketball together.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Steel frame + PE panel</li> <li>Diameter of basketry:17.7"</li> <li>Diameter of main pole:1.7"</li> <li>Size of backboard: 29.5" x 17.7" (L x W)</li> <li>Size of base: 29.1" x 21.6" x 5.1" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Height adjustable between 5.8 ft  to 6.8 ft</li> <li>Product weight: 17.6 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x basketball stand</li> <li><strong>Note: Please do not Dunk on the basketball hoop.</strong></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Sports > Sport Equipments,,Diameter of basketry:17.7"; Diameter of main pole:1.7"; Size of backboard:29.5" x 17.7" (L x W); Size of base:29.1" x 21.6" x 5.1" (L x W x H); ,Sport Equipments,,,Black,SP34956,shopify,38,1,deny,manual,67.99,90.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/SP34956/Adjustable_Basketball_Hoop_System_Stand_with_Wheels-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/SP34956/Adjustable_Basketball_Hoop_System_Stand_with_Wheels-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/SP34956/Adjustable_Basketball_Hoop_System_Stand_with_Wheels-3.png,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/SP34956/Adjustable_Basketball_Hoop_System_Stand_with_Wheels-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/i/file_238_4.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/a/d/adjustable_basketball_hoop_s