10-drawer-rolling-storage-cart-organizer-clear,10 Drawer Rolling Storage Cart Organizer with 4 Universal Casters-Clear,18429736,https://www.costway.com/rolling-storage-cart-organizer-with-10-compartments-and-4-universal-casters.html?piid=9229400&fee=152&fep=3078&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The rolling storage cart which is with 10 drawers is ideal for getting your work files in well organized and save the space easily in your office  home  school or garage.</p> <p> </p> <p>The cart with rolling makes it possible for you to keep your daily supplies in order wherever you decide to put it. It is of chrome plated steel framed and 10 removable pp drawer organizer. The cart can be put anywhere you want and saving space at the same time as it is compact designed.</p> <p> </p> <p>The attractive low-profile modern black and chrome design makes this unit a practical addition to nearly any room. Buy yours today!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Brand new</li> <li>10 drawer storage cart</li> <li>Four caster wheels  2 locking</li> <li>Ideal for storing small tools in office  home  school  garage</li> <li>Chrome plated steel frame</li> <li>Four caster wheels</li> <li>Easy assembly</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Ample Space for Storage & Classification-</strong> There are ten drawers in total for to store and classifying your stuff. Table top can also be used for putting stuff on.</li> <li><strong>Flexible Casters (2 Lockable)-</strong> Four casters under the entire shelf make the cart freely move to any place. Two of them can be locked steadily if you want the cart stay still. Top two handles enable it easy to push or pull.</li> <li><strong>Durable Chrome Construction-</strong> The whole frame is made of chrome steel which is anti-rust and long lasting. It is also solid and strong enough to support the shelf and stuff you put inside.</li> <li><strong>Appropriate Size-</strong> The overall size of this cart is 14 3/5"D x 12 4/5"W x 33 4/5"H. It is suitable for you to reach and take stuff from or put it in it.</li> <li><strong>Natural Clear Color Drawers-</strong> Clear color looks natural and fresh and perfectly match any décor of your home or office. Each drawer dimension is 14"D x 11"W x 2 2/5"H which also fits for storing stuff.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Steel + PP</li> <li>Drawer size: 14" x 11" x 2 2/5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Overall size: 14 3/5" x 12 4/5" x 33 4/5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > File Cabinets,,Drawer size:14" x 11" x 2 2/5" (L x W x H); Overall size:14 3/5" x 12 4/5" x 33 4/5" (L x W x H); ,File Cabinets,On Sale,,Transparent,HW52045CL,shopify,2734,1,deny,manual,54.99,64,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW52045CL/Rolling Storage Cart Organizer-2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW52045CL/Rolling Storage Cart Organizer-6.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_Drawer_Rolling_St_1756346583013153_111516.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW52045CL/Rolling Storage Cart Organizer-1.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW52045CL/Rolling Storage Cart Organizer-8.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW52045CL/Rolling Storage Cart Organizer-4.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW52045CL/Rolling Storage Cart Organizer-3.jpg,7
