10-feet-outdoor-patio-umbrella-with-tilt-adjustment-and-crank-beige,10 Feet Outdoor Patio Umbrella with Tilt Adjustment and Crank-Beige,05912478,https://www.costway.com/10-feet-outdoor-patio-umbrella-with-tilt-adjustment-and-crank.html?piid=9229200&fee=152&fep=3201&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Vented polyester fabric canopy is drizzle-resistant and sun-protective<br />● The outdoor umbrella is easy to open and close with crank handle<br />● Easy to block the sunlight from different directions with aluminum alloy tilt system<br />● 8 thicker umbrella ribs provide increased wind resistance<br />● Powder-coated umbrella pole is rustproof and sturdy<br />● Protective rib pockets keep the umbrella ribs in place<br />● Spring button allows you to push to connect or disconnect the poles<br />● Coming with fixing strap for easy storage<br />● Perfect for multiple occasions  such as garden  backyard and patio</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Superior Vented Canopy:</strong> Crafted from non-fading polyester fabric  the heavy duty patio umbrella provides lasting sun protection  drizzle resistance and high color fastness. Moreover  the vented top ensures proper airflow  keeping you cool and comfortable<br /><strong>● Sturdy Heavy Duty Structure:</strong> Equipped with 8 thickened metal ribs  the market umbrella features stable structure to against wind. The powder-coated metal umbrella pole offers a rust-resistant barrier for long-term use. Note: Please secure the umbrella with weight base(not included) that above 33 lbs.<br /><strong>● Easy Tilt Operation:</strong> Equipped with a convenient push-button tilt mechanism  the large table umbrella offers hassle-free 30° angle adjustment for optimal protection against the sun's rays at any time of day.<strong> </strong><br /><strong>● Smooth Crank Handle: </strong>Setting up the patio umbrella is a breeze with the crank handle for smooth operation. When not in use  the detachable pole and fixing strap allow for compact and efficient storage  keeping your outdoor space clutter-free.<br /><strong>● Versatile Application:</strong> The large 10 ft x 10 ft garden table umbrella will meet your needs for different occasions. With quick setup and simple design  the outdoor round umbrella is a perfect addition for pool  deck  garden or yard.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><table border="0"> <tbody> <tr> <td>Color                 </td> <td>Beige                             </td> </tr> <tr> <td>Material</td> <td>Metal  180 G Polyester  Aluminum Alloy</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Overall Dimension</td> <td>10 ft x 10 ft x 8.2 ft(L x W x H)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Umbrella Rim Height</td> <td>7.2 ft</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Net Weight</td> <td>14 lbs</td> </tr> <tr><td>Box Qty</td> <td>1(May vary by batch)</td> </tr> </tbody> </table>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Outdoor Umbrellas,,Overall Dimension:10 ft x 10 ft x 8.2 ft(L x W x H); ,Outdoor Umbrellas,Clearance,,Beige,OP70752BE,shopify,1016,1,deny,manual,59.99,64.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70752BE/10_Feet_Outdoor_Patio_Umbrella_Beige-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70752BE/10_Feet_Outdoor_Patio_Umbrella_Beige-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70752BE/10_Feet_Outdoor_Patio_Umbrella_with_Tilt_Adjustment_Beige-4.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70752BE/10_Feet_Outdoor_Patio_Umbrella_with_Tilt_Adjustment_Beige-3.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70752BE/10_Feet_Outdoor_Patio_Umbrella_Beige_Size-5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95