larger-capacity-folding-deer-game-cart,Larger Capacity Folding Deer Game Cart,04916528,https://www.costway.com/larger-capacity-folding-deer-game-cart.html?fee=152&fep=3213&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Brand new and high quality<br />● Large 17" wheels<br />● 37 mm wide rubber tire<br />● 17 mm Thick Heavy-duty steel axle<br />● Strong solid steel frame and construction</p> <a href="https://cdn1.costway.com/media/us/Install_video/04916528.mp4" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline;font-weight: bolder;color:#c82a2e;">Installation guide</a><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Sturdy Steel Construction:</strong> This deer game cart is constructed of heavy-duty steel tubes in smooth powder-coated finish  which provides a strong bearing capacity and can be used for a long time. 500 LBS Weight capacity makes this hunting cart perfect for hauling heavy games  bait  gear  firewood and more.<br /><strong>● Heavy Duty Rubber Tires:</strong> 17" Large wheels and 1.5" wide rubber tires increase the friction with ground  providing the game cart strong support to move in the wild. And the rubber tires are wear-resistant  which are suitable for different roads. Besides  the locking pins are used for fixation  ensuring great stability of this deer cart.<br /><strong>● Foldable Design:</strong> This hauling cart can easily fold up to a more compact size that will save plenty of space for storage and transporting during hunting. You could store it easily in a pickup truck and get ready for your hunting at any time. What's more  the steel handle and 2 wheels make it easy to move and haul heavy loads.<br /><strong>● Multiple Uses:</strong> This utility cart is designed for outdoor use and especially ideal for hunting season. The overall dimension of this hauling cart is 70" x 18"  which provides plenty of room for transporting your games and hunting equipment out of the wood. Moreover  this heavy duty cart is also suitable for hauling firewood out. <br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble:</strong> Coming with detailed instructions and necessary accessories  it is easy to assemble in minutes  allowing you start exciting hunting in minutes. Quick folding makes it simple arrange after outdoor activities as well.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown </li> <li>Material: Steel </li> <li>Overall dimension: 18" x 70"(L x H)</li> <li> Net weight: 24 LBS</li> <li> Weight capacity: 500 LBS</li> <li></li> <li> Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li> 1 x Folding deer game cart</li> <li> 1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Camping,,Overall dimension:18" x 70"(L x H); ,Camping,,,Bronze,OP70484,shopify,241,1,deny,manual,82,101,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70484_9_.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70484_5_.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70484_1_.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70484_10_.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70484_2_.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70484_8_.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70484_7_.jpg,7
2-feet-kids-gloves-skipping-rope-boxing-set,2 Feet Kids Gloves Skipping Rope Boxing Set,27346851,https://www.costway.com/2-feet-kids-gloves-skipping-rope-boxing-set.html?fee=152&fep=3229&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Including one punch bag  one pair gloves  one rope skipping  one rucksack  and one hook<br />● Perfect for children workout and get into shape<br />● Skipping Rope is good for warm up before boxing.<br />● Training gloves protect your hands while you practice<br />● Fit for Junior Children over 5 years old</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Great Option for Your Children:</strong> Thanks to this high reliability punching bag set  you can start boxing training for Taekwondo  Karate and Muay Thai at home or in the gym. Besides  it also includes a skipping rope to improve coordination. Apart from working on boxing skills  it is a perfect choice for your kids to relieve pressure and strengthen physical fitness. <br /><strong>● Durable Usage and Exquisite Craftsmanship:</strong> The punching bag is made of PU leather to ensure durability and prevent stripping off. It has been filled with rags and sand and the rebound effect is increased at the same time. Moreover  the tight stitching avoids leakage and prolongs its service life.<br /><strong>● Practical Boxing Gloves:</strong> The sponge padded boxing gloves can effectively reduce the risk of injury to kid's hands. Anti-perspiration holes promote air flow and circulation for extra comfort. In addition  there are hook and loop fasteners to firmly attached the gloves to the wrist. <br /><strong>● Considerate Punching Bag Hanger:</strong> The boxing set is equipped with high quality straps and considerate hook to hang the punching bag  which is not easy to fracture or break. Plus  there are several lines sutures on the sides to ensure long-term use and better user experience.<br /><strong>● Hassle-free Installation and Portable Design:</strong> Under the guidance of instruction  it is easy to assemble the boxing set to the bracket or work with your child to practice hands-on ability. In addition  smooth surface makes for easy cleaning and maintenance. And it can be stored in a carrying bag when not in use.</p> <p></p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black and blue</li> <li>Material:</li> <li>Punch bag: PU fabrics cover +foam filled</li> <li>Gloves: PU fabrics and sponge</li> <li>Size of punch bag: 10" x 10" x 24" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight of sandbag: 22 lbs</li> <li>Weight of gloves: 8 oz</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Punch bag</li> <li>1 x Gloves</li> <li>1 x Hook</li> <li>1 x Rucksack</li> <li>1 x Skipping rope</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Sports > Strength Training > Boxing & Martial Arts,,Size of punch bag:10" x 10" x 24" (L x W x H); ,Boxing & Martial Arts,Drop Price,,Black,SP34952,shopify,140,1,deny,manual,52.99,73.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_605_38.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_609_19.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/p/sp34952.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/-/9-1_2.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_530_38.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_570_36.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_597_17.jpg,7
