verdeb table ss innovative design with swivel base for easy mobility and lift tabletop can be adjusted vertically from 24.5" to 36" to meet your different demands of desired height. Just lifting it effortlessly  the stability will also be guaranteed while adjusting.<br /><strong>● Compact Design and Smooth Wheels:</strong> There are four casters on the base and two of them are lockable  which allow you to easily move the desk around any room or lock them to make your it stationary. it dresses a complete of high-quality wooden and its concise appearance can easily catch your eyeballs. It features rectangular outlook  which perfectly meet your demand of durability.<br /><strong>● Easily Assemble and Customer Service:</strong> This laptop table is made of MDF wooden and metal   so you can just clean it easily with damp cloth. In addition  you can quickly assemble the item according to the instruction we offered for you. We packed this item as good as we can  if there is any damaged parts  please contact us freely and provide pictures of damaged parts for us to solve the problem as the way you want(discount or replacement).</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Silver (frame) + black (table)</li> <li>Material: Steel (frame) + MDF (table)</li> <li>Overall dimension: 23.5" x 16" x 24.5"-36" (L x W x Adjustable H)</li> <li>Steel tube size: 20 x 40 x 0.7mm</li> <li>Thickness of MDF table: 15mm</li> <li>Unit weight: 11 lb</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Laptop desk stand</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Laptop Tables & Printer Stands,,Overall dimension:23.5" x 16" x 24.5"-36" (L x W x Adjustable H); Steel tube size:20 x 40 x 0.7mm; ,Laptop Tables & Printer Stands,Clearance,,Black,HW65679,shopify,238,1,deny,manual,44.99,44.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/4/_4_29_34.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/c