outdoor-patio-steel-swing-bench-loveseat,2-Seat Porch Glider with HDPE Back Seat and Steel Frame-Black,93852417,https://www.costway.com/2-seat-porch-glider-with-hdpe-back-seat-and-steel-frame.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=3298&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,-A large sitting area accommodates 2 people comfortably -Ergonomic backrest and armrests for a cozy sitting experience -Smooth and quiet gliding for a comfortable swing -Weather resistant HDPE material for durability -Powder coated steel frame for rustproof -Anti-slip foot pads for extra stability -Applicable in the backyard  garden  porch  etc -Easy to assemble with the detailed instruction<p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Durable and Sturdy Construction:</strong> Crafted with a heavy-duty steel frame and thickened metal pipes  this porch glider ensures great sturdiness and durability. The powder-coated steel frame with a sturdy base can support up to 600lbs  ensuring long-lasting use without warping or damage over time.<br />● <strong>Weather-Resistant HDPE Seat and Back:</strong> The seat and back of the glider are made from HDPE  a waterproof and weather-resistant material that resists fading. Complete with detailed assembly instructions and all necessary hardware  cleaning the steel frame and HDPE seat is a breeze with just a simple wipe  ensuring effortless upkeep of your outdoor relaxation space.<br />● <strong>Smooth Gliding Experience:</strong> Enjoy a soothing and silent gliding motion on our outdoor glider bench  offering a nice range of motion without taking up too much space. Relax and feel the spring breeze as you unwind on this patio essential.<br />● <strong>Comfortable Ergonomic Design:</strong> The curved back support of this outdoor glider bench provides extra comfort and relaxation by ergonomically fitting your back spine at the perfect angle. It's the ideal companion for leisure time  offering relaxation  rest  and entertainment.<br />● <strong>Versatile Natural Style:</strong> Designed with a naturally chic style  this patio glider is ideal for spending quality leisure moments with loved ones in your outdoor living area. Its simple yet sophisticated design seamlessly blends in  adding a touch of casual elegance to your garden or patio.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black/Brown</li> <li>Material: Steel and HDPE</li> <li>Overall dimension: 46" x 29" x 34" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Size of seat: 41.5" x 17" (L x W)</li> <li>Size of back: 41.5" x 15" (L x W)</li> <li>Distance from floor to seat: 16.5"</li> <li>Distance from floor to armrest: 24"</li> <li>Width of arrest: 2.5"</li> <li>Weight capacity: 600 lbs</li> <li>Product weight: 42 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Swinging chair</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Patio Rocking Chairs & Gliders,,Overall dimension:46" x 29" x 34" (L x W x H); Size of seat:41.5" x 17" (L x W); Size of back:41.5" x 15" (L x W); ,Patio Rocking Chairs & Gliders,,,Black,OP2970,shopify,374,1,deny,manual,119.99,119.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP2970/OP2970 (2).jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP2970/Bench_Loveseat-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP2970/OP2970 (10).jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP2970/OP2970 (9).jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP2970/Bench_Loveseat-5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP2970/OP2970 (6).jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/p