sy Storage:</strong> The clothes hamper holds its upright shape as needed  but you can easily fold the durable and user-friendly laundry hamper for added space saving convenience when not in use. You can easily slip it in your suitcase and carry it with you on your camping trips or family vacations!<br /><strong>● Simple and Stylish Design:</strong> This bamboo clothes hamper is not only a good helper in family life  but also combines clean lines and a solid interior  offering a neatly appearance and contemporary style that effortlessly coordinates with almost any decor. This laundry hamper is also a gift choice for family or friends  easy to clean and maintain.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><div class="chanpin_zhensh"> <ul> <li>Color: natural</li> <li>Material: bamboo and polyester cotton</li> <li>Size of product: 15.7"x11.8"x23.6"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Volume of product: 72L</li> <li>Product weight: 4.18lbs.</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul> </div>,Costway,Bath > Laundry Baskets,,,Laundry Baskets,Clearance,,Brown,HW67642CF,shopify,317,1,deny,manual,34.99,34.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/1/71x1nymoipl._sl1200_.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/1/71qoh6uwvzl._sl1200_.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_67_5_2.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/1/81x_abhyibl._sl1200_.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/1/714wul-ojhl._sl1200_.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/1/71-gj4raahl._sl1200_.jpg,6,,7
