et. The compact size makes it convenient for you to take it to almost any outdoor activity.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Natural  Black (iron frame)</li> <li>Material: Iron  Fir Wood</li> <li>Overall Dimension of Table: 70" x 18" x 29.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Overall Dimension of Bench: 70" x 9" x 18" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight Capacity of Bench: 660 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Tables > Picnic Tables,,Overall Dimension of Table:70" x 18" x 29.5" (L x W x H); Overall Dimension of Bench:70" x 9" x 18" (L x W x H); ,Picnic Tables,Drop Price,,Natural,OP70433,shopify,299,1,deny,manual,129.99,250.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_448_33.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_363_32.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_523_35.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/11_319_27.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/p/o/portable_picnic_table_set.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_421_33.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_545_36.jpg,7
12-v-battery-powered-kids-ride-on-dumper-truck-yellow,12 V Battery Powered Kids Ride on Dumper Truck-Yellow.,52837169,https://www.costway.com/12v-battery-powered-kids-ride-on-dumper-truck.html?piid=9211000&fee=152&fep=3409&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This fully-equipped front loader will move up and down  and bucket in and out when your little builder controls the handle.</p> <p> </p> <p>This excavator is the latest fantastic and functional pedal powered kids ride-on  great for your lovely children. It provides a realistic look and a real working bucket for loads of fun. The excavator could suit for digging sand  snow  or even toys.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for a ride-on truck like this  do not hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>High impact blow molded resin body  non-toxic & easy-to-clean material</li> <li>Kids ride on glorified toys  pretend play to mimic adult construction</li> <li>Working front loader & tipping digger bucket  scooping  lifting  carrying and dumping</li> <li>Pedal-powered with an easy-to-operate handle  convenient for moving and digging</li> <li>Comfortable & spacious seat with safety belt  providing a safe driving environment</li> <li>Good load-bearing of digger bucket  the maximum load capacity of 6 lbs</li> <li>Functions of forwarding  backward  stop and high/low speed to dig sand  snow  even toys</li> <li>Suitable for children with age 37 to 96 months</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Excavator Educational Fun:</strong> This excavator is designed to mimic adult construction excavator in look  which aids in children's hand and eye coordination and builds kids' dexterity and confidence. Arm extends for realistic play and your kids can enjoy emulating being a construction worker. Functions of forwarding  backward  stop and two speeds add more fun.<br /><strong>● Durable and Wear-resistant Materials:</strong> Made of waterproof and non-toxic PP raw material and ironware  the body of this well-made kids digger ensures safety while riding. Also  the extra wide wheels are made of wear-resistant materials  which are strong enough to withstand slight collision. The waterproof  easy-to-clean and durable surface will satisfy every parent.<br /><strong>● Well-designed Safe Construction:</strong> Comfortable seat with safety belt  simulated decoration with stable joints and spacious pedal give your lovely kids a safe and comfortable driving environment. Easy-to-operate buttons and a sensitive handle allow your kids to enjoy digging at a low or high speed.<br /><strong>● Long Battery Life:</strong> This excavator has an external side charging port and needs to charge for 8 - 12 hours. When it is fully charged  your kids can continuously play it for 1.5 hours which makes sure that your little kids can abundantly enjoy it.<br /><strong>● Flexible Front Loader:</strong> The adjustable sturdy arm can move freely. Fully functional backhoe digger is equipped with a strong front loader of multiple joint activities especially for scooping up sand  snow  or even toys. Great gift for birthdays and holidays for boys and girls.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Plastic  ironware</li> <li>Color: Yellow</li> <li>Size: 59" x 24.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight: 39 lbs</li> <li>Load capacity: 66 lbs</li> <li>Ambient temperature: 0-40 degree centigrade</li> <li>Speed: 2.5 km/h- 5km/h</li> <li>Battery: 6V 7AH *2</li> <li>Charging period: 8-12 Hours Each Time</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Kids ride on excavator</li> <li>1 x Charger</li> <li>2 x Rechargeable battery</li> <li>2 x Motors</li> <li>1 x Instruction manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Ride On Toys > Powered Ride On Toys,,Size:59" x 24.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H); ,Powered Ride On Toys,Clearance,,Yellow,TY327431YE,shopify,1023,1,deny,manual,199.99,209.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/produc