wooden-jewelry-cabinet-storage-organizer-with-6-drawers,Large Capacity Jewelry Storage Cabinet with 9 Drawers,50946287,https://www.costway.com/wooden-jewelry-cabinet-storage-organizer-with-6-drawers.html?fee=152&fep=3592&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● The flip top mirror is convenient for dressing and wearing earrings<br>● The top 4 compartments help place your jewelry in categories<br>● 8 hooks and 2 anti-throw ropes keep your necklaces well stored<br>● 9 drawers of different kinds provide roomy storage space<br>● 2 shelves on the doors offer extra storage for larger items<br>● Magnetic catches prevent side doors from unwanted opening<br>● The back anti-toppling strap enhances stability and security<br>● Soft lining prevents your jewelry from being scratched<br>● Anti-slip foot pads add stability and protect the floor<br>● Easy to assemble with detailed instructions</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Large Capacity and Classified Storage:</strong> Top 4-compartment jewelry organizer and 9 drawers of 3 different kinds can neatly organize your rings  earrings  bracelets  etc. Besides  there are 8 necklace hooks on the side doors of the jewelry armoire.<br>● <strong>Unique Flip-Top Mirror Design:</strong> The standing jewelry storage cabinet features a flip-top vanity mirror  allowing you to try on jewelry and check your appearance conveniently before stepping out.<br>● <strong>Upgraded Stability and Safety: </strong>Thickened legs offer strong support to the jewelry armoire. The bottom non-slip foot pads prevent your floor from unwanted scratches. Moreover  the jewelry cabinet also adopts an anti-toppling strap at the back to enhance security.<br>● <strong>Perfect Addition to Your Home:</strong> This classic and vintage standing jewelry cabinet is applicable to various places  such as the bedroom  dressing room  living room  etc. It will be a wonderful gift for your mom  wife or anyone who loves collecting jewelry.<br>● <strong>Thoughtful Design:</strong> With exquisite pull ring handles  the drawers can be easily opened. The side doors come with 2 protective ropes to prevent your necklaces from being thrown while opening the doors. Additionally  magnetic catches help keep the side doors closed tightly.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Walnut</li> <li>Material: MDF  Glass</li> <li>Overall Dimension: 16" x 10.5" x 40" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Mirror Size: 8.5" x 6" (L x W)</li> <li>Drawer Size: 8.5" x 7.5" x 2" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net Weight: 40 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Bedroom > Jewelry Armoires,,Overall Dimension:16" x 10.5" x 40" (L x W x H); Mirror Size:8.5" x 6" (L x W); Drawer Size:8.5" x 7.5" x 2" (L x W x H); ,Jewelry Armoires,,,Brown,JV10454,shopify,204,1,deny,manual,199.99,199.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/l/a/Large_Capacity_Jewel_1765182298775821_716184.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/l/a/Large_Capacity_Jewel_1765182299663669_967131.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/l/a/Large_Capacity_Jewel_1765182297090266_401477.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/l/a/Large_Capacity_Jewel_1765182303883748_793727.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/l/a/Large_Capacity_Jewel_1765182297888500_231209.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/l/a/Large_Capacity_Jewel_1765182301326231_734868.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/l/a/Large_Capacity_Jewel_1765182302165419_723783.jpg,7
2-pieces-folding-recliner-zero-gravity-lounge-chair-beige,2 Pieces Folding Recliner Zero Gravity Lounge Chair - Beige,87142509,https://www.costway.com/2-pieces-folding-lounge-chair-with-zero-gravity.html?piid=9229200&fee=152&fep=3623&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>These 2-piece lounge chairs are suitable for outdoor living areas  such as a patio  garden  backyard  or can be used in your living room or bedroom.</p> <p>  </p> <p>Made of steel and Textilene  the chairs have a sturdy and durable construction. The surface of the chairs is smooth and soft  providing you a comfortable experience. The folding design makes the chairs easy to transport and store. It is a good choice for relaxation  relief  sleep  and entertainment. You and your families can enjoy your free time with these lounge chairs.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for this product  don't hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>High quality and brand new</li> <li>Steel tubes frame  durable and sturdy</li> <li>Incline and adjustable back to fit your body</li> <li>Removable headrest for comfort</li> <li>With a removable cup and magazine holder</li> <li>Lightweight is easy for transporting</li> <li>With the folding feature  easy to store and save space</li> <li>Good choice for relaxing  relief  sleep  and entertainment</li> <li>Fits for beach  deck  yard  and room</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>●<strong> Folding Design:</strong> This gravity chair can be folded into one third for easy stacking and storage. And it's lightweight  which can be easily carried from room to room.<br />● <strong>Multi-Purpose:</strong> It's perfect for enjoying both indoor and outdoor time. It can be used anywhere you choose  such as a bedroom  a balcony  a garden  and a courtyard. It's going to give you a great lounge time.<br />● <strong>Cup Holder Tray and Headrest:</strong> A cup holder tray to place beverages  magazines  phones  or other small items for convenient accessibility. A removable headrest for a better relaxing experience.<br />● <strong>Durable Frame:</strong> Featuring durable aluminum seat posts and steel leg posts  this recliner is sturdy enough to carry users up to 300 lbs. It's ventilated in the summer  and you can even use cushions for the winter. Its knitting technique and superior material guarantee its long-term durability.<br />● <strong>Product Size Information:</strong> Weight Capacity: 300 lbs. Item Size: 35.5" - 65" x 26" x 44.5" (L x W x H). Folding Size: 37.5" x 26" x 6" (L x W x H).</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Fabric  steel and plastic</li> <li>Color: Beige</li> <li>Open size: 35.4" x 25.2" x 43.3" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Size of armrest: 22.0" x 2.2" (L x W)</li> <li>Size of cup holder: 20.0" x 9.1" x 2.3" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Folding size: 36.2" x 25.0" x 5.1" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 300 lbs</li> <li>Product weight: 32 lbs</li> <li>Package include: 1 set = 2 pcs folding recliner chair</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Beach & Lawn Chairs,,Open size:35.4" x 25.2" x 43.3" (L x W x H); Size of armrest:22.0" x 2.2" (L x W); Size of cup holder:20.0" x 9.1" x 2.3" (L x W x H); Folding size:36.2" x 25.0" x 5.1" (L x W x H); ,Beach & Lawn Chairs,Clearance,,Beige,NP10642CM-2,shopify,20,1,deny,manual,89.99,89.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/1/_1_83_87.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/3/_3_45_11.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_583_163.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/i/n/in_2_1.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab3352