portable-pop-up-ground-camo-blind-hunting-enclosure,Portable Pop up Ground Camo Blind Hunting Enclosure,61350248,https://www.costway.com/portable-pop-up-ground-camo-blind-hunting-enclosure.html?fee=152&fep=3626&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Brand new and high quality<br />● Durable weatherproof and wear-resistant material<br />● Shoot-through camo mesh windows<br />● Shadow-Guard lining eliminates shadows and silhouettes<br />● 360° degree visibility with one full view windows and two small windows<br />● Zipper corner door for easy entry and exit<br />● Hands-free carry bag compactly stores blind<br />● Lightweight (9lbs)  bottomless design<br />● 2-3 person capacity<br />● Keeps you protected and hidden</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Integrate with the Environment:</strong> The hunting tent is the best-hidden place for wild hunting or wildlife photography. The oxford fabric is coated with wood and leaf camo patterns. Allows you to blend into the surroundings and not be discovered by animals.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>High-Quality Material:</strong> The hunting tent is made of steel structure and 150D oxford fabric  which ensures waterproof and great durability. It equips 4 zippered windows for 360° degrees full view and easy shooting. There is no doubt that this is a professional hunting tent.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Large Capacity for 2-3 People:</strong> The overall size of this hunting tent is 61" x 59" x 63" (L x W x H)  which can hold 2-3 people. This hunting blind provides plenty of room to put in a chair for rest  so you can observe the prey patiently and comfortably.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Easy to Install and Carry:</strong> Pop-up design make the hunting tent easy to set up or takedown in seconds. The weight of the hunting blind is only 9 lbs  we also provide you a backpack for easy carrying.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Wide Applicability:</strong> It is more than just a hunt