ern & Artistic Design:</strong> This table set is of unique artistic modern design  with straight lines and round circles to give out classical line of beauty and shows grace flavor. The hollow-carved table is easily cleanable and accommodates a wider range of items. <br /><strong></strong></li> <li><strong>Best for Outdoor:</strong> It’s an ideal fit for poolside  garden  patio and porch. Should you want to relocate it based on your needs  it’s convenient. Maintenance is not required and neither will it have any damages to it over the time. Enjoy dining with no skepticism.<br /><strong></strong></li> <li><strong>Easy to Clean and Maintain:</strong> The premium fabric made cushions are resistant to dirt and rain drops. No matter how bad the weather is. It makes them easier to wash  clean and maintain.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Steel  cotton and fabric</li> <li>Size of love seat: 47.5" x 29.5" x 34.0" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Size of coffee table: 36" x 20" x 18" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight of loveseat and table set: 52.47 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of chair: 550 lbs</li> <li>Weight of coffee table: 110 lbs</li> <li>Thickness of cushion: 4 inches</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Loveseat </li> <li>1 x Coffee table</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Size of love seat:47.5" x 29.5" x 34.0" (L x W x H); Size of coffee table:36" x 20" x 18" (L x W x H); ,Patio Conversation Sets,Clearance,,Beige,HW51784BE,shopify,244,1,deny,manual,159.99,159.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw51784_1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw51784_-5.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_79_