r floor from getting scratched. Moreover  its anti-skid features will keep the table from slipping.<br /><strong>● Portable and Easy Clean: </strong>Despite having a solid frame  this table is light with a weight of 23 lbs. It's easy to move without help. Thanks to its all weather-resistant PE rattan and steel frame  it's very easy to clean and maintain with a feather duster or a wet towel.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Mix Brown/Mix Gray/Black  </li> <li>Material: Steel+ PE</li> <li>Overall dimension: 22" x 22" x 18.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Umbrella hole diameter: Slightly larger than 1.5"</li> <li>Product weight: 23 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 165 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Umbrella side table</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Tables > Patio Coffee Tables,,Overall dimension:22" x 22" x 18.5" (L x W x H); Umbrella hole diameter:Slightly larger than 1.5"; ,Patio Coffee Tables,,,Brown,HW66109,shopify,227,1,deny,manual,79.99,79.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW66109/Outdoor_Patio_Rattan_Wicker_Steel_Side_Deck_Table_Brown-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW66109/Outdoor_Patio_Rattan_Wicker_Steel_Side_Deck_Table_Brown-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW66109/Outdoor_Patio_Rattan_Wicker_Steel_Side_Deck_Table_Brown-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW66109/Outdoor_Patio_Rattan_Wicker_Steel_Side_Deck_Table_Brown-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW66109/Outdoor_Patio_Rattan_Wicker_Steel_Side_Deck_Table_Brown_Size-5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cac