outdoor-wicker-bar-table-with-2-metal-mesh-shelves,Outdoor Wicker Bar Table with 2 Metal Mesh Shelves,71294856,https://www.costway.com/outdoor-wicker-bar-table-with-2-metal-mesh-shelves.html?fee=152&fep=4271&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This bar table provides a comfortable place for you to drink and chat with friends outdoors and enjoy the warmth of the sun.</p> <p> </p> <p>The suitable height of the table will make you feel very comfortable sitting around. Its large and classified storage space allows you to put wine  snacks  and drinks on the shelves for your convenience  so you can enjoy them anytime. Furthermore  the table is super sturdy with the reinforced steel structure and adjustable footpads. Meanwhile  the simple and elegant style also makes it a beautiful decoration for your balcony or garden and will give you a feeling of relaxation and happiness when you relax with your family or friends. Imagine how you will spend your wonderful time with it.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for such a product  do not hesitate to take it to your home!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Multifunctional storage with a wide tabletop and 2 shelves</li> <li>2-rail stemware rack is perfect to hang 4 wine glasses</li> <li>Solid steel frame ensures high stability and weight capacity</li> <li>Powder-coated surface prevents steel pipes from rust</li> <li>Adjustable footpads highly increase the stability</li> <li>Premium PE rattan is elegant and weatherproof</li> <li>Ideal for backyard  poolside  deck  etc.</li> <li>Easy to assemble with the help of clear instruction</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Ample Storage Space:</strong> The 55" wide tabletop provides ample space for you to easily fetch frequently used items. And double steel mesh shelves are also perfect to store multiple things like food  cups  plates and wine bottles. Moreover  the 2-rail stemware rack is added to store 4 wine glasses  which can protect them from breakage.<br /><strong>● Sturdy Steel Structure</strong>: Made of heavy-duty steel pipes  the main frame of the bar table is not easy to deform or bend  ensuring high stability. Each steel pipe is well powder-coated for rust resistance. What's more  the adjustable footpads on the bottom are functional to make the bar table stand more stably.<br /><strong>● Elegant and Weatherproof Rattan</strong>: The table frame is wrapped with a well-woven mix of brown PE rattan  adding a piece of elegance to the surroundings. More importantly  the rattan surface is weatherproof and can withstand long-time outdoor use  enabling the bar table to accompany you anytime and anywhere.<br /><strong>● Wide Range of Application</strong>: Elegant PE rattan looks stylish and simple  and will not go out of style even after many years. And the bar table is at a suitable height  matching well most kinds of outdoor bar chairs. Therefore  it's ideal for multiple occasions  like backyard  poolside  deck  balcony and garden.<br /><strong>● Simple Installation</strong>: The bar table is equipped with easy-to-follow instructions  so the assembly won't cost too much of your time or effort. Note: Please do not tighten all the screws until all the holes are aligned. Overall dimension: 55" x 18.5" x 36" (L x W x H). Weight capacity of tabletop: 77 lbs. Weight capacity of top shelf: 33 lbs. Weight capacity of bottom shelf: 165 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Mix brown</li> <li>Material: PE rattan  steel</li> <li>Overall dimension: 55" x 18.5" x 36" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 35 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of tabletop: 77 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of top shelf: 33 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of bottom shelf: 165 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Patio bar table</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Bar Furniture,,Overall dimension:55" x 18.5" x 36" (L x W x H); ,Patio Bar Furniture