ey're bound to have endless happy times.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Iron  210D Oxford cloth</li> <li>Color: Blue</li> <li>Overall dimension: 46" x 31" x 46" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 176 lbs</li> <li>Net weight: 20.4 lbs</li> <li></li> <li>Package include:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Swing<br /><br /></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Outdoor Play > Swing & Playsets,,Overall dimension:46" x 31" x 46" (L x W x H); ,Swing & Playsets,,,Blue,OP3036,shopify,66,1,deny,manual,72.99,102,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_509_9.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_536_9.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/a/s/asdzzz.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_582_8.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/1/51fx8p17h8l._ac_.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_583_8.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_552_9.jpg,7
