18-inch-garden-heavy-duty-rotary-push-tine-for-soil-aeration,18 Inch Rolling Lawn Aerator with Anti-slip Handle and Tine Spikes,59147283,https://www.costway.com/18-inch-garden-heavy-duty-rotary-push-tine-for-soil-aeration.html?fee=152&fep=5077&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● A fast and efficient way to keep your lawn aerated<br />● Breathes new life into your lawn without harmful and expensive chemicals<br />● Complete with 3 pieces of tubular steel handle<br />● Easy-rolling lawn aerator lets the air  water and nutrients reach grassroots<br />● Lightweight design saves effort when using<br />● Reasonable height and width make work more efficient<br />● Detachable handle for easy storage<br />● Sharp metal spikes can go deep into the soil<br />● Suitable for sand  clay  soil  etc.<br />● Rubber on the handle provides comfort<br />● Easy to assemble and use</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● Bring New Life to Lawn: With the length of 1.2-inch tine spikes  this rolling lawn aerator will be able to roll deeper into the ground. As a result  the soil will get loose  making it easy for water  oxygen  and nutrients to diffuse into the soil pores. As time passes by  the grass and plants will grow more rapidly and splendidly.<br />● Labor-saving and Lightweight Tool: The length of the handle is about 40.5 inches  which allows you to operate the push aerator without bending down. Also  the width of the spike is 18 inches to increase the range of soil turning. Thanks to its light-weight design and compact size  it is easy to push around even on rough terrain.<br />● High-security and Space-saving Design: This lawn roller includes a 3-piece steel tubular handle sections  which should be connected with a snap-fastener to ensure safety while in use. Also  these sections are very convenient to disassemble  making it easy to store away when not in use.<br />● Durable Steel Material: Made of durable steel  this manual lawn aerator is sturdy and stable. Rolling parts on both sides are made of PP  which is flexible and decreases the whole weight when working.<br />● Simple to Assemble: To assemble the handle  you only need to connect and tighten the 3 tubes. After that  you can connect the handle to the roller by tightening the fasteners. The whole process takes only a few minutes. Afterward  your lawn aerator tool is ready for use.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Main color: Green</li> <li>Material: Steel  rubber  PP</li> <li>Overall dimension: 18" x 8" x 50" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Diameter of roller: 6"</li> <li>Length of the nail: 1.2"</li> <li>Net weight: 7.5 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Garden lawn aerator roller</li> <li>1 x Instruction manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Garden > Garden Tools > Lawn Care Tools,,Overall dimension:18" x 8" x 50" (L x W x H); Diameter of roller:6"; ,Lawn Care Tools,,,Green,GT2980,shopify,2920,1,deny,manual,39.99,39.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_567_95.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_541_15.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/t/gt2980_11_.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/0/000_9.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_579_96.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_610_95.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_618_18.jpg,7
