inflatable-mighty-bounce-house-jumper-with-water-slide-without-blower,Inflatable Mighty Bounce House Jumper with Water Slide without Blower,98240173,https://www.costway.com/inflatable-mighty-bounce-house-jumper-with-water-slide-without-blower.html?fee=152&fep=5184&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Great time for your kids to climb  slide  and whoosh into the splash pool<br>● Protective mesh wall of waiting area gives parents peace of mind<br>● Heightened guardrails and damper platform for safe landing<br>● Safe and enduring craftsmanship for longtime companionship<br>● PVC laminated 420D oxford cloth is waterproof and tear-resistant<br>● Double-seam reinforced stitching endures kid's energetic play<br>● All-included package for easy setup  storage and upkeep<br>● Dual-use design for kids to have fun anytime and anywhere<br>● Attach the water hose for kids to slide into summer fun<br>● Your backyard's main attraction that brings instant backyard fun<br>● Recommended to use with a 520W-680W blower (not included)</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● All-in-One Splash Adventure:</strong> This inflatable water park combines a spacious splash pool  a curved water slide  and a challenging climbing wall to keep kids active  engaged  and excited for hours. Designed to fully motivate your child to climb  slide  and splash  this inflatable water slide turns backyard play into a daily adventure.</p> <p><strong>● Built-in Protection Features:</strong> A dedicated waiting area with mesh walls helps keep kids visible while they play and prevents accidental falls or rough entry onto the slide. Heightened guardrails plus a buffer platform underneath the climbing wall add extra peace of mind  making this inflatable bounce house water slide a safer choice for families.</p> <p><strong>● Heavy-Duty Fabric Strength: </strong>Crafted with PVC laminated 420D oxford cloth and reinforced with double seam stitching  this bouncer is made to handle en