 for any outdoor activities  such as BBQ  camping  picnic  party  etc.<br />● <strong>Ready to Use and Low Maintenance:</strong> This foldable table requires no tools or tedious steps for assembly. What's more  the smooth and waterproof surface is easy to clean with damp cloth. The overall size of the table is 6' x 30" x 30" (L x W x H)  which offers enough space for 6-8 adults  and the folded dimension is 3' x 3' x 3" (L x W x H).</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown</li> <li>Material: HDPE + thick steel</li> <li>Pattern: Rattan design</li> <li>Product size: 6' x 30" x 30" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Folded size: 3' x 30" x 3" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 330 lbs</li> <li>Package weight: 35 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes: 1 x folding table</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Tables > Picnic Tables,,Product size:6' x 30" x 30" (L x W x H); Folded size:3' x 30" x 3" (L x W x H); ,Picnic Tables,On Sale,,Brown,OP70550,shopify,54,1,deny,manual,89.99,89.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_678_17.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_667_18.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_718_22.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_481_17.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_653_10.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_540_8.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_632_9.jpg,7
