8-000-btu-portable-air-conditioner-with-dehumidifier-function,8000 BTU(Ashrae) Portable Air Conditioner with Dehumidifier Function,96478520,https://www.costway.com/8-000-btu-portable-air-conditioner-with-dehumidifier-function.html?fee=152&fep=5856&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Including 1 x Portable AC  1 x Remote control  1 x Exhaust gose  1 x Window seal-plate<br />● It comes with remote control for more convenient use<br />● It offers cooling  dehumidifying  fanning  and sleeping mode to meet the various needs of users<br />● Quiet operation (Noise≦52dB) in sleeping mode<br />● 2 fan speeds<br />● Various protection functions such as a 24-hour programmable timer  super intelligent temperature sensor  water-full control  and warning  etc<br />● This 8000BTU/H air conditioner unit delivers fast  effective cooling for spaces up to 230 sq. ft<br />● Strong airflow rate of 300m3/h that ensures fast air circulation<br />● 10ft long drain hose that allows you to drain the water in the bathroom easily<br />● Equipped with four all-direction casters for easy moving<br />● Equipped with exhaust hose to exhaust hot air</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Multiple Function Modes:</strong> This portable air conditioner offers cooling  dehumidifying  fanning  and sleeping mode to meet the various needs of users. This air conditioner will automatically lower down the working noise to under 52dB once it is set to sleeping mode. This feature allows maintaining the temperature while sleeping.<br />● <strong>Convertible Fan Speed and All-day Timer:</strong> There are 2 speeds in fan mode  you can switch between high and low speed as you wish. There is an energy-saving 24-hour programmable timer  allowing the air conditioner unit to shut down automatically once reaching the usage time.<br />● <strong>Strong Air Flow Rate and Wide Coverage:</strong> The compact 8000BTU/H air conditioner unit delivers fast and effective cooling for spaces up to 230 sq. ft. You can use it in your home  office  cabin or camper. It comes with a strong airflow rate of 300m3/h that ensures quality air circulation while replacing the stale air with the outdoor fresh air in a few minutes.<br />● <strong>Water-Full Warning and Long Drain Hose:</strong> Among various protection functions  this unit is designed with a water-full control and warning feature  keeping your floors or carpets from getting wet. The drain hose has a length of 10ft that allows you to drain the water in the bathroom easily.<br />● <strong>Easy Moving Casters and Remote Control:</strong> There are four all-direction casters that allow you to move it easily from one place to another. Also  this air conditioner features a modern design that everyone loves and remote control  which allows you to set it up easily.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Suggested window width: 22.5-42inch</li> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Cooling capacity: 8000BTU（Ashrae），5000BTU（SACC）</li> <li>Refrigerant/charge: R410a/16.6oz</li> <li>Power supply: 110-120v/60hz</li> <li>Rated input: 830w</li> <li>Rated current: 10.2a</li> <li>Low side pressure: 261psi</li> <li>High side pressure: 580psi</li> <li>Air flow: 300m³/h</li> <li>Ac cooling rate (btu/hr): 8000btu</li> <li>Ashrae: 8000btu/hr</li> <li>Sacc: 5000btu/hr</li> <li>Ac coverage area (sq. ft.): 230</li> <li>Noise: 55db</li> <li>Temperature setting range: 62.6℉ to 86 ℉</li> <li>Filter type: Washable</li> <li>Exhaust hose: Single</li> <li>Length of exhaust hose: 11"- 5'</li> <li>Remote control: Yes</li> <li>Dimension: 12" x 13.5" x 28"(W x D x H)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Portable Air Conditioners,,Dimension:12" x 13.5" x 28"(W x D x H); ,Portable Air Conditioners,Drop Price,,White,EP24937,shopify,425,1,deny,manual,269.99,269.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/i/a/ia_100000000909.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/i/a/ia_100000000906.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/p/ep24937_.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_697_34.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/i/a/ia_100000000902.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/i/a/ia_100000000846.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/i/a/ia_100000000891.jpg,7
mirrored-lockable-jewelry-cabinet-with-stand-and-led-lights-brown,Lockable Mirrored Jewelry Cabinet with Stand and Led Lights-Brown,05326841,https://www.costway.com/lockable-mirrored-jewelry-cabinet-with-stand-and-led-lights.html?piid=9225200&fee=152&fep=5867&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This elegant jewelry cabinet is perfect for organizing and storing your favorite rings  necklaces  and bracelets.</p> <p> </p> <p>Made of high-quality MDF  this jewelry cabinet is sturdy and durable. It is equipped with a big mirror and has a powerful storage capacity. For its built-in different compartments and separate hooks  you can save your favorite accessories safely and in an organized manner.</p> <p> </p> <p>The jewelry storage cabinet makes it easy to choose your jewelry in the morning without the frustration of looking for loose/missing pieces. Organize valuables and display elegant furniture in your home. Don't hesitate to add it to your cart!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Brand new and high quality</li> <li>Made of premium MDF  sturdy and durable</li> <li>Designed with a wood exterior and a velvet-lined interior</li> <li>An elegant full-length mirror</li> <li>Powerful storage capacity</li> <li>Features LED lights (auto light up when opening the door) making your jewelry more dazzling</li> <li>Dressing mirror and jewelry cabinet cleverly combines</li> <li>Safe & secure storage: Features a lock and a key to protect jewelry  makeup  or other accessories</li> <li>Easy to assemble</li> <li>Perfect for bedroom  jewelry shop</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Large Divisional Storage Space:</strong> This storage cabinet features 6 lined shelves designed for holding 108 earring slots  36 hooks for necklaces and bracelets  1 scarf rod  6 rows of ring slots  5 storage shelves for cosmetics  2 bottom drawers for small stuffs. Divisional storage space keeps items in order and neatly  so you can pick up jewelry at a glance.<br /><strong>● 4 Adjustable Mirror Angles:</strong> This floor standing mirror jewelry cabinet has 4 upper horizontal holes on each side of the stand to adjust different beveled angles for a better view  makes it available for person with different height. It ensures that the cabinet rotates within a certain angle  which effectively prevents the jewelry from falling over due to excessive rotation.<br /><strong>● Stylish Design with Full-length Mirror:</strong> The full-length embedded mirror measures 43 x 11 inches  especially its explosion-proof and high-definition dressing design  clearer and safer. Thus you can check your well-dressed outfit from head to toe when dressed and applying makeup. In addition to its practical use  its simple and elegant outlook looks great in any bedroom or dressing room.<br /><strong>● LED Lights and Lockable Cabinet:</strong> 2 LED interior lights powered by 3 AAA batteries (NOT INCLUDED) automatically turn on and off as the mirrored door opens and closes  making this cabinet help you quickly to choose the jewelry you need. Even in dim light  you can clearly see the rings and pick up the right pieces. It comes with a key to keep your jewelry privacy and out of kid's reach.<br /><strong>● Sturdy Frame with Upgrade Bottom Design:</strong> Made of premium MDF board with PVC decorating  durable and solid for a long lifespan. The frame is thick and with strong strength  will not easy to warp or deform. Come with exquisite workmanship  the large bottom bar enhances the extra stability and balance. And the soft velvet liner protect your fine jewelries from scratches and oxidation.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown/li> <li>Material: MDF</li> <li>Overall dimension: 16.1" x 14.4" x 57.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Mirror dimension: 11" x 39.8" (W x L)</li> <li>Quantity of battery: 3 x AAA (not included)</li> <li>Quantity of LED lights: 8</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x jewelry cabinet</li> </u