eds  the heated towel rack can be placed on the floor with 2 stable metal stands  allowing you to conveniently move it around. With detachable stand and 3 wall-mounted kits  the towel warmer is also wall mountable to save space.<br><strong>● Easy to Install & Use</strong>: Simple assembly process is required for the heated towel warmer  then all you need to do is to plug it in and wait for your towels to warm up. The towel warmer can be plugged into a regular electrical outlet with a voltage rating of AC 120V/60Hz.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Material: Low Carbon Steel</li> <li>Overall Dimension(with stand): 22”x 12”x 37.5” (L x W x H)</li> <li>Overall Dimension(without stand): 22”x 31.5” (L x W x H)</li> <li>Each Bar Maximum Weight: 44 lbs</li> <li>Net Weight: 5.5 lbs/ 2.5 kg</li> <li>Highest Temperature: 131℉(55℃)</li> <li>Rated Power: 100W</li> <li>Voltage: 120V 60Hz</li> <li>Cord Length: 4 ft</li> <li>Box Qty: 1</li> <li>Package Includes:</li> <li>1 x Heated Towel Rack</li> <li>2 x Metal Stand</li> <li>1 x Accessory Bag</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Bath > Towel Racks,,Overall Dimension(with stand):22”x 12”x 37.5” (L x W x H); Overall Dimension(without stand):22”x 31.5” (L x W x H); ,Towel Racks,,,White,EP22806,shopify,171,1,deny,manual,64.99,138.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP22806/100W_Electric_Towel_Warmer_Drying_Rack-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP22806/100W_Electric_Towel_Warmer_Drying_Rack-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP22806/100W_Electric_Towel_Warmer_Drying_Rack-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP22806/100W_Electric_Towel_Warmer_Drying_Rack-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com