 umbrella that slides through the table's center hole  which is wear-resistant and waterproof for outdoor use. It keeps children cool and protected from the dazzling sunlight. Moreover  it is foldable and removable if kids want more play area or enjoy indoor pleasure.<br />● <strong>Child-safe Material and Smooth Corner Design:</strong> Made of high quality wood with water-based painting  this table and bench set is impact-resistant and tough for long term use. It is non-toxic for kids’ health  so parents can rest assured. In addition  all corners are rounded to avoid any potential clothes or skin scratch.<br />● <strong>Kid-sized Table Set with Roomy Space:</strong> This picnic table set is scientifically designed to fit kids’ height. Two built-in benches seat up to 4 children  thus your little one can comfortably share their seat with their friends face to face. The 35’" x 13.5" table provides spacious surface to display abundant food and beverages.<br />● <strong>Adorable Children Gift:</strong> This stylish children activity table set is perfect for craft time  snacking  board and card games  and more with friends! It can be used for both indoor and outdoor such as living room  garden  backyard or playground. It is sure to the perfect present for boys and girls on birthday  Christmas and other holidays.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: PP  PE  sponge</li> <li>Color: As pictures show</li> <li>Material: Wood</li> <li>Bench dimension: 35" x 6.5" x 11" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Table dimension: 35" x 13.4" x 20" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Umbrella size: 51" x 67.5" (Diameter x H)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes: </li> <li>1 x Table</li> <li>1 x Umbrella </li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Toddler & Kids Furniture > Kids Table & Chair Sets,,Bench dimension:35" x 6.5" x 11" (L x W x H); Table dimension:35" x 13.4" x 20" (L x W x H); Umbrella size:51" x 67.5" (Diameter x H); ,Kids Table & Chair Sets,Drop Price,,Brown,OP70529,shopify,516,1,deny,manual,75.99,107.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_385_68.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/u/outdoor_4-seat_kid_s_picnic_table_bench-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/u/outdoor_4-seat_kid_s_picnic_table_bench-1.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_550_67.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/u/outdoor_4-seat_kid_s_picnic_table_bench-3.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/u/outdoor_4-seat_kid_s_picnic_table_bench-4.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_447_76.jpg,7
4-in-1-detachable-baby-stroller-tricycle-with-round-canopy-blue,5-in-1 Detachable Baby Stroller Tricycle with Round Canopy-Blue,73450219,https://www.costway.com/4-in-1-detachable-baby-stroller-tricycle-with-round-canopy.html?piid=9210100&fee=152&fep=6466&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Perfect gift for kids  accompanying children through different stages of growth<br />● 5-position adjustable canopy provides a perfect shade solution for your kids<br />● Observing mesh window ensures optimal ventilation and visibility<br />● Features a detachable canopy that requires a one-button installation<br />● 4-level pushing handle with limited steering angle for safety<br />● Comes with a 2-position seat  helping kids find the comfiest sitting position<br />● Designed with dual rear brakes  ensuring convenient and stable stopping<br />● Equipped with a detachable cushion that is also washable<br />● Comes with a detachable handrail and a removable pushing handle for flexibility<br />● Has a front wheel clutch to release or limit the front pedals<br />● Includes a safety strap to stop the tricycle rolling away<br />● Thanks to the mesh storage basket  you can keep toys within reach<br />● Anti-slip handles come with an interesting bell  which brings more fun<br />● Retractable footrests and 5-point safety belt help kids maintain stability<br />● Stable riding experience on the asphalt  rubber  cement  hardwood  and more<br />● ASTM compliant and CPSIA certificated for ensured quality</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Flexible 5-In-1 Design:</strong> The baby tricycle can be turned into a toddler tricycle for 10 months +  a push trike for 18 months +  a training trike for 2 years old +  an independent trike or a classic trike for 3-5 years old. It also features many flexible details  like a 2-level seat  a removable washable cushion  a detachable guardrail  etc.<br />● <strong>Secure Parent Control:</strong> For your comfort  the 4-level parent handle is adjustable from 30.5" to 37". In addition  the kids' trike features a 58° limited steering angle for secure navigation  an extra safety strap on the pushing handle  and dual rear wheel brakes for immediate stopping  making it a perfect fit for family outings.<br />● <strong>Adjustable Sun Protection:</strong> Protect your child from harsh sunlight with the 5-position canopy that is also detachable. Additionally  the baby push stroller  ASTM compliant and CPSIA certificated  includes an observing mesh window on the top  which allows you to keep an eye on your little one during rides while maintaining great airflow.<br />● <strong>Enhanced Safety Features:</strong> Equip your baby for a safe ride with the stroller trike's 5-point safety harness and retractable footrests designed to support and secure little riders. Built to accommodate children up to 55 lbs  the 5-in-1 kids tricycle ensures durability and long-lasting comfort as your child grows.<br />● <strong>Perfect Riding Experience:</strong> Designed with little hands in mind  the trike has anti-slip handles that ensure a firm grip and a friendly bell to make rides more enjoyable. The mesh storage basket provides ample storage space. Besides  the smart front wheel clutch can lock pedals as needed  avoiding accidental injuries.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Blue</li> <li>Overall dimension: As picture shown</li> <li>Suitable age from 10 months to 5 years old</li> <li>Front wheel diameter: 10"</li> <li>Rear wheel Diameter: 8"</li> <li>Weight capacity: 55 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of basket: 2.2 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes: </li> <li>1 x Tricycle </li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Baby Strollers,,Overall dimension:As picture shown; Front wheel diameter:10"; Rear wheel Diameter:8"; ,Baby Strollers,Clearance,,Blue,BB4691BL,shopify,230,1,deny,manual,89.99,89.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/produc