3-tier-bamboo-bench-storage-shoe-shelf-black,3 Tier Bamboo Bench Storage Shoe Shelf-Black,41309785,https://www.costway.com/3-tier-bamboo-shoe-rack-bench-for-entryway.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=6527&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<ul> <li>● Crafted from tenacious bamboo material  stable  reliable</li> <li>● Functionally combining the bench and the shoe rack together</li> <li>● Easy to assemble with an illustrated instruction</li> <li>● Shelf capacity of 18 lbs  maximum capacity of 220 lbs</li> <li>● Neatly storage your shoes  also as bedside bench  plant stand  side table and more</li> <li>● Space-saving and simple design  look beautiful in your home.</li> <li>● Ideal for living room  bedroom  bathroom and more</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Fair Well to Shoe Piles:</strong> This freestanding shoe rack offers you 2 tiers of slatted storage shelves  that are at least 6-pair-of-shoe stock  giving you a neat and tidy entry. And you can also drop off your bag  hats  and other things on the first tier. <br /><strong>● Multifunctional Design:</strong> This shoe bench guarantees you a sitting spot while changing your shoes with the ability to keep your shoes underneath the bench and within reach. It also works as a perfect side table  storage shelf  and plants stand in your living room  bathroom  and balcony.<br /><strong>● Excellent Stability and Bamboo:</strong> With a robust bamboo frame  this shoe bench holds up to 220 lbs and supports steadily and firmly when you sit on it. And each shelf can bear a maximum weight of 18 lbs. Bamboo material has impressive tenacity  which means it can be used for the long term. <br /><strong>● Compact and Simplicity Inspired:</strong> With a simple appearance  this shoe rack bench stands beautifully in most homes and interiors  well complementing with existing furniture. The compact size makes the shoe bench easily fit into narrowed spots to save valuable floor spaces. <br /><strong>● Assembly Is a No Brainer:</strong> To make the installation less strenuous  this shoe bench delivers detailed instructions  and you can also watch the installation videos for more specific guidance. Once assembled  the shoe bench measures 27.5 inches long  11 inches wide  and 17.5 inches high.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black/Natural</li> <li>Material: Bamboo</li> <li>Dimension:27.6" x 11.0" x 17.7"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Distance between each shelf: 6"</li> <li>Product Weight: 9.0lbs</li> <li>Package Contents: 1 X Shoe Rack Bench</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Entryway > Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,Dimension:27.6" x 11.0" x 17.7"(L x W x H); ,Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,,Black,HW66058BK,shopify,75,1,deny,manual,45.99,45.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/3/03_14_14.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/5/05_12_14.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/1/01_12_13.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/2/02_13_13.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/1/011_4_3.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/4/04_13_14.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/8/08_9_13.jpg,7
