rtable and compact. It is perfect for your limited space such as dorms  apartments  condos  motor homes  RV's  camping and more. And the light weight makes it easy for moving.<br /><strong>● Shipping and Customer service:</strong> UPS or USPS will deliver the item to your house in 3-6 business days after you placed an order. We packed the item as good as we can  if there is any damaged part  please contact us first and offer us pictures of damaged part  we will solve the problem as the way you want(discount or replacement).</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Gray and white</li> <li>Material: ABS+ PP</li> <li>Dimension: 24.8" x 15" x 28.5" (L x D x H)</li> <li>Voltage: 120 V/60 Hz</li> <li>Net weight: 29.3 lbs</li> <li>Wash capacity: 12 lbs</li> <li>Spin capacity: 8 lbs</li> <li>Washing power:260 W</li> <li>Spinner power: 140 W</li> <li>Length of inlet pipe: 44.5"</li> <li>Length of drainpipe: 20.5"</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Appliances > Washers & Dryers > Washing Machines,,Dimension:24.8" x 15" x 28.5" (L x D x H); ,Washing Machines,On Sale,,Gray,FP10354,shopify,1343,1,deny,manual,159.99,318.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_538_12.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/a/6/a6_21_5.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/a/1/a1_26_10.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/a/8/a8_18_6.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/a/7/a7_22_5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/a/4/a4_24_7.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136