ging table for changing diapers conveniently</li> <li>Several storage bags with various specifications to meet your different requirements</li> <li>Two casters with brakes under the bed for easy moving and relocation</li> <li>All corners are covered with PP plastic to protect babies</li> <li>Apart from the bed  all other accessories are removable</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Rugged Stable Folding Travel Bed with Fancy Toys:</strong> Made of iron pipe  PP plastic  Rugged  Stable and Folding Travel Bed with Fancy Toys: This eco-friendly and sturdy bed is made of iron pipe  PP plastic  and oxford cloth. There are six strands evenly distributed under the bed and cross bracing reinforce to maintain its stability. Its folding property makes it portable and suitable for traveling. The hanging toys and the music box will help to ease the baby's mood when they wake up.</li> <li><strong>Zipper Door for Baby and Breathable Mesh Cloth:</strong> The upper sleeping bed can be removed to use it as a playing house  and there is a side zipper door for babies to enter into the bed by themselves. This bed adopts net cloth to maintain the ventilation in summer  which makes it be seen clearly from the outside.</li> <li><strong>Rocking Support and Casters with Brake Design:</strong> Apart from the six strands and cross bracing  it includes two retractable rocking support legs which are detachable and can be used to help your baby to fall asleep. Furthermore  there are two casters under the bed for easy moving and relocation  and they will stop rolling just by pressing the brakes to ensure safety.</li> <li><strong>Diaper Changing Table and Attentive Corner Protector:</strong> There is a detachable diaper changing table above the bi-level bed  so you don't need to bend down to change diapers. All corners are covered by PP plastic to make them sleek and rust-proof to protect babies from getting hurt by metal edges.</li> <li><strong>Canopy with Mosquito Net abov