28-inch-pink-dollhouse-with-furniture,28 Inch Pink Dollhouse with Furniture,38925701,https://www.costway.com/28-inch-pink-dollhouse-with-furniture.html?fee=152&fep=8430&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Made of eco-friendly MDF with non-toxic paint<br />● 3 levels of open space<br />● 5 rooms and a balcony<br />● 8 pieces of colorful furniture<br />● Accommodates 4" mini dolls<br />● Large enough that multiple children can play at once<br />● The side windows allow kids to view dolls from a different point of view<br />● Easy to assemble</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Ooden Multi-Story Dollhouse:</strong> The 3 story semi-open miniature townhouse has 5 open rooms  including bathroom  living room  dressing room  kitchen and dining room and a bonus balcony. The stunning doll house wallpapers and decorations in each room have a lot of details to make it look real enough to inspire kids' imagination.<br /><strong>● DIY Creative Collocation:</strong> The doll house is equipped with 8 pieces colorful furniture accessories  like table and chair set  cabinet clothes hanger and a toilet  bathtub etc.The accessories and furniture can be placed and arranged at will  offering tons of storytelling possibilities  and the girls can create a wonderful story for their own.<br /><strong>● Safe Material and Easy Setup:</strong> The princess dream house uses high-quality non-toxic MDF material  which is durable and does not crack. The edges are smooth  with no sharp or rough burrs and they will not scratch the child's delicate skin. This dream dollhouse comes with detailed instructions manual  and it's easy to set up.<br /><strong>● Encourages Creativity and Imagination:</strong> The dollhouse encourages girls to build her dream house for lovely dolls and role play with friends. The pretend playset can stimulate kids' imagination develop creativity exercise hands-on ability practice motor skills  while also promoting communication  reasoning and intellectual thinking.<br /><strong>● Best Gift for Children:</strong> This pretend play toy is a wonderful birthday or Christmas gift for the little princess aged 3-12 years old. This dollhouse can accommodate dolls up to 4 inches tall. And the furniture is tiny and cute  and is the excellent size for little hands. Your child will be over the moon and have a lot of fun to roleplay with her friends.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: MDF</li> <li>Net weight: 15.4 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimension: 24" x 11" x 28"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Dollhouse</li> <li>1 x Screw bag</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Pretend Toys > Play Tents & Playhouse,,Overall dimension:24" x 11" x 28"(L x W x H); ,Play Tents & Playhouse,,,Pink,HW56619,shopify,107,1,deny,manual,89.99,89.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/8/28in_pink_dollhouse_with_furniture-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/8/28in_pink_dollhouse_with_furniture-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/k/4/k4_6_62.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/k/2/k2_6_64.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/k/5/k5_7_60.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/k/1/k1_6_65.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/k/8/k8_7_49.jpg,7
