art is made of durable and wearable 600 D canvas and it can be used for a long period.</p> <p><strong>Large Storage Space:</strong> Equipped with 3 compartments aside the table  you can place diapers  towels and any other accessories conveniently. If there are more items needed  the lower storage space is available to keep toys  diaper pail and baby clothes  etc.</p> <p><strong>Foldable Changing Table:</strong> Easily fold it if you finish all the tasks! With its space saving design  you can store it behind a door. It will make life a little easier for parents.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Iron frame + Waterproof PVC + 600D canvas</li> <li>Dimension: 31.5" x 24.8" x 35.4" ( L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 11.2 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity : 24 lbs</li> <li>Suitable for babies up to 12 months</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Nursery Furniture > Changing Tables,,Dimension:31.5" x 24.8" x 35.4" ( L x W x H); ,Changing Tables,On Sale,,Black,AC10003BK,shopify,607,1,deny,manual,62.99,62.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/a/baby_storage_folding_diaper_changing_table-1_3_.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/a/baby_storage_folding_diaper_changing_table-1_1_.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/a/baby_storage_folding_diaper_changing_table-1_2_.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/a/baby_storage_folding_diaper_changing_table-1_10_.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/a/baby_storage_folding_diaper_changing_table-1_4_.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d2713