toddler-travel-stroller-for-airplane-with-canopy-and-adjustable-backrest-black,Toddler Travel Stroller for Airplane with Canopy and Adjustable Backrest-Black,24087153,https://www.costway.com/toddler-travel-stroller-for-airplane-with-canopy-and-adjustable-backrest.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=8512&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<ul> <li>●  Construction by durable steel frame</li> <li>●  Non-toxic and breathable canopy with skylight for keeping an eye on your baby</li> <li>●  5-point safety harness for protecting your baby</li> <li>●  Multi position reclining seat for comfortable sleeping</li> <li>●  Smart foldable design for more convenient storage</li> <li>●  Storage basket underneath for holding accessories</li> <li>●  Feeding tray in front for placing things</li> <li>●  5.5'' EVA wheels offer more stability</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Adjustable Backrest & Canopy:</strong> The backrest of the baby stroller can be reclined from 110° to 145° for sitting  lying or sleeping. You can always find the most comfortable position for your little one. What’s more  the canopy can be adjusted freely according to different weather conditions  providing the best rest environment for baby.<br /><strong>● One-hand Fold & Portable Design:</strong> Parents can quickly fold the baby stroller with one hand by pressing a button on the handle. Weighing only about 13 lbs  the compact and lightweight stroller can easily fit in the trunk of a car as well as in the overhead bin of an airplane  suitable for family trips or everyday outings.<br /><strong>● More Features & Convenience:</strong> There is a mesh skylight at the canopy top so you can observe baby's condition at any time. The removable snack tray with cup holder provides great on-the-go convenience and the large storage basket can be used to store your baby's necessities or as a shopping basket.<br /><strong>● Multiple Safety Protections:</strong> The baby stroller has passed ASTM & CPSC safety standard test. The main frame is made of high-quality iron pipe  which is sturdy and durable. The Oxford fabric is not easy to tear or puncture. In addition  the stroller features a 5-point harness to ensure safety while fitting baby's body.<br /><strong>● All-Terrain Wheels & One-step Brake:</strong> The wear-resistant EVA wheels are designed with shock absorption spring system for a smooth ride on a variety of terrains. The front wheels can be rotated 360 degrees  and the rear wheels can be locked with one-step brake.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black/Coffee</li> <li>Material: Steel  300D Oxford  PP  EVA</li> <li>Net weight: 13 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimension: 35"(L) x 18"(W) x 39"(H)</li> <li>Folded size : 31.5"(L) x 18"(W) x 21"(H)</li> <li>Weight capacity of the seat: 33 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of the basket: 3 lbs</li> <li>Age range: 6-36 months</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Baby stroller</li> </ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Baby Strollers,,Overall dimension:35"(L) x 18"(W) x 39"(H); Folded size:31.5"(L) x 18"(W) x 21"(H); ,Baby Strollers,On Sale,,Black,BB4758BK,shopify,1676,1,deny,manual,92.99,92.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/b/bb4758bk-1_7_.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/b/bb4758bk-1_11_.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/b/bb4758bk-1_1_.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/l/black_9.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/b/bb4758bk-1_5_.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/b/bb4758bk-1_6_.jpg,6,https://asset