outdoor-recliner-cushioned-chaise-lounge-with-adjustable-backrest,Outdoor Recliner Cushioned Chaise Lounge with Adjustable Backrest,56184703,https://www.costway.com/patio-wicker-chaise-lounge-chair-with-wheels-adjustable-reclining-chair-with-cushions.html?piid=9220100&fee=152&fep=8598&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Do you want to bathe in warm sunshine under the blue sky and white clouds? This outdoor rattan lounge chair will be your ideal choice for spending leisure time!</p> <p> </p> <p>Featuring a weather-resistant PE wicker overlay on sturdy metal frame  this piece can be used outdoors all year round. The 6-position adjustable back allows you to sit up  lean back or lie down completely to meet your different needs such as reading or sleeping. Two rear wheels enable the recliner to be easily transported from one place to another  allowing you to follow the moving sunlight at all times. With a stylish and classic appearance  this lounge chair will be a perfect complement to your patio  yard and poolside!</p> <p> </p> <p>It is your best choice for your living room  garden  veranda  etc. Don't hesitate to buy one!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of weather-resistant PE rattan for year-round outdoor use</li> <li>Adjustable backrest with 6 different positions to fit different needs</li> <li>Thick sponge padded cushion for maximum lounging comfort</li> <li>Including headrest and curved armrests for added comfort</li> <li>Removable cushion cover with zipper for easy cleaning</li> <li>Suitable for poolside  balcony  backyard and other places</li> <li>Designed with two back wheels for easy movement</li> <li>Easy to assemble with clear instructions and all necessary tools included</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>●<strong> Selected Materials and Stable Structure:</strong> Made of weather-resistant PE rattan and sturdy metal frame  this lounge chair has a high load-bearing capacity and a longer service life without breaking easily. In addition  the non-slip foot pads at the bottom can enhance the overall stability while preventing scratches on the floor.<br />● <strong>Adjustable Backrest and Smooth Wheels:</strong> The backrest of this recliner has 6 adjustable positions to choose from  allowing you to sit up  lean back or lie down completely  to meet your different needs of reading  relaxing and sleeping. Besides  two smooth wheels allow the lounge chair to be easily relocated around your patio.<br />● <strong>Ergonomic Comfortable Design:</strong> This rattan lounge chair is equipped with a thick cushion and extra headrest to double your comfort. The elastic cord can prevent the cushion from moving. The zippered cushion cover made of durable waterproof polyester cloth can be easily removed for washing. Moreover  the curved armrests on both sides are moderate in height to rest your arms.<br />●<strong> Wide Range of Applications:</strong> With a chic and stylish look  this eye-catching chaise chair is a perfect complement to the courtyard  porch  poolside  patio or any outdoor setting. Whether you want to take a nap  bathe in the sun or enjoy outdoor beauty  it is a good companion.<br />● <strong>Dimension of Outdoor Chaise:</strong> Equipped with detailed instructions and necessary tools  this lounge chair can be easily assembled in a short time. Overall dimension: 79" x 27.5" x 14" ~ 40.5" (L x W x H)  adjustable height: 14" 21" 27.5" 32.5" 37" 40.5" weight capacity: 400 lbs  thickness of cushion: 2".</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Rattan color: Brown</li> <li>Color of cushion: White</li> <li>Material: Galvanized steel  PE rattan  polyester fabrics</li> <li>Overall dimension: 79.0" x27.5" x 21"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Thickness of cushion: 2.0"</li> <li>Adjustable height: 14"/21"/27.5"/32.5"/37"/40.5"</li> <li>Weight capacity: 220 lbs</li> <li></li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Lounge chair with cushion</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Outdoor Chaise Lounges,,Overall dimension:79.0" x27.5" x 21"(L x W x H); ,Outdoor Chaise Lounges,Clearance,,White,HW66946,shopify,236,1,deny,manual,139.99,139.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_398_53.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_420_58.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_270_52.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_442_63.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_419_61.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_381_53.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_341_53.jpg,7
