rigeration compartment.<br /><strong>● Powerful Performance:</strong> This refrigerator cools quickly and evenly  and it will keep ice frozen solid and foods perfectly chilled. It is an excellent value that will bring years of quiet  reliable use.<br /><strong>● Crisper Drawer:</strong> The crisper drawer is designed for your fruits and vegetables  which always keeps them fresh.<br /><strong>● Freezer Compartment:</strong> Separate freezer compartment chills your ice cream all summer  and the included ice tray can make ice cubes to keep your drinks cool.<br /><strong>● Removable Glass Shelf:</strong> The glass shelf can be removed or adjusted if you want to organize taller things. And it also offers convenience for cleaning.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Stainless steel + glass + plastic</li> <li>Interior capacity: 3.2 cu. ft</li> <li>Power: 120 V / 60 Hz</li> <li>Temperature range: 5 °F – 50 °F</li> <li>Package weight: 52 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x refrigerator</li> <li>1 x instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Appliances > Kitchen Appliances > Refrigerators & Freezers > Refrigerators,,,Refrigerators,,,Black,EP22672BK,shopify,404,1,deny,manual,289.99,289.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP22672BK/3.2_cu_ft._Compact_Stainless_Steel_Refrigerator_Black-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP22672BK/3.2_cu_ft._Compact_Stainless_Steel_Refrigerator_Black-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP22672BK/3.2_cu_ft._Compact_Stainless_Steel_Refrigerator_Black-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP22672BK/3.2_cu_ft._Compact_Stainless_Steel_Refrigerator_Black-Size-5.jpg,4,https://