e protected when using this wobble chair because of the silicone material made from the bottom  the embossing of which often improves friction to ensure children's protection. The bottom is designed to avoid scratching the floor of your room.<br />● <strong>Adjustable Height:</strong> The adjustable height of this stool is about 16.5" to 24" for children above 7 years of age and adults. It is easy to use since the stool is fully assembled and the pneumatic rod inside helps to move the stool to different heights.<br />● <strong>Suitable for Various Occasions:</strong> This chair catches your attention with its distinctive stylish appearance. It blends well into the living room  the kitchen counters  the classroom  the markets  etc.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black/Green/White</li> <li>Materials: PP  silicone material</li> <li>Product size: 13" x 13" x 16.5"-24" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 10 lbs</li> <li>Max loaded weight: 250 lbs</li> <li>Minimum adjusting weight: 66 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes: </li> <li>1 x Wobble seating stool</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Office Chairs > Kneeling Chairs,,Product size:13" x 13" x 16.5"-24" (L x W x H); ,Kneeling Chairs,Drop Price,,Black,JV10554BK,shopify,467,1,deny,manual,59.99,59.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/3/_3_51_22.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/2/_2_107_22.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/8/c8_5_78.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/1/_1_93_25.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/a/d/adjustable_active_learning_stool_size_black-5.jpg,5,https://assets.cost