e chair.<br />● <strong>Tempered Glass and Top Grade Steel:</strong> This table and chair set selects the tempered glass table top and the top-grade steel material  which ensures durability and longevity of the whole set. In addition  the selected paint coating renders a fresh and young look to the furniture.<br />● <strong>Easy for Use and Wash:</strong> This table and chairs set is prepared to be used upon delivery. It frees you from all the boring and even complicates manual assembly work. The table top is glass material  which means easy cleaning with just a piece of damp cloth.<br />● <strong>Utility Furniture:</strong> This patio Bistro Set can be used on various occasions. For example  you can use it on your balcony to enjoy quality time with your partner at night  or you can use it in your yard to enjoy quality time with your friends over a cup of tea.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material of seat: Textile fiber  steel and glass</li> <li>Color: Black/Red</li> <li>Size of chair: 19" x 20" x 32" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Size of coffee Table: 24" x 28"</li> <li>Thickness of table top glass: 5 mm</li> <li>Max loading weight of table: 133 lbs</li> <li>Max loading weight of chair: 265 lbs</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>2 x Chairs</li> <li>1 x Table</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Size of chair:19" x 20" x 32" (L x W x H); Size of coffee Table:24" x 28"; ,Patio Conversation Sets,Clearance,,Black,OP3355BK,shopify,196,1,deny,manual,74.99,74.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_491_94.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/3/13_67_18.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_541_121.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.