patio-lawn-folding-garden-rectangle-wood-portable-planter-box,Folding Wooden Raised Garden Bed with Removable Bottom for Herbs Fruits Flowers,61798045,https://www.costway.com/patio-lawn-folding-garden-rectangle-wood-portable-planter-box.html?fee=152&fep=9720&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● High-grade fir wood for high stability and durability<br />● Detachable bottom makes maintenance and assembly much easier<br />● Drainage hole prevents water accumulation and protects plants’ roots<br />● Raised legs are effective to prevent dampness<br />● Ideal for patio  garden  deck  etc.<br />● Suitable to grow a variety of plants like fruits  flowers and so on<br />● Appealing appearance adds a piece of elegance<br />● Easy to assemble with tools and quick to fold<br /><a href="https://cdn1.costway.com/media/us/Install_video/61798045.mp4" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline;font-weight: bolder;color:#c82a2e;">Installation guide</a></p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Solid Fir Wood Structure:</strong> The folding planting box is made of high-quality fir wood  which is natural  well-crafted and weatherproof  ensuring long-time outdoor use. The main frame formed by thicker wood is of high strength  enabling the planter box to load a maximum weight of 88 lbs.<br />● <strong>Thoughtful Design:</strong> The planting box is well designed for better plant growth. It's easy to manage and clean the planter box with the detachable bottom. The drainage hole at the bottom plank effectively avoids water accumulation and prevents the roots of plants from rotting. Also  raised legs to keep a certain distance from the ground to prevent moisture.<br />● <strong>Wide Range of Application:</strong> The folding plant container is widely applied and it can perfectly fit outdoor places. It features the ideal size for patio  front porch  deck and other areas outside your home without taking up much space. It can be also used to grow a variety of plants  including flowers  herbs  fruits and all kinds of greenery.<br />● <strong>Attractive Appearance:</strong> The wooden planter is simple but attractive. Natural color is full of life. Wooden construction complements the natural beauty of the flowers and greenery that are contained in the planter. It can create a harmonious and peaceful atmosphere for you and help you enjoy your life better.<br />● <strong>Easy Setup and Folding:</strong> The tool-free installation will save much effort for you. Unlike other common planting boxes  this is foldable. You just need to remove the detachable bottom before folding. What's more  with 6.5 lbs lightweight  the planter box is effortless to be moved anywhere you want.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Natural</li> <li>Material: Fir Wood</li> <li>Overall Dimension: 27.5" x 12" x 10" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Folding Dimension: 27.5" x 10" x 3.5" (L x W x Thickness)</li> <li>Weight Capacity: 88 lbs</li> <li>Net Weight: 6.5 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Garden > Raised Garden Beds,,Overall Dimension:27.5" x 12" x 10" (L x W x H); Folding Dimension:27.5" x 10" x 3.5" (L x W x Thickness); ,Raised Garden Beds,,,Natural,GT3961,shopify,236,1,deny,manual,49.99,49.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/GT3961/Raised_Garden_Bed_for_garden-2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/GT3961/Raised_Garden_Bed_for_backyard-6.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/GT3961/Folding_Wooden_Raised_Garden_Bed-1.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/GT3961/Raised_Garden_Bed_with_Removable_Bottom-7.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb