6-tier-garden-wooden-shelf-storage-plant-rack-stand,6 Tier Garden Wooden Shelf Storage Plant Rack Stand ,96708412,https://www.costway.com/6-tier-garden-wooden-shelf-storage-plant-rack-stand.html?fee=152&fep=9722&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This flower stand can fully play its multifunctional role inside or outside your home.</p> <p> </p> <p>Equipped with solid and weather-resistant wood construction  the plant stand can be placed at your balcony  living room  garden or patio etc. You can not only display beautiful flowers and vigorous potted plants but also store or exhibit your photos  trophies  books and other beautiful artworks. Multi-layer high and low design makes full of space to highlight all plants. Each rack provides sufficient space to accommodate plants. And the hollow-out design makes it convenient for you to water plants.</p> <p> </p> <p>The strong bearing capacity and weather-resistant wood construction will maintain long term use. It will be an ideal choice for your home!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor places such as balcony  living room  bedroom  patio  garden or terrace</li> <li>Hollow-out racks convenient for watering and draining especially in rainy day</li> <li>High and low design and multi layers making full of space and fully displaying all plants or ornaments </li> <li>Being used for displaying various flowers or potted plant such as succulent plants  narcissus  cactus  roses  lilies  tulips  daisies</li> <li>Sturdy and solid fir wood construction maintaining anti-corrosive and weather-resistant</li> <li>Easy to assemble with high-quality hardware and detailed manual</li> <li>Strong bearing capacity ensuring long period use</li> <li>11 spacious racks offering ample space for storing and displaying plants or flowers</li> <li>In addition to serving as a flower rack  it can be used for displaying pictures  paintings  knickknacks  books and other artworks or ornaments</li> </ul><p st