-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Fir wood</li> <li>Overall dimension: 29.5" x 10" x 55.5"</li> <li>Weight: 9.3 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Wood flower rack</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Garden > Plant Stands,,Overall dimension:29.5" x 10" x 55.5"; ,Plant Stands,Bestseller,,Brown,GT3560,shopify,16,1,deny,manual,54.99,54.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/4/b4_10_2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/7/b7_10_2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/1/b10_11_2.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/3/b3_11_2.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/9/b9_13_2.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/6/b6_10_2.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/8/b8_9_2.jpg,7
