 adjustable. Thus  this can block your little ones from harmful UV rays  and won't hurt their eyes. It can also be stretched out and folded back anytime as needed.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Lock Wheels and 5-Point Harness:</strong> 2 lockable wheels are much safer than without locks. Mom or Dad can easily stop the stroller hands-free to make sure that everything is safe. 5-point harness is also designed for safety  which gives the baby a comfortable and enjoyable ride.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Iron (frame) + 300D oxford (cover) + EVA (wheels)</li> <li>Product size: 26.0" x 20.0" x 43.5"</li> <li>Fold size: 43.5" x 12.0" x 8.0"</li> <li>Product weight: 12.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of the seat: 33 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of the storage basket: 3 lbs</li> <li>Recommended age: Above 6 months</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Baby Strollers,,Product size:26.0" x 20.0" x 43.5"; Fold size:43.5" x 12.0" x 8.0"; ,Baby Strollers,,,Black,BB4880BK,shopify,475,1,deny,manual,79.99,79.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/1/m15_18_2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/1/m17_15_2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/7/271_3_2.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/1/m18_13_2.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/1/m19_13_2.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/2/m24_3_2.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/2/m25_3_2.jpg,7
