 let the wood stay in the sawhorse firmly. It provides extra safety when you saw wood.<br /><strong>● Easy To Use:</strong> With its simple and useful design  you could quickly set up and use the sawhorse. It can help you do the work more efficiently.<br /><strong>● Triangular Structure:</strong> When set up  this triangular structure of the sawhorse will be more sturdy. And with the saw tooth  it also avoids contact damage between cutting blades and steel struts.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Steel</li> <li>Item weight: 16.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 220 lbs</li> <li>Folding dimensions: 39" x 32" (L x W)</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 32" x 32" x 31.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Storage & Garages > Garages,,Folding dimensions:39" x 32" (L x W); Overall dimensions:32" x 32" x 31.5" (L x W x H); ,Garages,On Sale,,Silver,TL33845,shopify,174,1,deny,manual,39.99,49.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/l/tl33845_2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/l/tl33845_3.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/l/tl33845.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/l/tl33845_1.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/l/tl33845_4.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/l/tl33845_5.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/l/tl33845_6.jpg,7
