y and durable enough to stand steadily. With an anti-skid foot pad under each leg to protect the floor from being scratched.<br />● <strong>Built-in Storage Compartment:</strong> There is a large built-in storage compartment under the seat for storing music  books or other items. The top lid and hidden storage are connected by a premium bracket lock which can hold the seat lid in the fully open position.<br />● <strong>Padded Seat:</strong> Padded with the high-resilience sponge and covered with soft PU leather  our piano bench makes you feel very comfortable even if practicing for a long time.<br />● <strong>Elegant Design And Multi-functional Usage:</strong> The unique and elegant design allows this piano bench to blend in with any decoration style perfectly. It is suitable for many occasions  such as orchestras  recording studios  music bands  concerts  schools  churches  homes  etc.<br />● <strong>Duet Piano Bench:</strong> The overall dimension of our exclusive piano bench is 29.5" x14" x19.5" (L x W x H)  it can easily accommodate 2 adults for duet performances or comfortable tutoring.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Pu leather and solid wood</li> <li>Overall size: 29.5" x 14" x 19.5" ( L x W x H )</li> <li>Weight capacity: About 360 lbs</li> <li>Net weight: About 14 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Piano bench</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > Ottomans,,Overall size:29.5" x 14" x 19.5" ( L x W x H ); ,Ottomans,Bestseller,,Black,JV10571BK,shopify,172,1,deny,manual,54.99,128.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw60296bk_3_1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw60296bk_6_1.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw60296bk_1_1.jpg,3,h