outdoor-kids-ride-on-construction-excavator-with-safety-helmet,Ride on Push Car Bulldozer Digger Toy with Safety Helmet and Working Shovel,98614370,https://www.costway.com/outdoor-kids-ride-on-construction-excavator-with-safety-helmet.html?fee=152&fep=10513&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Greatly satisfies kids' curiosity with safety helmet  toy stone and multiple sounds<br />● Stores kids' essentials with ease thanks to its ample storage space<br />● Offers comfortable seating experience with wide and cozy seat<br />● Ensures toddlers' safety due to odorless PP and HDPE with ASTM certification<br />● Prevents kids from accidental injury with overturn protection<br />● Suitable for different road conditions with shockproof tires<br />● Manually controlled bucket for extra fun<br />● Perfect gift for Christmas  birthday and other events</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Realistic Ride-On Bulldozer:</strong> Simulating the details of an excavator  this ride-on bulldozer is equipped with a vivid push bucket and hand-cranking device  enabling kids to manually push the soil  sand  branches  snow and stones. Kids can also control the toy to move forward and backward  experiencing authentic engineering work.<br /><strong>● Sturdy and Safe Construction:</strong> Made of premium PP material  the ride on excavator is wear-resistant  durable  and sturdy to hold up to 55 lbs. The seat height is foot-to-floor  convenient for children to get on or off. With an overturn protection device at the rear  the ride-on construction vehicle for kids further protects the child from falling over.<br /><strong>● Large Storage Compartment:</strong> The wide seat has both sitting and storage functions. There is a large storage space under the seat where children can store their toys  snacks  storybooks and other necessities. In this way  kids can ride as far as they want  no need to worry about getting things back and forth.<br /><strong>● Solid Tire for Various Roads:</strong> Constructed of HDPE of higher hardness and strength  the wheels ensure long service life. And designed with a groove pattern  the tires are anti-skid and shock resistant  assuring kids to ride comfortably and safely and suitable for different roads: stone roads  cement roads  boardwalk etc.<br /><strong>● Educational Gift for Children:</strong> Insert three AA1.5V batteries(Excluded)  the ride on push car will make sounds  providing added fun. Kids can play and enjoy the sound at the same time  beneficial to cultivate their hand-eye coordination  hearing comprehension  motor ability. The bulldozer toy will be a great gift for kids aged over 3 years old.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Yellow</li> <li>Material: PP  HDPE</li> <li>Overall Dimension: 35" x 17.5" x 12" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Seat Dimension: 7.5" x 6.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Net Weight: 7 lbs</li> <li>Recommended Age: Over 3 years old</li> <li>Battery Needed: 3*AA 1.5v (Not Included)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Ride On Toys > Push & Pedal Ride On Toys,,Overall Dimension:35" x 17.5" x 12" (L x W x H); Seat Dimension:7.5" x 6.5" (L x W); ,Push & Pedal Ride On Toys,,,Yellow,TY342975,shopify,904,1,deny,manual,69.99,106.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY342975/Ride_on_Push_Car_Toddler_Bulldozer_Digger_Toy_withSafety_Helmet_and_Working_Shovel-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY342975/Ride_on_Push_Car_Toddler_Bulldozer_Digger_Toy_withSafety_Helmet_and_Working_Shovel-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY342975/Ride_on_Push_Car_Toddler_Bulldozer_Digger_Toy_withSafety_Helmet_and_Working_Shovel-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d