2-person-waterproof-sleeping-bag-with-2-pillows-black,2 Person Waterproof Sleeping Bag with 2 Pillows-Black,12034586,https://www.costway.com/2-person-waterproof-sleeping-bag-with-2-pillows.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=10640&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Used as a two person sleeping bag<br />● Separated into two separate bags for individual use<br />● Zippers on both sides for easy entry and exits<br />● Specially designed extra interior pockets for storage<br />● Crafted with high quality water-resistant 190T polyester  lined with T/R fabric and filled with luxurious cotton<br />● Designed for near-freezing temperatures  it can keep you warm and cozy even when it's 32°F~ 59°F<br />● Waterproof  weather-resistant design and prevent you from any dampness<br />● Comes with two small T/R fabric pillows<br />● Perfect for hiking  camping  traveling and more<br />● Included a travel-friendly carrying bag with extra holding straps which makes it quite convenient to store and carry</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 2 In 1 Muliti-function Use:</strong> Designed to be used as a large sleeping bag  our sleeping bag can also be separated into two individual sleeping bags if you need. Zippers on both sides for easy entry and exits. Specially designed extra interior pockets for storage to make you travel/Outdoor adventure just a little easier.<br /><strong>● Super Warm and Most Comfortable:</strong> Crafted with high quality water-resistant 190T polyester  lined with T/R fabric and filled with luxurious cotton  Goplus double sleeping bag is quite soft  warm  comfortable and durable that ensuring you can get a good and relaxing sleep after a tiring day of trekking  hiking  travel or any other exploration.<br /><strong>● Made for Extreme Weathers:</strong> Our double sleeping bags are designed for near-freezing temperatures  it can keep you warm and cozy even when it's 32°F ~ 59°F. Furthermore  Our sleeping bags have a waterproof  weather-resistant design and prevent you from any dampness - this is achieved through double-filled technology and S-shaped quilted design.<br /><strong>● Bonus Pillows:</strong> Comes with two small T/R fabric pillows that gives your neck some good  solid support  and will let your camping life more comfortable and have a good night. Perfect for hiking  camping  traveling and more!<br /><strong>● Easy to Carry and Clean:</strong> Our sleeping bags are also extremely easy to clean. Moreover  each sleeping bag comes with a travel-friendly carrying bag with extra holding straps which makes it quite convenient to store and carry the sleeping bag along.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black/Blue</li> <li>Material: Polyester + cotton</li> <li>Unfold dimension: 87" x 59" x 4"</li> <li>Folding dimension: 17" x 12" x 12"</li> <li>Pillow size: 16" x 9"</li> <li>Product weight: 6 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Camping > Air Mattresses & Sleeping Bags,,Unfold dimension:87" x 59" x 4"; Folding dimension:17" x 12" x 12"; Pillow size:16" x 9"; ,Air Mattresses & Sleeping Bags,Bestseller,,Black,OP3650BK,shopify,5,1,deny,manual,49.99,49.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/1/_1_94_29.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/3/_3-de_1.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op3650bk_goplus_.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/r/1/r16_20_1.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/1/_1-de_2.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/r/1/r14_24_1.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product