onstruction:</strong> This stroller is constructed by durable but lightweight aluminum frame and wearproof non-toxic and breathable Oxford fabric cover  protecting your baby from rains or harmful rays. Furthermore  shock absorbers are built in this stroller for high stability  meeting American ASTM safety standard.<br /><strong>● Adjustable Bassinet and Canopy:</strong> You can easily adjust the bassinet of this stroller to meet your baby's different needs to lie  sit or sleep. The 5-point safety harness combined with sleeping cushion provides your baby safe and comfy sleeping. The adjustable 3-section canopy can well protect your baby from ultraviolet radiation.<br /><strong>● Reversible Seat and One-touch Parking:</strong> The bassinet direction is reversible  allowing the baby can face outside to satisfy their curiosity for the world  or face to parents for more interactions. Also  you can stop the stroller quickly with one-touch foot operated brake  improving the safety and flexibility when going out along with your little baby.<br /><strong>● Folding Design and Large Storage Space:</strong> Just press the button on the pushing handle  you can easily fold this stroller in minutes. The folding design is ideal for storage when not in use  and easy carrying when taking your baby outside. The large storage basket underneath is perfect for holding purses  groceries  and diaper bags  etc.<br /><strong>● Practical Cup Holder and Warm Footmuff:</strong> The stroller is high enough to protect your baby from dust. There is a cup holder on the pushing handle  convenient for feeding bottle storage. Furthermore  the bassinet comes with a foot cover  protecting your baby against pitiless wind in winter. When summer comes  you can remove the foot cover to keep your baby cool.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Aluminum alloy + iron pipe + PP + Oxford (cover)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 33 lbs</li> <li>Unit weight: 22 lbs</li> <li>Size: 37