 the left cabinet wall  1 scarf rod  29 hooks for necklaces and bracelets  2 rows of 60 ring slots  and 5 shelves for cosmetics and 2 bottom drawers for private stuffs etc.; they are designed for practical storage purpose  functional for daily use.<br /><strong>●With Key and Lock for More Privacy Storage:</strong> Do you want to have more private and secure space for your jewelry? This jewel armoire is lockable with key. You can keep private storage of your jewelry. The lock and key are well built and of superior quality. You can rest assured that they are durable for long time service.<br /><strong>●Mold-Proof Surface Coating:</strong> This MDF boards are specially customized. They are not ordinary materials in the market. They have good moisture resistance performance and the surface uses a very good quality coating. It is not only environmentally friendly  but also effectively prevents mold. This coating is very smooth and looks very textured and you will be happy to receive it.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Material: Real glass  quality MDF  soft velvet</li> <li>Overall dimension: 14.5" x 3.5" x 56.5" (W x D x H)</li> <li>Mirror dimension: 43.5" x 10.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Quantity of LED Lights: 15</li> <li>Battery: 3 x AAA (Not included)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Jewelry cabinet</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Bedroom > Jewelry Armoires,,Overall dimension:14.5" x 3.5" x 56.5" (W x D x H); Mirror dimension:43.5" x 10.5" (L x W); ,Jewelry Armoires,,,White,JV10083,shopify,406,1,deny,manual,94,134,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/k/4/k4_9_14.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/k/3/k3_9_14.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/k/1/k10_4_14.jpg,3,https://assets.costwa