lexible to pluck  contributing to long service time and easy operation.<br /><strong>● With Useful Accessories:</strong> 3 picks with great flexibility on your fingers can help you control strings in different situations. The digital tuner with button cell has the ability to precisely adjust the sound level. With a strap and a carrying bag  it is easy to take the banjo along with you while protecting it from corrosion and scratch.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As the picture show</li> <li>Material: Wood + steel</li> <li>Fingerboard material: Rosewood</li> <li>Body material: Sapele wood</li> <li>Net weight: 6.0 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimension: 13.5" x 4" x 39" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Musical Instruments > Guitar & Strings,,Overall dimension:13.5" x 4" x 39" (L x W x H); ,Guitar & Strings,Drop Price,,Black,MU10052,shopify,106,1,deny,manual,139.99,139.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/u/mu10052_1_.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/u/mu10052_2_.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/u/mu10052_4_.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/u/mu10052_10_.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/u/mu10052_9_.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/u/mu10052_3_.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/m/u/mu10052_7_.jpg,7
