height-adjustable-computer-desk-sit-to-stand-rolling-table,Height Adjustable Computer Desk Sit to Stand Rolling Table,59764203,https://www.costway.com/height-adjustable-computer-desk-sit-to-stand-rolling-notebook-table.html?piid=9220100&fee=152&fep=11764&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Steel pipe frame for great strength and bearing capacity<br />● Sturdy MDF and powder-coated steel frame  providing years of use<br />● Height adjustable design to meet your maximum comforts<br />● Perfect to act as end table  side table  coffee table and more<br />● 4 universal casters  2 of which are lockable to ensure flexibility<br />● Wide enough tabletop to hold more daily items<br />● Ideal for business or personal use<br />● Easy to assemble with detailed manual and complete accessories</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Stable and Durable Construction:</strong> The iron pipe and MDF board construction give this computer desk a great strength and stability. As it’s quite sturdy  it can bear a load of up to 66 lbs. Moreover  the anti-scratch PVC coated top surface gives it a longer service life.</li> <li><strong>Considerate Ergonomic Design:</strong> The ergonomic design allows you to adjust the table’s height to various configurations. Being able to adjust your seating position leads you to have a cushy experience. Meanwhile  it lets you have the tension on your shoulders and back relaxed as well.<br /><strong></strong></li> <li><strong>Multipurpose Usages:</strong> With height-adjustable design  it is a practical and functional work helper. Nor only it acts as a computer desk  but also as an end table  side table  coffee table  etc. Its various features make it a sweet spot as a multi-functional table based on your needs.<br /><strong></strong></li> <li><strong>Easy Storage and Portability:</strong> The desk features 4 universal wheels with brakes on two of them for overwhelming portability and stability. Moreover  they provideprotection to the floor from iron pipes. And the height-adjustable  function contributes in saving more space.<br /><strong></strong></li> <li><strong>Compact Size with Wide Space:</strong> Although the table is compact  the 33.5 x 20.5 inches tabletop is wide enough to hold at least 2 monitors  a keyboard  mouse and other stationeries. The multipurpose table is able to act both as a study or work table for you.<br /><br /></li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Material: MDF + Steel tube</li> <li>Overall size: 37.5" x 20.5" x 27" - 42" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Height: Adjusted from 27" to 42"</li> <li>Workstation size: 33.5" x 20.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 66 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Laptop table</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Office Desks > Standing Desks,,Overall size:37.5" x 20.5" x 27" - 42" (L x W x H); Workstation size:33.5" x 20.5" (L x W); ,Standing Desks,Clearance,,White,HW65631WH,shopify,270,1,deny,manual,99.99,119.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/placeholder/default/LOGO2_3.png,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW65631WH/Height_Adjustable_Computer_Desk_Sit_to_Stand_Rolling_Table-1.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW65631WH/Height_Adjustable_Computer_Desk_Sit_to_Stand_Rolling_Table-2.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/placeholder/default/LOGO2_3.png,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW65631WH/Height_Adjustable_Computer_Desk_Sit_to_Stand_Rolling_Table-3.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08