4-pieces-tolix-style-metal-dining-side-chair-stackable-wood-seat-white,4 Pieces Tolix Style Metal Dining Side Chair Stackable Wood Seat-White,51092846,https://www.costway.com/4-pieces-tolix-style-metal-dining-chairs-with-stackable-wood-seat.html?piid=9220100&fee=152&fep=11766&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Featuring superior metal frame and thick wood seat  these chairs is sturdy enough to hold up to 265 lbs.</p> <p> </p> <p>These vintage gun metal chairs afford you the comfort  stylish home furniture choice. And each metal chair has a X-brace under the seat that provides additional support and stability. In addition  this chair includes plastic feet pads to protect your flooring and resistant to slippery. Therefore  whether you're using this chair for your kitchen  patio or bistro  it's sure to offer you level up your leisure time quality!</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for such product  don't hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Ergonomic seat and back design provides more comfort</li> <li>Stackable design for space-saving when not in use</li> <li>Heavy-duty metal construction hold weight up to 265 lbs</li> <li>Rubber foot pads protects your floor from damage</li> <li>X-brace under the seat for additional safety & stability</li> <li>Lightweight and easy to clean with a damp cloth</li> <li>Suitable dining room  bar  living room  coffee shop & patio</li> <li>Easy to assemble with instruction  hardware and tools included</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Modern And Stylish Design:</strong> Our chairs perfectly combine solid wood with iron  and are stylish and modern in design  suitable for all decorative styles. You can put them in the restaurant  cafe  courtyard  kitchen  dining room and living room.</li> <li><strong>High Quality Pine Wood Cushion:</strong> The cushion is made of thick pine wood panels  which are natural and environmentally friendly with clear wood grain. The underside of the seat cushion has reinforced cross bracing  which makes the chair structure strong and has a strong load-bearing capacity.</li> <li><strong>Comfortable And Firm Backrest:</strong> The curve of the back of the chair is ergonomically designed for a comfortable sitting. The backrest consists of a round tube and a steel plate that provides good support for the back and releases back pressure. No matter how long you sit  you won't feel tired.</li> <li><strong>Four Strong Legs:</strong>The four legs are made of iron with widened edges to prevent your feet from being hurt by sharp edges. With non-marking feet caps  you can protect your floor. The chair surface is smooth  wear resistant and corrosion resistant. And you can easily wipe off the stain with a damp cloth.</li> <li><strong>Easy To Remove The Backrest:</strong> A set of 4 chairs is sold and you can assemble them easily in a short time. You can also quickly assemble and disassemble the backrest of the chair according to your needs. And four chairs can be stacked for easy storage and movement  saving you space.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As the picture shows</li> <li>Material: metal  elm wood</li> <li>Product dimensions: 18" x 18" x 33.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Seat size: 14'' x 14''</li> <li>Backrest size: 18" x 16.5"</li> <li>Seat height: 17.5"</li> <li>Seat thickness: 0.8"</li> <li>Net weight: 44 lbs</li> <li>Maximum weight capacity: 265 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>4 x metal chairs</li> <li>1 x Screw bag</li> <li>1 x User guide</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Kitchen & Dining > Dining Chairs,,Product dimensions:18" x 18" x 33.5" (L x W x H); Seat size:14'' x 14''; Backrest size:18" x 16.5"; ,Dining Chairs,Clearance,,White,HW60716WH,shopify,97,1,deny,manual,149.99,159.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_522_5.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/prod