 & Playback Controls: </strong>The back multifunctional control panel  combined with a sensitive remote control provides simple and convenient operation  the bright LCD display tracks your music and customizes the wonderful stereo combination. 1600W high-power speaker components reproduce clear sound and crisp high pitch.<br><strong>● Easy Mobility and Set-up: </strong>Sturdy and durable enclosure design incorporates three handles that allow for easy speaker portability. The detachable folding tripod at the bottom can be adjusted in height from 26" to 38" by rotating the knob. In addition  the triangular reinforced structure and the non-slip foot cap add extra stability. <br><strong>● Wonderful Party Addition:</strong> Our professional sound system allows you to sing karaoke with your family and friends  and sway your body in the music to release your passion. It is ideal for small to large events such as DJ gigs  home parties  outdoor gatherings  speeches  back yard BBQs and much more. Compatible with analog devices with 6.35 mm output jack.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><table> <tbody> <tr> <td>Color</td> <td>As the picture shown</td> </tr> <tr> <td>System</td> <td>Active 2-way full range</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Version of Bluetooth</td> <td>All devices</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Woofer</td> <td>10"</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Tweeter</td> <td>1"</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Power max</td> <td>1600W</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Power rms</td> <td>300W</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Frequency range</td> <td>65 Hz - 18 Khz</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Mic input level</td> <td><5 mv</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Line input/ output level</td> <td>250 mv</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Connector</td> <td>XLR/6.35 mm/RCA</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Sensitivity</td> <td>98 db</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Impedance</td> <td>8 ohm</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Voltage</td> <td>110 V/220 V</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Total height(stands+speaker)</td> <td>4.5ft to 5.5 ft</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Tripod stand weight capacity</td> <td>66 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Speaker dimensions</td> <td