wear-resistant and resistant to deformation.And its length is so long that even large TV sets can be placed. Due to its strong load-bearing capacity of 200lbs  you can place many things such as TV sets  vases  photo frames and so on.<br /><strong>● Large Open Storage Space:</strong> Our 59" TV stand has eight large open storage spaces on the front and side. You can put CD  DVD  books  magazines and accessories in order. The open storage makes it easy to display and take your things.And the four shelves can be adjusted up and down to facilitate the placement of items of different heights.<br /><strong>● Four Threading Holes:</strong> There are four large threading holes on the back of the TV stand to allow the wires to be placed in order. You can freely place TV set-top boxes  game consoles  stereos and other electrical equipment. It can also help electrical equipment to ventilate and dissipate heat.<br /><strong>● Easy to Clean and Assemble:</strong> The MDF veneer makes the surface of the TV stand very smooth and waterproof  easy to clean and maintain. It is very simple and quick to assemble. You can easily assemble it in 15 minutes. It can save you a lot of time.<br /><strong>● Wide Range of Applications:</strong> The design of the TV stand is modern and fashionable  suitable for most home decoration. You can put it in the living room  bedroom  lounge  activity room and many other places. We believe it will stand out in any room.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: MDF</li> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Net weight: 70.5 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimension: 59" x 15.5" x 17.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 200 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x TV stand</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > Entertainment Centers & TV Stands,,Overall dimension:59" x 15.5" x 17.5" (L x W x H); ,Entertainment Centers & TV Stands,Clearance,,Black,HW60170BK,shopify,130,1,deny,manual,99.99,99.99,https://assets.costway