set-of-2-mid-century-modern-dsw-dining-side-chair-white,Set of 2 Mid-Century Modern DSW Dining Side Chair-White,21086574,https://www.costway.com/modern-set-of-2-mid-century-dsw-dining-side-chair.html?piid=9220100&fee=152&fep=11898&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<ul> <li>Brand new and good quality</li> <li>Comfortable and stylish</li> <li>Mid-century looks  perfect for any room in your home</li> <li>Assembly is required</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>●<strong> Lightweight and Durable Frame:</strong> Our dining set is made of high-quality plastic and solid beech wood legs which offering durability and sturdiness. The steel frame of legs adopts cross fixation  the structure is strong and durable. Plastic and wood materials are light in weight which is easy for you to transport.<br />● <strong>Ergonomic Seat Design:</strong> The chairs that we make are designed to be both comfortable and as ergonomically correct as possible. Our chair consults with the scientific curve and can fit your back and haunch perfectly. Thick and roomy PP seats will not break easily  providing you with strong support and cozy sitting experience.<br />● <strong>Stable Design for Better Support:</strong> The connection between the seat and the legs of the chair is reinforced with high-quality gaskets and screws to ensure that the chair is firm and will not shake. The four feet of the chairs extend out slightly  ensuring double stability and safety for you to use. Non-slip foot pads can prevent the floor from being scratched.<br />●<strong> Stylish Decoration for Home:</strong> Combining blue finish surface with natural wooden legs  this modern side chair set has stylish and concise design which will surely highlight your indoor décor. Placing this dining chair set in your home or office and it is suitable for having dinner with friends at home or holding a meeting in the office.<br />●<strong> Easy to Assemble:</strong> With assembled leg frame and molded shell seat  all you need to do is connecting the seat to the leg with 4 screws. Easy-to-understand instructions are included for you to finish the assembly conveniently. All installation tools and accessories are in small bags. You don't need to prepare additional tools.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Materials: PP seat</li> <li>Beech Wood legs</li> <li>Weight limit : 300 pounds</li> <li>Seat dimension: 17" x 18.5"（D x W) </li> <li>Seat height: 17"</li> <li>Overall dimension: 22" x 18.5" x 32" (D x W x H)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Kitchen & Dining > Dining Chairs,,Seat dimension:17" x 18.5"ï¼D x W); Overall dimension:22" x 18.5" x 32" (D x W x H); ,Dining Chairs,,,White,HW65771WH-2,shopify,371,1,deny,manual,84.99,84.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_560_13.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_539_63.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/5/85_3_4_1.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/2/92_2_22_1.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/9/89_2_24_1.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_555_65.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_577_68.jpg,7
