r Column Meets Your Needs:</strong> 7" diameter with 7.2 ft height  this solar shower can hold 9.25 gallons of water. And it is enough for you to enjoy a refreshing shower in sun-warmed water before and after your swim. No doubt it will be a treat. And it is also a great addition to your garden or your swimming pool with modern style. It's going to be impressive.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Temperature and Pressure Adjustable and Faucet:</strong> This solar shower equipped with temperature and pressure adjustable device. You can adjust the temperature by turning the handle left and right. Hot water on one side  cold water on the other. The water temperature can reach 140 degrees Fahrenheit under intense sunlight. The operation is very simple. Besides  the below faucet design for wash your feet.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Unique PVC Material with Black Finish:</strong> This solar shower is built with high-quality PVC material  so it ensures that the product does not rust. In addition  PVC materials feature high strength and weather-resistance  so the product is suitable for outdoor use. And the black exterior design is to better absorb solar energy  faster to heat the water.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: PVC</li> <li>Diameter: 7''</li> <li>Height: 85.5'' (7.2 ft)</li> <li>Item weight: 19.5 lbs</li> <li>Water tank capacity: 9.3 gallon (35 L)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Outdoor solar shower</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Camping > Portable Toilets & Showers,,Diameter:7''; ,Portable Toilets & Showers,,,Black,OP70623,shopify,392,1,deny,manual,129.99,129.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70623/7_Feet_Adjustable_Outdoor_Solar_Heating_Shower_Head-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP