lightweight-super-bodyboard-surfing-with-eps-core-boarding-l,Lightweight Super Bodyboard Surfing with EPS Core Boarding-L,86325041,https://www.costway.com/lightweight-super-bodyboard-surfing-with-eps-core-boarding.html?piid=1352100&fee=152&fep=12097&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Do you want to enjoy surfing fun? The bodyboard gives you a cool and wonderful experience of riding a wave on a hot summer day.</p> <p> </p> <p>Made of high-quality EPS core  XPE deck and HDPE slick bottom  it has strong buoyancy and load-bearing capacity. Moreover  it has good impact resistance and weather resistance  making it difficult to deform and fade. The crescent tail has great flexibility and comfort to suit your different riding styles. The most important thing is that it has a leash and a wristband that protect you from being washed away by the waves. The light weight is easy to carry and transport  so you can take it to the pool  water park  river and sea.</p> <p> </p> <p>This bodyboard is your best choice  don't hesitate to buy it!<br /><br /> </p> <ul> <li>Suitable for water sports  giving you a wonderful outdoor surfing experience</li> <li>It has excellent buoyancy and strong load-bearing capacity</li> <li>Made from high quality EPS core  XPE deck and high-density polyethylene slick bottom</li> <li>It has good impact resistance and weather resistance for long-term use</li> <li>The bodyboard has 60/40 rails  rear channels  and a crescent tail</li> <li>Leash and wrist rope design improve safety and stability during surfing</li> <li>Light weight makes it easy to carry and transport</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Wonderful Surfing Experience:</strong> On the hot summer days  you can use our body board to enjoy wonderful and exciting surfing experience in the sea  beach  river  swimming pool and water park. Exquisite patterns and bright colors give you the best surfing fun. It can help you relax and exercise your back and abdomen muscles.</li> <li><strong>High-quality & Durable Materials:</strong> The surface of our bodyboard is the XPE deck  which has good impact resistance and durability. EPS core is weather resistant  waterproof and shock absorbing. And the high-density polyethylene slick bottom adds stiffness and increases speed  projection and ideal flexibility.</li> <li><strong>Strong Buoyancy & Light Weight:</strong> Strong buoyancy and sturdy construction give ourbody board a strong load-bearing capacity. It is not easily deformed and faded and can be used for a long time. The light weight makes it easy to carry  so you can take it wherever you go.</li> <li><strong>Dynamic Design:</strong> The body board has 60/40 rails  rear channels  and a crescent tail  which are suitable for all kinds of waves. And it's easy to control and can increase your speed and strength. You can easily stand or lie on it to meet your different needs.</li> <li><strong>With Leash & Wrist Rope:</strong> The scientifically designed leash position provides a good traction experience that enhances safety and stability during surfing. The wristband can be put on the wrist or ankle to prevent the surfboard from being lost. You can freely adjust the tightness of the wristband for maximum comfort.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: XPE  EPS  HEPE</li> <li>Color: Yellow</li> <li>Overall size: 41" x 20.5" x 2.36" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 1.9 lbs</li> <li>Max user’s weight: 189 lbs</li> <li>Max user’s height: 71"</li> <li>User age: Over 14 years old</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Bodyboard</li> <li>1 x Leash</li> </ul>,Costway,Sports > Water Sports > Surfing,,Overall size:41" x 20.5" x 2.36" (L x W x H); ,Surfing,,,Yellow,OP3843-L,shopify,398,1,deny,manual,45.99,70.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_669_79.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog