  beaches  and at the sea. It is the best gift for parents  children  and friends. You can use it for water games  parties  vacations  and sunbathing.<br /><strong>● Superior Load Bearing Capacity:</strong> With strong buoyancy and load-bearing capacity  the floating pad can support up to 778 to 889 lbs. of evenly distributed weight and is suitable for 4-6 persons. It is perfect for parties  bringing hours of fun for the whole family and friends on a hot summer day.<br /><strong>● Three-layer Composite XPE Foam:</strong> The floating water pad is made of three layers of eco-friendly XPE foam  which ensures good quality  does not absorb water and is not easily deformed. The safe XPE foam is odorless and bouncy  while effectively preventing bacterial growth. In addition  the materials make this pad stable and durable.<br /><strong>● Easy to Roll up and Store:</strong> At just 15lbs of weight  this floating water pad is lightweight and easy to move and carry around. It comes with 2 storage straps that hold the pad together when rolled up for easy transport  carrying  and storage. The space-saving design allows you to store it anywhere when not in use.<br /><strong>● Easy to Anchor <strong>and</strong> Clean: </strong>You can easily anchor this floating pad in the lake or to a dock by using two 4.9' bungee tethers in order to prevent the pad from drifting away. The pad is safe and easy to clean with soap and water  providing you with years of vivid colors and endless fun.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: XPE foam</li> <li>Color: Orange</li> <li>Overall size: 12' x 6' x 1.5' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 16.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 778 to 889 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Floating water pad</li> <li>2 x Bungee tethers</li> </ul>,Costway,Sports > Water Sports > Swimming,,Overall size:12' x 6' x 1.5' (L x W x H); ,Swimming,Clearance,,Orange,OP3838,shopify,444,1,deny,manual,189.99,189.99,http