 is protected with surface paint to prevent rusting and fading. Therefore  this lawn roller will give you years of worry-free use.<br /><strong>● 16-gallon Capacity:</strong> With large capacity  the sod roller  holding up to 16 gallons of water sand or cement  is heavy enough to press the raised lawn back to its original position so that the loose rhizomes are closely integrated with the underlying soil.<br /><strong>● Humanized Design:</strong> Convenient push and tow-behind design provide versatility for rolling tight areas. In addition  the U-shaped handle makes operation more convenient. What's more  the rounded drum edges help avoid damage to your lawn during turns.<br /><strong>● Easy for Storage and Transport:</strong> The lightweight lawn roller can be easily transported when it is empty. Other than that  when finishing rolling your lawn  you can simply drain and hang this compact roller in your garage or shed  which occupies minimal space.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Green</li> <li>Main material: Steel</li> <li>Overall size: 44" x 35.5" x 12"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Diameter of the drum: 12"</li> <li>Capacity: 16 gallons / 63 L</li> <li>Net weight: 30 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Lawn roller</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Garden > Garden Tools > Lawn Care Tools,,Overall size:44" x 35.5" x 12"(L x W x H); Diameter of the drum:12"; ,Lawn Care Tools,Clearance,,Green,GT2914GN,shopify,595,1,deny,manual,79.99,140.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_392_9.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_487_4.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/t/gt2914gn_1.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d0