 particles and the filter can assimilate 99.97% of particles that have a size greater than or equal to 0.3 micrometers. This shows that this product can be used in hospital wards  Chemical industry factories and other places where usually have a lot of people with a sensitive constitution  they are more prone to allergies and cleaner air is needed.<br /><strong>● Certified for Safety</strong>: This air scrubber is ETL Certified  that is to say  it meets North American mandatory standards. You can interconnect up to several of these air scrubbers to customize your air filtration needs. All the products are manufactured with relatively advanced equipment. We use highly advanced production technology and have the most stringent quality control measures.<br /><strong>● Extra Features for Convenience</strong>: This industrial air purifier has eight pads for easy support. When you lay the purifier flat  the pads ensures that the housing of the purifier will not touch the ground directly and will not be scratched. There is a groove on the side of the air purifier that can be used to perfectly summarize the 25ft wire so that the wire will not be disorderly.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: PPT</li> <li>Color: Blue</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 25" W x 16.5" D x 25" H</li> <li>Net weight: 39 lbs</li> <li>Certification: ETL</li> <li>Power: 1/3HP</li> <li>Area : 500-2000sq.ft</li> <li>Air flow: 150-500 CFM</li> <li>Motor speed: 2950 RPM</li> <li>Wire length: 25 ft</li> <li>Plug: Three-pronged plug</li> <li>Voltage: 115V/60HZ</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Air purifier</li> <li>1 x User manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Air Purifiers,,Overall dimensions:25" W x 16.5" D x 25" H; ,Air Purifiers,Clearance,,Blue,EP24042,shopify,384,1,deny,manual,349.99,349.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/EP24042/Industrial