li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Powerful Motor for High-Efficiency Cleaning:</strong> The high pressure washer features a powerful 2000W motor  which generates up to 3000 PSI/2.0 GPM  it is an ideal way to quickly and easily blasts away caked mud  gunk and grime  helping you solve a variety of heavy-duty cleaning tasks.<br /><strong>● 5 Replaceable Nozzles:</strong> This pressure washer comes with 5 interchangeable nozzles(0° 15°  25° 40 °  and liquid soap)  allowing you to change the spray width or mode for different cleaning task.<br /><strong>● Thermal and Overload Protection:</strong> This high pressure washer features an auto stopping system when the trigger is not engaged  so the motor shuts off automatically. Furthermore  the thermal protection and overload protection provide you security while using this machine.<br /><strong>● Portable Wheels and Built-in Pressure Hose Reel:</strong> Two bottom wheels and top handle help to carry this pressure washer with less effort. Moreover  the built-in onboard hose reel protects and helps to prevent kink in the high-pressure hose and makes winding or unwinding a simple task.<br /><strong>● Multipurpose Design for Wide Applications:</strong> The gun stock can be connected to the lance  fixed brush  and big patio cleaner to meet your different cleaning needs  which makes this high pressure washer ideal cleaning solution for all vehicles  home  boats  driveways  decks  etc.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Blue and black / Red and black</li> <li>Material: PP  Metal</li> <li>Dimension: 11.5'' x 11'' x 29''(L x W x H)</li> <li>Power cord length: 16.4 ft (5m)</li> <li>High pressure hose length: 26 ft (8m)</li> <li>Power: 2000 W</li> <li>Rated voltage: 110-120 V</li> <li>Rated frequency:60 HZ</li> <li>Rated pressure: 10.0 Mpa</li> <li>Max. permissible pressure: 3000 PSI</li> <li>Rated flow rate: 1.58 GPM</li> <li>Max. flow rate: 2 GPM</li> <li>Max. inlet: 0.3 Mpa</li> <li>Degree of prot