e drawer from sliding out and lock the tool box (small lock are not included). In addition  the padding inside drawers and the padding at the top of lower box are EVA  which has good cushioning  seismic  heat insulation and other functions  and can effectively protect tools.<br /><strong>● Easy to Move and Stop Steadily:</strong> This tool combination box has flexible and ingenious wheel design. This toolkits has four universal wheels which can rotate 360 degrees  and two of them have braking function. The upper case can be completely moved. When transporting  the upper case is stuffed into the lower cabinet. Those designs allow users to move the combo box easily and to stop steadily.<br /><strong>● Keep Tidy and Save Time:</strong> With this toolkit  your scattered tools can be stored in an orderly manner  which can not only make your workroom neat  but also make it easy for you to find the job you want. More importantly   5 drawers are equipped with slide rails  which make the drawers pull out smoothly and operate smoothly.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Main material: Steel  rubber-plastic synthetic wheel</li> <li>Overall dimension: 23" x 11" x 40.5"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Upper case dimension:17.5" x 9.5" x 13" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Lower cabinet dimension: 23" x 11" x 27.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity of each drawer: 11 lbs</li> <li>Total weight capacity: 220.5 lbs</li> <li>Net weight: 38 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Tool combination cabinet</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Storage & Garages > Garages,,Overall dimension:23" x 11" x 40.5"(L x W x H); Upper case dimension:17.5" x 9.5" x 13" (L x W x H); Lower cabinet dimension:23" x 11" x 27.5" (L x W x H); ,Garages,Drop Price,,Black,TL35688BK,shopify,508,1,deny,manual,159.99,318,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TL35276BK/2in1_Tool_Che