nd the total carrying capacity of that is 220.5 lbs. In addition  The whole storage cabinet could be detached into 2 boxes  which can be used separately or together according to your requirement.</li> <li><strong>High Quality Material:</strong> The body of this tool combination box is made of solid and durable steel  and the wheel is made of rubber-plastic synthetic material. High quality material selection and solid workmanship make the box structure strong  wear-resistant and durable. It has a long service life.</li> <li><strong>Unique Protection Function:</strong> This cart is equipped with drawer lock rod  which can be used to prevent the drawer from sliding out and lock the tool box (small lock are not included). In addition  the padding inside drawers and the padding at the top of lower box are EVA  which has good cushioning  seismic  heat insulation and other functions  and can effectively protect tools.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Move and Stop Steadily:</strong> This tool combination box has flexible and ingenious wheel design. This toolkits has four universal wheels which can rotate 360 degrees  and two of them have braking function. The upper case can be completely moved. When transporting  the upper case is stuffed into the lower cabinet. Those designs allow users to move the combo box easily and to stop steadily.</li> <li><strong>Keep Tidy and Save Time:</strong> With this toolkit  your scattered tools can be stored in an orderly manner  which can not only make your workroom neat  but also make it easy for you to find the job you want. More importantly   5 drawers are equipped with slide rails  which make the drawers pull out smoothly and operate smoothly.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As the picture shows</li> <li>Main material: Steel  rubber-plastic synthetic wheel</li> <li>Overall dimension: 23" x 11" x 40.5"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Upper case dimension:17.5" x 9.5" x 13" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Lower cabinet dimension: 23" x 11" x 