ain its original appearance for years to come.<br /><strong>● No Assembly and Easy to Clean:</strong> There is no assembly needed. Simply take it out of the box and place it wherever you want. Besides  thanks to its smooth service and design  it is extremely easy to clean and maintain  simply by using a damp cloth.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As shown in the picture</li> <li>Material: Chinese fir and steel</li> <li>Diameter: 30"</li> <li>Overall dimension: 30" x 30" x 1.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight of one set: 12 lbs</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>2 x Decorative wooden wheel</li> </ul>,Costway,Decor > Decorative Accessories > Outdoor Decor,,Diameter:30"; Overall dimension:30" x 30" x 1.5" (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Decor,,,Brown,HW65608,shopify,236,1,deny,manual,74.99,74.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/3/w3_8_12.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/5/w5_8_11.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/1/w1_9_13.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/9/w9_6_10.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/2/w2_8_12.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/4/w4_9_12.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/1/w10_5_11.jpg,7
