r of poles are 7mm. 8 Poles are covered by soft and warm faux fleece.<br /><strong>● In Line with Nature of Cat:</strong> All cats are crazy about climbing and sitting in the high place. Puppy and kittens can learn how to take stairs through it. Lovely puppy or kittens can play  climb  relax or sleep on it.<br /><strong>● Optimal for Older or Disabled Animals:</strong> Pets are one of our family. When they get old  dogs or cats can't jump or run anymore. It's pain for them. With comfortable pet stairs your dogs and cats will still smoothly go up to the sofa and lay on it. Bring one for your "old friends".<br /><strong>● Installation in One Moment:</strong> The installation is very easy to follow the manual. All necessary hardware and tools are included. Every single man can finish it in half hour.<br /><strong>● Customer Service Guaranteed:</strong> UPS or USPS will deliver it to your house in 3-6 business days after you placed your order. We packed the products in good condition  if there is some parts damaged or missing  plz feel free to contact with us we will response you in 24 hours with smile:)</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Particle board  faux fleece</li> <li>Color: Beige</li> <li>Overall dimension: 16" x 24" x 24" (W x D x H)</li> <li>Step depth: 6"</li> <li>Item weight: 17 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 80 lbs</li> <li>Stair tread height difference: 5" (Average approximation)</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x 4-step pet stairs</li> <li>1 x Manual</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Pets > Cat Supplies > Cat Trees  Condos & Scratchers,,Overall dimension:16" x 24" x 24" (W x D x H); ,Cat Trees  Condos & Scratchers,,,Beige,PS7174,shopify,46,1,deny,manual,49.99,69.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_246_48.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_250_70.jpg,2,ht