solid-free-standing-wood-planter-box-with-trellis-for-garden,Solid Free Standing Wood Planter Box with Trellis for Garden,67843951,https://www.costway.com/solid-free-standing-wood-planter-box-with-trellis-for-garden.html?fee=152&fep=12632&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>●100% solid wood for stability and durability</p> <p>●Weather-resistant design is great for outdoor using</p> <p>●Suitable for being placed in the balcony  garden and yard</p> <p>●Designed with drain hole to prevent rotting of roots</p> <p>●Large storage space for planting more plants</p> <p>●High load capacity allows more plants to be suspended</p> <p>●The built-in trellis offers great support for climbing plants</p> <p>●Create a romantic pastoral atmosphere for your yard</p> <p>●Easy installation needed</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● High-Quality Wood Material:</strong> The raw material of this planter with trellis is natural fir  which is solid. The wood has a clear texture and does not crack easily. The whole frame is durable when used outdoors. The feature which is no fear of sun and rain can extend the service life.<br /><strong>● Powerful Considerate Design:</strong> This planter has a built-in trellis that provides a place for climbing plants to grow. In addition  the trellis can not only cover climbing plants but also hang bracket plants. There are two holes on the bottom plate  which facilitate the timely discharge of excess water.<br /><strong>● Large Space for Planting:</strong> This outdoor planter with trellis has a large flower box that can hold a considerable number of plants and flowers. You can put the soil into this planter and plant flowers or vegetables that you like. Moreover  a lot of hanging orchids and climbing plants can be hung on the trellis.<br /><strong>● Unique Shape for Decorating:</strong> The flower box at the bottom can be used for flower pots and the flower rack at the top can be used for climbing vines. The top has an arc design to increase the ornamental value. Dark brown frame can be coordinated with the color of the plants. This unique  simple style is great for decorating your garden  yard or balcony.<br /><strong>● Quick and Easy to Install:</strong> This concise garden planter box is easy to install together by yourself or with your family members in a short time. All the necessary accessories and the complete installation instructions are packaged well in the product parcel.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Dark brown</li> <li>Material: fir</li> <li>Net weight: 10.5 lbs</li> <li>Product dimensions: 25" x 11" x 48" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Inside dimension: 23" x 8.5" x 6" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Mesh size: 36" x 25" (H x L)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Planter with trellis</li> <li>1 x Instruction book</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Garden > Raised Garden Beds,,Product dimensions:25" x 11" x 48" (L x W x H); Inside dimension:23" x 8.5" x 6" (L x W x H); Mesh size:36" x 25" (H x L); ,Raised Garden Beds,Clearance,,Brown,GT3564,shopify,122,1,deny,manual,79.99,79.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_230_225.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_244_246.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/11_98_114.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/2/12_52_12.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_249_254.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_235_223.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/