an be used for climbing vines. The top has arc design to increase the ornamental value. Dark brown frame can be coordinated with the color of the plants. This unique  simple style is great for decorating your garden  yard or balcony.</li> <li><strong>● Quick and Easy to Install:</strong> This concise garden planter box is easy to install together by yourself or with your family members in short time. All the necessary accessories and the complete installation instructions are packaged well in the product parcel.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Dark brown</li> <li>Material: Fir</li> <li>Net weight: 9.24 lbs</li> <li>Product dimensions: 25" x 11" x 30" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Inside dimension: 23" x 8.5" x 6" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Mesh size: 21" x 25" (L x H)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li>1 x Planter with trellis</li> <li>1 x Instruction book</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Garden > Raised Garden Beds,,Product dimensions:25" x 11" x 30" (L x W x H); Inside dimension:23" x 8.5" x 6" (L x W x H); Mesh size:21" x 25" (L x H); ,Raised Garden Beds,Clearance,,Brown,GT3429,shopify,314,1,deny,manual,44.99,54.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_249_255.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_235_224.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/t/gt3429.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_244_247.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_216_208.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_260_74.jpg,6,,7
