3000psi-16-inch-pressure-washer-surface-cleaner-attachment,3000psi 16 Inch Pressure Washer Surface Cleaner Attachment,40278139,https://www.costway.com/3000psi-16-inch-pressure-washer-surface-cleaner-attachment.html?fee=152&fep=12642&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The 16" wide diameter surface cleaner provides high-pressure and two rotating jets for fast cleaning with no streaking.</p> <p> </p> <p>The 16" wide diameter surface cleaner elements are compatible with most brands of gas pressure washers  making this surface cleaner ideal for deep cleaning of outdoor areas such as garage floors  driveways  sidewalks and more. The design controls the overspray to protect walls and the user from getting wet. Simply attach the accessory to a quick-connect wand for 4x faster cleaning. If you are in a need of something economical with great performance  this unit provides a reliable option.</p> <p> </p> <p>Order one now and stop worrying about the high costs and energy consumption of owning this type of product. Make your life easier and more enjoyable.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>16-inch cleaning diameter with a strong cleaning ability making it ideal for large horizontal surfaces</li> <li>1/4-Inch Quick-Connection is compatible with most brands of pressure washers</li> <li>This surface cleaner cleans up to 4 times faster than standard nozzles on the market</li> <li>Two rotating nozzles deliver streak-free cleaning  ideal for hospital and train stations</li> <li>Black PP plastic shell covers the dual high-pressure water jets  ensure that you will not get wet while using it</li> <li>Stainless steel nozzle is safe and non-toxic  with rust-resistant features</li> <li>The steel nozzle keeps the water clean and sanitary</li> <li>The high-efficient function saves you time and greatly reduces working intensity</li> <li>High-pressure cleaning prevents streaking or stripping of delicate surfaces</li> <li>Dome housing design avoids overspray or backsplash</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 16-Inch Cleaning Path:</strong> Its 16-inch diameter is ideal for large horizontal surfaces which obviously saves energy and time. It's a helpful cleaning attachment for varieties of places.<br /><strong>● Two Rotating Nozzles for Intensive Clean:</strong> This unit uses two rotating nozzles for efficient clean that eliminates dirt fast and thoroughly. For use with gas pressure washers up to 3000 PSI  rotation speed 1450 rpm which prevent streaking or stripping.<br /><strong>● Compatible with Quick-Connect Wands:</strong> The cleaner attachment is equipped with 1/4-inch quick-connect inlet and it is easy for you to match a suitable quick-connect wand and attach to it.<br /><strong>● Durable Material with Good Quality:</strong> It is consists of stainless steel nozzle  iron joint  copper connecting rod to lengthen service life. Scrubbing brush is durable and wear-resisting to work on rough surface.<br /><strong>● Suitable for Multiple Occasions:</strong> This surface cleaner attachment is ideal for deep cleaning of outdoor areas such as driveways  patio  backyard  garage  etc.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Iron  stainless steel  copper  PP plastic</li> <li>Overall dimension: 16" x 5.5" (Dia x H)</li> <li>Quick-connect inlet: 1/4"</li> <li>Net weight: 3.7 lbs</li> <li>Rotation speed: 1450 Rpm</li> <li>Max pressure: 3000 PSI</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li> <li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Pressure washer attachment</li> <li>2 x Spare washer (For replacement when water leaks)</li> </ul>,Costway,Appliances > Vacuums & Cleaners,,Overall dimension:16" x 5.5" (Dia x H); ,Vacuums & Cleaners,Clearance,,Black,CL11731,shopify,660,1,deny,manual,29.99,29.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_238_17.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df7