bamboo-sofa-table-end-table-bedside-table-with-storage-bag,Bamboo Sofa Table End Table Bedside Table with Storage Bag,13867920,https://www.costway.com/bamboo-sofa-table-end-table-bedside-table-with-storage-bag.html?fee=152&fep=12645&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>If you are looking for a side table to suit for your room or you are still bothered by a messy room that doesn't have additional storage space. This lovely side table made of 100% bamboo that is not only sturdy but modern to match your furniture set.</p> <p>   </p> <p>The L-shaped tray table stands steady on the floor and you can place it beside your bed or sofa as a laptop table  coffee table or end table to save space. On the back of the side table  there is a storage bag have different sizes of pockets to help you store sundries. In addition  the corners of this side table are round and smooth to prevent bumping and hurting. And painted with varnish  the whole side table is waterproof and convenient to clean with cloth.</p> <p>  </p> <p>If you are looking for a side table like this  don't hesitate to buy it!</p> <p>   </p> <ul> <li>L-shaped side table is easy to be placed beside the sofa and bed</li> <li>Natural bamboo frame to make whole table sturdy and durable</li> <li>Space-saving storage bag with different pockets to store things</li> <li>Round corners to protect your family and pets effectively</li> <li>Multipurpose table can be used as a side table  coffee table  TV tray table and working table</li> <li>A perfect addition to fit for your style of decoration and other furniture</li> <li>Surface with varnish is waterproof and convenient to clean with cloth</li> <li>Easy to assemble or detach by yourself according to the instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>Multipurpose Table with Spacious Tabletop:</strong> The tabletop of this tray table is great for working or holding beverage  snacks or books and paired with a back storage bag for small items. You can put the side table close to where you sit and provide extra area which also can be a laptop table  coffee table or end table.</p> <p><strong>Space-Saving Design of Table:</strong> With smart L-shaped design and geometric cross-bar base  the console table stands steady on the floor and can be placed freely beside the sofa or chair. And the use of storage bags can also make use of vertical space. In addition  the detachable coffee table can also be stored in a small space when not in use.</p> <p><strong>100% Bamboo with Round Corners:</strong> Made of natural bamboo  the whole side table is sturdy with no peculiar smell. Bamboo is more durable than plastic stand and makes your end table looks very fantastic. Designed with round corners  your family and pets can be prevented to have accidental bumps.</p> <p><strong>Comes with Versatile Storage Bag:</strong> The cotton and linen polyester fabric have been used to make the storage bag more tough and thick. There are different sizes of pockets on the storage bag for storing different sundries like notebooks and remote controls. In addition  the bag is in dark color and it is not easy to be soiled.</p> <p><strong>No Hassle Assemble & Cleaning:</strong> This tray comes with detailed and illustrated instructions  you can assembly it easily in short time. What's more  the tea table has been varnished to have a water-proof surface which is easy to clean with a cloth.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Natural</li> <li>Material: Bamboo and polyester</li> <li>Overall dimension: 19.5" x 14" x 24.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Storage bag dimension: 14" x 16" (W x H)</li> <li>Distance between legs: 16"</li> <li>Net weight: 8 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 50 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Tray table</li> <li>1 x Storage bag</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > End & Side Tables,,Overall dimension:19.5" x 14" x 24.5" (L x W x H); Storage bag dimensi