</li> <li>Adjustable volume design</li> <li>Assembly required</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Dual Control:</strong> Enable your child to drive manually or use the remote control to guide them safely.<br />● <strong>Attractive and Fun Function:</strong> Equipped with an MP3 player  an AUX input  a USB port  and a TF card slot  this electric truck can be attached to your device to play music or stories. Children will gain more control and entertainment during playtime.<br />● <strong>Cool Appearance:</strong> This truck has a realistic design with bright LED headlights  adjustable safety belts  horns  easy start/stop buttons  double door magnetic locks  etc.<br />● <strong>Security Assurance:</strong> Four wear-resistant wheels made of superior PP materials with no possibility of leakage or tire burst  removing the issue of inflating  which ensures a safer and easier driving experience for kids.<br />● <strong>Soft Start:</strong> It is worth mentioning that the soft-start technology of children riding on a truck prevents children from getting frightened by sudden acceleration or braking. Scientifically designed kids ride on a truck is a wonderful gift for your children's birthday or Christmas.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Red</li> <li>Main material: PP + Iron</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 46.5" x 31" x 29" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 35 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 66 lbs</li> <li>Speed: 3-6 km/h</li> <li>Charge time: About 8-12 hours</li> <li>Battery: 12V 7AH x 1</li> <li>Motor: 12V x 2</li> <li>Recommended for ages: 3-7 years old</li> <li>Certification: UL</li> <li>Box QTY: 2(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Kids ride on truck</li> <li>1 x 2.4GHZ remote control</li> <li>1 x Charger</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Ride On Toys > Powered Ride On Toys,,Overall dimensions:46.5" x 31" x 29" (L x W x H); ,Powered Ride On Toys,Clearance,,Red,TY327440RE+,shopify,153,1,d