hing your private items in the order.<br />●<strong> Exquisite Craft:</strong> Constructed by high-quality particleboard with eco-friendly veneer  this end table is durable for a long time. All materials are certificated as non-toxic  odorless  and stable items  which have reached EPA standards. Delicate wood grain finish brings out elegant and retro style.<br />●<strong> Lightweight and Intimate Detail:</strong> This elegant and simple table is not heavy to move to anywhere you want. Protective pads at the bottom of the table prevent your floor from being scratched and stand more stably. Ideal for your small space  such as an apartment  condo  and dorm room.<br />● <strong>Easy to Assemble and Clean:</strong> All hardware and parts are given the number  and assembly steps are shown in picture forms for reference. A complete set of screws fit in pre-punched holes on this table. A smooth PU finish allows you to clean them easily  just with a damp cloth.<br />● <strong>Versatile Table:</strong> This multifunctional end table could match perfectly with any decor theme with a simple shape in classical color. Compact design is suitable for your bedroom as a bedside table  your living room as an end stand beside the sofa  or your workshop as a tool organizer.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown</li> <li>Material: Particleboard  PU</li> <li>Product dimension: 20" x 18.5" x 23.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Drawer dimension: 14" x 13" x 4" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 27.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of TableTop: 110 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of drawer: 22 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of lower shelf: 11 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Bedroom > Nightstands,,Product dimension:20" x 18.5" x 23.5" (L x W x H); Drawer dimension:14" x 13" x 4" (L x W x H); ,Nightstands,,,Brown,HW61715,shopify,171,1,deny,manual,45.99,105,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27