2-in-1-adjustable-folding-handle-rollator-walker-with-storage-space-blue,2-in-1 Adjustable Folding Handle Rollator Walker with Storage Space-Blue,75064381,https://www.costway.com/2-in-1-rollator-walker-aluminum-walking-aid-assistant-with-storage-space.html?piid=9210100&fee=152&fep=12952&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This is the 2 in 1 rollator which can be converted into a wheelchair by flipping the backrest over and open the footrests.</p> <p> </p> <p>The handlebar has six adjustable heights  so you can choose the most suitable height for your needs. The sturdy aluminum tubes make the whole rollator hard to rust and easy to handle. And it is reinforced with sturdy x-shaped frame to increase safety and stability. The soft backrest and widened cushion provide good support. And the pedals with anti-skid texture and two handbrakes will prevent the elderly from dumping when going down the slope. It hardly need extra tools to assemble and is very easy to fold or carry.</p> <p> </p> <p>The 2-in-1 rollator walker can provide you with comfort and convenience! Don't hesitate to buy it!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>With a reversible backrest  it can be quickly converted from a walker to a wheelchair</li> <li>Adjustable height in six gears to satisfy different people’s needs</li> <li>Aluminum tubes are light in weight  stable in structure and not easily deformed</li> <li>Detachable storage bag can store things and fixed umbrella stand can hold umbrellas</li> <li>Durable PVC wheels are wear-resistant and shock-absorbing</li> <li>Ergonomic handles have a dual braking system and are very easy to use</li> <li>Wide and comfortable cushion provides a good experience when sitting</li> <li>The handles and footrests are non-slip  better protect your safety</li> <li>Storage bag can be used as a backpack  and the shoulder strap is adjustable</li> <li>It can be folded quickly for convenient transport and storage</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>2 in 1 Rollator for Multi-purpose Uses:</strong> You can easily convert the rollator into a wheelchair by flipping the backrest and moving the footrests to the front. The rollator can help the elderly and injured people walk and exercise their legs. When they are tired  they can pull the brake to lock the wheels and sit on it for rest.<br />● <strong>Foldable Design and Easy to Assemble:</strong> By pulling the rope on the seat  this rollator can be quickly folded into a compact size to save space. You can put it in the trunk of the car or in the corner of the room. And it's easy to assemble in 10 minutes to save your time and effort.<br />● <strong>Adjustable Handles and Detachable Storage Bag:</strong> Non-slip and comfortable handles can be adjusted to six different heights to meet the needs of people of different heights. The detachable storage bag with adjustable length shoulder strap for easy storage and carrying of items. And there is an umbrella stand for you to place an umbrella.<br />● <strong>Sturdy and Durable Structure:</strong> The non-slip footrests and the handle with a dual brake system effectively prevent the user from dumping when going down the slope. And the bottom of the seat is reinforced with a sturdy X-shaped frame that provides 300 pounds of weight  making the rollator more stable.<br />● <strong>Safe and User-friendly Design:</strong> The 8-inch PVC wheels are wear-resistant and shock-absorbing  making it suitable for a variety of indoor and outdoor roads. And it is safer to use FDA certification. The widened cushion and soft backrest provide a more comfortable sitting position.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Blue</li> <li>Material: Aluminum  PP  PVC  nylon  oxford cloth  polyester cloth  and net cloth </li> <li>Overall dimension: 24" x 40.5" x 33.5"-38.5" (L x W xH)</li> <li>Range of height: 33.5"-38.5"</li> <li>Seat size: 17.5" x 12" (L x W)</li> <li>Sitting height: 21.5"</li> <li>Wheels diameter: 8"</li> <li>Ne