nd you are set to go. Moreover  you can quickly fold it in the carrying bag without any extra tools needed. This compact and light-weight design  allows you to take it anywhere you want  including cars  trains  and planes.</li> <li><strong>Multifunctional Playpen:</strong> The foldable crib is suitable and spacious enough for babies from 0 to 3 years of age. It can be used for sleeping  but also as a place for mothers and babies to play together. Besides  the mattress includes a soft and thick sponge that will make your baby's sleeping experience more comfortable and enjoyable.</li> <li><strong>Mesh Cloth Design & Zipper Door:</strong> The travel crib is designed with full-height mesh cloth design for strong visibility  allowing you to see your baby and your baby to see you! Moreover  the soft and breathable mesh provides good air circulation while avoiding sultry heat. With a zipper door design  it can be easily opened  allowing you can reach your baby instantly.</li> <li><strong>Removable and Washable Mattress:</strong> The soft  flat and non-collapsing mattress is specially designed for a more comfortable sleeping experience  as well as to protect their delicate spines. Due to the adjustable zipper  the mattress cover and all the crib fabric can be removed and washed  allowing you to maintain a clean and healthy environment for your baby.</li> <li><strong>Safe and Firm Structure:</strong> Made of high-quality aluminum and iron tubes  this item is ASTM certified  ensuring its stability and firmness. The four corners on the bottom are evenly positioned to prevent the playpen from tilting while enhancing its stability.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Dark gray / light gray</li> <li>Material: Aluminum tubes (foot)  iron tubes (handrail)  mesh cloth</li> <li>Overall size: 45.5" x 31" x 27" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Mattress size: 39.5" x 24" x 1.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Side zipper door size: 25" x 16.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Carrying bag size: 23.5" x 