tier storage shelf  allowing you to store more shoes  with the weight capacity of up to 41lbs.</li> <li><strong>Simple and Compact Design:</strong> With its simple design and powerful function  this storage shelf is not only great for home use but is also suitable for the office. Each 2-tier storage is 12" x 31" x 12" making it perfect for limited spaces. Thanks to stack design  you can use the shelves individually or in a combination.</li> <li><strong>Enjoy the fun of DIY:</strong> It comes with detailed instructions and all necessary hardware provided  allowing you to install this piece of furniture in no time. Enjoy the fun of DIY with your family. Furthermore  the flat and open shelf surface makes it easy to clean and maintain.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Material: Mdf</li> <li>Each one dimension: 31" x 12" x 12" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Stackable dimension: 31" x 12" x 36" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Load bearing: 11 lbs per shelf</li> <li>Net weight: 34 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>3 x 2-tier shoe rack</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Entryway > Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,Each one dimension:31" x 12" x 12" (L x W x H); Stackable dimension:31" x 12" x 36" (L x W x H); ,Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,,White,JV10913WH,shopify,181,1,deny,manual,99.99,99.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_pieces_31_inch_stackable_multi-shape_shoe_rack_white-2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_3__73_25.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw63971_.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_12__12_13.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78