 can watch their movements at any time. The bouncer stakes in each corner ensure the stability and firmness of the entire bouncer castle.<br /><strong>● Quick Inflation and Deflation:</strong> The inflatable castle takes only a few minutes to inflate. After use  it can be quickly deflated through the air tube  then folded and placed in the bag. Thanks to its easy-to-carry functionality  gardens  parks and more places can also be a paradise for your child.<br /><strong>● Excellent Oxford Materials:</strong> Made of wear-resistant oxford cloth with a PVC coat  combined with premium sewing techniques  this inflatable house will provide continuous bounce for children. Exquisite craftsmanship plus high quality material selection makes sure it can accompany your kids for many years. No need to worry about excessive jumping will reduce its service time.<br /><strong>● Endless Happy Time:</strong> An inflatable slide is connected to the jumping area. Your child will be keen to have fun in the jumping area and jump over and over again  then slide down the slide. Built-in basketball rim provides extra entertainments. Big entrance for convenient access. Build a happy childhood for your child.<br /><strong>● Sweet Accessories:</strong> This inflatable bounce house comes with a carrying bag  a repair kit. Max. weight capacity: 198 lbs (Suggestion: every kid's weight should be under 99 lbs). Suitable for 2 kids play together. Recommended for ages: 3-10 years old.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As the picture shows</li> <li>Main material: Oxford cloth  PVC</li> <li>Inflated size: 110" x 83" x 67" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 28.5 lbs</li> <li>Max. weight capacity: 198 lbs</li> <li>(Suggestion: every kid's weight should be under 99 lbs)</li> <li>Recommended for ages: 3-10 years old</li> <li>Suitable for 2 kids play together</li> <li>Recommend blower: <a href="https://www.costway.com/index.php/480-w-0-64-hp-air-blower-pump-fan-for-inflatable-bounce-house.html