. With 360° heating and a rotating glass turntable  foods will be cooked more evenly for delicious results.<br />● <strong>Compact <strong>and</strong> Retro Design:</strong> With its lightweight and compact design  this gorgeous microwave oven is easy to carry and store. And it features a unique retro appearance  adding fun and elegance to the atmosphere of a room.<br />● <strong>Simple Operation:</strong> There are 6 buttons on the multifunctional control panel  which are simple to operate for you. The digital LED screen helps you know the remaining cooking time clearly and accurately.<br />●<strong> Multifunctional Microwave:</strong> This microwave oven has a default cooking menu for popular foods such as popcorn  pizza  vegetable  meat  fish  and more  bringing endless convenience to your daily life.<br />● <strong>Completion Sound <strong>and</strong> Child Lock Design:</strong> When cooking is finished  there will be a cooking end signal with three beeps. As well  the attached child lock can prevent children from accidentally touching to provide improved security and safety. Our microwave oven is ETL and UL certified  meaning it is safe and suitable for use.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Green</li> <li>Main material: Steel + glass</li> <li>Overall dimension: 18" x 14" x 10" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Turntable diameter: 9.5"</li> <li>Net weigh: About 23 lbs</li> <li>Capacity: 0.7 Cu. Ft (About 20 L)</li> <li>Output power: 700 W</li> <li>Rated voltage: 120 V</li> <li>Rated frequency: 60 Hz</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Microwave oven</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Appliances > Kitchen Appliances > Toaster Ovens,,Overall dimension:18" x 14" x 10" (L x W x H); Turntable diameter:9.5"; ,Toaster Ovens,On Sale,,Green,EP23853GN,shopify,676,1,deny,manual,109.99,109.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_392_44.jpg,1,h