set-of-2-folding-metal-luggage-rack-suitcase-black,Set of 2 Folding Metal Luggage Rack Suitcase-Black,35497186,https://www.costway.com/set-of-2-folding-metal-luggage-rack-suitcase.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=13414&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● High-quality iron structure is sturdy enough to withstand any weight<br />● 2 compartments storage needs with suitcase  shoes  bags or other items<br />● Special foldable structure makes it easy to fold in a few seconds<br />● Conveniently store in a closet  or simply leaning against a wall or corner<br />● Simple  modern design adds a modern touch to your space<br />● Widely used in bedroom  living room or hotel<br />● Easy to install with detailed instruction and accessories<br />● Plastic foot on both ends of the iron pipe to increase the stability and protect the floor</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Strong Metal Structure:</strong> High-quality iron structure with safe paint make the luggage rack features a more antirust and corrosion-resistant advantage to be used for a long time without deformation and can hold up to 130 lbs weight. 4 fixed heavy-duty straps can effectively prevent wobbling and securely load all kinds of luggage.<br /><strong>● Multipurpose Storage Shelves:</strong> The luggage rack consists of 2 partitions. The top one of the main shelves consists of 4 sturdy straps that can be placed with smaller suitcases or bulky travel gear. There are also 7 iron pipes at the bottom acting as the second partition for storing small items such as shoes and bags  which is suitable for daily household use.<br /><strong>● Foldable and Convenient Storage:</strong> With a foldable structure  the luggage rack can be easily folded in a few seconds when not in use for storage in a closet  or simply leaning against a wall or corner  requiring little space. The anti-loose screw structure is designed to withstand repeated folding and being more solid.<br /><strong>● Elegant Style and An Organizer:</strong> This luggage rack has a simple  modern design with texture and luster metal material  being perfect for bedroom  living room or hotel while adding a modern touch to your space. With this luggage rack  you can quickly organize your travel items without having to dig through them and fully place your luggage in order.<br /><strong>● Easy to Install:</strong> The luggage rack is easy to assemble. You can find all the necessary accessories in the package and assemble them together in a short time according to the instructions. Further  there is a plastic foot on both ends of the iron pipe to be more stable and non-slip while protecting the ground to a certain extent.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Iron  heavy-duty straps</li> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Weight capacity: 130 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 25" x 17" x 22" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Item weight: 18.5 lbs.</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>2 x Luggage rack</li> <li>1 x Instruction manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Entryway > Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,Overall dimensions:25" x 17" x 22" (L x W x H); ,Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,,Black,HW61694BK-2,shopify,491,1,deny,manual,64.99,64.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_Folding_Met_1764662929132119_537537.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_Folding_Met_1764662930084830_608591.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_Folding_Met_1764662927524494_202677.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_Folding_Met_1764662928320930_737631.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab