folding-aluminum-infant-reversible-stroller-with-diaper-bag-beige,Folding Aluminum Infant Reversible Stroller with Diaper Bag-Beige,42930578,https://www.costway.com/folding-aluminum-infant-reversible-stroller-with-diaper-bag.html?piid=9229200&fee=152&fep=13422&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● The stroller is ASTM certified and is the perfect gift for parents with 0-3-year-olds<br />● Large carriage and comfortable mattress for better sleep<br />● Adjustable design allows for various upright positions<br />● Five-point seat belt and detachable guardrail provides premium safety<br />● Foot cover protects from wind during the winter and can be removed in summer<br />● Ventilation nets around the stroller allow for good air circulation<br />● X-shape anti-rust aluminum alloy for ultimate stability<br />● A large-capacity storage basket and a carry bag are perfect to store essentials<br />● Universal front wheels and shock-proof rear wheels suit even uneven roads<br />● Lightly step on the brake pedal to make the stroller stop<br />● Adjust the angle of the non-slip handrail for people of different heights<br />● Push the button on the side to quickly fold the stroller into a compact size  <br />The cover prevents wind or water  and the net keeps out mosquitoes</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 2-in-1 Functional Design:</strong> This infant stroller features 3 reclining positions  not only creating a cozy sleeping space as a bassinet pram  but also providing awesome view for baby to enjoy the outside world as a pushchair. And the stroller can be reversed both inside or outside to satisfy different demands of you and your little one.<br /><strong>● Adjustable Canopy and Handle:</strong> The premium canopy can be either detached or adjusted to different angles according to the weather. Also  the functional net and rain cover effectively keep infants away from rain. Moreover  the 5-gear handle offers much convenience to parent