ly integrated with other decorations  you can position it in restaurants  kitchen counters  coffee shops  and other areas.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble and Clean:</strong> In a short period of time  clear instructions will help you complete the assembly. Moreover  the cushions and backrests of PU leather and smooth metal rods makes the bar stools easy to clean with only a rag.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As the picture shows</li> <li>Material: PU  metal  sponge</li> <li>Product size: 20.5" x 18.5" x (37.5 - 46)" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Seat height: 23.5" - 32"</li> <li>Weight capacity: 265 lbs</li> <li>Net weight of each stool: 22 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>2 x Barstool</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Kitchen & Dining > Bar Stools,,Product size:20.5" x 18.5" x (37.5 - 46)" (L x W x H); ,Bar Stools,,,Brown,HW61545,shopify,341,1,deny,manual,169.99,296.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/4/_4_29_84.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/5/_5_10_74.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/1/_1_101_116.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/3/_3_58_43.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/1/_10_31.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/2/_2_112_124.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/8/_8_63.jpg,7
