8-in-1-multifunctional-home-gym-squat-fitness-equipment,8-in-1 Multifunctional Home Gym Squat Fitness Equipment,17285634,https://www.costway.com/8-in-1-multifunctional-home-gym-squat-fitness-equipment.html?fee=152&fep=13512&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● 8-in-1 sissy squat combines a variety of core training functions  suitable for home gym<br />● Perfect to exercise abdomen  leg & arm muscles  quadriceps and gluteus<br />● Thickened iron squat with 265 lbs load-bearing is stable and durable enough for long time use<br />● T-shape bottom design to prevent turning over when you are doing exercises<br />● 11 levels height adjustable up to 11.5" for people with a different height requirement<br />● Ergonomic cushion with PVC+PU cover to support your legs comfortably<br />● 4 enlarged non-slip foot pads will increase friction as well as protecting the floor<br />● Non-slip handles and anti-skid front pedal strengthens its stability and safety<br />● Users could move it easily due to the convenient wheels in the front<br />● Can be kept into a small size for storage or wiped very easily</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 8-in-1 Multifunctional Squat Machine:</strong> This 8-in-1 sissy squat provides a core workout training to effectively exercise your abdomen and leg muscles. Squat mainly exercises your quadriceps and gluteus  while enhancing knees and hip joints. And you can fasten the tension rope to the hooks to exercise your arms.<br /><strong>● Durable Steel Construction with Large Load Capacity:</strong> Made of sturdy and thickened iron pipes  this squat with 265 lbs load-bearing is extremely durable and will not deform easily. With the bottom designed into a T-shape to touch the ground  the squat will not turn over while you doing weight-bearing exercises. <br /><strong>● Anti-Skid Foot Pads and Handle:</strong> There are 4 enlarged footpads at the bottom to increase friction as well as protecting the floor. And the non-slip handles together with the front pedal will effectively prevent slip during push-ups squats  sit-ups  twists and flat supports. <br /><strong>● 11 Levels Height Adjustable up to 11.5":</strong> Both of the cylinders and mat can be adjusted into several heights using the knobs to satisfy the needs of people with different heights. Covered with a premium PVC+PU cover  the ergonomic leg cushion will support your legs softly to improve the comfort of sports. <br /><strong>● Wheels for Easy Transportation:</strong> Two wheels in the front of the Squat Machine will facilitate your movement and can move it easily without much effort. And you can adjust the height into a compact size for storage.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black + yellow</li> <li>Material: Iron + PVC + PU</li> <li>Maximum weight of user: 265 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 38" x 16.5" x 18.5-30" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Cushion size: 16" x 7.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Net weight: 29.5 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Sissy squat</li> <li>1 x Instruction manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Sports > Strength Training > Benches Racks & Bars,,Overall dimensions:38" x 16.5" x 18.5-30" (L x W x H); Cushion size:16" x 7.5" (L x W); ,Benches Racks & Bars,,,Black,SP36947,shopify,53,1,deny,manual,89.99,111.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_488_13.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_479_13.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/3/33333_2.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/2/12_212_66.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_486_13.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catal