 facilitate moving and storing it</li> <li>No installation is required</li> <li>It has a power-saving mode to save energy</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 2 in 1 Running and Walking Treadmill:</strong> 2-in-1 treadmill has two modes of exercise: 1. When the riser and armrests are raised  can run up to 12 km/h maximum to reach the ideal body shape and weight. 2. Can place it under the table when the riser is folded and enjoy walking at a speed of 1-4 km/h while working or studying.<br /><strong>● 2.25 hp Quiet Motor and Shock-absorbing Design:</strong> This treadmill will provide a silent and high-intensity work-out with a powerful 2.25 hp motor on its base. It absorbs your tread with the 7 layer shock-absorption deck and keeps you safe from hurting the knees and lower body.<br /><strong>● Spacious Running Belt and LED Display and Phone Bracket:</strong> LED display monitors the real-time speed  time  calorie  and distance and takes up to 265 lbs maximum of weight on it. It has a wide and non-slip running belt for safety during a workout. The treadmill is equipped with a phone holder to keep the phone accessible and watch videos during the workout.<br /><strong>● Remote Control and Safety Key:</strong> The treadmill is enhanced with the remote control enables to adjust the speed and to stop. It is equipped also with a safety key so as to prevent accidents from happening and shut off immediately when an emergency occurs.<br /><strong>● Easy to Install  Move or Store:</strong> Easy to gear up that saves time and energy. The built-in wheels enable us to move around without any hassle. It can be folded which allows it to become compact and take up much less storage space. Can be stored under beds  transported in cars or simply propped up in a cupboard. It has CE  ROHS  CB  EN957  IEC certifications by SGS.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Silver</li> <li>Overall dimension: 52" x 27" x 42.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Running area: 15" x 40"</li> <li>Speed range: 1KM/H-12.0KM/H</li> <li>Load bearing strength: 220 lbs</li> <li>Net weight: 61 lbs</li> <li>Voltage: 110V</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Running machine</li> </ul>,Costway,Sports > Exercise Machines > Treadmills,,Overall dimension:52" x 27" x 42.5" (L x W x H); ,Treadmills,Bestseller,,Silver,SP37914US-SL,shopify,209,1,deny,manual,370,1850,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_8__113_3.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2.25hp_2_in_1_folding_treadmill_with_app_speaker_remote_control.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_9__97_2.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_1__137_1.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_4__133_3.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_5__119_6.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_3__139_1.jpg,7
