d Durability:</strong> Both table and chairs are equipped with non-slip feet pads to protect your floor and add stability to the furniture. Because the bottom of the chair has X-shaped brackets  the whole chair has high bearing capacity. Rattan materials are not easily deformed or corroded thus the furniture set can be used for long time.<br />● <strong>Best for Outdoor Living:</strong> The all-weather wicker with a nature look is suitable for using in all seasons. The combination of two chairs and a table is perfect for close conversations. Premium lightweight rattan makes it easy to move this wicker rattan furniture set from patio to lawn or from backyard to garden.<br />● <strong>Prominent Comfortable Seating:</strong> The rattan chairs are ergonomically balanced with backs for extra lumbar support. The cushion is made of soft and thick sponge which is very comfortable for you to sit and rest. You can put some drinks or snacks on the table  and then sit down to enjoy the cozy life.<br />● <strong>Aesthetic Appearance:</strong> This set of outdoor table and chairs is made of rattan which has exquisite weaving techniques. The table is accompanied with a milk white tempered glass tabletop. Whole color scheme is simple but classic which is suitable for any place where you need to have a conversation or rest.<br />● <strong>Easy to Clean and Assemble:</strong> The soft cushion on the chair is equipped with a waterproof polyester cloth cover. It is convenient for you to wash it. The table is equipped with removable tempered glass  which can be easily wiped off with a damp cloth if it is dirty. And you just need to put all the parts together by following our installation instruction.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Rattan Material: PE </li> <li>Materials: Polyester  Sponge  steel  wicker</li> <li>Maximum load bearing of chair: 330 Ibs</li> <li>Maximum load bearing of table: 110 Ibs</li> <li>Size of chair: 23.5" x 23" x 29" (L x W x H)</