convertible-wall-mounted-table-with-a-chalkboard-white,Convertible Wall Mounted Table with A Chalkboard-White,50347819,https://www.costway.com/convertible-wall-mounted-table-with-a-chalkboard.html?piid=9220100&fee=152&fep=13581&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Let's make the most of your existing space with this stylish and affordable fold-out convertible desk!</p> <p> </p> <p>The wall mounted desk folds out to provide ample space for working and folds up to serve as the cabinet to keep tidy  an ideal space-saving solution for any homeowner looking for storing essential items to reduce clutter and optimize your personal space. Exquisite smooth provides a handy working surface and access to storage compartments when open.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for the wall mounted desk  don't hesitate to buy it!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Optimize your personal space  served as a working and storage area anywhere you need it</li> <li>A handy working surface and a metal buckle for easy access to storage necessities Folding away neatly to save space when not in use</li> <li>Full-featured  decorate it freely and arrange your favorite artworks on it</li> <li>Sturdy and durable  enough to hold your accessible items & protecting valuable stuffs with the baffle design</li> <li>Back blackboard for writing down to-do-list and decorating your home</li> <li>Easy set-up and maintenance  saving your time and energy</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Space-saving and Foldable Design:</strong> Wall mounted and foldable design offers an ideal space-saving solution for those who want to store essential items and keep the room tidy. And the back writing blackboard allows you to record personal to do list or leaving notes for other family members when you are in a hurry.<br /><strong>● Multifunctional Use and Large Storage Space:</strong> Featuring the multiple storage compartments  this wall mounted table provides a spacious storage space to display your items. And the baffle design on the left-side effectively protects your valuable items from falling down.<br /><strong>● Durable and Stable Craftsmanship:</strong> Crafted from the P2 standard MDF with NC coating  this handy fold out convertible desk is sturdy and strong enough for your daily use. When folded out  the tabletop can hold up to 44 lbs  fully meeting daily needs. And the stylish metal buckle firmly hooks the board to serve as the cabinet.<br /><strong>● Elegant and Modern Appearance:</strong> This desk will be the perfect eye-catching addition to your limited space. It is painted in creamy white and after folding the black back is trimmed with white edge. The clean lines create a stylish and minimalist style  ideal for decorating a bedroom  living room  study or office.<br /><strong>● Easy to Clean and Install:</strong> Mounts easily onto any wall in your home so you can start studying and working in no time. Detailed assembly manual and full set of hardware fitting is included. And with the wet cloth you can wipe dirty stain easily from the smooth surface.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Material: P2 standard MDF</li> <li>Overall dimensions:24" x 34" x 57.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Folded dimensions: 24" x 6.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 32.4 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of the unfolded desk top:44 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of each cube: 4.4 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li>1 x Fold out wall mount desk</li> <li>1 x User guide</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Laptop Tables & Printer Stands,,Overall dimensions:24" x 34" x 57.5" (L x W x H); Folded dimensions:24" x 6.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H); ,Laptop Tables & Printer Stands,,,White,HW61920WH,shopify,196,1,deny,manual,99.99,99.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/o/Convertible_Wall_Mou_1775107231767397_197507.jpeg,1,http