50-inch-recessed-electric-insert-wall-mounted-fireplace-with-adjustable-brightness,50 Inch Recessed Electric Insert Wall Mounted Fireplace with Adjustable Brightness,21594673,https://www.costway.com/50-inch-recessed-electric-insert-wall-mounted-fireplace-with-adjustable-brightness.html?fee=152&fep=13583&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>In today's fast-paced work and life  people are more eager to enjoy the natural  warm  and leisurely feeling brought by the fireplace.</p> <p> </p> <p>As a household electric heating appliance  the electric fireplace is much safer and more reliable  has easy installation and disassembly  and has a high combustion utilization rate. Compared with wood-burning and gas fireplaces  electric fireplaces will not have strange smells and noise generated when the flame is burning  Besides  they can warm up a large area  providing a comfortable environment to enjoy. Designed with 9 flame colors  it also brings you elegant viewing effects. Touch the switch  the magical flame will be displayed instantly. With two installation options  the fireplace can be wall-mounted installed or recessed installed easily!</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for a fireplace like this  do not hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <p></p> <ul> <li>Heater with low 750W and high 1500W power to heat a room quickly</li> <li>Temperature from 62℉-82℉ to make a warm and cozy environment</li> <li>Creates realistic flame effects with 9 flame colors and 5 light intensities</li> <li>High-intensity LED lights with display show brighter and higher flame</li> <li>LED Screen panel and remote control for more convenient operation</li> <li>6 Buttons to set: Power  Color  Flame  Heater  Temperature  and Timer</li> <li>0.5-8 hour timing and overheat protection for efficient and safer use</li> <li>Advanced metal plate and thickened tempered glass ensure durability</li> <li>Easy to install with two options: wall-mounted/recessed installation</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>2 Heat Settings with Thermostat:</strong> Featuring 2 heat settings (high 1500W and low 750W) to choose from  the front heater vent provides heat quickly  which is a healthier heating mode without gas or wood burning. And the thermostat goes from 62℉-82℉  warming area is up to 400 square feet to make you feel comfortable in every corner of your house on cold days! <br />● <strong>True-to-Life Flame with 9 Colors:</strong> To create the cozy atmosphere of a traditional fireplace  this electronic unit with 9 flame colors  5 light intensities  and plastic crystals emulate a bright and realistic flame effect. And ultra-high intensity LED lights with large display allows the flame to show burning high enough  which can be operated with or without heat.<br />● <strong>Wall-Mounted/Recessed Installation:</strong> Specially designed with 2 installation methods  this electric fireplace can be recessed in the wall or mounted on the wall  whose black frame will give the room a sleek and modern look. Only weighing 38lbs to 53lbs  the fireplace is light enough to allow you to install it by using the easy-to-understand instructions. <br />● <strong>LED Screen and Remote Controller:</strong> Remote control and touch LED screen panel  equipped with 6 image buttons respectively  make it more convenient to control every function of the electric fireplace  you can turn on/off the power  adjust flame colors  light intensities  heat  temperature  and 0.5-8 hour timing for more energy-efficient use.<br />● <strong>Safe Design and Overheat Protection:</strong> Constructed of premium metal plate and 5mm thick tempered glass  the electric fireplace is wear-resistant and durable. And ETL-certified plugs and wires ensure added safety when used. And if the device is overheated  it will cut off power automatically to avoid dangerous incidents.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Metal plate  tempered glass  plastic crystal  LED</li> <li>Heater: 750W  1500W</li> <li>Voltage: 120V/ 60Hz</li> <li>Product dimensions: 50"(L) x 5.5"(W) x 21.5"(H)</li> <li>Temperature: 62℉-82℉</li> <li>Timer range: 0.5-8 hour</li> <li>Flame color: 9 flame color</li> <li>Net weight: 53lbs</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Electric fireplace</li> <li>1 x User's manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Fireplaces,,Product dimensions:50"(L) x 5.5"(W) x 21.5"(H); ,Fireplaces,Clearance,,Black,EP24727US,shopify,272,1,deny,manual,159.99,159.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/1/c12_6_10.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/1/c11_9_10.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/1/c1_14_26.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/1/c10_11_15.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_268_31.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/3/c3_11_22.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_1__71_62.jpg,7
makeup-dressing-table-with-touch-switch-lighted-mirror-and-cushioned-stool-black,Makeup Dressing Table with Touch Switch Lighted Mirror and Cushioned Stool-Black,30785149,https://www.costway.com/makeup-dressing-table-with-touch-switch-lighted-mirror-and-cushioned-stool.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=13624&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● High-quality materials are sturdy and durable<br />● Wide tabletop and 4 drawers provide ample storage space for your cosmetics<br />● Smart storage makes your makeup tidier<br />● The bearing capacity of stool is large enough to carry the weight of an adult<br />● 100% solid wood legs ensure enough stability<br />● Non-slip pads protect the floor from scratches<br />● The classic carved design is very easy to attract people's attention<br />● 360° rotating mirror with 10 LED bulbs gives you a bright view and the appropriate angle<br />● Brightness can be adjusted to meet the needs of different lighting environments<br />● This vanity table can be turned into a writing desk<br />● The stool cushions are filled with a premium sponge for comfort and softness<br />● Elegant design for any room decoration  perfect for bathroom  bedroom  corridor<br />● The power plug is UL certified<br />● Easy to assemble  detailed instructions will be provided</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Sturdy Structure:</strong> The top of the vanity set made of MDF is smooth and flat. Table and stool are supported by solid wood legs and non-slip pads to ensure that it does not wobble easily and is ideal for long-term use. The stool will accommodate up to 220 pounds  enough to hold on to an adult.<br />● <strong>Rotating Oval Mirror:</strong> This oval mirror is equipped with 10 led lights and an extra bulb for replacement. This light has a memory feature  and when the switch is turned on again  the brightness will be the same as last time. In addition  the brightness can be adjusted for daily makeup.<br />●<strong> Spacious Storage:</strong> This set  featuring 4 drawers and a large tabletop  provides an adequate space to organize makeup  jewelry  or accessories. And 2 layers on the tabletop make it easy to classify.<br />●<strong> Comfortable and Versatile Stool:</strong> The cushion  filled with a high-density sponge  has a strong resilience and will not collapse easily. Cushion cover with decorative patterns is elegant and breathable. The separate stool is perfectly suited as a piano bench  shoe bench  or footrest.<br />● <strong>Dual-Use Desk:</strong> The dresser can be divided into two parts and the desk can be put in a bedroom or study for reading or writing. It suits perfectly your home in a modern style.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black / White / Brown</li> <li>Material: P2 MDF + Pine</li> <li>Net weight: 37.5 lbs</li> <li>Vanity table size: 29.5"(L) x 16"(W) x 57"(H)</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 80 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of stool: 220 lbs</li> <li>Stool size: 14.5"(L) x 11"(W) x 18"(H)</li> <li>Big drawer size: 9.5"(L) x 10.5"(W) x 2.5"(H)</li> <li>Big drawer interior size: 9"(L) x 10"(W) x 2.5"(H)</li> <li>Small drawer size: 7.5"(L) x 3.5"(W) x 2.5"(H)</li> <li>Small drawer interior size: 7"(L) x 3"(W) x 2"(H)</li> <li>Mirror size: 11"(L) x 16.5"(W)</li> <li>Table top to the ground: 30"</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li>1 x Vanity table set with lights</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Bedroom > Makeup Vanities,,Vanity table size:29.5"(L) x 16"(W) x 57"(H); Stool size:14.5"(L) x 11"(W) x 18"(H); Big drawer size:9.5"(L) x 10.5"(W) x 2.5"(H); Big drawer interior size:9"(L) x 10"(W) x 2.5"(H); Small drawer size:7.5"(L) x 3.5"(W) x 2.5"(H); Small drawer interior size:7"(L) x 3"(W) x 2"(H); Mirror size:11"(L) x 16.5"(W); ,Makeup Vanities,,,Black,HW66050US-BK,shopify,36,1,deny,manual,169.99,169.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df