5-tier-wood-large-shoe-rack-holds-up-12-18-pairs,5-Tier Wood Large Shoe Rack Holds up 12-18 Pairs,64328095,https://www.costway.com/5-tier-wood-large-shoe-rack-holds-up-12-18-pairs.html?fee=152&fep=13627&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<ul> <li>● Strong acacia wood structure allows it to enjoy great weight capacity</li> <li>● Smooth surfaces and corners prevent from bumping and injuring</li> <li>● Removable shelves give you option to choose reasonable height</li> <li>● Eight metal hooks on both sides can be used to suspend high heels</li> <li>● The capacity of the five-storey can meet the storage needs of a family</li> <li>● The top handle design provides convenience for the mobile shoe rack</li> <li>● It is suitable for corridors  living rooms  bedrooms  bathrooms and gardens</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Large Storage Space:</strong> This shoe rack has five shelves and four pairs of shoes can be stored on each shelf. Its oversize design not only provides the perfect storage solution for your whole family  but also keeps your entrance in order. So that when you enter the door  you will not trip your shoes and find the entrance in a mess.</li> <li><strong>Sturdy and Durable Frame:</strong> The shoe rack is made of FCS-certified Acacia woods  which is hard  corrosion resistant and durable for long-time use. The boards are fixed with galvanized steel screws to ensure a firm and stable structure. The connection of twin screw strengthens the stability of the shoe rack so that each layer can bear up to 180 pounds.</li> <li><strong>Removable Shelf <strong>and</strong> Metal Hooks</strong>: Each shelf of this shoe rack is independent  so you can remove one layer to store your high shoes or backpacks. Because of the lath design of the shoe rack  we have also installed eight metal hooks on both sides of the shoe rack to facilitate your storage of high heels.</li> <li><strong>Multifunctional Use:</strong> Simple and classic appearance makes it suitable for various decoration styles. Ingenious design increases its practicability. It's not just a shoe rack in the entrance and you can use it as a storage shelf in the living room  bathroom  kitchen and a plant rack in the garden.</li> <li><strong>Lightweight <strong>and</strong> Easy Installation:</strong> The product structure is very simple and easy to assemble. The instruction is provided  which includes very detailed and concise installation steps  and it will not take you too much time. In addition  it only weighs 15.5 lbs  so you can easily move it to where you want to place it.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Wood</li> <li>Net weight: 15.5 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimension: 33" x 10" x 32" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Material: Acacia wood + metal</li> <li>Each layer weight capacity: 180 lbs</li> <li>Wood humidity: <14%</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Shoe shelf</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Entryway > Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,Overall dimension:33" x 10" x 32" (L x W x H); ,Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,,Natural,JV10326,shopify,405,1,deny,manual,69.99,69.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_2__70_99.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_1__68_109.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_196_116.jpg,3,,4,,5,,6,,7
