us design increases its practicability. It's not just a shoe rack in the entrance and you can use it as a storage shelf in the living room  bathroom  kitchen  and a plant rack in the garden.<br /><strong>● Lightweight and Easy Installation:</strong> The product structure is very simple and easy to assemble. The instruction is provided  which includes very detailed and concise installation steps  and it will not take too much time. In addition  it only weighs 11 lbs  so you can easily move it to where you want to place it.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Teak</li> <li>Material: Acacia wooden</li> <li>Net weight: 11 lbs</li> <li>Size: 34" x 11" x 17.5" (L x W x H) </li> <li>Weight capacity: 350 lbs</li> <li>Wood humidity: <14%</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes: </li> <li>1 x Shoe rack bench</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Entryway > Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,Size:34" x 11" x 17.5" (L x W x H) ; ,Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,,Natural,HW62414,shopify,211,1,deny,manual,64.99,64.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_1__68_110.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_5__58_92.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_9__42_73.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_3__74_89.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_196_117.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_2__70_100.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_6__58_89.jpg,7
contemporary-chair-side-end-table-compact-table-with-drawer-nightstand-natural,Contemporary Chair Side End Table Compact Table with Drawer Nightstand-Natural,06137294,https://www.costway.com/contemporary-chairside-end-table-with-drawer-and-open-shelf.html?piid=9229100&fee=152&fep=13635&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The chairside end table can meet your demands of storing and decorating extremely.</p> <p> </p> <p>This is our simple but fashionable end table which adds functionality to any room in your home. With the retro appearance and delicate handle  the end table can totally match the décor of your home. The chairside table has a capacious drawer and a shelf at the bottom to provide large storage space and keep your rooms stay neat. What’s more  this table is durable and stable which has a long service time. At the top and bottom  you can put your crafts and furnishing articles. In the internal  you can store personal items and so on. </p> <p> </p> <p>This multifunctional table can be placed in the living room  bedroom  and study as a nightstand or chairside table. It will surely bring you a cozy life.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Solid MDF board and rubber wood legs ensure its stability and durability</li> <li>Compact furniture designed for small space living</li> <li>Smooth surface is easy to clean and maintain</li> <li>Spacious tabletop is an ideal place for display crafts and plants</li> <li>A drawer and a shelf at the bottom for large storage space</li> <li>Practical table for bedroom  living room and entryway</li> <li>Metal handle for easy opening and closing</li> <li>Retro and elegant design which is suitable for home decoration</li> <li>Simple assembly needed with detailed instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Carefully Selected Materials:</strong> This end table is made of high-quality MDF board and solid rubberwood foot  so it is sturdy and durable. The surface of the table is covered with veneering modules makes the table won't be damaged  scratched  or rotted easily.<br />● <strong>Large Storage Space:</strong> This end table has a spacious storage space with a deep drawer and a shelf at the bottom. It can be placed beside your bed or sofa and you can display some commonly used items such as a desk lamp  remote control and so on.<br />● <strong>Elegant and Concise Appearance:</strong> Wooden furniture in retro style brings a natural atmosphere to your urban life. The end table has a delicate sense of gloss and shows the quality of high-grade.<br />● <strong>High Security and Stability:</strong> This table has round corners  which largely improve the safety of use. The cambered handle is easy to push and pull the drawer  and the protruding part will not scratch the body.<br />● <strong>Easy to Assemble and Clean:</strong> You can easily put all the parts together by following our installation instructions in a short period of time. This chairside table is lightweight so you can move it anywhere you want.</p> <p> </p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown</li> <li>Material: MDF  rubber wood</li> <li>Size: 13" x 22" x 23" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight: 25 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity :50 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x End table</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > End & Side Tables,,Size:13" x 22" x 23" (L x W x H); ,End & Side Tables,Clearance,,Natural,HW61983RE,shopify,260,1,deny,manual,74.99,114.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/o/Contemporary_Chair_S_1766380494784557_947250.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/o/Contemporary_Chair_S_1766380495639300_929596.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/o/Contemporary_Chair_S_1766380496531260_734