 11" (W)  and the perfect size is not only great for home use but also suitable for the office.<br />● <strong>Lightweight and Easy Installation:</strong> The product structure is very simple and easy to assemble. The instruction is provided  which includes very detailed and concise installation steps  and it will not take you too much time. In addition  it is only 7 lbs heavy  so you can easily move it to where you want to place it.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Teak</li> <li>Material: Acacia wood</li> <li>Overall dimension: 27.5" x 11" x 17.5" (L x W x H) </li> <li>Weight: 10 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 180 lbs</li> <li>Package Includes:</li> <li>1 x Shoe rack bench</li> <li>1 x User's manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Entryway > Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,Overall dimension:27.5" x 11" x 17.5" (L x W x H) ; ,Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,,Natural,HW62413,shopify,219,1,deny,manual,54.99,54.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw62413_6.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/4/_4_30_10.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/2/_2_115_10.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/3/_3_63.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/i/_in_.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/5/_5_11_9.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/i/file_222_4.jpg,7
