ip pads and anti-toppling fitting  which can ensure safe use</li> <li>360° spinning mirror to let you have an overall clear sight of your face from any angle</li> <li>The stool cushions are filled with a premium sponge for comfort and softness</li> <li>Drawers with retro handles can be pulled in and out smoothly </li> <li>Easy to assemble  detailed instructions will be provided</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>● <strong>10 LED Lights of Adjustable Brightness:</strong> This great vanity set features 10 LED lights with endlessly adjustable brightness. The unique memory feature ensures that the last adjusted brightness is already displayed when the light is turned on.</li> <li>● <strong>5 Large Drawers and Detachable Organizers:</strong> Spacious desktop and five drawers have sufficient storage space for your cosmetics. 6 desktop compartments and 2 DIY dividers in the middle drawer will help you properly classify your items so that you can use space effectively.</li> <li>● <strong>Durable Structure and Solid Wood Legs:</strong> The pine legs of the dresser and the rubber legs of the stool ensure the durability and solidity of the vanity set. The safety design of the anti-slip and anti-slip mats not only prevents the dresser from tipping over but also protects the floor from scratches.</li> <li>● <strong>Premium Comfortable Stool:</strong> This padded stool is made of high-quality flame retardant sponge and fabric. Proper height and soft cushioned seat will relieve the fatigue and give you a more comfortable make-up experience.</li> <li>●<strong> 2-in-1 Vanity Table Set:</strong> With the removal of the mirror top  the makeup table may be used as a writing desk or a laptop desk.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: MDF+ Pine+ Rubber wood </li> <li>Net weight:39 lbs </li> <li>Vanity table size: 31.5" x 16" x 54" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 287 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of stool: 250 lbs