ble so that you clearly read the name of countries and cities. And the plates of each country are colorful and well defined. In the meanwhile  our globe also contains geographic information about equator  oceans  seas  deserts and important rivers and lakes.<br /><strong></strong></li> <li><strong>High-quality Material:</strong> The world globe is made of PVC material  which is totally safe to children’s bodies. In addition  the base is chrome plated  which makes it more stable and durable. It is worth mentioning that  the bottom of base features a non-slip pad to prevent sliding.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Main material: PVC</li> <li>Globe diameter: 13"</li> <li>Base diameter: 8"</li> <li>Height: 16"</li> <li>Net weight: 2.51 pounds</li> <li>Base: Chromate finish</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x 13" Illuminated World Globe</li> <li>1 x USB cable</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Learning Toys,,Globe diameter:13"; Base diameter:8"; ,Learning Toys,,,Blue,HW63198,shopify,202,1,deny,manual,74.99,74.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/3/13_Inch_Illuminated__1763013275973640_396388.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/3/13_Inch_Illuminated__1763013276819643_443534.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/3/13_Inch_Illuminated__1763013277593003_234975.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/3/13_Inch_Illuminated__1763013275208002_617927.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/3/13_Inch_Illuminated__1763013278448692_340883.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/3/13_Inc