r a long time.<br /><strong>● Ergonomic Design of Sofa:</strong> Designed with a slightly sloping backrest and curved handrails  the single chair and loveseat are very comfortable for relaxing yourself. With thick and soft cushions  it will also add comfort. And the seat cushions can be fixed on the slat of the chair with strings. You don't need to worry about moving of cushion.<br /><strong>● Multipurpose 4-piece Furniture:</strong> This furniture set which includes 4 pieces can be combined in various ways or be used separately according to your different needs. You can enjoy a good time with your family to drink  eat or chat. The set is ideal for your garden  patio  balcony  poolside and backyard to be a perfect decor.<br /><strong>● Thick and Washable Cushions:</strong> Comes with three padded seat cushions and four back cushions  this set will provide the ultimate comfort and make you totally relax with a soft and high resilience sponge. What's more  the cushion with hidden zipper which is easy to take off the cover and rinse by hand or machine.<br /><strong>● Size of Wooden Patio Set:</strong> Dimension of loveseat: 45" x 29" x 30"(L x W x H)  single sofa: 23.5" x 29" x 30"(L x W x H)  table: 39.5" x 19" x 18"(L x W x H)  weight capacity of loveseat: 700 lbs  weight capacity of single sofa: 360 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color of frame: Teak</li> <li>Color of cushion: Gray</li> <li>Material: Acacia wood  polyester fabric  sponge</li> <li>Dimension of loveseat: 45" x 29" x 30"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of single sofa: 23.5" x 29" x 30"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of table: 39.5" x 19" x 18"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Height of armrest: 23.5"</li> <li>Height of seat: 17"</li> <li>Weight of the set: 77 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of loveseat: 700 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of single sofa: 360 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>2 x Single chair</li> <li>1 x Loveseat</li> <li>4 x Back cushion</li> <li>3 x Seat cushion</li> <li>1 x Table</