hat can keep the temperature at a set point. The temperature can be adjusted from 62 Fahrenheit to 82 Fahrenheit to gratify your various requirements. And the overheat protection system will automatically turn off the power for safety when the temperature is too high.<br /><strong>● 2 Ways of Controlling</strong>: In order to bring you great convenience  the flame  heat and timer can be controlled by not only touch buttons but also the handy remote control (a maximum available distance of 26 ft). Meanwhile  the LED indicator can also display the temperature degree (red color for Fahrenheit and green color for Celsius).<br /><strong>● Multiple Installations</strong>: Coming with detailed and illustrated instructions  you can find the installation is not so difficult. In addition  despite freestanding  the electric fireplace insert can also be installed on a TV stand or cabinet. Attention: Before purchase  please check the "size" image  again and again  to make sure the size is ok for your mantel.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Iron  glass</li> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Dimension of fireplace: 19" x 5" x 17.5"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of front panel: 18" x 17" (L x H)</li> <li>Voltage: 120 V  60 Hz</li> <li>Watts: 1400 Watts</li> <li>Maximum output: 5 000 BTUs</li> <li>Weight of product: 13.5 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Electric fireplace</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Appliances > Climate Control Appliances > Fireplaces,,Dimension of fireplace:19" x 5" x 17.5"(L x W x H); Dimension of front panel:18" x 17" (L x H); ,Fireplaces,,,Black,FP10173US-BK,shopify,660,1,deny,manual,99.99,181.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/p/fp10173us-bk-1_3_.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/p/fp10173us-bk-1_6_.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/m