 with crystal handles can be pulled in and out smoothly</li> <li>Easy to assemble with detailed instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>360° Rotating LED Mirror with Adjustable Brightness:</strong> The oval mirror of the dressing table is equipped with 10 LED bulbs  which illuminates in a not so glare low-light environment. The soft white light gives you comfort and pleasant experience to do makeup. Adjustable brightness and memory functions bring you more convenience. The 360° rotatable oval mirror design gives the choice to change the angle of the mirror as the way you want.</li> <li><strong>Large Space for Organization:</strong> With a central drawer  a spacious table top and two side drawers next to the oval mirror  this vanity table provides ample storage space for cosmetics  jewelry  accessories and small items. A crystal handle is provided to slide the drawer in and out very smoothly. Besides  the shelf on the small drawer can be decorated with potted plants  flowers and more.</li> <li><strong>Premium Material for Sturdy Structure:</strong> Combined with high-quality materials and a sturdy frame structure，this vanity set not only has sufficient stability and safety  but also has an extremely long endurance. Solid wood legs with non-slip pads ensure the table and stool have excellent load-bearing capacity while preventing scratches on the floor.</li> <li><strong>Elegant & Multi-functional Design:</strong> Exquisite workmanship and elegant appearance make the vanity set look more attractive and enhances the beauty of the room. The floral finish on the stool and the slightly curved legs add extra charm to the looks. The multi-functional design allows the dresser to be used as a writing or laptop desk when the top is removed.</li> <li><strong>Cushion Stool with Soft Sponge:</strong> This astonishing dressing set comes with a separate upholstered stool. Features with breathable and skin-friendly fabric and high-density sponge  this 