ss:</strong> Made of high-quality drop stitch material  our inflatable gymnastic mat is environmental and durable. The reinforced seams give the inflatable cushion a good air tightness to ensure perfect high strength training and long service life.</li> <li><strong>Comfort Experience & Safety Guarantee:</strong> The inflatable gymnastic mat has good elasticity  which can effectively reduce the impact generated during exercise and provide good support for the body. In addition  the non-slip surface prevents you from getting hurt while exercising.</li> <li><strong>Fast Inflation & Easy to Use:</strong> The inflatable gymnastic mat can be inflated quickly by using a professional electric pump. The valve has an excellent anti-leakage function that allows the gymnastic pad maintaining its pressure for days. Besides  the light weight design and webbing handle make it easy for you to move and carry.</li> <li><strong>Convenient Storage & Easy to Clean:</strong> After venting air  our inflatable gymnastic mats can be easily rolled up. The compact size and lightweight design make it easy to carry and store. In addition  the smooth surface and waterproof material make it easy to clean.</li> <li><strong>Multifunctional Mat & Wide Application:</strong> This durable inflatable mat is ideal for your healthy workout  such as gymnastics  cheerleading or tumbling. It can be used in gymnasiums  schools or gardens. In addition  it's waterproof so it also can be placed on the pool or sea.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Green/Pink/Blue</li> <li>Material: Drop stitch</li> <li>Product size: 10' x 3.3' x 4" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 23 lbs</li> <li>Load-bearing capacity: 265 lbs</li> <li>Pump voltage: 120v/ 60 Hz</li> <li>Certification: UL ETL  CE  ROHS  SAA</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Inflatable gymnastic mat</li> <li>1 x Professional electric pump</li> <li>1 x Repair kit</li> </ul>,Costway,Sports > Yoga > 