2-in-1-folding-treadmill-with-bluetooth-speaker-remote-control-navy,2.25HP 2 in 1 Folding Treadmill with APP Speaker Remote Control-Navy,18732649,https://www.costway.com/2-25hp-2-in-1-folding-treadmill-with-bluetooth-speaker-remote-control.html?piid=9221000&fee=152&fep=13812&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This innovative 2-in-1 foldable treadmill has 2 sport modes so that it can be used as a running treadmill and an under-the-desk walking treadmill.</p> <p> </p> <p>You can use it for walking  jogging  and running  making it suitable for homes  offices  and gyms. With a quiet 2.25 HP motor  it won’t disturb others. The 7-layered shock-absorbing running belt provides effective cushioning for your joints and muscles. The versatile LED display monitors your movement data in real-time. It is equipped with remote control and a safety key for an immediate shut-down in emergency situations. The foldable design and transport wheels make it easy to move and store the treadmill. Start exercising now and burn calories!</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for a folding treadmill like this  please do not hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>The 2-in-1 treadmill can be used as an under-the-desk treadmill and a running treadmill</li> <li>The speed is 1-4km/h in the walking mode and 1-12km/h in the running mode</li> <li>Powerful 2.25 hp quiet motor makes your running quieter</li> <li>Use the phone holder to watch videos or chat with friends while running</li> <li>Multi-layer design and sturdy steel frame make it shock-absorbing and noise-reducing</li> <li>7-layer non-slip running belt provides an effective cushion for your knees</li> <li>LED display clearly shows time  speed  distance  and calories</li> <li>The adjustable running speed with the remote control to reach the intensity that best suits you</li> <li>Safety key ensures that the treadmill can be stopped immediately in emergencies</li> <li>Transport wheels and foldable design facilitate moving and storing it</li> <li>No installation is required</li> <li>It has a power-saving mode to save energy</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 2 in 1 Running and Walking Treadmill:</strong> 2-in-1 treadmill has two modes of exercise: 1. When the riser and armrests are raised  can run up to 12 km/h maximum to reach the ideal body shape and weight. 2. Can place it under the table when the riser is folded and enjoy walking at a speed of 1-4 km/h while working or studying.<br /><strong>● 2.25 hp Quiet Motor and Shock-absorbing Design:</strong> This treadmill will provide a silent and high-intensity work-out with a powerful 2.25 hp motor on its base. It absorbs your tread with the 7 layer shock-absorption deck and keeps you safe from hurting the knees and lower body.<br /><strong>● Spacious Running Belt and LED Display and Phone Bracket:</strong> LED display monitors the real-time speed  time  calorie  and distance and takes up to 265 lbs maximum of weight on it. It has a wide and non-slip running belt for safety during a workout. The treadmill is equipped with a phone holder to keep the phone accessible and watch videos during the workout.<br /><strong>● Remote Control and Safety Key:</strong> The treadmill is enhanced with the remote control enables to adjust the speed and to stop. It is equipped also with a safety key so as to prevent accidents from happening and shut off immediately when an emergency occurs.<br /><strong>● Easy to Install  Move or Store:</strong> Easy to gear up that saves time and energy. The built-in wheels enable us to move around without any hassle. It can be folded which allows it to become compact and take up much less storage space. Can be stored under beds  transported in cars or simply propped up in a cupboard. It has CE  ROHS  CB  EN957  IEC certifications by SGS.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: ABS</li> <li>Color: Navy</li> <li>Overall dimension: 49" x 27" x 42" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Folding dimension: 52" x 27" x 5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Running area size: 40" x 16" (L x W)</li> <li>Net weight: 74 lbs</li> <li>Weigh capacity: 265 lbs</li> <li>Working voltage: AC 110V 60 Hz</li> <li>Peak Motor power: 2.25 HP</li> <li>Speed: 1.0-12.0 km/h</li> <li>Control method: Controller</li> <li>Screen display: Time  speed  distance  calorie</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Sports > Exercise Machines > Treadmills,,Overall dimension:49" x 27" x 42" (L x W x H); Folding dimension:52" x 27" x 5" (L x W x H); Running area size:40" x 16" (L x W); ,Treadmills,Bestseller,,Navy,SP37914US-NY,shopify,147,1,deny,manual,219,1095,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_8__112_35.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/p/sp37514ny_.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_11__62_15.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_9__96_22.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_6__112_39.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_294_7.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_1__136_2.jpg,7
