3-pcs-wicker-rocking-bistro-set-with-glass-coffee-table-and-storage-shelf-beige,3 Pcs Wicker Rocking Bistro Set with Glass Coffee Table and Storage Shelf-Beige,63109458,https://www.costway.com/3-pieces-cushioned-patio-rattan-set-with-rocking-chair-and-table.html?piid=9229200&fee=152&fep=13826&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Constructed of a heavy steel frame and premium rattan  the whole set is sturdy and durable to serve you for a long time. Including 2 rocking chairs and a coffee table  this set suits any style of home. </p> <p>   </p> <p>The rocking chairs are designed to rock slowly and gently which will bring you a fantastic feeling. Comes with soft and thick cushions  you will feel extreme comfort for your hip and back when you sit on the chair. And the cover of the cushion is equipped with a zipper for easy removal and cleaning. The set also contains a coffee table that has a lower shelf to provide additional storage space. With our furniture set  you will have a comfortable space for relaxing conversations with friends and family or reading a book alone and enjoying your morning coffee.</p> <p>    </p> <p>If you are looking for a rocking chair set like this  don't hesitate to buy it!</p> <p>   </p> <ul> <li>Including 1 table with tempered glass top and 2 rocking chairs</li> <li>Sturdy and heavy steel frame ensures large weight capacity</li> <li>High-quality PE wicker can withstand the moderate change in weather</li> <li>Slightly sloping back and seat of the rocking chair offers unexpected comfort</li> <li>Soft and thick cushions will provide a more comfortable sitting experience</li> <li>Tempered glass is fixed by suckers to avoid slipping when in use</li> <li>A lower shelf of the table to provide additional storage space</li> <li>Removable cover with the zipper of cushion for machine-washable conveniently</li> <li>The classical and concise design fits any decoration of the house</li> <li>Perfect for outdoor space like garden  back yard  deck  poolside and so on</li> <li>Easy to install with detailed instruction and convenient to clean</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Sturdy Frame with Exquisite Rattan:</strong> The frame of this 3-piece rocking chair set is made of heavy-duty steel and premium PE wicker which ensures the sturdiness and durability of the whole set. Not only the set can provide a stronger bearing capacity but also it is not easy to deform. The weight capacity of the chair is about 360 lbs.<br /><strong>● Rocking Design for Chairs:</strong> Featuring rocking function  this classical and ergonomic chair will bring a state of rustic and comfortable relaxation for you. And there is a piece of the pad at the bottom of the rocking chair that prevents sliding of the chair and protects the feet.<br /><strong>● Extremely Comfortable Experience:</strong> The rattan of the rocking chair is resilient and comfortable to sit on. Each chair is also equipped with a cushion and pillow. They have good air permeability and are soft which can effectively reduce the pressure on your hips and relieve your fatigue of the day and enjoy leisure time. And the cover of the seat cushion has a zipper for easy cleaning.<br /><strong>● Glass Top Table with Storage Shelf:</strong> There is a thick and solid tempered glass table on the top and is fixed with several suckers. You don't need to worry about moving of top. In addition  the table also features a lower shelf with spacious storage space so that you can store some items.<br /><strong>● Suitable for Various Occasions:</strong> This rocking chair set is perfect for both indoor and outdoor use. You can put it in your bedroom  porch  living room  balcony  garden  and backyard anywhere you want. You can sit on it and bathe in the morning sunshine  listen to music and drink a cup of coffee  or talk freely with friends.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Steel  rattan  sponge  fabric</li> <li>Color of rattan: Be