ion and Removable Cover:</strong> Padded with high-resilience sponge  this table set with good elasticity is very soft to provide you with a comfortable sitting experience. The waterproof cover with zipper can be easily removed  which facilitates your cleaning and maintenance.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble:</strong> This rattan table and chairs set comes with a clear and brief instruction  which has straight forward illustrations and descriptions. Each screw and pin has its own code to let you easily understand the assembly progress  taking you little time and energy.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color of rattan: Black</li> <li>Color of cushion: Beige</li> <li>Material: Metal  hand-woven PE wicker  polyester  sponge</li> <li>Table dimension: 73" x 31.5" x 43" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Stool dimension: 19" x 15.5" x 42.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Size of each cushion: 15.5" x 14.5" x 2" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Table weight capacity: 165 lbs</li> <li>Stool weight capacity: 400 lbs</li> <li>Net weight of each chair: 12.5 lbs</li> <li>Net weight of table: 60.5 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 3(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Dining table</li> <li>6 x Bar stools</li> <li>6 x Seat cushions</li> <li>1 x User guide</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Bar Furniture,,Table dimension:73" x 31.5" x 43" (L x W x H); Stool dimension:19" x 15.5" x 42.5" (L x W x H); Size of each cushion:15.5" x 14.5" x 2" (L x W x H); ,Patio Bar Furniture,,,Black,HW68663B+,shopify,12,0,deny,manual,419.99,459.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW68663B+/7_Pieces_Patio_Rattan_Wicker_Dining_Furniture_Set-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW68663B+/7_Pieces_Patio_Rattan_Wicker_Dining_Furniture_Set-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d2