 stylish design  this pool handrail is suitable for swimming pool with step  sloped entries  spa  water park  etc. It measures 32" long and 22" tall  which is a great addition to pool safety.<br /><strong>● Safe Use:</strong> The pool handrail is equipped with a solid widened base  which is firmly connected to the bent tube for supporting your safe use. And with strong load-bearing force  it helps you to enter or exit the pool easily without worrying about rail's looseness.<br /><strong>●Easy to Assemble:</strong> This pool handrail comes with clear and brief installation instruction  which has straightforward illustrations and descriptions. You can follow the steps in the manual to complete the installation quickly.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Sliver</li> <li>Material: Stainless steel 304</li> <li>Product dimension: 32" x 4" x 22.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 6.5 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Swimming pool handrail</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Swimming Pools,,Product dimension:32" x 4" x 22.5" (L x W x H); ,Swimming Pools,Clearance,,Silver,OP70574,shopify,178,1,deny,manual,49.99,295.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_378_14.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_290_13.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/2/12_152_7.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_374.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_307.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_374.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/