81-quart-capacity-end-loading-insulated-food-pan-carrier,81 Quart Capacity End-loading Insulated Food Pan Carrier-Black,50384261,https://www.costway.com/81-quart-capacity-end-loading-insulated-food-pan-carrier-with-handles.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=14053&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Seamless double shell filled with commercial-grade polyurethane material for optimal insulation.<br />● Environmentally friendly food-grade LLDPE material ensures safe usage.<br />● 270 degrees revolving door with stainless steel shaft to easily load or unload pans.<br />● Maintains temperatures for hot or cold food over 8 hours.<br />● Inlaid sealing ring and nylon latches enhance sealing performances.<br />● 81-quart large capacity accommodates 5 full-sized food pans.<br />● Distinct intervals for placing different sizes of food pans meet varying needs.<br />● Adjustable vent cap balances pressure on outside and inside compartment.<br />● Perfect for canteens  hotel gatherings  fast food restaurants  parties  etc.<br />● User-friendly handles for convenient movement and handling.<br />● Used without electricity to achieve environmental protection.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Excellent insulation with sealing ring:</strong> This insulated food pan carrier features a seamless double walled shell and is filled with commercial-grade polyurethane foam to achieve optimal insulation. Besides  the door with a inlaid sealing ring  which helps maintain the internal food temperature perfectly.<br /><strong>● Large capacity for versatile use:</strong> This food pan carrier with 81 quart large capacity can hold 5 full-size food pans of hot or cold food. And various intervals allow you to place different sizes of food trays as needed. It can store all kinds of hot and cold dishes  which is ideal for canteens  restaurants  large-scale hotels  corporate gatherings  etc.<br /><strong>● High quality guarantee:</strong> The food pan carrier is mainly made of two layers of lldpe material inside and outside  which is sturdy and durable to support your long-term use. What's more  the food-grade material ensure that it is environment-friendly and harmless to humans for safe use. <br /><strong>● Humanized design:</strong> This insulated food pan carrier is equipped with two ergonomic handles for easy carrying anywhere you want. The maximum angle to open the door is 270 degrees  so you can easily unload meal tray and take out the items. And it comes with nylon latches  which won't rust or dent.<br /><strong>● Non-electrical design:</strong> This insulated food pan carrier can keep multiple plates of food for several hours at safe temperature without electricity and the energy consumption is zero. It is a perfect choice to keep food warm or cold while achieving the energy conservation and environmental protection.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: LLDPE  polyurethane  stainless steel  nylon</li> <li>Product dimension: 24" x 16.5" x 25" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Internal dimension: 21" x 13" x 17" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Capacity: 81 quart (77 L)</li> <li>Net weight: 26 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Insulated food pan carrier</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Not included food pans</li> </ul>,Costway,Appliances > Kitchen Appliances > Food Warmers & Burners,,Product dimension:24" x 16.5" x 25" (L x W x H); Internal dimension:21" x 13" x 17" (L x W x H); ,Food Warmers & Burners,,,Black,OP70086,shopify,40,1,deny,manual,209.99,209.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70086/81Q_Capacity_End_loading_Insulated_Food_Pan_Carrier-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70086/81Q_Capacity_End_loading_Insulated_Food_Pan_Carrier-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/