multifunctional-37-electric-keyboard-piano-with-microphone-blue,Multifunctional 37 Electric Keyboard Piano with Microphone-Blue,26980541,https://www.costway.com/multifunctional-37-electric-keyboard-piano-with-microphone.html?piid=9210100&fee=152&fep=14057&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This baby electronic piano is made of ABS material  which is durable and non-toxic without endangering the health of kids.</p> <p> </p> <p>This kids piano keyboard is the best gift to accompany your children! And the music piano features convenient recording and playback functions  allowing your little singer to record his/her own songs and play for the whole family. 37 keys piano with various pleasant sound can stimulate your child's creativity and imagination while exercising the flexibility of their fingers.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for kids piano keyboard  don't hesitate to buy one.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of environmentally friendly ABS material for safe use</li> <li>Play the main melody in sequence by pressing any key after pressing the one key one note</li> <li>External interfaces include MP3  earphone  microphone and charging</li> <li>Designed with 37 keys  8 tone and 4 percussion instruments </li> <li>Record and playback for improving performance</li> <li>Power supply: battery  power bank or charging adapter as you like</li> <li>Required 3 AA batteries(not included)</li> <li>Multifunctional control panel with various rhythms and demo key</li> <li>Comes with a microphone  music score  USB charging cable  MP3 cable  music stand</li> <li>Inspire your child's creativity and intelligence</li> <li>Suitable for the children over 18 months</li> <li>Provide good sound quality by detachable microphone</li> <li>Adjustable volume and song speed for freely playing</li> <li>Exercise child's hearing and memory</li> <li>ASTM certification approved</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Multifunctional Electronic Keyboard:</st