 to Install:</strong> This portable canopy can be easily assembled with detailed instructions and complete accessories. For your safety  do not use the tent outdoor during heavy rain  snow  or strong win</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Cover material: PE</li> <li>Frame material: White powder coated steel (PE Connectors)</li> <li>Net weight: 20 lbs</li> <li>Product size: 10' x 20' x 8.5' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Canopies,,Product size:10' x 20' x 8.5' (L x W x H); ,Canopies,Drop Price,,White,OP70089,shopify,1326,1,deny,manual,94.99,94.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_416_10.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_443_9.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70089_.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70089-2.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_498_20.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_492_31.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_520_43.jpg,7
