age. Besides  the thickened and widened shoulder straps can evenly distribute the pressure on the shoulders  making your exercise more comfortable.<br /><strong>● Extra Storage Pocket:</strong> A mesh bag at the back of the weighted vest can be used to store small items such as cards  keys and mobile phones. This way  you can enjoy your workout without missing an important text or phone call.<br /><strong>● Ideal for Exercise:</strong> The 12-pound vest will help you to increase your workout  burn more calories  build muscles  and get a better workout. It is ideal for all sports enthusiasts and can be used while running  climbing  working out or even walking.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Product weight: 12/20 lbs</li> <li>Material: 2.5 mm neoprene  black iron sand</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Weighted vest</li> </ul>,Costway,Sports > Strength Training > Weights Accessories,,,Weights Accessories,Bestseller,,Black,SP36974,shopify,172,1,deny,manual,39.99,39.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_306_17.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_398_19.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_339_13.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_361_13.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_378_13.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_373_16.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_373_12.jpg,7
