2-pieces-patio-rattan-ottoman-set-with-removable-cushions-beige,2 Pieces Patio Rattan Ottoman Set with Removable Cushions-Beige,87142530,https://www.costway.com/2-pieces-patio-rattan-ottoman-set-with-removable-cushions.html?piid=9229200&fee=152&fep=14207&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Want to buy a 2 piece ottoman that is best in class having all the style  space  comfort and elegance. Try this 2-piece rattan ottoman set  it is made to satisfy your expectations.</p> <p>   </p> <p>Made of PE wicker and sturdy steel  the set has a large weight capacity and is weather resistant for durable use. The ottomans are equipped with soft and high-resilient cushion for a comfortable sitting experience. Besides  each cushion has a rope for fixing it with the ottoman to prevent it from slipping. What’s more  the covers of seat cushion are easy to be taken off and washed if it gets stained or dirty. The ottoman can be used as a single-seat  rearranged  or combined with other furniture set to get the best use of.</p> <p>   </p> <p>So bring your home a beautiful ottoman set and enjoy the quality and comfort.</p> <p>   </p> <ul> <li>Sturdy and solid steel frame ensures sturdiness and durability</li> <li>Premium and hand-woven rattan suitable for outdoor </li> <li>Premium cushions for maximum comfort</li> <li>Water-proof cushion cover is removable and washable </li> <li>Fixed by ropes to prevent the cushion from slipping</li> <li>Four wedged feet enhance stable </li> <li>Elegant yet casual designs perfect for any home decor</li> <li>Multifunctional  it can be used as a seat  footrest or a coffee table</li> <li>Easy to assemble</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Solid Frame & Exquisite Rattan:</strong> Solid powder-coated steel frame and wedge foot ensure overall stability of the ottoman set. Made of high-quality PE rattan  the patio ottoman set is waterproof and fade resistant. More  combine rugged structure with quality material  the ottoman set has large weight capacity.</li> <li><strong>Cozy Cushion w/ Waterproof Cover:</strong> Comes with 2 padded cushions  the ottoman set will provide the ultimate comfort and make you totally relax with soft and high resilience sponge. More  the waterproof polyester cover with smooth zipper is easy to removable and washable when get dirty.</li> <li><strong>Multipurpose Patio Ottoman:</strong> The set of 2 rattan seat set in simple style can be used separately to suit your different needs  such as footrest or footstool. And it can also combine with other patio furniture set to add seat. And the ottoman set is suitable to place at your garden  patio  balcony  poolside or backyard to be a perfect decor.</li> <li><strong>Humanized & Considerate Design:</strong> There are 2 ropes on the cushion to fix the seat cushion on the ottoman that making it difficult to slip off. The ropes runs through the hollowed-out handle. Besides  thanks to the PE rattan and premium steel  the ottoman set with built-in hollow-handle is lightweight and easy to move. </li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble & Maintain:</strong> The 2 pieces ottoman set can be put together easily by following the given instructions. With all required accessories in hand  it won’t take you too much time to assemble by yourself. You just need attach the feet to the ottoman. Besides  the rattan ottomans are easy to clean by wet cloth.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Khaki</li> <li>Material: Steel & Rattan</li> <li>Overall dimension:16" x 16" x 18"(with cushion)</li> <li>Cushion thickness: 2.5"</li> <li>Net weight:15 lbs (set of 2)</li> <li>Weight capacity:375 lbs (single)</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>2 x Ottoman</li> <li>2 x Cushion</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs,,Overall dimension:16" x 16" x 18"(with cushion); ,Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs,Clearance,,B