kids-adjustable-width-height-gymnastics-parallel-bars,Kids Adjustable Width & Height Gymnastics Parallel Bars,41798562,https://www.costway.com/adjustable-kids-double-horizontal-bars-gymnastic-training-parallel-bars.html?piid=9229300&fee=152&fep=14390&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This is the gymnastics parallel bars which may be the best gift for your child.</p> <p> </p> <p>The parallel bars allow your children to get more exercise and develop their coordination skills. It is adjustable in 11 levels from 38" to 55" in height  and the parallel bars are designed to allow a variety of exercises  making it ideal for children aged 6-12. The parallel bars base is welded by triangular bracket a3 steel pipe  which can bear 264 pounds and has a stable structure. And double locks are designed on the parallel bars to ensure the safety of children during training. In addition  it is simple to install and can be easily completed in simple steps.</p> <p> </p> <p>Come and buy this gymnastics parallel bars to give your children a healthy growth life.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Solid A3 steel and thicken tube ensure high durability</li> <li>Welded supports on the bottom keep parallel stable</li> <li>Adjustable height from 38" to 55" adapts to children of different heights</li> <li>The design of parallel bar provides a variety of exercise ways</li> <li>Easy to assemble with 7 steps according to the clear instruction</li> <li>Talcum powder for your better performance of gymnastics</li> <li>A perfect gift for kids to exercise  keep healthy and increase courage</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Double Locking Design:</strong> Helping children grow up healthily and safely is what we have been pursuing. Therefore  the parallel bars are designed with double locks to ensure the safety of children during training. Both the tube and the base have knobs to prevent the parallel bars from loosening during use.</li> <li><strong>Heavy-duty Structure:</strong> The strong structure is welded by triangular support A3 steel pipe  and the 0.06'' thick stainless steel plate gives the bars a great stability. The heavy structure enables the parallel bars to have a bearing capacity of up to 220lbs  ensuring your child has strong support in training.</li> <li><strong>Adjustable Height & Width:</strong> The parallel bars are adjustable from 38" to 55" in 11 levels  which is very suitable for children of different heights and can accompany their growth. In addition  the design of parallel bars is suitable for a variety of exercises to bring more fun to children.</li> <li><strong>Easy Assembly & Disassembly:</strong> The parallel bars are very easy to assemble and disassemble  all the process does not need other auxiliary tools. And there are detailed installation steps in the manual so that you can easily assemble all the parts together.</li> <li><strong>Fantastic Gift for Children:</strong> The gymnastics parallel bar is perfect for 6 to 12-year-old kids  because it can keep them away from their mobile phones. Our gymnastics parallel bars can help develop the temperament of children  exercise their hands and feet coordination ability.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Pink</li> <li>Material: A3 steel & bamboo bar</li> <li>Product size: 99" x 52" x 55" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Inner width: 46.5"</li> <li>Wooden pole diameter: 15"</li> <li>Adjustable height: 38" to 55" with 11 levels</li> <li>Product weight: 106 lbs</li> <li>Age: 6-12 years old</li> <li>Max weight support: 264 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Gymnastics parallel bar</li> <li>1 x Talcum powder</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 2(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Sports > Yoga > Yoga Accessories,,Product size:99" x 52" x 55" (L x W x H); Wooden pole diameter:15"; ,Yoga Accessories,Clearance,,Pink,SP36978FS+,shopify,50,1,deny,manual,279,558,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/2/c2_16_6.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/3/c3_13_6.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/1/c10_12_6.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/9/c9_17_4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/6/c6_16_5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/4/c4_16_6.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/c/1/c1_16_6.jpg,7
2-25hp-folding-treadmill-running-jogging-machine-with-led-touch-display-black,2.25HP Folding Treadmill with Bluetooth Speaker-Black,56089473,https://www.costway.com/2-25hp-folding-treadmill-running-jogging-machine-with-led-touch-display.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=14402&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This is a treadmill which is with a chic shape and a wide running belt to provide you with a cool running experience.</p> <p> </p> <p>You can easily achieve the fitness effects of walking  jogging  and running with the convenient speed adjustment knob. The clear led touch display monitors your movement data in real-time. With a powerful 2.25hp quiet motor  it provides you with a quiet and comfortable sports environment without disturbing others. 5-layer non-slip and shock-absorbing running belt provides effective cushioning for your joints  knees  and ankles. You can connect the treadmill to your phone through wireless device and play music while you are exercising. And you can put your phone  cups  and other items on the multifunctional bracket.</p> <p> </p> <p>This treadmill is your ideal fitness option.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Powerful 2.25hp quiet motor meets your fitness needs without disturbing others</li> <li>Super large led touch display shows speed  time  distance  calories  and heart rate</li> <li>Treadmill looks like a cool and stylish sports car  which is cooler than other treadmills</li> <li>8-stage damping system gives you a comfortable running experience</li> <li>Speaker delivers a fantastic stereo experience by playing music through wireless device and mp3 cable</li> <li>Multi-functional bracket designed to store cups  mobile phones and keys</li> <li>Safety key ensures that the treadmill could be stopped immediately in an emergency</li> <li>5-layer non-slip running belt absorbs impact to protect the knee</li> <li>The treadmill is structurally stable and can withstand a weight of 265 pounds</li> <li>4 built-in transport wheels and folding design make it easy to move and store</li> <li>Easy to assemble  saving you time and effort</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Super Large LED Touch Display:</strong> The LED touch display monitors the distance  speed  time  and calories in real-time during the exercise. Can track the heart rate with a pulse sensor on both armrests. The treadmill has a cool look and stylish racing design allows to enjoy reaching the fitness goal.<br /><strong>● Powerful Silent Motor and 8-stage Damping System:</strong> With its 2.25 HP motor  it is ideal for keeping things quiet while exercising at home or in the office. The 8-stage damping system gives a safe and comfortable running experience.<br /><strong>● Speaker and Multi-functional Bracket:</strong> Designed with built-in speaker and MP3 cable  you can enjoy music while exercising. Its multifunctional bracket can hold the gadgets well and stays in place. It also has an emergency key for safety purposes.<br /><strong>● Non-slip Running Belt and Sturdy Structure:</strong> It's 5-layer non-slip texture running belt absorbs impact and great protection of the knees. High-quality steel pipes and ABS give the treadmill a rugged construction and a load capacity of 265 lbs.<br /><strong>● Foldable Design and Easy to Move:</strong> Its foldable design fits into just any space to make it easier to exercise. With its built-in 4 wheels  this treadmill can be moved around easily and store without any hassle.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: ABS  steel pipe</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 60" x 30.5" x 46.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Folding dimensions: 62.5" x 30.5" x 11" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Running area: 48.5" x 17"</li> <li>Net weight: 106 lbs</li> <li>Weigh capacity: 265 lbs</li> <li>Voltage: Ac 110v 60 Hz</li> <li>Power: 2.25 hp</li> <li>Speed: 1.0-14.0 km/h</li> <li>Screen display: Speed/time/distance/calorie/heart rate/step</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Folding treadmill</li> <li>1 x Multifunctional bracket</li> <li>1 x Safety key</li> <li>1 x Power cord</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Sports > Exercise Machines > Treadmills,,Overall dimensions:60" x 30.5" x 46.5" (L x W x H); Folding dimensions:62.5" x 30.5" x 11" (L x W x H); ,Treadmills,Clearance,,Black,SP37546BK,shopify,2659,1,deny,manual,289.99,523.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/3/s3_13_29.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/5/s5_12_59.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/1/s1_16_11.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/p/sp37546bk_.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_242_41.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/2/s2_14_10.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/6/s6_12_23.jpg,7
