om environmentally friendly PE material  this package has no odor. The waterproof and stain resistant PE material is easy to keep clean. With all corners rounded  the table and chairs set is kid-friendly in case of any minor collisions.</li> <li><strong>Strong Bearing Capacity:</strong> Thanks to the impact resistant HDPE material  the table and chairs set features a sturdy frame separately. Both the table and the chair can hold 176 pounds  allowing kids to play with them freely. Don't worry about it falling apart even if kids abuse it.</li> <li><strong>Lightweight for Moving:</strong> Despite having a solid frame  this kids’ furniture set is lightweight for convenient moving and relocation. With a total weight of 12.5 pounds  kids can work together to move them easily. It ensures the kids can do the assembly themselves.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Grey + Green</li> <li>Material: PP</li> <li>Table dimensions: 27" x 27" x 20"</li> <li>Chair dimensions: 12" x 13" x 20"</li> <li>Product weight: 14.5 lbs</li> <li>Table weight capacity: 66 lbs</li> <li>Chair weight capacity: 33 lbs</li> <li>Package Includes: </li> <li>1 x Kid table & chair set</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Toddler & Kids Furniture > Kids Table & Chair Sets,,Table dimensions:27" x 27" x 20"; Chair dimensions:12" x 13" x 20"; ,Kids Table & Chair Sets,,,Blue,HW56085GN,shopify,253,1,deny,manual,89.99,89.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw56085gn.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_272_126.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_223_149.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_253_160.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/