uper Sturdy Construction:</strong> Well crafted with thick chipboard and powdered -coated metal frame  the 4 tier bookcase is sturdy enough to ensure stability and durability. More  the X-shaped bracket will strengthen the stability and keep balance. Besides  the premium chipboard is water-proof.</li> <li><strong>Stable and Safe Usage:</strong> Equipped with an anti-toppling device  this sturdy storage rack shelf can be fixed to the wall for added security. Even better  adjustable leg pad in the bottom is not only preventing wobbling from uneven floor  but also protect your floor from being scratched.</li> <li><strong>Versatile Industrial Bookshelf:</strong> 4-tier bookcase combines art elements with utility function  create an elegant and stylish look to your room. The bookshelf is so simple and classic that it can be put in any space in your house  such as living room  bedroom  bathroom or balcony.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble:</strong> The storage cabinet is very simple to assemble with a clear instruction. Plus  the individual parts of this practical bookshelf are manageable and numbered so that assembly is quick and easy. More  comes with smooth and flat surface this cabinet is also easy to clean.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Rustic Brown</li> <li>Material: Chipboard and metal</li> <li>Overall dimension: 29" x 12" x 61" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 44 lbs</li> <li>Max. Load capacity: 220 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Bookshelf</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Bookcases,,Overall dimension:29" x 12" x 61" (L x W x H); ,Bookcases,Clearance,,Brown,HW63533,shopify,112,1,deny,manual,54.99,54.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_12__13_51.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_2__