kids-inflatable-bounce-house-castle-with-balls-pool-and-bag,Kids Inflatable Bounce House Castle with Balls Pool and Bag,48130795,https://www.costway.com/kids-inflatable-bounce-house-castle-with-balls-pool-and-bag.html?fee=152&fep=14529&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Designed with abundant accessories for delightful playing time<br>● Immerse little ones in endless coolness when used wet<br>● Children can have a good time playing anytime  anywhere when used dry<br>● Water slide provides thrilling fun that encourages active play<br>● Wide bouncy area allows 2 children to jump and play together safely<br>● Splash pool with colorful balls stimulates sensory exploration and imaginative play<br>● Dense stitching ensures durability and long-lasting use<br>● 4.7" raised handrails offer additional safety for climbing and sliding<br>● Dense protective mesh keeps children visible while preventing falls<br>● Cute Castle design sparks creativity and provides a magical play environment<br>● 420D Oxford cloth is high-strength and wear-resistant for outdoor durability<br>● Connect to a 370W-480W blower (not included) for quick and easy inflation<br>● Assembly needed<br>● Note: Please keep the blower on during use</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Immersive Playful Experience:</strong> The inflatable bounce house features a magical castle design  a water slide  a large splash pool and a wide bouncy area  inviting kids to jump  slide and splash together. Whether used wet as a summer water park or dry for year-round fun  it provides endless hours of active play.<br>● <strong>Effortless & Quick Installation:</strong> With the jumping castle  setup is a breeze by simply unfolding  connecting to a 370W-480W blower (not included)  installing the water hose and securing the bouncer with ground stakes. This all-in-one design allows parents to create a delightful play space almost instantly  indoors or in the backyard.<br>● <strong>Sweet Accessories Included:</strong> Each blow up bouncy playhouse comes with a practical carrying bag  a repair kit  a water hose kit  6 bouncer stakes and 50 colorful balls  enhancing the play experience. These thoughtful additions ensure that kids have multiple ways to enjoy their time while parents appreciate the fully equipped set.<br>● <strong>Child-Friendly & Secure Details:</strong> The backyard party water slide incorporates dense stitching  high-quality 420D Oxford cloth  raised handrails and protective mesh  ensuring a safe and fun experience for kids. Parents can feel at ease knowing their kids are protected during hours of play. Weight limit for inflatable part is 200 lbs.<br>● <strong>Unforgettable Gift of Childhood:</strong> Offering more than just fun  the inflatable bounce house makes an ideally unforgettable gift for birthdays or holidays  fostering social skills  imagination and active living. Creating lasting memories  this playhouse provides a magical adventure that kids will remember and cherish for years to come.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><table> <tbody> <tr> <td>Color</td> <td>Multi-colored</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Material</td> <td>420D Oxford Cloth  Mesh</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Product Dimensions</td> <td>142.5" x 77" x 76" (L x W x H)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Dimensions of Jumping Area</td> <td>58.5" x 56.5" (L x W)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Dimensions of Slide Surface</td> <td>38" x 19" (L x W)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Dimensions of Splash Pool</td> <td>61" x 44.5" (L x W)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Height of Handrail</td> <td>4.7"</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Recommended Age</td> <td>3-12 Years Old </td> </tr> <tr> <td>Weight Limit for Inflatable Part</td> <td>200 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Individual Weight Limit</td> <td>100 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Net Weight</td> <td>22 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Recommended Blower</td> <td>370-480W <span style="text-decoration: underline;">(Not Included)</span></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Box Qty</td> <td>1</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Package Includes</td> <td>1 x