y of water to keep the slides wet.<br /><strong>● Durable Materials and Safety Design: </strong>Made of heavy-duty puncture-resistant 300D oxford  this inflatable waterslide can be used for a long time. Moreover  the climb areas are made of extraordinary 600D oxford. Besides  the top of the slide is surrounded by a net to protect your kids.<br /><strong>● Considerable</strong><strong> and </strong><strong>Practical</strong><strong> Accessory: </strong>The Hippo water bouncer comes with 4 ground stakes for securing the stability and firmness of the entire water park. A pack of repairing accessories used for easy maintenance and a carrying bag provided for easy storage and transportation.<br /><strong>● Quick Inflation and Deflation:</strong> Inflated size: 9.5ft (L) x 12.5ft (D) x 7.5ft (H). This waterslide takes only a few minutes to inflate and it also can be quickly deflated through a long air outlet tube. The whole process does not have to wait for a long time. (Recommended for use with 735 W blower  the blower is not included.)<br /><strong>● Enjoy Water Fun: </strong>An exciting climbing wall and slippery slide for whooshing into the refreshing splashdown pool. This inflatable slide bouncer is ideal for children the age of 3-10 and could turn your backyard into the children's amusement park. Recommend 2-3 kids at a time.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Blue</li> <li>Material: 600D oxford + 300D oxford</li> <li>Overall dimension: 9.5" x 12.5" x 7.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 25 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 200 lbs</li> <li>Recommended age: 3-10 years old</li> <li>Recommend blower: <a href="https://www.costway.com/735-w-1-0-hp-air-blower-pump-fan-for-inflatable-bounce-house.html" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bolder; color: #c82a2e;">735 W Blower</a></li> <li></li> <li>Package included:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Inflatable slide bouncer</li> <li>1 x Carrying bag</li> <li>1 x Repairing pack</li> <li>4 x Bo