nd avoid shaking. In addition  the surface of the kitchen table is smooth for easy cleaning just with a damp cloth.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble:</strong> This dining room table comes with clear and brief instruction  which has straightforward illustrations and descriptions. Each screw and pin has its own code to let you easily understand the assembly progress  taking you little time and energy.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Dark coffee (as picture shows)</li> <li>Material: Engineered wood</li> <li>Product dimension: 63" x 31.5" x 30" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 64.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 200 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Kitchen & Dining > Dining Tables,,Product dimension:63" x 31.5" x 30" (L x W x H); ,Dining Tables,,,Black,KC55456DK,shopify,860,1,deny,manual,119.99,129.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_3__76_102.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_2__71_137.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_11__29_124.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_1__71_114.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_5__60_94.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_7__54_122.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_4__73_99.jpg,7
yard-pong-giant-pong-game-set-with-carry-bag,Yard Pong Giant Pong Game Set with Carry Bag,90217836,https://www.costway.com/yard-pong-giant-pong-game-set-with-carry-bag.html?fee=152&fep=14672&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Comes with 12 ultra-durable buckets made of high-quality PP<br />● With two PVC balls that are wear-resistant and not easy to fluff<br />● Stackable design makes the buckets easy to store and save space<br />● Equipped with a carry bag for easy storage and transportation<br />● Ideal for party  barbecue  camping and other outdoor activities<br />● Suitable for people of all ages and players of different levels<br />● Can be used in outdoor places such as the beach  backyard and swimming pool</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>Perfect for All Ages and Occasions:</strong> This yard pong game set is ideal for activities such as parties  barbecues  camping  etc. The easy to understand gameplay and flexible rules make it suitable for all kinds of people  whether children or adults  beginners or advanced players.<br /><strong>Fun to Play:</strong> Split into two teams and place six buckets on each side arranged in a triangle (your court size can be adjusted depending upon the skill level of the players). The buckets can be filled with sand or water to keep in place without being easily knocked over. Then take turns tossing balls into opponents' buckets to knock them out of play.<br /><strong>Long-lasting and Durable Materials:</strong> Made of high-quality eco-friendly PP  our buckets are thick and not easy to break. Fine workmanship ensures that the surface is smooth  burr-free and easy to clean. Two PVC balls are wear-resistant and not easy to fluff  ensuring long-term durability.<br /><strong>Easy to Store and Carry:</strong> The easy-to-stack design makes these buckets easy to store  which can greatly save space when not in use. The lightweight and a free carry bag make this set easy to carry to the beach  courtyard  park and any other place you want.<br /><strong>A Perfect Gift:</strong> Beer pong has always been a classic game in the US  and this giant pong yard game will take your beer pong skills to a larger playing field! Whether it's a birthday  school party  Christmas or another special day  this set will bring your family or friends together for hours of fun.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: PP + PVC</li> <li>Size of bucket: φ7.5" x 7" (H)</li> <li>Size of ball: φ2.5"</li> <li>Net weight: 5 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>12 x Bucket</li> <li>2 x PVC ball</li> <li>1 x Carry bag</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Outdoor Play > Lawn Games,,Size of bucket:φ7.5" x 7" (H); Size of ball:φ2.5"; ,Lawn Games,Clearance,,,OP70088,shopify,260,1,deny,manual,37.99,37.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/2/12_262_18.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/3/13_74_12.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_567_4.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/y/a/yard_pong_giant_pong_game_set-2.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/11_357_3.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_456_65.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_395_8.jpg,7
