ily assemble it according to the instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Solid Wood Ceiling Fan with Silent Motor: T</strong>he stylish and minimalist design makes it suitable for living rooms  bedrooms  dining rooms and kitchens. The powerful motor can provide large-area air circulation. And it won’t make any bothering noise when you use it  so you don't have to worry about yourself and others being disturbed.</li> <li><strong>Reverse Ceiling Fan for All Seasons:</strong> In summers  the ceiling fan brings you cool air to greatly reduce the indoor temperature. You can rotate it in the opposite direction to greatly promote indoor air circulation in winter. And it can also be used as a decoration to enhance the beauty of your home.</li> <li><strong>Manipulated by the Remote Control:</strong> The ceiling fan is equipped with a remote control for your convenience. There are 5 speeds that can be adjusted to meet your different needs and maintain the ideal comfort level. And it has timing function  so you can set 3 different times (1 hour / 4 hours / 8 hours) as needed.</li> <li><strong>Premium Materials & Safe Design:</strong> The 52'' ceiling fan is composed of 3 solid wood blades and iron frame. The fan blades with clear texture are moisture resistant and durable. The sturdy iron frame ensures that the ceiling fan is stable and not easy to shake. And it is safer to use with UL certification.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Install:</strong> You are able to finish the assembly within a few minutes by reading and following the instruction manual we send you carefully. The 2 downrods allow you to select the height of the fan to be installed as required. And you can conveniently take it off for storage.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brushed nickel  burlywood</li> <li>Material: Iron  tung wood</li> <li>Overall dimension: 52"φ x 12.5"/17.5"h</li> <li>Each blade dimension: 26" x 6.5"</li> <li>Downrods: 5"/10"</li> <li>Net 