  this office chair promotes air circulation  which can effectively prevent heat and humidity from accumulating near the human body and keeps your back and legs cool and sweat-free even in hot summer.<br /><strong>● Multi-Functional Mechanism:</strong> Considering different table heights and personal habits  we use the high-quality gas cylinder to adjust the seat height to help you find the most comfortable position. And the locking mechanism allows you to relax from heavy work  pull out the handle to start rocking   and push it in to stop.<br /><strong>● 360 Degree Swivel and Free Sliding:</strong> 5 universal wheels are silent and wear-resistant  which can also effectively prevent scratching the floor. The great flexibility enables it to move smoothly and quickly in all directions  ensuring multi-tasking convenience.<br /><strong>● Suitable for Various Occasions:</strong> The mesh office chair has a simple and generous shape  which can complement various decoration styles. Comfortable sitting experience and great convenience make it suitable for office  conference room  study   and many other places.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Mesh  PP  PU  steel  sponge</li> <li>Overall dimension: 25.5" (L) x 28" (W) x 45.5" - 49.5" (H)</li> <li>Back size: 20" (L) x 22" (H)</li> <li>Seat size: 19.5" (L) x 21" (W)</li> <li>Net weight: 27lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 265 lbs</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Massage mesh office chair</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Office Chairs > Ergonomic Chairs,,Overall dimension:25.5" (L) x 28" (W) x 45.5" - 49.5" (H); Back size:20" (L) x 22" (H); Seat size:19.5" (L) x 21" (W); ,Ergonomic Chairs,,,Black,HW66652,shopify,260,1,deny,manual,79.99,89.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_328_59.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.co