rocking-chair-upholstered-armchair-with-lumbar-support-beige,Upholstered Rocking Chair with and Solid Wood Base-Beige,89230176,https://www.costway.com/upholstered-rocking-chair-with-fabric-padded-seat-and-solid-wood-base.html?piid=9229200&fee=152&fep=14791&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Arc rocking base for gentle rocking motions<br />● Solid rubber wood frame for excellent sturdiness and long-term use<br />● Supports up to 350 lbs<br />● Widened back to relax your back and spine<br />● High-quality polyester fabric and sponge for a skin-friendly touch and maximum comfort<br />● Ergonomic armrests to place your hands and arms<br />● Detachable seat cushion cover can be cleaned by the washing machine<br />● Perfect for living rooms  bedrooms  nurseries  offices  lounges  etc<br />● Assembly required</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Safe and Gentle Rocking Function:</strong> Featuring curved rocking legs and adjustable foot pads  the rocking chair ensures gentle and smooth motion within 20 degrees. It can rock you into a state of relaxation and is an ideal napping spot for you and your guests. <br /><strong>● Superior Rubber Wood Frame:</strong> Solid rubber wood as its base frame  the nursery rocking chair bears a high load-bearing capacity of 350 lbs. The natural rubber wood frame is also enduring  anti-crack  and wear-resistant  providing a long-lasting lifespan.<br /><strong>● Removable Padded Seat Cushion:</strong> The 6.5" thick seat cushion is designed with the quality polyester fabric cover and elastic sponge for soft and comfortable support. When not in use  the seat cushion can be detached. Plus  the zippered seat cushion cover is removable and machine-washable for effortless cleaning. <br /><strong>● Wide Backrest and Ergonomic Armrests:</strong> 27" widened backrest enables you to comfortably lean on the back. Additionally  the cozy and supportive armrests allow you to rest your hands or arms  taking its s