igh-density and soft sponges  this chair provides you a comfortable and soft sitting experience.</li> <li><strong>Thickly Padded Seat Cushion:</strong> Designed with 3" thick cushion and high density sponge inside  the whole recreational rocking chair is soft enough for you to enjoy yourself and relax your body after tired work. Its fabric slipcover is wear-resistant and skin-friendly.</li> <li><strong>Comfortable Rocking Experience:</strong> Equipped with two loop rocker feet that connected with one horizontal wooden bar  this rocking chair will give you comfortable and safety sitting experience. There are four protective pads at the base bottom to prevent floor from being scratched while chair is rocking.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Gray</li> <li>Material: Wood + sponge</li> <li>Overall dimension: 26.5" x 34" x 33.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 39 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 256 lbs</li> <li>Package include: </li> <li>1 x Massage rocking chair</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > Chairs > Accent Chairs,,Overall dimension:26.5" x 34" x 33.5" (L x W x H); ,Accent Chairs,Clearance,,Gray,HW67036GR,shopify,3,1,deny,manual,79.99,79.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/2/_2_90_96.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/1/_1_80_70.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/i/file_191_23.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/3/_3_41_10.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/i/file_190_38.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/3/_3_39_57