 fade-resistant  which ensures that this furniture can service you long time.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Cozy and Humanized Design:</strong> Comes with thick padded cushions  this 4pcs patio will provide you an extraordinary comfort experience. With a smooth zipper  the cover of the cushion is removable and washable. Designed for ultra comfy  this patio furniture set has an ergonomic design of wide armrests and curved backrest.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Functional Coffee Table:</strong> The strong detachable tempered glass on top of the coffee table adsorbs four suckers for added safety. More  extra crossbar support under the table top ensures overall stability and durability. The large rectangular rattan coffee table is an ideal place to keep drinks  foods and some decorations.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Free Combination Sofa Set:</strong> This 4 piece rattan patio furniture set includes two single sofas  one loveseat and one coffee table that can accommodate 4-5 persons with ease and comfort. Even better  with lightweight and separate design  we can alter or change the positions or directions according to our needs and requirements.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Dimension of the Patio Set:</strong> The single sofa dimension is 23.5" x25" x31" (L x W x H)  size of double sofa: 43.5" x 25" x 31" (L x W x H) and size of coffee table: 35" x 18" x 17.5" (L x W x H). Benefit from quality materials and sturdy construction  the weight capacity of coffee table is 165 lbs  the weight capacity of single sofa is 400 lbs and the weight capacity of bench is 800 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: PE rattan  polyester fiber  steel  sponge</li> <li>Single sofa dimension: 23.5" x 25" x 31" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Loveseat dimension: 43.5" x 25" x 31" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Coffee table dimension: 35" x 18" x 17.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 70 lbs</li> <li>Loveseat capacity: 792 lbs</li> <li>Single chair capacity: 400 lbs</li> <li>Coffee table capacity: 800 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Loveseat</li> <li>2 x Single chairs</li> <li>1 x Coffee table</li> <li>3 x Cushions</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Single sofa dimension:23.5" x 25" x 31" (L x W x H); Loveseat dimension:43.5" x 25" x 31" (L x W x H); Coffee table dimension:35" x 18" x 17.5" (L x W x H); ,Patio Conversation Sets,Clearance,,White,HW63238WH,shopify,2350,1,deny,manual,179.99,209.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_560_34.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_590_34.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_685_21.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_458_43.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_640_38.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_517_34.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_643_21.jpg,7
