ve Cover:</strong> To prolong the lifespan of the umbrella stand  a removable dust-proof cover is included in the package. Made of premium polyester fabric  it is waterproof  snow-resistant and dust-proof  which will protect the fillable umbrella base from outdoor weather.<br /><strong>● Hassle-free Assembly:</strong> With simple assembly steps  the umbrella stand can be put together in short time. You just need to install the X-shaped frame and supporting pole first  and then install the 4 side panels. After that  you can finish the installation of the umbrella base by filling the 2 sandbags and attaching to the dust-proof cover.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Metal</li> <li>Overall Dimension: 29" x 29" x 16" (L X W X H)</li> <li>Sandbag Capacity: 200 lbs</li> <li>Net Weight: 11 lbs</li> <li> </li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Square Umbrella Base</li> <li>1 x Dust-proof Cover</li> <li>2 x Sandbag</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul> ,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Outdoor Umbrella Bases,,Overall Dimension:29" x 29" x 16" (L X W X H); ,Outdoor Umbrella Bases,,,Black,NP10821,shopify,1065,1,deny,manual,42.99,76.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/n/NP10821/Fillable_Umbrella_Base_with_2_Sandbags_and_Dust-proof_Cover-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/n/NP10821/Fillable_Umbrella_Base_with_2_Sandbags_and_Dust-proof_Cover-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/n/NP10821/Fillable_Umbrella_Base_with_2_Sandbags_and_Dust-proof_Cover-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/n/NP10821/Fillable_Umbrella_Base_with_2_Sandbags_and_Dust-proof_Cover_Size-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog