te decoration.<br /><strong>● Practical Glass Coffee Table:</strong> Our coffee table is made of a sturdy frame and tempered glass tabletop. The strong tempered glass is attached to 4 suckers for added safety and high loading capacity. The large rectangular rattan coffee table is an ideal place to keep drinks  food  and some decorations  which can add luster to this rattan furniture set.<br /><strong>● Easy to Clean and Move:</strong> This patio furniture set requires less maintenance because of the high-quality materials. Equipped with a smooth zipper  the cover can be easily removed for cleaning. Made of lightweight rattan  this rattan set can be easily moved anywhere you want.<br /><strong>● Dimension of 4 Piece Patio Wicker Set:</strong> Size of single sofa: 23" x 25" x 31"  size of loveseat: 43.5" x 25" x 31"  size of coffee table: 34.5"x 18" x 17.5". Max load of single sofa: 350 lbs  max load of loveseat: 700 lbs  max load of coffee table: 110 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color of rattan: Black</li> <li>Material: PE  tempered glass  sponge  steel</li> <li>Size of loveseat: 43.5" x 25" x 31"  (L x W x H)</li> <li>Size of single sofa: 23" x 25" x 31" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Size of coffee table: 34.5"x 18"x 17.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity of single sofa: 350 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of loveseat: 705 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 110 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>2 x Single sofa</li> <li>1 x Loveseat</li> <li>1 x Coffee table</li> <li>3 x Seat cushion</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Size of loveseat:43.5" x 25" x 31"  (L x W x H); Size of single sofa:23" x 25" x 31" (L x W x H); Size of coffee table:34.5"x 18"x 17.5" (L x W x H); ,Patio Conversation Sets,,,White,HW63239WH,shopify,1268,1,deny,manual,224.99,224.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/5