3-in-1-convertible-wooden-high-chair-with-cushion-gray,3-in-1 Convertible Wooden High Chair with Cushion-Gray,02951647,https://www.costway.com/3-in-1-convertible-wooden-high-chair-with-cushion.html?piid=9224700&fee=152&fep=14858&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This is the baby high chair which is a combination of the aesthetic inspiration of children's furniture design and the ergonomic concept of baby's growth.</p> <p> </p> <p>With a detachable and adjustable large tray  it can give your baby a good place to eat  play  learn and rest. The 3 in 1 versatile design allows high chair to be switched to three different shapes to meet the baby's needs at different ages. Moreover  made of safe and durable materials  the quality of the chair is reliable. The five-point seat belt also can effectively prevent your baby from falling out of the chair due to climbing.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for such a high chair  this will be your best choice!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of food-grade PP and pe  non-toxic and odorless</li> <li>Meet different growth needs with 3 in 1 convertible design</li> <li>With adjustable and detachable tray for easy cleaning</li> <li>Keep baby safe in place with 5-point harness</li> <li>With a pu safety baffle and a free astm-tested wooden baffle for extra security</li> <li>Removable pu cushion  soft and comfortable</li> <li>Solid beech and stable structure ensure excellent load bearing</li> <li>Legs with foot-pads effectively prevent skidding and avoid scratching the floor</li> <li>Rounded corners effectively prevent your baby from being injured</li> <li>Easy to assemble with detailed instruction and all hardware delivered</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>3-in-1 Convertible High Chair:</strong> By simply adjusting the legs and tray  this modern high chair can be converted into a baby feeding chair  a toddler seat with guardrail or an ordinary stool chair to meet the different growth needs of children from six months to six years old.</li> <li><strong>3-stage Adjustable & Detachable Tray:</strong> The removable tray makes cleaning a breeze. What you need to do is simply unlatch the convenient plate and move it to the sink for a thorough rinse. And three adjustable positions can provide more space for fast-growing children.</li> <li><strong>Safe & Durable Materials:</strong> Made of food-grade PP and PE  this high chair is non-toxic and odorless. The legs are made of high-quality beech wood  which is sturdy and durable with good pressure resistance. Soft PU cushion and baffle provide a comfortable sitting experience for baby.</li> <li><strong>Stable & Sturdy Structure:</strong> A-shaped structure effectively reduces the center of gravity and the bottom is designed with X-shaped steel frame for reinforcement  which makes the high chair stable and not easy to overturn. In addition  the anti-skid foot pads can enhance the overall stability while preventing scratching the floor.</li> <li><strong>5-point Safety Harness:</strong> The five-point safety belt with adjustable length can keep baby securely in place without leaning forward and falling down  preventing them from being injured when left unattended. In addition  this chair is also equipped with an ASTM-tested wooden baffle for replacement  which provides added security.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Gray</li> <li>Material: Beech wooden legs + PP tray + PE seat + PU cushion</li> <li>High chair size: 20.5" x 21.5" x 36" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Short feeding chair size: 17.5" x 17.5" x 26" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Tray size: 15" x 8.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Net weight: 10.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 35 lbs</li> <li>Applicable age: 6 months - 3 years old</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Baby high chair</li> <li>1 x Wooden baffle</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Nursery Furniture > High Chairs,,High chair size:20.5