erall stability of the game table  while not scratching the floor.</li> <li><strong>Restore Real Game Scene:</strong> Comes with 2 balls and 22 players  our foosball table simulates the real football field to provide exciting game experience. And the scorers on both sides can help you record your game scores at any time.</li> <li><strong>Ergonomic Handles & Smooth Playing Surface:</strong> The rod bars have comfortable anti-skid grips which are ergonomically designed to better control the balls. The large and smooth playing field ensures smoother ball rolling  allowing the game to be played at a fast pace.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble:</strong> With detailed assembly instruction and all hardware delivered  it is easy to set up your foosball table with a finished size of 48" x 24" x 31" (L x W x H). It’s suitable for a variety of occasions such as game room  office or club.</li> <li><strong>Suitable for All Ages:</strong> The classic table football game can fully exercise the players' thinking ability and hand-eye coordination ability. And the easy to understand gameplay and flexible rules make it suitable for all kinds of people  whether kids or adults  beginners or advanced players.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: MDF  steel  PP</li> <li>Color: As the picture shows</li> <li>Overall dimension: 48" x 24" x 31" (L x W xH)</li> <li>Net weight: 26.5 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Foosball table (assembly is required)</li> <li>8 x Steel rods</li> <li>22 x Players</li> <li>2 x Footballs</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Game Room,,Overall dimension:48" x 24" x 31" (L x W xH); ,Game Room,,,Brown,SP36989GR,shopify,67,1,deny,manual,92.99,118.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/p/sp36989gr-3.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d2