portable-travel-toilet-with-paper-holder-for-indoor-outdoor,5L Portable Travel Toilet with Paper Holder for Outdoor,51074283,https://www.costway.com/portable-travel-toilet-with-paper-holder-for-indoor-outdoor.html?fee=152&fep=14881&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This compact portable toilet is ideal for use in camping  hiking  boating  and road trips.</p> <p> </p> <p>The compact portable toilet does not take up too much space and is designed for outdoor activities. You can use it for camping  hiking  boating and road trips  giving you great convenience and comfort. Made of high-quality PP material  it is smooth and burr-free  more caring for your skin. The removable inner bucket can be used with a trash bag  so you don't need to clean. The double-lid design can effectively block off odors and keep the air fresh. The removable paper holder is designed to place paper towels on it. Not only can it be used as a toilet  but it can also be used as a trash can or seat to make your journey more convenient. The handle design and light weight make it easier to move and carry.</p> <p> </p> <p>So don't miss the oppurtunity to buy one  it will never disappoint you!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Compact toilet can be used indoors and outdoors without taking up much space</li> <li>You can use the removable inner bucket directly or put a garbage bag on it</li> <li>The inner and outer lids can effectively prevent odor leakage</li> <li>Detachable toilet paper holder allows you to hang toilet paper on either side</li> <li>Made of high quality PP material with smooth edges and no burrs</li> <li>Maximum load is 440 lbs  supporting your long-term use</li> <li>With the right height and ergonomic design  it can be used as a stool</li> <li>Hidden handles and light weight make your carrying easier</li> <li>The portable toilet provides all the comforts of a real home toilet</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Make the Journey Worry-free:</strong> This compact toilet can be used indoors and outdoors without taking up much space. It’s perfect for camping  hiking  boating and road trips and can provide all the comforts of a real home toilet. It can meet your emergency needs and let you enjoy nature with peace of mind.<br /><strong>● Easy to Clean and Prevent Odor:</strong> The toilet comes with a removable inner bucket so you can use it with trash bags for no cleaning. The inner bucket has a firm handle for easy carrying and cleaning. The inner and outer lids can effectively seal off-odors and keep the air fresh.<br /><strong>● Detachable Toilet Paper Holder:</strong> There is a paper holder on one side of the toilet  allowing you to put paper towels on it for convenience. The detachable design allows the paper towel to be hung on either side according to your usage habits. It can bring great convenience to your trip.<br /><strong>● High-quality Materials and Stable Structure:</strong> Made from premium PP materials  the portable toilet is smooth  burr-free  comfortable and skin-friendly. The sturdy structure makes it have a strong bearing capacity and good stability without slipping. The right height is ergonomically designed to provide maximum comfort  so it can also be used as a stool.<br /><strong>● Humanized Design:</strong> The lightweight and hidden handles on both sides of the toilet make the toilet easy to move and carry. The large-capacity inner bucket allows you to use it multiple times without having to empty it frequently. Thoughtful design can meet your outing needs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Gray</li> <li>Material: PP</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 16" x 19.5" x 13.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Inner bucket dimensions: 11.5" x 13.5" x 7.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 4.5 lbs</li> <li>Bearing capacity: 440 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Portable toilet</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Camping > Portable Toilets & Showers,,Overall 