 measures 8 ft x 2.5 ft x 4.5 ft (L x W x H)  and it weighs 50.5 lbs. The carrier stand is easy to assemble.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Main material: Steel</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 8 ft x 2.5 ft x 4.5 ft (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 50.5 lbs</li> <li>Maximum bearing capacity: 175 lbs</li> <li>Kayak capacity: 2</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Freestanding kayak rack</li> <li>1 x User manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Sports > Water Sports > Surfing,,Overall dimensions:8 ft x 2.5 ft x 4.5 ft (L x W x H); ,Surfing,Clearance,,Black,TL35157,shopify,8,1,deny,manual,115.99,161.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_2__71_245.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_202_107.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_12__13_81.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_10__35_76.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_7__55_104.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_1__72_104.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_9__44_83.jpg,7
