uction:</strong> Made of premium engineered wood  this rolling desk cart is sturdy and durable to support your long-term use. And the curved edge design is safe to protect you from being cut when in use. In addition  the smooth surface is easy to clean with a damp cloth.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble:</strong> This mobile laptop stand comes with a clear and brief instruction  which has straight forward illustrations and descriptions. Each screw and pin has its own code to let you easily understand the assembly progress  taking you little time and energy.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Iron + Engineered Wood</li> <li>Product dimension: 21.5" x 15.5" x 26"-43.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Desktop tilt angle: 0-180° (Recommend 45°)</li> <li>Net weight: 26.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 33 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Laptop cart</li> <li>1 x User's manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Laptop Tables & Printer Stands,,Product dimension:21.5" x 15.5" x 26"-43.5" (L x W x H); ,Laptop Tables & Printer Stands,,,Black,CB10517BK,shopify,327,1,deny,manual,64.99,112.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/i/Sit_to_Stand_Laptop__1781762973108489_198724.jpeg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/i/Sit_to_Stand_Laptop__1781762972279056_630269.jpeg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/i/Sit_to_Stand_Laptop__1781762967635104_435017.jpeg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/i/Sit_to_Stand_Laptop__1781762966895657_599607.jpeg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/i/Sit_to_Stand_Laptop__1781762973840170_996767.jpeg,5,https://asse