Fabric Avoids Sultry:</strong> The fabric is light and breathable. You will never feel sultry even in the midst of summer  which makes a perfect addition for outdoor places like the patio  backyard and so on. The soft seat and strong-elasticity drawstring will relieve whole-body fatigue after work.<br /><strong>● Lockable and Ergonomic Tilt System:</strong> Designed with an ergonomic armrest  footrest and reclining backrest  the backyard chair guarantees the most comfortable sitting feeling. There is a ring-pull knob for you to lock the position. And the equipped headrest pillow is detachable and adjustable so that you can use it to support both neck and waist.<br /><strong>● Practical and Durable Storage Cup Holder:</strong> There is a large plastic accessory cup holder that can be installed on both sides according to your habits. The holes are designed in different shapes to place drinks  cups  tablets  magazines  mobile phones and other small necessities. Raised edge will effectively prevent falling and damage.<br /><strong>● Easy to Store with Foldable Design:</strong> This chaise lounge can be folded to a compact size of 39.5" x 28" x 7" for easy transportation and storage. Compact dimension and lightweight provides a big convenience for you to store in narrow space when not in use or put in the trunk when going to the seaside enjoy the sunshine.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Beige</li> <li>Material: Steel  fabric</li> <li>Expansion dimension: (37.5 - 73.5") x 27.5" x (34" - 47.5") (L x W x H)</li> <li>Folding dimension: 39.5" x 28" x 7" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Cup-holder dimension: 15.5" x 9.5" x 2.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Pillow width: 17.5"</li> <li>Weight capacity: 500 lbs</li> <li>Net weight: 20.5 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes</li> <li>1 x Zero gravity chair</li> <li>1 x Cup-holder</li> <li>1 x Headrest pillow</li> <li>1 x User guide</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seat