3-pieces-outdoor-rattan-patio-conversation-set-with-seat-cushions-white,3 Pieces Outdoor Rattan Patio Conversation Set with Seat Cushions-White,83926715,https://www.costway.com/3-pieces-outdoor-rattan-patio-conversation-set-with-seat-cushions.html?piid=9220100&fee=152&fep=15066&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This rattan patio conversation set which will provide you a comfortable experience in your leisure time.</p> <p> </p> <p>This set of outdoor furniture is made of high-quality rattan and strong steel  which is durable and has a long service life. The thick soft cushions are comfortable and breathable  which can relieve your fatigue of the whole day. Removable seat covers and tempered glass table tops are easy to clean. Modern and stylish lines make this furniture set a perfect embellishment for backyard  patio  balcony or any other outdoor space! If you are looking for such a rattan bistro set  this will be your ideal choice!</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking an rattan patio conversation set like this  do not hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of high quality PE rattan with strong toughness  not easy to break</li> <li>Sturdy metal frame structure with superior load-bearing performance</li> <li>High quality sponge filled cushions  soft and comfortable</li> <li>Thick tempered glass table top is sturdy and easy to clean</li> <li>With plastic foot pads  anti-skid and wear-resistant</li> <li>Cushion cover with zip for easy removal and washing</li> <li>Ideal for balcony  backyard  pool side or other outdoor places</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Ergonomic Comfortable Design:</strong> Wide armrests are moderate in height to rest your arms. Thick cushions are filled with high-density sponge  which is resilient and not prone to collapse even after sitting for a long time. By reducing the pressure on your hips  waist  and back  this conversation can relieve your fatigue throughout the day.<br />● <strong>Excellent Durability and Stability:</strong> Constructed of steel frame and wrapped with PE wicker  this patio furniture set is not easy to deform with strong toughness and superior load-bearing performance. Both table and chairs are equipped with anti-skid foot pads to protect your floor while enhancing overall stability.<br /><strong>● Coffee Table with Glass Top: </strong>This bistro set features an elegant coffee table that is perfect for drinks  fruits  newspapers  and other items. The thick tempered glass top is firmly fixed by four suckers to avoid easy moving or falling.<br /><strong>● Clean and Assemble: </strong>All you have to do is to put all the parts together by following the detailed assembly instructions. The cushion covers with zippers are easy to remove and clean. You can easily wipe the tempered glass tabletop with just a damp cloth when there are stains on it.<br />● <strong>Size Information:</strong> Dimension of chair: 23" x 23" x 27.5" (L x W x H)  coffee table: 16" x 16" x 17" (L x W x H)  weight capacity of chair: 350 lbs  weight capacity of coffee table: 220 lbs. This 3pcs set is ideal for your patio  front porch  poolside  yard or any other outdoor spaces.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color of cushion: As shown in the figure</li> <li>Materials: PE Rattan  polyester fiber  steel  sponge</li> <li>Color of rattan: Black</li> <li>Net weight: 37.5 lbs</li> <li>Size of chair: 23" x 23" x 27.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Size of table: 16" x 16" x 17" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Maximum load bearing of chair: 350 lbs</li> <li>Maximum load bearing of table: 220 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Coffee table</li> <li>2 x Wicker chairs</li> <li>2 x Seat cushion</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Size of chair:23" x 23" x 27.5" (L x W x H); Size of table:16" x 16" x 17" (L x W x H); ,Patio Conversation Sets,Clearance,,White,HW63218WH,shopify,22,1,deny,manual,129.99,129.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_257_88.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_262_88.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_226_78.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_242_51.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/2/12_60_56.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_277_8.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_253_59.jpg,7
