twin-size-14-inch-wooden-slats-bed-mattress-frame-brown,Twin Size 14 Inch Wooden Slats Bed Mattress Frame-Brown,79104863,https://www.costway.com/14-inch-twin-size-rubber-wood-platform-bed-frame-with-wood-slat-support.html?piid=9225200&fee=152&fep=15072&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This is an elaborate twin-size wooden bed frame made of solid rubberwood and poplar wood. The bed frame is stable and sturdy  which gives you long years of comfort.</p> <p> </p> <p>With 6 solid legs on both bedsides  the bed frame has a high weight capacity of 250 lbs to firmly support your mattress. the bed frame has a modern and concise design which can go well with the decoration of your rooms or hotels. The 10.5-inch under-bed space is good for ventilation which extending the life of the mattress. At the same time  sufficient space also can be convenient for you to store unused boxes. Combining with reliable quality and premium craftsmanship  The bed frame with a proper mattress can provide you with excellent comfort while sleeping.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for a wooden bed that provides you stylish and strong support for your mattress  why not take it home right now?</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>100% solid wood for stability and long lifespan</li> <li>6 sturdy legs for spreading the pressure evenly</li> <li>10.5" Large under-bed storage space to manage your idle things</li> <li>Suitable for one adult to sleep comfortably and sags</li> <li>14 poplar wood slats enhance the lifetime of the mattress</li> <li>No need box spring for saving money</li> <li>All the accessories are secured and noise-free</li> <li>Modern and concise design is suitable for matching the decoration for any room</li> <li>Easy to clean and maintain with a duster cloth</li> <li>Easy to assemble</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Solid Wood Bed Frame:</strong> This premium bed consists of a 100% solid rubberwood frame and a poplar support slat  which reinforces reliability and durability. With 6 legs on both sides of the bed  the weight and pressure of the whole bed frame can be extended evenly to each leg.<br />●<strong> Large Storage and No Box Spring:</strong> Provided with 10.5" height under-bed storage space  this twin-size bed frame can hold shoe boxes and other idle items in it to make a tidier environment. This bed frame can fit well with a memory foam mattress and standard mattress.<br />●<strong> Restful Sleep Experience:</strong> The twin-size bed is ideal for one person to sleep easily and sags. Screws securely attach all parts of the bed frame to improve stability. This bed frame doesn't make any noise and doesn't sway as you turn over.<br />● <strong>Concise Design:</strong> Combined with high quality and timeless design  this wooden bed has a superb look that suits every room theme.<br />●<strong> Easy Assembly:</strong> This wooden platform bed does not need to be assembled in a complicated way. With clear instructions and complete accessories  installation is fast and easy.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown/natural finish</li> <li>Material: Rubberwood + poplar wood</li> <li>Weight: 50 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 250 lbs</li> <li>Product size: 74.5" x 38" x 14" (L x W x H) (Twin Size)</li> <li>Suitable mattress size: 39" x 75" (Twin size  mat not included)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Twin size bed frame</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Bedroom > Beds & Bed Frames > Simple Bed Frame,,Product size:74.5" x 38" x 14" (L x W x H) (Twin Size); Suitable mattress size:39" x 75" (Twin size mat not included); ,Simple Bed Frame,Clearance,,Brown,HW63258BN,shopify,109,1,deny,manual,129.99,198,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/d/4/d4_23_5.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136