nd the other 6 support legs in the side ensure the stableness. In addition  14 thickened bed boards are on the top which can arrange the weight of mattress evenly.</li> <li><strong>Stylish Design with Premium Accessories:</strong> Designed in a modern and concise style  this wooden bed will match really well with the rest of your furniture or decors. And equipped with antirust and strong accessories  the parts of our bed are tightly connected with each other. It won’t make noise when you turn over on the bed.</li> <li><strong>Multipurpose for Different Scenes:</strong> Most children and adults can use our classical wooden bed. Designed in a suitable size  not only the bed can be placed in your bedroom but also for some other places like the apartment  hotels and so on. Our wooden bed will meet your different needs perfectly.</li> <li><strong>Provide Additional Storage Space:</strong> Under the wooden bed  there is plenty of room for you to store some things like storage boxes  suitcases  and luggage and it is easy to take them out. The height between the floor and the board of bed is about 10.5 inches. Your room will be clean and neat after you put them under your bed.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble:</strong> All the necessary accessories and the detailed installation instructions are packaged well in the parcel. Therefore  it is even not difficult to install our wooden bed by yourself in a short time according to the instructions step by following steps.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown/Natural Finish</li> <li>Material: Rubberwood  poplar wood</li> <li>Net weight: 66 lbs</li> <li>Product dimensions: 80" x 60" x 14" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Number of bed board: 14 Bars</li> <li>Applicable mat size: 80" x 60" (L x W) (Mat Not Include)</li> <li>Weight capacity of bed: 600 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Queen size wood bed</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Bedroom > 