compatible with any E12 bulb  and UL Certification guarantees your safety. Strong and stable frame structure ensures long service life.<br />● <strong>Suitable for Various Occasions:</strong> The glamorous industrial design of this drop light allows it to decorate any room and perfectly match your furniture. And it can be widely used in residential or commercial lighting  such as bedrooms  living rooms  corridors  restaurants  cafes  etc.<br />● <strong>Easy to Install and Clean:</strong> This ceiling lamp is equipped with all installation hardware  which enables you to obtain perfect lighting experience through simple installation. In addition  it is also very easy to clean and can be wiped with soft cloth to obtain a brand-new lamp.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material:  Iron</li> <li>Product size: 55" x 20" x 20" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 4.5 lbs</li> <li>Rated voltage: 120V / 60Hz</li> <li>The light bulb: 5 x E12 (not included)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li>1 x Folding chandelier</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Decor > Lighting > Ceiling Lights,,Product size:55" x 20" x 20" (L x W x H); ,Ceiling Lights,Clearance,,Black,EP24480US,shopify,159,1,deny,manual,35.99,35.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_1__73_79.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_2__72_77.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/3/13_27_58.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_11__30_88.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_7__56_63.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/