ong> The chair set includes 4 dining chairs. The arm less design makes it easy to pair with the dining table that fits well in the small apartment. An ideal dining set for your kitchen and dining room. Overall dimension: 20" x 15.5" x 35.5" (L x W x H)<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble and Maintain:</strong> A clear and brief instruction is included  which has straight forward illustrations and descriptions. It helps complete your installation quickly  saving your time. In addition  the surface is smooth and glossy  which is very convenient to clean with a damp cloth.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black base and walnut seat</li> <li>Material: Rubber wood and MDF</li> <li>Overall dimension: 20" x 15.5" x 35.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Seat height: 17.5"</li> <li>Net weight: 11 lbs per chair</li> <li>Weight capacity: 275 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>4 x Dining chairs</li> <li>1 x User manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Kitchen & Dining > Dining Chairs,,Overall dimension:20" x 15.5" x 35.5" (L x W x H); ,Dining Chairs,Drop Price,,Black,KC53338,shopify,228,1,deny,manual,229.99,229.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/set_of_4_dining_chair_spindle_back_wooden_legs-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/set_of_4_dining_chair_spindle_back_wooden_legs-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/set_of_4_dining_chair_spindle_back_wooden_legs-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/set_of_4_dining_chair_spindle_back_wooden_legs_size-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/set_of_4_dining_chair_spindle_back_wooden_legs-7.jpg,5,https://ass