super-lightweight-bodyboard-surfing-with-leash-eps-core-boarding-l,Super Lightweight Bodyboard Surfing with Leash EPS Core Boarding-L,05367492,https://www.costway.com/super-lightweight-bodyboard-surfing-with-leash-eps-core-boarding.html?piid=1352100&fee=152&fep=15140&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This bodyboard gives you a cool and wonderful experience of riding a wave on a hot summer day. The crescent tail has great flexibility and comfort to suit your different riding styles.</p> <p> </p> <p>Made of high-quality EPS core  XPE deck and HDPE slick bottom  it has strong buoyancy and load-bearing capacity. Moreover  it has good impact resistance and weather resistance  making it difficult to deform and fade. The most important thing is that it has a leash and a wristband that protects you from being washed away by the waves. The light weight is easy to carry and transport  so you can take it to the pool  water park  river and sea.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for a bodyboard surfing like this  do not hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Not easy to break or deform due to the durable EPS core</li> <li>Waterproof XPE deck has good impact resistance and durability</li> <li>Smooth HDPE bottom greatly reduces the friction during surfing</li> <li>Ultra-light in weight makes bodyboard very easy to carry wherever you go </li> <li>It has excellent buoyancy and strong load-bearing capacity</li> <li>Leash and wrist rope design improves safety and stability during surfing</li> <li>The bodyboard has 60/40 rails  rear channels  and a crescent tail</li> <li>Bright colors and stylish design attract attention from the seaside </li> <li>Suitable for water sports  giving you a wonderful outdoor surfing experience</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Bring You Great Surfing Experience:</strong> With stylish design and bright colors  this body board allows you to enjoy an exciting surfing experience in the ocean  river  swimming pool and water park. It can help you get rid of the irritability caused by the hot summer  fully wake up your energy and motivate your whole body.<br /><strong>● Dynamic Design:</strong> The body board has 60/40 rails  rear channels  and a crescent tail  which are suitable for all kinds of waves. It is not only suitable for experienced surfers  but also for beginners because it is easy to control and can increase your speed and strength.<br /><strong>● Durable and Premium Materials:</strong> Covered with XPE deck  this body board is waterproof and has good impact resistance. The HDPE slick bottom adds stiffness and increases speed  projection and ideal flexibility. And due to the durable EPS core  it will not break or deform easily.<br /><strong>● Includes Leash with Wristband:</strong> The wristband can be put on the wrist or ankle to prevent the surfboard from being lost. The scientifically designed leash position provides a good traction experience that enhances safety during surfing. You can freely adjust the tightness of the wristband for maximum comfort.<br /><strong>● Lightweight and Superior Buoyancy:</strong> The light weight makes it easy to carry  so you can take it wherever you go. Strong buoyancy and sturdy construction give the body board a strong load-bearing capacity. It is not easily deformed and faded and can be used for a long time.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Blue</li> <li>Material: XPE  EPS  HDPE</li> <li>Overall size: 41" x 20" x 2.36" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 1.7 lbs/2 lbs</li> <li>Max user's weight: 122 lbs/188 lbs</li> <li>Max user's height: 55"/71"</li> <li>User age: Over 12/14 years old</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Bodyboard</li> <li>1 x Leash</li> </ul>,Costway,Sports > Water Sports > Surfing,,Overall size:41" x 20" x 2.36" (L x W x H); ,Surfing,On Sale,,Blue,OP70226-L,shopify,172,1,deny,manual,45.99,45.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70226_-5_2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70226_-7_2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70226_-1_2.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/u/Super_Lightweight_Bo_1772519799716894_861831.jpeg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70226_-3_2.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_2__72_45.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70226_-6_2.jpg,7
