help you get rid of the irritability caused by the hot summer  fully wake up your energy and motivate your whole body.<br /><strong>● Dynamic Design:</strong> The bodyboard has 60/40 rails  rear channels  and a crescent tail  which are suitable for all kinds of waves. It is not only suitable for experienced surfers  but also for beginners because it is easy to control and can increase your speed and strength.<br /><strong>● Durable and Premium Materials:</strong> Covered with XPE deck  this bodyboard is waterproof and has good impact resistance. The HDPE slick bottom adds stiffness and increases speed  projection and ideal flexibility. And due to the durable EPS core  it will not break or deform easily.<br /><strong>● Includes Leash with Wristband:</strong> The wristband can be put on the wrist or ankle to prevent the surfboard from being lost. The scientifically designed leash position provides a good traction experience that enhances safety during surfing. You can freely adjust the tightness of the wristband for maximum comfort.<br /><strong>● Lightweight and Superior Buoyancy:</strong> The lightweight makes it easy to carry  so you can take it wherever you go. Strong buoyancy and sturdy construction give the bodyboard a strong load-bearing capacity. It is not easily deformed and faded and can be used for a long time.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>M</li> <li>Color: Pink</li> <li>Material: XPE  EPS  HDPE</li> <li>Overall size: 37" x 19" x 2.36" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 1.7 lbs</li> <li>Max user's weight: 122 lbs</li> <li>Max user's height: 55"</li> <li>User age: Over 12/14 years old</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Bodyboard</li> <li>1 x Leash</li> <li>L</li> <li>Color: Pink</li> <li>Material: XPE  EPS  HDPE</li> <li>Overall size: 41" x 20" x 2.36" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 2 lbs</li> <li>Max user's weight: 188 lbs</li> <li>Max user's height: 71"</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li