2-in-1-electric-motorized-health-and-fitness-folding-treadmill-with-dual-display-and-speaker-green,2-in-1 Electric Motorized Health and Fitness Folding Treadmill with Dual Display and Speaker-Green,12657830,https://www.costway.com/2-in-1-electric-motorized-folding-treadmill-with-dual-display.html?piid=9210300&fee=152&fep=15186&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Powerful yet quiet 2.25HP motor makes your running quieter and more comfortable<br />● Dual display screen for both touch control and remote control<br />● Monitor speed  distance  time  and calories in real-time<br />● Used as a desk treadmill to walk steadily at a speed of 1-4km/h<br />● Used as a running treadmill to shape your body at a speed of 1-12km/h<br />● Connect the treadmill to your phone to enjoy music<br />● 5-layer shock-absorbing running belt reduces impact during sports<br />● Put your phone on the phone bracket to enjoy movies while running<br />● It can be used out of the box without any extra installation<br />● Built-in transport wheels make it easy to move and store<br />● The safety key helps stop the running machine immediately to avoid emergency<br />● The energy-saving treadmill had passed CE  ROHS  CB  EN957  IEC certifications by SGS<br />● Speed unit could be switched between mile and km in APP<br />● Please do not place the treadmill on carpet during usage to avoid motor overheat<br />● Please note that only the Start/Stop and +/- buttons are functional on the upper display  while the other speed keys are displayed for reference purposes only</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Dual Display Screen Treadmill:</strong> This treadmill is designed with a touchscreen and LED display to track the distance  speed  time  and calories in real-time. A cool-running experience with a colorful line flashing feature.<br /><strong>● Innovative 2-in-1 Folding Design:</strong> It has 2 modes that can be used  for walking and jogging. When the handrail is folded  it can be used as an under-desk treadmill at a speed of 1-4 km/h. Unfold the handrail with its 1-12 km/h speed to enjoy running and reach the fitness goal.<br /><strong>● Powerful Quiet Motor and Shock Reduction Running Belt:</strong> Powerful  but with a quieter environment with a 2.25 HP motor. Featuring a 7-layer non-slip and shock-absorbing running belt which helps to feel comfortable and protected.<br /><strong>● Wireless Speaker  Remote Control  and Phone Holder:</strong> Outfitted with a speaker to connect the phone wirelessly and listen to favorite music while exercising. It's also remote control operated and with a safety key that shuts down immediately during an emergency to protect your safety. You can use the phone holder to watch videos or chat with your friends  too.<br /><strong>● No Assembly Required and Easy to Store:</strong> The compact  foldable design and built-in wheels make it easy to move and store in a small space. No assembly is required. It has CE  ROHS  CB  EN957  IEC certifications by SGS.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: ABS</li> <li>Color: Green</li> <li>Overall dimension: 49" x 27" x 42" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Folding dimension: 52" x 27" x 5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Running area size: 40" x 16" (L x W)</li> <li>Net weight: 74 lbs</li> <li>Weigh capacity: 265 lbs</li> <li>Working voltage: AC 110V 60Hz</li> <li>Peak motor power: 2.25HP</li> <li>Speed: 1.0-12.0 km/h</li> <li>Control method: Touch button  controller</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x 2 in 1 folding treadmill</li> <li>1 x Remote control</li> <li>1 x Phone holder</li> <li>1 x Safety key</li> <li>1 x Power cord</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Sports > Exercise Machines > Treadmills,,Overall dimension:49" x 27" x 42" (L x W x H); Folding dimension:52" x 27" x 5" (L x W x H); Running area size:40" x 16" (L x W); ,Treadmills,,,Green,SP37522GN,shopify,511,1,deny,manual,219,1095,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/i/file_194_12.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/p/sp37148gn-1_1_.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_615_12.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/3/_3_1.png,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/1/_1_1.png,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/4/_4_1.png,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/2/_2_1.png,7
