ion for Children:</strong> As the size of table and chairs are especially designed for children  there will be no discomfort of feet off ground. Ergonomic backrest and the middle footrest provide max comfortable sitting. And the table of suitable height is conducive to baby learning and playing.<br><strong>● Perfect Gift for Baby 3+ Years:</strong> This children table set will be a perfect present for any occasion and the best partner to play block  paint and do craft projects. Double chairs will help your child in sharing happiness with others and make more friends. They must be surprised by such an excellent gift.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><table> <tbody> <tr> <td>Color</td> <td>Pink/White/Natural</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Material</td> <td>P2 MDF</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Applicable age</td> <td>3-7 Years</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Table dimension</td> <td>24.5" x 24.5" x 19" (L x W x H)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Chair dimension</td> <td>12" x 12" x 20.5" (L x W x H)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Table capacity</td> <td>50 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Chair capacity</td> <td>100 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Table net weight</td> <td>21.5 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Chair net weight</td> <td>6.5 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Box Qty</td> <td>1(May vary by batch)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Is Assembly Required</td> <td>Yes</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Package includes</td> <td>1 x Mini Table</td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td>2 x Backrest Chairs</td> </tr> <tr> <td> </td> <td>1 x User’s Instruction</td> </tr> </tbody> </table>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Toddler & Kids Furniture > Kids Table & Chair Sets,,Table dimension:24.5" x 24.5" x 19" (L x W x H); Chair dimension:12" x 12" x 20.5" (L x W x H); ,Kids Table & Chair Sets,Drop Price,,Natural,BB5584NA,shopify,2448,1,deny,manual,71.99,71.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BB5584NA/Kids_Table_Chairs_Set_With_Storage_Boxes_Blackboard_Whiteboard_Drawing_Natural-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/produ