rong> Equipped with thick and high resilience cushions for seat and back  the set will provide the ultimate comfort and make you totally relax. What's more  the cushion with hidden zipper which is easy to take off the cover and rinse by hand or machine.</li> <li><strong>Multipurpose Set with Elegant Design:</strong> The conversation set is designed in concise and modern style. In addition  the armrest is decorated with delicate nylon rope which brings beauty to the whole set. The set is not only a décor but also practical for many outdoor or indoor spaces including living room  garden  yard  patio  porch.</li> <li><strong>Free Combination of Set:</strong> Comes with multiple furniture pieces  the 4pcs set can be used separately or grouped in different ways to meet your different needs. With enough room for 4-6 people  you can have a good time with your friends or family to chat or have meals together. There will be more combinations if you buy two sets.</li> <li><strong>Overall Dimension:</strong> The dimension of every piece is as follows. Armchair: 28 x 26 x 30 in (L x W x H)  hold 360 lbs capacity. Loveseat: 52 x 26 x 30 in (L x W x H)  hold 700 lbs capacity. Coffee table: 40 x 24 x 16 in (L x W x H). Please refer to product images for details.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Teak and grey</li> <li>Material: acacia wood  polyester fabric  sponge</li> <li>Dimension of loveseat: 52" x 26" x 25" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of single Sofa: 28" x 26" x 25" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of table: 40" x 24" x 16" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Height of seat: 12"</li> <li>Weight of the set: 114.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of loveseat: 700 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of single sofa: 360 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>2 x Single chair</li> <li>1 x Loveseat</li> <li>1 x Table</li> <li>4 x Seat cushion</li> <li>4 x Back cushion</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 3(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furnitur