extendable-foldable-heavy-duty-clothing-rack-with-hanging-rod,Extendable Foldable Heavy Duty Clothing Coat Rack Stand with Hanging Rod,73409586,https://www.costway.com/extendable-foldable-heavy-duty-clothing-rack-with-hanging-rod.html?fee=152&fep=15224&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Adjustable heights for hanging both short and long clothes<br />● Premium metal materials make this garment rack more stable and durable<br />● Stable triangular base add enhanced stability to the clothes rack<br />● Foldable designs don't take up too much space<br />● 2 wheels with brakes make it easy to park the clothes rack where you want<br />● Easy to move the garment rack to different places with 4 universal wheels<br />● Lightweight and compact design is convenient for moving<br />● Simple and modern design can perfectly match your home decoration<br />● Easy to assemble and take down</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Extendable and Foldable Garment Rack:</strong> This standing coat rack consists of a stable base and a top hanging rod. The height of the rod can be adjusted from 39” to 66” according to your needs. Clothes and trousers of different lengths can be hung on it. The hanger can be folded up and placed in a compact space when not in use.<br><strong>● Sturdy and Stable Construction:</strong> Made of premium electroplate metal tubes  the garment rack is heavy-duty and durable. Thickened tubes offer steadiness to this garment rack so it can easily hold heavy winter jackets and coats. The modern coat rack is not easy to wobble or fall because of the stable triangular structure.<br><strong>● Flexible Rolling Wheels:</strong> The laundry coat rack stand is equipped with 4 smooth wheels  2 of which have brakes. This smart design brings you ease of hanging clothes and wheeling them along anywhere. No more hassle of carrying heavy garments from one place to another. Besides  two lockable wheels allow you stop the clothes rack in where you want.<br><strong>● Multipurpose Usage:</strong> Because of the compact and lightweight design  our rolling garment rack is convenient to move and storage. The entryway coat rack is concise which can match well with your home decoration. This rack not only can be placed in indoor space like living rooms and bedroom but also outdoor because of the waterproof and rustproof materials.<br><strong>● Easy to Assemble and Collapsible:</strong> Came with numbered parts and illustrated instructions  the garment rack is easy and convenient to be placed together or taken down. Just spend a little time and energy you can get a perfect garment rack. Dimension of the garment rack: 35" x 19" x 39-66".</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><table> <tbody> <tr> <td>Color</td> <td>Sliver</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Material</td> <td>Metal</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Dimension</td> <td>35" x 4.5" x 39" (Folded)</td> </tr> <tr> <td></td> <td>35" x 19" x 39-66" (Extended)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Net Weight</td> <td>5 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Maximum Bearing Capacity</td> <td>33 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Box Qty</td> <td>1(May vary by batch)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Package Includes</td> <td>1 x Garment rack</td> </tr> <tr> <td></td> <td>1 x Instruction</td> </tr> </tbody> </table>,Costway,Furniture > Entryway > Coat Racks & Hall Trees,,Dimension:35" x 4.5" x 39" (Folded); ,Coat Racks & Hall Trees,Bestseller,,Silver,HW63969,shopify,650,1,deny,manual,36,36,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/x/Extendable_Foldable__1759977777049113_664430.jpeg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/x/Extendable_Foldable__1759977777486771_385927.jpeg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/e/x/Extendable_Foldable__1759977777898755_236629.jpeg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab335