5-tier-ladder-shelf-modern-bamboo-leaning-bookshelf-ladder-bookcase,5-Tier Modern Bamboo Wall-Leaning Display Ladder Bookshelf,64398251,https://www.costway.com/5-tier-ladder-shelf-modern-bamboo-leaning-bookshelf-ladder-bookcase.html?fee=152&fep=15233&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This ladder bookshelf is an ideal storage solution for your bedroom  living room and office.</p> <p> </p> <p>Made of high-quality bamboo  this ladder shelf is not only durable and sturdy but also has good load-bearing. Except for that  the fine craftsmanship also makes it easy to clean and maintain. Equipped with a 5-tier open storage shelf of different sizes  our ladder storage unit provides large storage space for you to arrange your items while keeping your room clean and tidy. Most importantly  featuring a unique and space-saving wall-leaning design  the ladder shelf unit makes full use of space and suitable for small spaces. By the way  the ladder bookcase is easy to assemble with clear instruction and numbered parts.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you looking for such a product  don't hesitate to buy it now!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>The rugged bamboo frame is durable and sturdy than wood</li> <li>5-tier open storage shelf provide plenty of storage space</li> <li>Multifunctional display stand suit for lots of space</li> <li>Space-saving and lightweight ladder shelf is suitable for corner</li> <li>Non-slip foot pads ensure overall stable</li> <li>Premium screws are not easy to rust and tightly connected</li> <li>Wall-leaning ladder shelf is stable with a triangle structure</li> <li>A good storage solution for living room  bedroom and bathroom</li> <li>Easy assembly with clear instruction</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 5-Tier Open Storage Shelf:</strong> Equipped with 5 open storage shelves  the ladder rack maximizes the vertical storage space and provides plenty of storage for your daily display items. The open ladder shelf can keep your belongings organize and neat as well  easy to access and clean. Besides  the large distance between each shelf can place tall stuff.<br /><strong>● Natural Bamboo Frame:</strong> The ladder shelf is made of natural bamboo which is durable and sturdy than wood. Additionally  thanks to the bamboo structure  the ladder shelf is water-proof and lightweight for long time worry-free usage. Moreover  it is fixed with high-quality non-rusty screws  so this ladder shelf is very stable.<br /><strong>● Unique and Stable Leaning Design:</strong> The bookshelf leans against the wall to form a stable triangle structure for maximum stability. It is worth mentioning that each shelf leans against the wall vertically to ensures stability. Additionally  the bookshelf with non-slip feet ensures stability while without scratching the floor.<br /><strong>● Versatile Ladder Storage Shelf:</strong> The ladder storage rack is lightweight and multifunctional  which is not only suitable for bedroom and living room  but also for small spaces. Featuring a water-proof frame and large load-bearing  the practical storage shelf unit is also a great storage solution for the bathroom.<br /><strong>● Worry-free Assembly:</strong> With detailed instructions and clearly defined components  the ladder bookshelf is easy to assemble with the necessary tools. The bookshelf has five differently sized layers. With a touch of natural charm  the ladder shelf unit creates a special piece of furniture that adds decor to your room.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Natural</li> <li>Material: Bamboo</li> <li>Overall dimension: 17" x 14" x 65" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Distance between each shelf: 14"</li> <li>Net weight: 13 lbs</li> <li>Max. weight capacity: 44 lbs (each shelf)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x 5-Tier ladder shelf</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Bookcases,,Overall dimension:17" x 14" x 65" (L x W x H)