4-pieces-patio-solid-wood-furniture-set-beige,4 Pieces Patio Solid Wood Furniture Set-Beige,63524971,https://www.costway.com/4-pieces-patio-solid-wood-furniture-set-with-water-resistant-cushions.html?piid=9229200&fee=152&fep=15313&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Made of premium acacia wood  the whole frame is sturdy and not easy to crack or deform.</p> <p> </p> <p>All the single chairs and loveseat are equipped with soft and high-resilient cushion for seat and backrest. You will get excellent comfort if you sit on the sofa. In addition  the zippered cover can be removed conveniently for rinsing. Each piece of our set is independent so that they can be rearranged based on your preference. Comes with a coffee table  you can put drinks  snack  magazines and fruits on. Please enjoy your leisure time with your friends or family in your balcony  garden or backyard.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for wood furniture set like that  don't hesitate to buy it.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Acacia wood frame ensures sturdiness and durability</li> <li>Thick and soft cushions will provide you excellent comfort</li> <li>Wide armrest in suitable height to rest your arm</li> <li>Cover with zipper of cushion is convenient to be taken off and washed</li> <li>Cushions can be fixed with loveseat or single chair tightly</li> <li>Can be rearranged in various ways to meet your different needs</li> <li>Perfect to be placed in your patio  poolside and garden</li> <li>Easy to assemble according to instruction</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Heavy Duty Solid Wood Frame:</strong> The whole frame of the sofa set is made of premium acacia wood which is sturdy and not easy to crack or deform. And the parts are connected with premium screws so that the set is stable and will provide large weight capacity.</li> <li><strong>Ergonomic Chair with Washable Cushion:</strong> Designed with slightly sloping backrest  the loveseat and single chair are close to your body shape. Plus  equipped with high resilience cushions for seat and back  the set will provide the ultimate comfort to you. And the cover of cushion with hidden zipper is easy to take off and rinse by hand or machine.</li> <li><strong>Multiple Combinations of Set:</strong> The 4 pieces furniture set can be used separately or grouped in different ways to meet your different needs. It is enough space for 4-6 people and you can chat or have meals with your friends or family together. If you buy two sets  there will be more combinations for you.</li> <li><strong>Versatile & Practical Sofa:</strong> Designed with concise style  the set with wood texture will be a good decor and bring warm atmosphere to your home. The sofa set is ideal to be placed in your garden  patio  balcony  poolside  backyard and other outdoor space in your house to create a private corner.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble:</strong> It is convenient to assemble the furniture set just following the instructions. The dimension of every piece is as follows. Single Chair: 24" x 27" x 34.5" in (L x W x H)  hold 360 lbs. Loveseat: 53" x 27" x 34.5" in (L x W x H)  hold 700 lbs. Coffee table: 40" x 24" x 16" in (L x W x H).</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Wood</li> <li>Material: Acacia wood  polyester fabric  sponge</li> <li>Dimension of loveseat: 53" x 27" x 34.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of single sofa: 24" x 27" x 34.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of table: 40" x 23.5" x 18" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Height of seat: 17" (include cushion)</li> <li>Weight of the set: 103.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of loveseat: 700 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of single sofa: 360 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of coffee table: 220 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 2(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Dimension of loveseat:53" x 27" x 34.5" (L x W x H); Dimension of single sofa:24" x 27" x 34.5" (L x W x H); Dimension of table:40" x 23.5" x 18" (L x W x H); ,Patio Conversation Sets,Clearance,,Beige,HW63970WH+,shopify,88,1,deny,manual,319.99,319.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_269_10.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_258_10.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_152_10.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_278_10.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_265_10.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_272_10.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_243_10.jpg,7
2-drawers-accent-console-entryway-storage-shelf-black,Narrow Console Table with Drawers and Open Storage Shelf-Black,65473902,https://www.costway.com/2-drawers-accent-console-entryway-storage-shelf-with-bottom-shelf.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=15329&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Wide top and large bottom shelf for ornaments  photos and books<br />● 2 storage drawers for knick-knacks and private items<br />● Equipped with anti-tipping device to protect kids and furry friends<br />● Solid wood legs provide reliable support and endure test of time<br />● Adjustable foot pads keep the table stable and avoid scratching floor<br />● Works well as a console table  foyer table or sofa table<br />● Easy cleaning surface saves you time and effort</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Narrow Console Table with Storage:</strong> The 31.5"L x 14"W x 32"H console table fits limited room yet to bring ample storage space. It features a spacious tabletop  2 pull-out drawers and a bottom storage shelf to meet storage or display needs. <br />● <strong>Sturdy Construction with Solid Wood Legs:</strong> Crafted with premium MDF panels and solid rubber wood legs  the entryway table has a strong bearing capacity and long lifespan. Plus  the adjustable foot pads further improve overall stability.<br />● <strong>Anti-tipping Device for Extra Security:</strong> Worried about mischievous kids or furry friends? Get relaxed! This accent table comes with anti-tipping device to prevent falling accidents. And the drawers are also equipped with stoppers to avoid sliding off.<br />● <strong>Elegant and Versatile Addition:</strong> The sofa table looks stylish and elegant. It comes to elevate your room decoration to the next level. Besides  with practicable functions  the table can serve well in entryway  living room  dining room  etc.<br />● <strong>Pre-installed Design for Quick Assembly:</strong> The foyer table comes partly pre-installed  leaving you some simple steps to finish assembly. Plus  the detailed instruction and labeled accessories will also be of great help.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black/Gray/White</li> <li>Material: MDF  Rubber Wood</li> <li>Overall Dimensions: 31.5" x 14" x 32" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Bottom Shelf Dimensions: 27.5" x 12" x 19" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Clearance Between Bottom Shelf and Ground: 4"</li> <li>Interior Dimensions of Drawer: 11"x 10" x 4" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Front Panel of Drawer: 12"x 4.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Weight Capacity of Tabletop: 110 lbs</li> <li>Weight Capacity of Bottom Shelf: 44 lbs</li> <li>Net Weight: 25 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Entryway > Console Tables,,Overall Dimensions:31.5" x 14" x 32" (L x W x H); Bottom Shelf Dimensions:27.5" x 12" x 19" (L x W x H); Interior Dimensions of Drawer:11"x 10" x 4" (L x W x H); ,Console Tables,,,Black,HW65113BK,shopify,78,1,deny,manual,94.99,99.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW65113BK/Black_Console_Table_with_Drawers_and_Open_Storage_Shelf-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW65113BK/Black_Console_Table_with_Drawers_and_Open_Storage_Shelf-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW65113BK/Black_Console_Table_with_Drawers_and_Open_Storage_Shelf-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW65113BK/Black_Console_Table_with_Drawers_and_Open_Storage_Shelf-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW65113BK/Black_Console_Table_with_Drawers_and_Open_Storage_Shelf_size-5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW65113BK