3-pcs-wicker-rocking-bistro-set-with-glass-coffee-table-and-storage-shelf-blue,3 Pcs Wicker Rocking Bistro Set with Glass Coffee Table and Storage Shelf-Blue,63109458,https://www.costway.com/3-pieces-cushioned-patio-rattan-set-with-rocking-chair-and-table.html?piid=9210100&fee=152&fep=15335&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Constructed of a heavy steel frame and premium rattan  the whole set is sturdy and durable to serve you for a long time. Including 2 rocking chairs and a coffee table  this set suits any style of home. </p> <p>   </p> <p>The rocking chairs are designed to rock slowly and gently which will bring you a fantastic feeling. Comes with soft and thick cushions  you will feel extreme comfort for your hip and back when you sit on the chair. And the cover of the cushion is equipped with a zipper for easy removal and cleaning. The set also contains a coffee table that has a lower shelf to provide additional storage space. With our furniture set  you will have a comfortable space for relaxing conversations with friends and family or reading a book alone and enjoying your morning coffee.</p> <p>    </p> <p>If you are looking for a rocking chair set like this  don't hesitate to buy it!</p> <p>   </p> <ul> <li>Including 1 table with tempered glass top and 2 rocking chairs</li> <li>Sturdy and heavy steel frame ensures large weight capacity</li> <li>High-quality PE wicker can withstand the moderate change in weather</li> <li>Slightly sloping back and seat of the rocking chair offers unexpected comfort</li> <li>Soft and thick cushions will provide a more comfortable sitting experience</li> <li>Tempered glass is fixed by suckers to avoid slipping when in use</li> <li>A lower shelf of the table to provide additional storage space</li> <li>Removable cover with the zipper of cushion for machine-washable conveniently</li> <li>The classical and concise design fits any decoration of the house</li> <li>Perfect for outdoor space like garden  back yard  deck  poolside and so on</li> <li>Easy to install with detailed instruction and convenient to clean</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Sturdy Frame with Exquisite Rattan:</strong> The frame of this 3-piece rocking chair set is made of heavy-duty steel and premium PE wicker which ensures the sturdiness and durability of the whole set. Not only the set can provide a stronger bearing capacity but also it is not easy to deform. The weight capacity of the chair is about 360 lbs.<br /><strong>● Rocking Design for Chairs:</strong> Featuring rocking function  this classical and ergonomic chair will bring a state of rustic and comfortable relaxation for you. And there is a piece of the pad at the bottom of the rocking chair that prevents sliding of the chair and protects the feet.<br /><strong>● Extremely Comfortable Experience:</strong> The rattan of the rocking chair is resilient and comfortable to sit on. Each chair is also equipped with a cushion and pillow. They have good air permeability and are soft which can effectively reduce the pressure on your hips and relieve your fatigue of the day and enjoy leisure time. And the cover of the seat cushion has a zipper for easy cleaning.<br /><strong>● Glass Top Table with Storage Shelf:</strong> There is a thick and solid tempered glass table on the top and is fixed with several suckers. You don't need to worry about moving of top. In addition  the table also features a lower shelf with spacious storage space so that you can store some items.<br /><strong>● Suitable for Various Occasions:</strong> This rocking chair set is perfect for both indoor and outdoor use. You can put it in your bedroom  porch  living room  balcony  garden  and backyard anywhere you want. You can sit on it and bathe in the morning sunshine  listen to music and drink a cup of coffee  or talk freely with friends.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Steel  rattan  sponge  fabric</li> <li>Color of rattan: Blue</li> <li>Chair dimension: 25" x 27" x 28" (L x W x H) </li> <li>Table dimension: 18" x 18" x 19.5" (L x W x H) </li> <li>Height of seat: 17.5" (include seat cushion) </li> <li>Height of armrest: 25.5"</li> <li>Weight of set: 49 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of chair: 360 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 110 lbs</li> <li>Package include: </li> <li>Rocking chair x 2</li> <li>Cushion x 4</li> <li>Instruction x 1</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Chair dimension:25" x 27" x 28" (L x W x H) ; Table dimension:18" x 18" x 19.5" (L x W x H) ; ,Patio Conversation Sets,Clearance,,Blue,HW62861TU,shopify,128,1,deny,manual,129.99,159.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_258_43.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_243_43.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_152_43.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_278_43.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_265_43.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_272_43.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_269_43.jpg,7
wooden-outdoor-lounge-chair-with-ergonomic-design-for-yard-and-garden-natural,Acacia Wood Outdoor Adirondack Chair with Ergonomic Design-Natural,08521679,https://www.costway.com/wooden-outdoor-lounge-chair-with-ergonomic-design-for-yard-and-garden.html?piid=9229100&fee=152&fep=15337&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Made of durable acacia wood and galvanized screws  the Adirondack chair has solid structure and large weigh capacity for outdoor using.</p> <p> </p> <p>In addition to durability  this chair is also very comfortable. Combine ergonomic design with wood slat style  it is breathable as well as providing great support. More  the classic style of this wood chair make it perfectly matches with your decor  and adding the harmonious and nature accent to your room. It is your time to have a better relaxing time with the classic outdoor Adirondack chair.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for a chair like that  don't hesitate to buy it.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Heavy-duty acacia wood frame has weight capacity</li> <li>Premium galvanized screws are rustproof</li> <li>Ergonomic chair with wide armrest and backrest</li> <li>Unique shape combines with classic style</li> <li>Great for outdoor and indoor using</li> <li>Perfect for patio  deck  garden and balcony</li> <li>Quick assembly with detailed instruction</li> <li>Smooth surface for easy maintenance</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Durable Wood Structure:</strong> The Adirondack chair is made of super-strong acacia wood  which is durable and weather-resistant as well as not crack  chip and peel easily. Besides  using premium galvanized screws  it is weather-resistant and anti-rust for outdoor use. The Adirondack chair in large size is durable enough to hold up to 350 lbs.<br /><strong>● Ergonomic & Cozy Chair:</strong> The Adirondack chair with a spacious seat gives you considerable space to sit. And  the wide armrest and high backrest of this wood chair provide great support to you. More importantly  the Adirondack chair is using wood slat  which is breathable. Of course  in order to double comfy  you can put your cushion.<br /><strong>● Unique and Classic Style:</strong> The Adirondack chair simulates a little frog squatting on the ground  which not only increased stability but also added unique appeal. The wood surface with clear textures adds movement and lightness to the design  complementing and improving the accent of the whole home décor.<br /><strong>● Wild Application:</strong> The modern and stylish Adirondack chair is ideal for mixing and matching with other pieces of outdoor furniture. It is comfortable for you to enjoy outdoor leisure time. Thanks to durable structure and comfortable seats  the wood chair is great for the garden  poolside  and balcony.<br /><strong>● Easy Assembly & Simple Maintain:</strong> The Adirondack chair is easy for you to assemble within a short time. Just follow the instruction  the elegant chair is quick to put together. And the smooth surface is also convenient for cleaning up. Size of Adirondack chair is 27" x 35" x40.5" (L x W x H)</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Natural</li> <li>Material: Acacia wood</li> <li>Overall dimension: 27" x 35" x 40.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Height from the ground to the armrest: 24"</li> <li>Height from the ground to the seat: 15"</li> <li>Net weight: 19 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Adirondack chair</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Adirondack Chairs,,Overall dimension:27" x 35" x 40.5" (L x W x H); ,Adirondack Chairs,Clearance,,Natural,OP70302OR,shopify,1010,1,deny,manual,79.99,111.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/a/c/Acacia_Wood_Outdoor__1779699141888887_108187.jpeg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbn