 In addition  the height of the wide armrest is suitable to rest and relaxing your hands and arms.<br /><strong>● Multipurpose Furniture Set:</strong> The patio furniture set doesn't take up too much space and you can create a private corner. Designed in a concise and modern style  our 3pcs set is ideal to be placed in your garden  patio  balcony  poolside  backyard and other outdoor space in your house.<br /><strong>● Sturdy Coffee Table:</strong> Comes with a solid wood coffee table  it is great to place small items or decors on the table for easy taking. With a concise and rustic style  the table also can be used separately or as a side table to match other furniture.<br /><strong>● Convenient to Assemble and Clean:</strong> All necessary hardware and detailed instructions are included for your convenience and quickly assemble. With a waterproof surface  the set is easy to clean with a damp cloth. Armchair: 24" x 32.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H)  hold up to 360 lbs. Table: 16" x 16" x 14.5" (L x W x H)  hold up to 220 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Rattan  eucalyptus wood</li> <li>Color: Brown</li> <li>Dimension of armchair: 24" x 32.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of table: 16" x 16" x 14.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Height of armrest: 23"</li> <li>Height of seat: 15"</li> <li>Weight of the set: 38 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of chair: 360 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 220 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>2 x Armchair</li> <li>1 x Coffee table</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Dimension of armchair:24" x 32.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H); Dimension of table:16" x 16" x 14.5" (L x W x H); ,Patio Conversation Sets,Drop Price,,Brown,OP70267,shopify,68,1,deny,manual,209.99,319.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_1_19.png,1,h