inflatable-adjustable-stand-up-paddle-board-s,Inflatable & Adjustable Stand Up Paddle Board-S,81239450,https://www.costway.com/inflatable-adjustable-stand-up-paddle-board.html?piid=1352120&fee=152&fep=15403&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The wide and non-slip deck provides great stability  ensuring that you can stand on top and easily maintain balance without falling.</p> <p> </p> <p>The streamlined construction reduces drag and accelerate speed. With an adjustable and floatable paddle  you can choose the right length. When it deflated and rolled up  this paddle board is very light. Equipped with a backpack and carry handle for easy movement  carrying and storage.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for paddle board like that  don't hesitate to buy it.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Strong load-bearing capacity and ultra-thick design enhance stability</li> <li>3 fins at the bottom to help control direction and improve speed</li> <li>Non-slip deck and leash increase safety</li> <li>The bungee cords can be used to place personal items</li> <li>High-quality double-layer PVC material and V-drop stitch core makes sup sturdy and durable</li> <li>Floatable paddle can be free to adjust the length to meet different needs</li> <li>You can fold and store it in the provided backpack to save space</li> <li>Simple inflatable valve design with manual air pump for quick inflation in a short time</li> <li>There are carry handle on the SUP to make carrying more convenient</li> <li>Users can use it to surf  fish  paddle  do yoga and other sports</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Excellent Balance Performance:</strong> The SUP has sufficient length and width to improve its stability and better resist the impact of waves. 3 bottom panel fins can effectively improve speed  handling and steering for easy use and control. This paddle board is perfect for all skill levels and suits in most water environments.</li> <li><strong>Non-slip and Soft Deck:</strong> The non-slip pattern in the middle of the deck can avoid accidents as much as possible. The bungee cords on the deck makes it easy to store your backpack and other items. The safety leash ensures that you don't have to worry about accidents when slipping.</li> <li><strong>Durable and Premium Material:</strong> Made of double-layer PVC material and V-drop stitch core  it has a sturdy structure and strong load-bearing capacity. And it is not easy to deform and fade  and can be used for a long time. The aluminum alloy paddle is light and floatable  supporting height adjustment to meet the different needs of users.</li> <li><strong>Lightweight and Portable Design:</strong> The backpack makes it easy to carry it wherever you want  such as the ocean  lake or river. Even if you want to move it when it's full of gas  there's a carry handle for you to take. You can use it to surf  fish  do yoga or compete with friends to increase fun.</li> <li><strong>Complete SUP Kit & Fast Inflation:</strong> We provide an adjustable paddle  manual air pump  backpack  safety leash  repair kit and removable fin in package. With a manual air pump  you can easily inflate and use it. When it is deflated and rolled up  this paddle board is easy to carry and store.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As Pictures Show</li> <li>Material: PVC  v-drop stitch core  tarpaulin layer</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 9.8' x 30" x 6.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Adjustable length of paddle: 63" to 83"</li> <li>Backpack size: 11.5" x 11.5" x 34.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 24 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 253 lbs</li> <li>Package included:</li> <li>1 x Inflatable paddle board</li> <li>1 x Adjustable paddle</li> <li>1 x Carry bag</li> <li>1 x Removable slide-in fin</li> <li>1 x Safety leash</li> <li>1 x Manual air pump</li> <li>1 x Repair kit</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Sports > Water Sports > Surfing,,Overall dimensi