set-of-2-pvc-leather-bar-stools-with-solid-wood-legs,Set of 2 PVC Leather Bar Stools with Solid Wood Legs,75912386,https://www.costway.com/set-of-2-pvc-dining-leather-bar-stools-with-solid-wood-legs.html?piid=1358440&fee=152&fep=15404&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Constructed of high-quality materials to ensure durability<br />● Stable rubber wood frame ensures excellent load-bearing capacity<br />● Upholstered seat and back provide a comfortable sitting feeling<br />● With 4-sided brace bars for ultra comfort and added stability<br />● PVC leather cover is easy to wipe and keep clean<br />● Suitable for kitchen  café  bar and many other places<br />● Easy to assemble with detailed instructions</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Sturdy and Durable Construction:</strong> Made of high-quality wood  this bar stool set is sturdy and will not easily deform  ensuring a long service life. The square legs provide strong support  and a maximum weight-bearing capacity of 243 lbs.<br /><strong>● Comfortable Upholstered Seat and Back:</strong> The seat and back cushion are filled with high-density sponge and covered with breathable leather for extraordinary comfort. The backrest conforms to your back perfectly to ensure you or your guests and can sit comfortably for long periods of time.<br /><strong>● Ergonomic 4-sided Footrests:</strong> The legs are reinforced by 4-sided brace bars. This enhances the overall stability and also provides you with extra comfort and space for you to place your feet.<br /><strong>● Stylish Appearance for Multiple Uses:</strong> With a contemporary look  this bar stool set is an eye-catching decoration no matter where it is placed. It's a great choice beside a high dining table or kitchen counter  and is suitable for restaurants  bars  cafes  patios  family kitchens and other places.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble and Maintain:</strong> With the detailed  clear assembly instructions and all necessary hardware included  it's easy to assemble these barstools. The wear-resistant cover makes maintenance and cleaning a breeze  stains or spills left on the chairs can be quickly wiped with a soft damp cloth.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Materials: PVC  rubber wood</li> <li>Overall dimension: 18.5"  x 21"  x 39" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Seat dimension: 18" x 16.5"(L x W)</li> <li>Net weight: 31 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 243 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li>2 x Bar chair</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Kitchen & Dining > Bar Stools,,Overall dimension:18.5"  x 21"  x 39" (L x W x H); Seat dimension:18" x 16.5"(L x W); ,Bar Stools,,,Black,HW66619,shopify,873,1,deny,manual,149,227,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_PVC_Leather_1767755688278037_506065.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_PVC_Leather_1767755689224526_317535.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_PVC_Leather_1767755686713005_715575.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_PVC_Leather_1767755696205848_806230.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_PVC_Leather_1767755692244268_809824.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_PVC_Leather_1767755693256100_696529.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_PVC_Leather_1767755694240223_946435.jpg,7
indoor-outdoor-wooden-high-back-rocking-chair-black,Indoor Outdoor Wooden High Back Rocking Chair-Black,26198570,https://www.costway.com/indoor-outdoor-wooden-high-back-rocking-chair.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=15409&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This rocking chair is constructed of premium acacia wood  which is corrosion-resistant and durable to support your long-term use.</p> <p> </p> <p>Designed with contoured slatted seat  high back and widened armrest  the chair will give you comfortable sitting feeling to relieve fatigue. Thanks to its chic and elegant style  this rocking chair is perfect for your balcony  terrace  backyard and more.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for a chair like that  don't hesitate to buy it.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of premium acacia wood with good weather-resistance</li> <li>Has passed FSC certificate for safe use</li> <li>Contoured slatted seat to promote the heat dissipation</li> <li>Widened armrest and high backrest design to provide optimal sitting experience</li> <li>Four-supporting points with the cross-bar to ensure stability</li> <li>Max weight capacity can reach 350 lbs</li> <li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor use</li> <li>Accurate rocking radian for great safety and ultimate relaxation</li> <li>Ideal for patio  balcony  backyard  etc</li> <li>Smooth surface for easy cleaning</li> <li>Easy to assemble under the detailed instruction</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Selected Acacia Wood:</strong> Made of premium acacia wood  this outdoor rocking chair is weather-resistant and durable for a long service time. It is free of burrs to prevent stabbing of the skin and does not deform easily. What's more  this chair has passed FSC certificate to ensure safe use.</li> <li><strong>Ergonomic Design for Great Comfort:</strong> This rocking chair is designed with streamlined slat structure  which effectively promotes the heat dissipation and offers you the optimal sitting experience. Besides  the wide armrest and high backrest make it easy to support your arms and back.</li> <li><strong>Safe Rocking Structure:</strong> Featuring four-supporting points with cross bars  this outdoor rocking chair evenly disperses the pressure to each point. And after the precise calculation of the rocking radian  it can ensure personal safety and achieve ultimate relaxation.</li> <li><strong>Convenient Versatility:</strong> With simple and elegant style  this rocking chair can blend perfectly into any decor. The wood surface with classic color adds movement and lightness to the chair. You can seat on it to enjoy leisure time in the living room  garden  patio  balcony and other areas.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble & Clean:</strong> This rocking chair comes with a clear and brief instruction  which has straight forward illustrations and descriptions. Each part and screw has its own code to take you little time and energy. In addition  its smooth surface is easy to clean with a damp cloth.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Acacia wood</li> <li>Overall dimension: 33" x 28" x 45.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Seat dimension: 21" x 20" (W x D)</li> <li>Height from the ground to the armrest: 24.5"</li> <li>Height from the ground to the seat: 16.5"</li> <li>Net weight: 19.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 350 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Rocking chair</li> <li>1 x User manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Patio Rocking Chairs & Gliders,,Overall dimension:33" x 28" x 45.5" (L x W x H); Seat dimension:21" x 20" (W x D); ,Patio Rocking Chairs & Gliders,Clearance,,Black,HZ10110DK,shopify,19,1,deny,manual,124.99,124.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_284_2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/53