e. Plus  the sturdy metal frame supports up to 330 lbs for each chair and 135 lbs for the table.<br />● <strong>Convenient Folding Chairs</strong>: With no assembly required  these patio lawn chairs fold and unfold in a breeze  thanks to the convenient fixing devices. Moreover  the 105° inclined backrests and curved armrests make them ergonomic for ultimate comfort.<br />● <strong>Rippled Tempered Glass Tabletop</strong>: The centerpiece of this patio set is the rippled tempered glass tabletop. Not only is it pleasing to the eye with its unique texture  but it's also safe to use and easy to clean.<br />● <strong>Built-in Umbrella Hole</strong>: With a 1.57" umbrella hole  this small patio furniture set accommodates most standard patio umbrellas (not included). Additionally  the 2 bottom fixing holes increase stability. Note: Require weighted base (not included).</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown and Black</li> <li>Material: Fabric  Metal  Tempered Glass</li> <li>Dimensions of Table: 24" x 28" (Dia x H)</li> <li>Unfolded Dimensions of Each Chair: 24" x 24.5" x 36" (W x D x H)</li> <li>Folded Dimensions of Each Chair: 24" x 3.5" x 33.5" (W x D x H)</li> <li>Sizes of Seat: 20" x 17" (W x D)</li> <li>Seat Height: 17"</li> <li>Diameter of Umbrella Hole: 1.57"</li> <li>Net Weight of Table: 13.5 lbs/6 kg</li> <li>Net Weight of Each Chair: 9.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight Capacity of Table: 135 lbs</li> <li>Weight Capacity of Each Chair: 330 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li> <li>Package Includes:</li> <li>1 x Round Table</li> <li>2 x Folding Chairs</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Dimensions of Table:24" x 28" (Dia x H); Unfolded Dimensions of Each Chair:24" x 24.5" x 36" (W x D x H); Folded Dimensions of Each Chair:24" x 3.5" x 33.5" (W x D x H); Sizes of Seat:20" x 17" (W x D); Diameter of Umbrella Hole:1.57"; ,Patio Conversation Sets,,,Brown,OP7033