ble and Clean:</strong> With detailed assembly instructions and all hardware delivered  it’s easy to set up your storage rack. Its smooth surface and rust-proof coating facilitate daily maintenance  the stains left on the rack can be quickly wiped with a soft damp cloth  which greatly saves your time and labor.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown</li> <li>Material: MDF + iron</li> <li>Overall dimension: 23.5" x 9.5" x 69.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 28.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of each shelf: 33 lbs</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Bathroom space saver</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Bath > Over the Toilet Storage,,Overall dimension:23.5" x 9.5" x 69.5" (L x W x H); ,Over the Toilet Storage,,,Rustic Brown,BA7880CF,shopify,393,1,deny,manual,59.99,59.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BA7880CF/4-Tier_Freestanding_Over_the_Toilet_Storage_Rack-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BA7880CF/4-Tier_Freestanding_Over_the_Toilet_Storage_Rack-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BA7880CF/4-Tier_Freestanding_Over_the_Toilet_Storage_Rack-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BA7880CF/4-Tier_Freestanding_Over_the_Toilet_Storage_Rack-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BA7880CF/4-Tier_Freestanding_Over_the_Toilet_Storage_Rack_size-5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BA7880CF/4-Tier_Freestanding_Over_the_Toilet_Storage_Rack-6.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525