se to your body shape. Plus  equipped with high resilience cushions for seat and back  the set will provide the ultimate comfort to you. And the cover of cushion with hidden zipper is easy to take off and rinse by hand or machine.</li> <li><strong>Multiple Combinations of Set:</strong> The 4 pieces furniture set can be used separately or grouped in different ways to meet your different needs. It is enough space for 4-6 people and you can chat or have meals with your friends or family together. If you buy two sets  there will be more combinations for you.</li> <li><strong>Versatile & Practical Sofa:</strong> Designed with concise style  the set with wood texture will be a good decor and bring warm atmosphere to your home. The sofa set is ideal to be placed in your garden  patio  balcony  poolside  backyard and other outdoor space in your house to create a private corner.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble:</strong> It is convenient to assemble the furniture set just following the instructions. The dimension of every piece is as follows. Single Chair: 24" x 27" x 34.5" in (L x W x H)  hold 360 lbs. Loveseat: 53" x 27" x 34.5" in (L x W x H)  hold 700 lbs. Coffee table: 40" x 24" x 16" in (L x W x H).</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Blue</li> <li>Material: Acacia wood  polyester fabric  sponge</li> <li>Dimension of loveseat: 53" x 27" x 34.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of single sofa: 24" x 27" x 34.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of table: 40" x 23.5" x 18" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Height of seat: 17" (include cushion)</li> <li>Weight of the set: 103.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of loveseat: 700 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of single sofa: 360 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of coffee table: 220 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 2(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Dimension of loveseat:53" x 27" x 34.5" (L x W x H); Dimension of single sofa:24" x 27" x 34.5" (L x W x