convenient transportation and storage. Other than that  there exist side grab ropes around the floating island for fixation and easy pulling. <br /><strong>● Versatile Uses:</strong> The canopy island measures 71" x 71" x 63" (L x W x H)(canopy is included) and loads weights up to 441 lbs providing sufficient spaces to enjoy your summer water party. In addition  this floating lounge is not only suitable for beach  lake  and poolside but also patio  camping  and placing at home as a spare bed.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White  Brown  Silver</li> <li>Materials: PVC  190T Polyester fabric  fiber pipe</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 71" x 71" x 63" (L x W x H) (canopy is included)</li> <li>71" x 71" x 25.5" (L x W x H) (canopy is not included)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 441 lbs</li> <li>Net weight: 12 lbs</li> <li>Package included:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Inflatable canopy island</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Sports > Water Sports > Swimming,,Overall dimensions:71" x 71" x 63" (L x W x H) (canopy is included); ,Swimming,Drop Price,,White,NP10725,shopify,551,1,deny,manual,129.99,179.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_675_9.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_728_11.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/n/p/np10725-1_1.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/11_429_21.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_716_10.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_589_8.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525