kids-kitchen-cookware-pretend-cooking-food-play-set,Kids Kitchen Cookware Pretend Cooking Food Play Set,68592170,https://www.costway.com/kids-kitchen-cookware-pretend-cooking-food-play-set.html?fee=152&fep=15534&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The kitchen cooking set has multiply accessories to have a comprehensive cooking simulation experience. Kids can wash the fruits and vegetables in the sink to simulate cleaning  and pretend dinners and snacks with provided oven  stove  and microwave.</p> <p> </p> <p>Practice the fun of organization with cabinet and shelves. Realistic stove knob sound and rotatable faucet with its attractive appearance can greatly enhance the playing interest while helping kids develop better imagination  hands-on and motor skills. Safe material and eco-friendly paint won’t do any harm to kids’ health to make this kitchen playset a perfect gift for kids. This Play Kitchen Set can bring endless fun for kids!</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for a gift for your kids  don't hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Solid wood and MDF board with safe paint for longer and safer use</li> <li>Passes ASTM Certification for added safety</li> <li>Multiple playing areas for more fun</li> <li>Sufficient storage space for storing kitchen accessory to exercise organization skill</li> <li>Colorful appearance is more loved by children</li> <li>Swivel faucet added realism</li> <li>Realistic knob sounds bring an immersive cooking environment</li> <li>Improve color recognition  exercise hand-eye coordination ability</li> <li>A wide range of accessories make children free to play</li> <li>Easy to assemble and simply cleaning with removable sink</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Realistic Cooking Experience</strong>: The cooking playset features real cooking scenes. Put the pot on the stove and turn the knob  it will pretend the real knob click sounds. Besides  kids can simulate real the process of washing dishes in the sink to make cooking more interesting and realistic.</li> <li><strong>Safe & Non-toxic Material</strong>: Crafted of premium MDF board and a solid wood leg  the play food set is guaranteed to be super safe and long-lasting for kids to play freely. The surface is covered with non-toxic and eco-friendly paint  which features no odor and won’t do harm to kids for a safe playing environment. It is also ASTM-certificated.</li> <li><strong>Fun & Educational Cooking Set</strong>: The pretend play kitchen toy set can let kids create a delicious meal with friends to cultivate social skills. Plus  functional overhead cabinet and 2 open shelves encourage kids to keep kitchen accessories neat and orderly while exercising hands-on skills and developing an interest on organization.</li> <li><strong>Complete Equipment for Chef Needs</strong>: The cooking playset contains multiply accessories that kids chef needs  including a pot and a pan  a spatula  spoon  a removable sink with rotatable faucet  stove  oven  microwave oven  2 open shelves and a cabinet for condiments. All of these can greatly encourage kids' imagination and role play.</li> <li><strong>Lovely Appearance & Best Gift for Kids</strong>: Pretend kitchen set has a lovely appearance to be absolute an eye-catcher for kids. Bright colors  various kitchen utensils  realistic kitchen tools make it a great gift for kids over 3 years old for holidays  birthday party or festival to create hours of fun playing time.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As the picture shows</li> <li>Material: P2 MDF  solid wood</li> <li>Size: 23.5" x 12" x 37" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Age grade: 3-7 years old</li> <li>Certification: ASTM</li> <li>Net weight: 18 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Kitchen playset</li> <li>1 x Pot</li> <li>1 x Pan</li> <li>1 x Spatula</li> <li>1 x Spoon</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Pretend Toys > Play Kitchen Sets,,Size:23.5" x 12" x 37" (L x W x H); ,Play Kitchen Sets,Clearance,,Gray & White,HW63966,shopify,174,1,deny,manual,49.99,49.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_283_3.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_331_4.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_299_3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_307_3.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_314_3.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_310_3.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_313_3.jpg,7
10-x-10-feet-outdoor-commercial-pop-up-canopy-tent-white,10 x 10 Feet Outdoor Commercial Pop up Canopy Tent-White,95721084,https://www.costway.com/10-x-10-feet-outdoor-commercial-pop-up-canopy-tent.html?piid=9220100&fee=152&fep=15540&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The folding tent which can be conveniently stored in a portable bag to carry and perfect for many outdoor activities like parties  camping  flea markets etc.</p> <p> </p> <p>Are you finding a foldable canopy to provide shelter for some outdoor activities?  Constructed of powder-coated solid steel  the frame of the tent is rust-resistant and can provide long time service. And the height of canopy can be adjusted in 6-9 FT to meet your different needs. The wind ropes  stakes and sandbags which come with tent can also add stability of tent. Whether the weather is rain or shine  this outdoor shelter is sure to make your outdoor gathering pleasant. Under the canopy  there is enough space for you to place furniture like deck chair  table and loveseat to enjoy leisure time with your family or friends.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for such product  don't hesitate to buy it.</p> <p></p> <p></p> <ul> <li>Sturdy steel frame ensures stable frame of canopy</li> <li>Adjustable the height of 6-9 FT freely</li> <li>Pop-up design for easy installation with central hub system</li> <li>Stakes  rope and sandbag add additional stability of canopy</li> <li>Equipped with a wheeled bag for easy carrying and transport</li> <li>Side pocket of wheeled bag for storing some small accessories</li> <li>Rotatable feet for applying for uneven ground</li> <li>Drain hole on the top of the canopy</li> <li>Enough shade for you to have outdoor activities</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Simple One-Person Setup:</strong> Featuring a unique one-hand center lock system  this canopy tent is easy and effortless to secure or release the trusses  without the hassle of locking and unlocking the canopy leg sliders. There is no need for tools or extra help.<br>● <strong>Advanced Sun Defence:</strong> Crafted of premium 210D oxford fabric with silver coating  this pop up canopy offers UPF50+ sun protection  blocking 99% of harmful sunlight. Plus  its vented top creates superior airflow  ensuring comfort  shade  and peace of mind for sun-drenched outdoor days.<br>● <strong>Travel With Ease:</strong> This outdoor party tent stores perfectly in its rugged wheeled travel bag  complete with a reinforced handle. It easily fits most car trunks  and neatly organizes all included anchoring accessories - perfect for family outings  festivals  tailgates  markets  and more.<br>● <strong>Stable & Reliable Structure:</strong> Built around a heavy-duty truss connection  the frame of this beach tent offers robust support. Each corner is anchored using 4 sandbags  8 ground stakes  and 4 wind ropes. Your reliable structure for every backyard BBQ  beach trip  or country fair.<br>● <strong>Spacious 100 Sq.Ft Shade:</strong> Experience generous coverage with the straight-leg design of this 10 x 10 ft pop up canopy tent easily shading 10-12 people. Choose from 3 quick-adjust heights (8.2/8.5/8.8 ft) with pinch-free buttons  for versatile comfort wherever you set up.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Steel  Fabric</li> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Overall dimension: 10'L x 10'W x 9'H</li> <li>Dimension of sandbag: 47''L x 42''W</li> <li>Weight of canopy: 33.5 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Folding canopy</li> <li>1 x Wheeled bag</li> <li>8 x Stakes</li> <li>4 x Sandbags</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Canopies,,Overall dimension:10'L x 10'W x 9'H; Dimension of sandbag:47''L x 42''W; ,Canopies,Drop Price,,White,OP70300WH,shopify,515,1,deny,manual,84,119,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_x_10_Feet