4-wheel-rolling-garden-cart-work-seat-green,4-Wheel Rolling Garden Cart Work Seat-Green,93085162,https://www.costway.com/4-wheel-rolling-garden-cart-work-seat.html?piid=9210300&fee=152&fep=15553&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Sturdy frame with large weight capacity for people of all shapes and sizes<br />● Well painted to prevent rust for long-lasting performance<br />● Ergonomic and large seat for sitting comfortably<br />● Height adjustable and 360 degrees of rotation<br />● Four large wheels are inflated rubber tires that will grip the ground safely<br />● Tool tray under the seat can be used to store your tools<br />● The basket on the back is convenient to store your drinks  foods  etc.<br />● Convenient to assemble or disassemble</p> <a href="https://cdn1.costway.com/media/us/Install_video/93085162.mp4" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline;font-weight: bolder;color:#c82a2e;">Installation guide</a><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Sturdy and Durable Construction</strong>: Made of premium powder coated steel frame  heavy duty seat and steel axles  the garden cart is sturdy and durable enough to ensure a large bearing capacity up to 330 lbs. Besides  the rolling cart can withstand long hours of outdoor work.</li> <li><strong>Built-in Large Storage Space</strong>: Equipped with a tool tray under the seat  you can store some tools on demand for getting at any time without turn-back your body. And a removable mesh basket on the back can well store your tools  watering can and gloves. It is convenient to do your gardening in one go.</li> <li><strong>Portable Design with 4 Rubber Tires</strong>: The garden cart has 4 inflated rubber tires which have deep patterns on surface to prevent slipping or tipping over on wet floor. And the diameter of each tire is 10" so that it can increase the contact area with the ground and add additional stability for safe moving.</li> <li><strong>Humanized Seat for Comfort Garden</strong>: The shape of seat has an ergonomic design which can fit properly to your body and seat of our garden cart can be rotated 360 degrees. The height of seat can be adjusted so that you don't need to crouch down or bend over  relieving pressure on your back and legs.</li> <li><strong>Multifunctional Use & Drag Rod</strong>: Because of the practical design  the cart can be used in your garden to water the flowers or you can repair your car with the cart. Coming with a drag rod in the front of the cart  you can conveniently move the garden cart by pulling it with a rope. Overall dimension: 34" x 18" x (19"-21") (L x W x H)  max weight capacity: 330 lbs.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Steel  rubber  plastic</li> <li>Color: Green</li> <li>Overall dimension: 34" x 18" x (19"-21") (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of basket: 9" x 4.5" x 7.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Diameter of wheel: 10"</li> <li>Net weight: 31.5 lbs</li> <li>Max weight capacity: 330 lbs</li> <li>Box QTY:1</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>1 x Garden cart</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Garden > Garden Tools > Garden Carts,,Overall dimension:34" x 18" x (19"-21") (L x W x H); Dimension of basket:9" x 4.5" x 7.5" (L x W x H); Diameter of wheel:10"; ,Garden Carts,Clearance,,Green,GT3450,shopify,37,1,deny,manual,84.99,84.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/GT3450/4_Wheel_Rolling_Garden_Cart_Work_Seat-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/GT3450/4_Wheel_Rolling_Garden_Cart_Work_Seat-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/GT3450/4_Wheel_Rolling_Garden_Cart_Work_Seat-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/g/GT3450/4_Whee