3-in-1-kids-basketball-hoop-set-stand,3-in-1 Kids Basketball Hoop Set Stand,75890123,https://www.costway.com/3-in-1-kids-basketball-hoop-set-stand.html?fee=152&fep=15557&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The kids basketball hoop set n<span class="tlid-translation translation" lang="en">ot only helps the child to exercise  but also enhances his ability to think and improve family relationships.</span></p> <p><span> </span></p> <p><span>This kids basketball hoop set is made of high-quality HDPE  PP and PVC  which is non-toxic and tasteless. With the instructions  the set can be easily installed in a short time. The lovely appearance of frog can make kids fall in love with it immediately. There are 3 kinds of activities of this toy  including basketball  football and baseball  which give children more sport options. The kids 3-in-1 sports set can not only make children love sports  but also allow kids to learn to cooperate with friends in the playing. This is the best gift for your kids! </span><br /><br /></p> <p> </p> <p>Are you still looking for kids basketball hoop set for your child? The kids basketball hoop set stand will be your best choice. </p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of non-toxic and odor-free HDPE  PP and PVC materials</li> <li>ASTM certification ensure your kids’ safety</li> <li>Sleek surface protects baby's delicate skin</li> <li>6 adjustable height levels to accompany kids’ growth</li> <li>3 kinds of activities including basketball  football and baseball</li> <li>Enhances the kids’ coordination ability and motor skills</li> <li>The cute shape of the frog to attract the child's attention</li> <li>You can fill the base with sand or water to enhance stability without shaking</li> <li>The toy set is suitable for kids aged 3 to 8 years old</li> <li>Waterproof surface for easily cleaning and maintaining</li> <li>Easy to assemble with the instruction</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Safe Material & Stable Base</strong>: With the high-quality HDPE  PP and PVC materials  this kids basketball hoop stand set is non-toxic and odorless  which is safe and durable. In addition  the base can be added with water or sand to provide greater stability for children.</li> <li><strong>3-in-1 Sports Center</strong>: There are 3 activities of this basketball set stand  including basketball  football and baseball  which gives kids a variety of sports options. Moreover  this basketball hoop allows your kids to play with their family and friends  which make them learn to cooperate.</li> <li><strong>Promote Kids's Motor Skills</strong>: With this kids 3-in-1 basketball hoop set  basketball enhances the kids' coordination ability  football exercises their leg ability  and baseball promotes their hand strength. This stand adopts a variety of sports modes to promote the motor skills and healthy growth of your kids.</li> <li><strong>6 Adjustable Height</strong>: This basketball hoop set can be adjusted in 6 levels according to the height of the kid. It is suitable for children aged 3-8 years old  which can accompany their growth all the way. In addition  this toy can be used both indoors and outdoors  which is the best gift for children.</li> <li><strong>Lovely Appearance & Easy to Clean</strong>: With the cute frog look and bright colors  this kids basketball hoop set stand can attract kids' attention immediately. The surface of this toy is waterproof  which is easy to clean and maintain. In addition  according to the detailed instructions  this toy set can be installed easily without any tools.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Pink  yellow  green</li> <li>Material: HDPE  PP  PVC</li> <li>Product size: 24" x 23" x 46.5"- 51" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 7.5lbs</li> <li>Suitable age: 3-8 Years Old</li> <li>Height range: 46.5"- 51"</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li>1 x Kids basketball hoop set</li> <li>1 x Baseball bat</li> <li>1 x Baseball</li> <li>1 x Basketball</li> <li>1 x Football</li> <li>1 x User’s manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Outdoor Play > Toy Sports,,Product size:24" x 23" x 46.5"- 51" (L x W x H); ,Toy Sports,Clearance,,Multicolor,TY327457,shopify,97,1,deny,manual,45.99,45.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY327457/3in1_Kids_Basketball_Hoop_Set_Stand-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY327457/3in1_Kids_Basketball_Hoop_Set_Stand-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY327457/3in1_Kids_Basketball_Hoop_Set_Stand-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY327457/3in1_Kids_Basketball_Hoop_Set_Stand-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY327457/3in1_Kids_Basketball_Hoop_Set_Stand_size-5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY327457/3in1_Kids_Basketball_Hoop_Set_Stand-6.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY327457/3in1_Kids_Basketball_Hoop_Set_Stand-7.jpg,7
2-pieces-patio-rattan-folding-reclining-chair,2 Pieces Patio Rattan Folding Reclining Chair,43580167,https://www.costway.com/2-pieces-patio-rattan-folding-reclining-chair.html?fee=152&fep=15558&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This folding rattan chair is perfect for indoor or outdoor leisure time with your family or friends in backyard  garden  poolside and more.</p> <p> </p> <p>Made of high-standard steel frame with powder-coated finish  this chair has high stability and strong durability. The premium PE rattan material is durable enough to support large weight capacity. What‘s more  the backrest can be adjusted according to your different needs. Coming with the foldable design  the patio chair set can be easily stored without taking too much space. At the same time  the lightweight chairs can be put in the trunk for travel. Modern and concise style can well match with different kinds of furniture in your patio.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking such ratten chair  don't hesitate to buy it!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>5 adjustable positions meet you're a variety of needs</li> <li>Durable and weather-resistant PE rattan provides a long service life</li> <li>Heavy duty steel frame in triangular structure for large load-bearing capacity</li> <li>One-step forming rattan surface for cozy sitting experience</li> <li>The backrest and widened armrest have an ergonomic curve for well support</li> <li>Foldable & portable design for easy storage and transportation</li> <li>Anti-slip mats at bottom strengthen the stability of the chairs</li> <li>Ideal for patio  backyard  bars  cafes and garden</li> <li>Perfect for family gathering  party and outdoor camping</li> <li>No assembly required and easy to clean</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Solid and Durable Material:</strong> Made of a high-standard steel frame  this chair ensures strong stability and large bearing capacity. And the PE wicker is durable and weather resistant  which is not easy to be damaged and can be used for a long time. What's more  the protruding screws are wrapped in the protective cap that won't scratch your skin.<br />● <strong>5-Level Adjustable Reclining:</strong> This outdoor chair has 5 adjustable backrest positions  allowing you to choose ideal positions from sitting up to reclining. Lifting the armrest and securing to the position which is most comfortable for your back  you can totally slow down and enjoy your leisure time.<br />● <strong>Foldable and Compact Design:</strong> Adopting the foldable design  you can put the patio chairs in a folded frame to avoid occupying the space available on the site. What's more  this lightweight chair with a foldable design makes it convenient for you to carry and move. When you need chairs for outdoor activities  this chair set is a great choice for you.<br />● <strong>Ultra Comfortable Sitting:</strong> The widened armrest of this rattan chair can support and rest your hands to relieve the pressure. A high backrest has an ergonomic curve  helping your head and body to be comfortably placed in this well-designed chair. Besides  the one-step forming rattan surface has great breathability which will not let you feel stuffy even in the hot weather.<br />● <strong>Ideal for Various Places:</strong> Featuring with a stylish and simple design  this rattan chair set can fit well with various kinds of furniture. The outdoor folding chair is perfect for any indoor and outdoor use such as cafes  bars  garden  patio  porch and poolside. Pair this chair set with a rattan table  this furniture set will be the highlight of your patio.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Rattan color: brown</li> <li>Steel color: black</li> <li>Material: Steel  rattan</li> <li>Overall dimension: 28" x 23" x 33.5"- 44" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Distance from armrest to Floor: 27.5"</li> <li>Distance from seat to floor: 17.5"</li> <li>Folding dimension: 35.5" x 21.5" x 5.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight of each chair: 17 lbs</li> <li>Max weight capacity: 250 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li>2 x Rattan folding chairs</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Patio Dining Chairs,,Overall dimension:28" x 23" x 33.5"- 44" (L x W x H); Folding dimension:35.5" x 21.5" x 5.5" (L x W x H); ,Patio Dining Chairs,Drop Price,,Brown,HW64363-2,shopify,48,1,deny,manual,139.99,139.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_310_48.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_307_47.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw64363-2.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_314_45.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_283_45.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_313_48.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_299_47.jpg,7
2pcs-folding-patio-lounger-chair,2Pcs Folding Patio Lounger Chair,80594127,https://www.costway.com/2-pieces-folding-patio-lounger-chair.html?piid=9210200&fee=152&fep=15561&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The folding lounge chair is crafted with heavy-duty steel and premium wicker  which provides you with satisfactory load-bearing capacity and stability.</p> <p> </p> <p>Tightly hand-woven wicker and two-color cushion add unique charm to your outdoor space. The frame of chaise chair is stable after unfolding and fixing by hasps. And the lounge chair can be quickly folded when not in use for easy storage. It is convenient to carry the chaise chair to different places. Moreover  the maintenance is much easier with removable cover. It’s a perfect combination of practicality and aesthetics  which suits for various occasions like poolside  patio  porch and seaside as well.</p> <p> </p> <p>Are you looking for comfortable lounge chair for sun bathing? Don’t hesitate to buy it!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Premium wicker and heavy-duty steel adds sturdiness of frame</li> <li>Easy to store and carry with folding design</li> <li>A hook can be used to fix the chaise lounge chair after folding.</li> <li>Two sets of hasp and staple ensure the stability of chaise lounge</li> <li>Choose favorite color of red or beige with reversible cushion</li> <li>Pads at the bottom of chaise lounge prevent slipping</li> <li>S-shape of chair provides a comfortable support to your back</li> <li>Suitable to be placed in patio  garden  poolside and beach</li> <li>No need to assemble after receiving the lounge chair</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Foldable & Convenient Design</strong>: The wicker chaise is easy to be folded with lockable design on the side. The smart folding design ensures that you can store the chaise in corner without taking up too much space. In addition  the chaise is convenient to carry and transport with a handle.</li> <li><strong>Steel Frame with Exquisite Wicker</strong>: Made of heavy-duty steel  the frame of chaise lounge is solid enough to hold up to 400 lbs for one lounge chair. Wrapped with tight and exquisite PE wicker  the folding lounge can withstand the fluctuating weather and provides a comfortable zone to relax.</li> <li><strong>Ergonomic Seat with Reversible Cushion</strong>: Designed with S-shape  this pair of chaise loungers is close to human body shape. Plus  the lounge comes with soft and high-resilience cushion which enhances comfortable seating experience. In addition  you can use the cushion with double sides freely. And it is better to take cushihon inside in rainy days.</li> <li><strong>Modern Design for Various Scenes</strong>: This pair of chaise loungers is designed in natural and concise style. They will match your other outdoor furniture perfectly and are ideal for your patio  porch  poolside and garden to relax yourself in the sun or shade.</li> <li><strong>No Assembly Required</strong>: The set of lounge chair is pre-installed when you receive the package. Just unfold them and fix hasp to get stable lounge chairs. It is better to place beige side up of cushion to prevent colorfast for long time use. Overall dimensions: 81"(L) x 23.5"(W) x 20"(H). Dimensions after folding: 42"(L) x 23.5"(W). Weight capacity: 400 lbs.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color of rattan: Brown</li> <li>Material: PE  rattan  steel</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 81" x 23.5" x 20"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimensions after folding: 42" x 23.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Product weight: 49 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of each chair: 400 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>2 × Folding chaise lounge</li> <li>2 × Cushion</li> <li>1 × Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Outdoor Chaise Lounges,,Overall dimensions:81" x 23.5" x 20"(L x W x H); Dimensions after folding:42" x 23.5" (L 