 So there is no need to worry about the safety of the rectangle table.</li> <li><strong>Superior Design for Children:</strong> The rectangle table is specially designed for children because it has a height suitable for them. The design of this table is ergonomic and is specially prepared for children aged 3-8 years old so that they can use this table comfortably.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Clean & Assemble:</strong> The surface of this product is waterproof  which can achieve the purpose of easy cleaning. You can easily remove stains just by dabbing with a wet towel. In addition  this rectangle table is easy to install and have sufficient parts  which can be assembled quickly even by one person.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Carry & Storage:</strong> This rectangular table is made of HDPE  which is lightweight enough for you to take it to everywhere easily. Moreover  this table only covers a small area after disassembling  so it can be easily stored in any corner of the home without worrying about occupying too much space.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Red</li> <li>Material: HDPE + steel</li> <li>Table size: 47" x 23.5" x 19.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Table net weight: 20 lbs</li> <li>Table weight capacity: 220 lbs</li> <li>Suitable age: 3-8 Years old</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li>1 x Rectangle Table</li> <li>1 x Table user's manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Toddler & Kids Furniture > Kids Table & Chair Sets,,Table size:47" x 23.5" x 19.5" (L x W x H); ,Kids Table & Chair Sets,,,Red,HW64567RE,shopify,50,1,deny,manual,99.99,99.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_337_8.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_339_9.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_343_8.jpg,3,https:/