21-feet-aluminum-pool-cover-reel-set,22 Ft Pool Cover Reel Set Aluminum In-ground Swimming Solar Cover Reel,75860124,https://www.costway.com/21-feet-aluminum-pool-cover-reel-set.html?fee=152&fep=15661&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p><span>● Length adjustable to fit different sizes of pool</span><br /><span>● Suitable for 2.5 feet to 22 feet wide in-ground swimming pools</span><br /><span>● Made of rustproof aluminum tubes and stainless steel brackets</span><br /><span>● Effortless to roll or unroll the cover with a wheel and a hand crank</span><br /><span>● Package includes 8 straps with fixing clamps for the cover</span><br /><span>● Strong hook and loop fasteners for strap attachment</span><br /><span>● High stability with non-slip foot pads</span><br /><span>● Easy to move with a lifting handle and 2 wheels</span><br /><span>● Delivered in two boxes and may arrive separately</span></p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Make Your Life Easier：</strong> The elevated design makes this pool cover roller works better than normal ones that sit on the ground. It is a great helper while using the pool solar cover  which helps to reduce water evaporation and keep the water warm during the swimming season. Covering your pool can also keep debris from falling in and maintain its cleanliness.<br /><strong>● Fit All Shape Pools：</strong> This pool cover reel fits all shapes in-ground swimming pools within 18 ft width. It is suitable for rectangular pools  and also can work with kidney shaped  bean shaped  Oyster shaped or odd shaped pools. You simply need to cut the cover to fit the pool  and the package includes 8 straps with clamps to attach the cover.<br />● <strong>Adjustable Length：</strong> The solar cover reel is suitable for 4 ft to 18 ft wide inground swimming pools. You can install 1-3 sections of lockable and telescopic aluminum tubes according to the width of your pool. The 3-section grooved design of aluminum tubes makes this pool solar blanket roller not easy to droop after a long time of use. <br /><strong>● Sturdy and Durable Construction：</strong> Made of aluminum tubes and stainless steel brackets  this pool solar cover holder is rustproof  weather resistant and easy to maintain. The sturdy tires boast more durability and stability compared to plastic wheels.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble and Use：</strong> The assembly is easy with included instructions. With a hand crank on the wheel  the operation of rolling and unrolling the pool cover is smooth. Please remember to lock the fastening bolt to prevent rotation when the cover is rolled. The movement is effortless with a convenient lifting handle and 2 wheels</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><span>Color: Black + Silver</span></li> <li>Material: Aluminum + Stainless Steel</li> <li><span>Product Dimension: 23" x 24.5" (W x H)</span></li> <li>Adjustable Tube Length of Aluminum Tubes: 5.5-25.5 ft</li> <li><span>Weight Capacity: 132 lbs</span></li> <li>Recommended Thickness of Pool Cover: 8 mil</li> <li><span>Net Weight: 23 lbs</span></li> <li>Box Qty: 2(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Swimming Pools,,Product Dimension:23" x 24.5" (W x H); ,Swimming Pools,Drop Price,,Silver,BA7582+,shopify,49,1,deny,manual,169.99,169.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BA7582+/22_Ft_Pool_Cover_Reel_Set_Aluminum_In-ground_Swimming_Solar_Cover_Reel-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BA7582+/22_Ft_Pool_Cover_Reel_Set_Aluminum_In-ground_Swimming_Solar_Cover_Reel-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BA7582+/22_Ft_Pool_Cover_Reel_Set_Aluminum_In-ground_Swimming_Solar_Cover_Reel-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/BA7582+/22