saucer-tree-swing-surf-kids-outdoor-adjustable-swing-set,Saucer Tree Swing Surf Kids Outdoor Adjustable Swing Set,20196435,https://www.costway.com/saucer-tree-swing-surf-kids-outdoor-adjustable-oval-platform-set-with-handle.html?piid=9212000&fee=152&fep=15681&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Made of metal frame and oxford cloth  our surfing swing is weather resistant and durable. The height can be adjusted from 39" to 63".</p> <p> </p> <p>In addition  the adjustable handles work for users of any height and offer additional safe guarantee. The grid design in the middle and foam cushion around are comfortable to sit. Besides  our surf swing can be hang up both indoors and outdoors such as branch  patio and garden. Undoubtedly  it is an ideal for gift for your family.This surf swing is perfect for both kids and adults.</p> <p> </p> <p>If your looking for this product  don't hesitate to place an order.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of 600D oxford fabric for better durability</li> <li>PE rope and metal frame to have 333 lbs weight capacity</li> <li>Comes with foam handles for better security</li> <li>Adjustable height to meet various needs</li> <li>Suitable for both kids and adults</li> <li>Grid design in the middle is elastic and soft</li> <li>Foam padding for protection and comfort</li> <li>Wide applications for patio  garden or indoor etc.</li> <li>Easy to install  disassemble and store  saving you time and effort</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Oval Platform and Adjustable Height</strong>: Kids don't have to scramble for a try. Large oval platform (48" x 18") provides enough space for multiple kids sharing and playing together. The height can range from 39" to 63"  providing free adjustment under different conditions.<br /><strong>● Considerate Design</strong>: Foam handles on both sides allow you to keep balance with a better and safer grip. Grid design in the middle is elastic  soft and permeable to air  which helps you get rid of sultriness. Surrounding foam padding brings great protection and comfort.<br /><strong>● Durable and Sturdy Construction</strong>: This tree swing is built to last. The frame is composed of PE ropes and metal tubes  which is firm enough to take the weight of 333lbs. 600D oxford fabric is weather resistant and tear resistant to serve for a quite long time.<br /><strong>● A Perfect Gift</strong>: The surf swing is a great gift for your kids to stay away from electronic products and embrace the nature. It's also perfect for adults to enjoy leisure time. It can be installed in various places  such as backyards  playgrounds  and also indoor play areas  etc.<br /><strong>● Detachable and Easy to Assemble</strong>: The platform can be split into 4 tubes to be carried anywhere conveniently. With detailed instruction  it takes you just a few minutes to assemble the surf swing effortless. Besides  we offer a wrench for easy assembly.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As picture show</li> <li>Material: PP + PE + metal + EPE foam + Oxford fabric</li> <li>Net weight: About 8 lbs</li> <li>Maximum weight capacity: 333 lbs</li> <li>Overall size: 48" x 18" (L x W)</li> <li>Height range: 39"- 63"</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Surf swing</li> <li>1 x Wrench</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Outdoor Play > Swing & Playsets,,Overall size:48" x 18" (L x W); ,Swing & Playsets,,,Camouflage,OP70325AG,shopify,18,1,deny,manual,55.99,98.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_530_68.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_557_80.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/a/saucer_tree_swing.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9