otect children's health.<br /><strong>● 2-in-1 Climbing Triangle Ladder:</strong> The triangle ladder comes with a ladder that can be tilted as needed to climb and slide. It can not only strengthen children's motor skills and balance control but also help children to improve their courage. This is the perfect toy to accompany your baby to grow up!<br /><strong>● Stable Triangular Structure:</strong> With a triangular structure and metal connections  this climbing triangle ladder provides a solid foundation to prevent collapse to the greatest extent. It is strong enough and has a high bearing capacity of 132 lbs  which is suitable for kids aged 6 months to 6 years.<br /><strong>● Foldable Design and Easy to Clean:</strong> This climbing triangle with a foldable design can be easily reduced in size for storage and movement without taking up too much space. In addition  the smooth and waterproof surface makes it easy to clean and maintain with a wet cloth.<br /><strong>● Exquisite Workmanship and Safety Guarantee:</strong> Triangle climber has excellent workmanship and perfect details  making every corner smooth and free of burrs to prevent kids from being injured. In addition  it has passed ASTM certification to ensure the safety of kids.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Multicolor</li> <li>Material: Wood</li> <li>Product size: 48" x 28" x 43.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Climbing ramp size: 47" X 14" (L x W)</li> <li>Folding size: 28" x 7.5" x 47" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 35 lbs</li> <li>Bearing capacity: 132 lbs</li> <li>Applicable age: 6 Months - 6 years old</li> <li>Certification: ASTM</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li>1 x Climbing triangle</li> <li>1 x Ladder</li> <li>1 x User's manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Indoor Play > Climbers & Slides,,Product size:48" x 28" x 43.5" (L x W x H); Climbing ramp size:47" X 14" (L x W); Folding size:28" x 7.5" x 47" (L x W x H); ,Climbers & Slides,Clearance