s are connected by horizontal posts  which enhance its stability and durability. With the maximum load capacity of 132 lbs ( table ) and 220 lbs ( chair ) respectively  this bar table set promises you a long service life.<br /><strong>Effortless Assembly and Maintenance</strong>: To make the assembly of this bar set as effortless as possible  we have included quite clear and detailed instructions  numbered parts  and all necessary tools in the package  so it is easy to assemble.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As picture shows</li> <li>Material: Steel  engineered wood</li> <li>Net weight: 64 lbs</li> <li>Bearing of the table: 132 lbs</li> <li>Bearing of the chair: 220 lbs</li> <li>Table size: 36" x  19" x 36" ( L x W x H ).</li> <li>Chair size: 13.5" x 13.5" x 27.5" ( L x W x H ).</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Bar table</li> <li>2 x Bar chair</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Kitchen & Dining > Dining Room Sets,,Table size:36" x  19" x 36" ( L x W x H ).; Chair size:13.5" x 13.5" x 27.5" ( L x W x H ).; ,Dining Room Sets,Clearance,,Brown,HW64298BN,shopify,168,1,deny,manual,124.99,124.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_pieces_bar_table_set_with_storage_brown-2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_pieces_bar_table_set_with_storage_brown-1.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_pieces_bar_table_set_with_storage_brown-4.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_pieces_bar_table_set_with_storage_brown-3.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_pieces_bar_table_set_with_storage_brown_size-5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media