ck & Washable Cushion:</strong> Equipped with thick and high resilience cushions for seat and back  the furniture set will provide the ultimate comfort and make you totally relax. What's more  the cover with hidden zipper is easy to take off and rinse by your hand or machine.</li> <li><strong>Ergonomic & Multipurpose Design:</strong> The back of the chair is slightly sloping  which fits your curve of body perfectly. And the overall appearance is designed in concise and modern style. Not only can the set be a décor but also it is practical for many outdoor or indoor spaces including living room  garden  yard  patio  porch.</li> <li><strong>Sectional Set with Easy Installation Steps:</strong> The chair and coffee table can be combined in various ways or be used separately according to your different needs. And you will have a good time with your friends or guests. According to the instruction  it is convenient to assemble the set with required accessories.</li> <li><strong>Overall Dimension:</strong> The dimension of every piece is as follows. Single Chair: 24" x 27" x 34"(L x W x H)  hold up to 360 lbs capacity. Coffee Table: 18" x 18" x 19"(L x W x H)  hold up to 220 lbs capacity. Please refer to product images for details.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Acacia wood  polyester fabric  sponge</li> <li>Dimension of chair: 24" x 27" x 34"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of table: 18" x 18" x 19"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Height of seat: 16"(include cushion)</li> <li>Weight of the set: 51 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of chair: 360 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 220 lbs</li> <li>Package Include:</li> <li>2 x Chair</li> <li>1 x Table</li> <li>2 x Seat Cushion</li> <li>2 x Back Cushion</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Dimension of chair:24" x 27" x 34"(L x W x H); Dimension of table:18" x 18" x 19"(L x W x H); 