aver</strong>: Innovative high foot design takes almost no additional ground space. This bathroom organizer cleverly utilizes the vertical space to store bathroom supplies  saving a lot of space for other uses. It is an ideal storage unit for small apartment  dorm  etc.</li> <li><strong>Ample Storage Space and Adjustable Bottom Bar</strong>: Featuring 3-tire shelves with high fence  this toilet rack provides spacious storage room while ensuring that items are not easy to drop. Besides  the bottom bar can be adjusted  which allows you to assemble it just over the toilet no matter if there's a pipe in the back.</li> <li><strong>Fine Craftsmanship</strong>: Constructed of sturdy metal frame and premium engineered wood  this toilet shelf is stable and not easy to deform. And after refined treatment  the surface is rust-resistant and durable for a long serving time. It is equipped with non-slip foot pads to protect the floor from scratches.</li> <li><strong>Convenient Versatility</strong>: The bottom space of this freestanding bathroom shelf is wide enough to accommodate most toilets and washing machines. Thanks to its minimalist contour and elegant style  it can be well integrated into any decor. It is widely used in bathroom  balcony  and laundry room.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble & Clean</strong>: This bath storage rack comes with a clear and brief instruction  which has straight forward illustrations and descriptions. Each screw and pin has its own code to take you little time and energy. And its smooth surface is waterproof for easy cleaning with a damp cloth.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As picture shows</li> <li>Material: Iron + Engineered wood</li> <li>Product dimension: 24" x 9" x 66" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity of each shelf: 22 lbs</li> <li>Net weight: 21.5 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Toilet rack</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Bath > Over the Toilet St