3-in-1-convertible-wooden-high-chair-with-cushion-pink,3-in-1 Convertible Wooden High Chair with Cushion-Pink,02951647,https://www.costway.com/3-in-1-convertible-wooden-high-chair-with-cushion.html?piid=9229300&fee=152&fep=15760&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<ul> <li>● Made of food-grade PP and pe  non-toxic and odorless</li> <li>● Meet different growth needs with 3 in 1 convertible design</li> <li>● With adjustable and detachable tray for easy cleaning</li> <li>● Keep baby safe in place with a 5-point harness</li> <li>● With a pu safety baffle and a free astm-tested wooden baffle for extra security</li> <li>● Removable pu cushion  soft and comfortable</li> <li>● Solid beech and stable structure ensure excellent load bearing</li> <li>● Legs with foot-pads effectively prevent skidding and avoid scratching the floor</li> <li>● Rounded corners effectively prevent your baby from being injured</li> <li>● Easy to assemble with detailed instructions and all hardware delivered</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 3-in-1 Convertible High Chair:</strong> By simply adjusting the legs and tray  this modern high chair can be converted into a baby feeding chair  a toddler seat with guardrail or an ordinary stool chair to meet the different growing needs of children from six months to six years old.<br /><strong>● 3-stage Adjustable and Detachable Tray:</strong> The removable tray makes cleaning a breeze. What you need to do is simply unlatch the convenient plate and move it to the sink for a thorough rinse. And three adjustable positions can provide more space for fast-growing children.<br /><strong>● Safe and Durable Materials:</strong> Made of food-grade PP and PE  this high chair is non-toxic and odorless. The legs are made of high-quality beech wood  which is sturdy and durable with good pressure resistance. Soft PU cushion and baffle provide a comfortable sitting experience for the baby.<br /><strong>● Stable and Sturdy Struc