<br /><strong>● Solid Wood Material for Durable Use:</strong> Constructed of carefully selected natural paulownia wood  this room divider has a sturdy solid wood frame to ensure long-term service. Exquisite workmanship makes it wear-resistant and will not deform easily. Besides  the louver slat design allows light and air to pass through  which also contributes to durability.<br /><strong>● Foldable and Flexible Hinged Panels:</strong> This room divider consists of 4 louver panels  and the same sides allow you to always see the attractive front of the screen. In addition  six rustproof hinges ensure that the panel can be easily rotated and folded to flexibly accommodate any size of the room. The compact size after folding is very convenient for storage.<br /><strong>● Versatile Design for Wide Use:</strong> In addition to providing privacy for your bedroom or office as a partition  this screen can also be placed beside the window to block out sunlight when it is strong. Of course  a background wall decoration is also a good choice. The lightweight and portable design facilitate your movement and relocation.<br /><strong>● Natural and Retro Appearance:</strong> Retro style and simple appearance are not only excellent partition solutions but also perfect decorations so that your home can easily attract people's attention. In addition  the brown appearance made entirely of wood is very stain resistant and the smooth surface is easy to clean and maintain.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Natural</li> <li>Material: Paulownia and MDF</li> <li>Max extends size: 63.5" x 1" x 68" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Foldable size: 16" x 3.5" x 68" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Blackboard size: 29" x 12.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Product weight: 19 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Room divider</li> </ul>,Costway,Decor > Decorative Accessories > Room Dividers,,Max extends size:63.5" x 1" x 68" (L x W x H); Foldable size:16" x 3.5" x 68" (L x 