patio-convertible-solid-wood-sofa-with-cushion,Patio Convertible Solid Wood Sofa with Cushion,06583124,https://www.costway.com/adjustable-patio-convertible-sofa-with-thick-cushion.html?piid=9224700&fee=152&fep=15806&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Solid acacia wood frame provides stability and high bearing capacity<br />● Polyester cover is durable enough for long lifespan<br />● Easy to convert from a loveseat to a bed or chaise lounge with turndown armrests<br />● Soft pillow and cushion provide an extra comfortable sitting experience<br />● Cover of pillow is equipped with zipper for easy removing and cleaning<br />● Modern and stylish style easily match with a variety of styles of furniture<br />● Perfect for the poolside  patio  garden  bedroom  living room and more<br />● Easy to assemble with the hardware and instructions</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Sturdy and Durable Structure:</strong> This patio daybed is made of natural acacia wood with FSC certification  which is solid and moisture-resistant. With the stable wood construction  durable polyester cushion and pillows  this daybed boasts large bearing capacity and strong durability for long-lasting use.<br /><strong>● 3 Adjustable Positions:</strong> This daybed features three different adjustable positions to act as three furniture pieces in one. Both armrests can be independently adjusted up or down to transform it to a loveseat  a bed or even a chaise lounger  which can adequately meet your seating or sleeping needs.<br /><strong>●Removable Cushion and Pillow Covers:</strong> The 2" thick cushion is soft and attached with ropes for fixation and easy removing. And the 5" thick polyester pillows with zippers is easy to remove for easy cleaning and maintenance. With seat cushion and 2 large pillows  this daybed can give you a great relaxation.<br /><strong>● Modern Design and Widely Use:</strong> With the simple and stylish style  the daybed can harmoniously match with a variety of styles of furniture. This convertible sofa daybed also adds the sense of fashion to your room. This daybed is widely used in outdoors & indoors such as porch  courtyard  poolside  bedroom  living room  etc.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble and Dimensions:</strong> All the accessories and parts are included  which is easy for you to assemble the convertible sofa daybed. Just follow the instructions and then you can complete the assembly in a short time. Overall dimension of the daybed: 78" (L) x 29.5" (W) x 29.5" (H). Folded Size: 62" (L) x 29.5" (W) x 29.5" (H).</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color of cushion: Dark gray</li> <li>Material: Acacia wood  polyester  sponge</li> <li>Overall size: 78" x 29.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Sofa size: 62" x 29.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Height of seat: 12"</li> <li>Net weight: 46 lbs</li> <li>Max weight capacity: 700 lbs</li> <li> </li> <li>Box QTY: 2(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li> </li> <li>1 x Sofa daybed</li> <li>2 x Seat cushion</li> <li>4 x Back cushion</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Outdoor Benches,,Overall size:78" x 29.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H); Sofa size:62" x 29.5" x 29.5" (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Benches,Clearance,,Gray,OP70607BGR+,shopify,30,0,deny,manual,249.99,249.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_343.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_324.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_313_6.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_320.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_289_6.jpg,5,h