6-drawer-tool-chest-with-heightening-cabinet-red,6-Drawer Tool Chest with Heightening Cabinet-Red,21539608,https://www.costway.com/6-drawers-tool-chest-with-heightening-cabinet.html?piid=9210200&fee=152&fep=15822&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>If you are looking for a tool chest to store your tools and free your workshop from messy environment  then the 3-in-1 large capacity tool chest will be a perfect choice.</p> <p> </p> <p>The upgraded tool chest is designed with a heightening cabinet  a unique design standing it out of other ones in market. Benefitting from such design  you can get your desired tools more conveniently. When you have to move the tool chest to repair machines in other places  then the smooth-rolling universal casters will help you. Considering that there must be some friction between tools and steel panel  it comes with liners at the bottom  so as to protect your tools. You are allowed to detach the top box as well and carry it with the swiveling handles. Besides  locking system ensures great security for your valuable tools. What matters most is the high quality cold-rolled steel and powder-coated frosted surface  showing great performance in sturdiness and rust resistance.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for such product  don't hesitate to buy it.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Upgraded with a heightening cabinet  help you store and get tools conveniently during working</li> <li>Consist of top box  heightening cabinet and bottom cabinet  provide ample storage space</li> <li>Different storage space  allow for classified tool storage according to the size of tools</li> <li>The top box  detachable  lockable and portable  multifunctional for your daily use</li> <li>Liner inside can protect tools from scratching and corrosion</li> <li>Premium cold-rolled steel  sturdy  solid and durable  for longer life span</li> <li>Stable structure  large capacity  hold as many tool as possible</li> <li>Frosted surface features superior metallic texture</li> <li>4 Universal casters and 2 of them are lockable  combine mobility with security</li> <li>Single-Sided handle enable you to control the rolling tool cart easily</li> <li>Ball-Bearing drawer slides  smooth slide doors  easy to open and close</li> <li>Removable hooks on sides enable you to hang some tools for an easy access</li> <li>Appropriate for workshop  garage and other occasions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 3 In 1 Design with Heightening Cabinet:</strong> Compared with previous tool chest  the upgraded one comes with a heightening cabinet  designed to help you store and get tools more conveniently. Such design is superior to other ordinary ones. It is a top box  heightening cabinet and bottom cabinet all in one  which provides ample tool storage space  while allowing you to classify tools thereby finding what you need quickly.<br /><strong>● Portable Top Box with Enhanced Security:</strong> The top box can be easily detached from heightening cabinet by unscrewing 4 screws  so that you can carry it anywhere you want. And the swiveling side handles make it extremely portable. It is worth mentioning that the keyed locking system is capable of prevent your valuable tools from being stolen.<br /><strong>● High Quality Steel and Frosted Surface:</strong> Exquisitely crafted with thickened cold-rolled steel  the tool chest features good sturdiness  not easy to dent or deform as well. Solid structure endows the tool box with higher load bearing capacity  so as to hold more tools. Plus  frosted surface combines aesthetic appearance with metallic texture  for better using experience.<br /><strong>● 360° Swivel Casters for Convenient Mobility:</strong> There are 4 universal casters  and 2 with brakes are lockable. In this way  you can not only move it from your garage to workshop without any effort  but also enable it to remain in a fixed position. Meanwhile  comfortable handle provides added convenience when you push the tool cart.<br /><strong>● Open the Drawers and Doors Smoothly:</strong> The tool chest adopts slide doors both in center heightening cabinet and bottom cabinet  and what you need to do is open them up and down. 6 Drawers are also easy to open thanks to smooth ball-bearing drawer slides equipped there. Furthermore  liner inside the drawer can protect tools and reduce noise if you move the box.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black / red</li> <li>Material: Steel</li> <li>Top box dimension: 20" x 10" x 13.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Bottom cabinet dimension: 23.5" x 13" x 26" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Overall dimension: 23.5" x 13" x 52" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Handle length: 12.5"</li> <li>Net weight: 60.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of Each Drawer: 22 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 200 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Storage & Garages > Garages,,Top box dimension:20" x 10" x 13.5" (L x W x H); Bottom cabinet dimension:23.5" x 13" x 26" (L x W x H); Overall dimension:23.5" x 13" x 52" (L x W x H); ,Garages,,,Red,TL35294RE,shopify,145,1,deny,manual,189.99,261.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/4/w4_20_1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/3/w3_19_1.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/1/w1_19_1.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/1/w11_11_3.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/2/w2_19_1.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/1/w12_6_1.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/w/5/w5_18_1.jpg,7
