iting games.<br /><strong>● Robust Construction:</strong> Built to last  this foosball table made of sturdy MDF features solid construction  ensuring it stands up to intense play. Whether scoring goals in foosball or striking in billiards  this table remains stable and reliable  providing hours of fun for family and friends.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Natural</li> <li>Material: MDF + PP + Metal</li> <li>Overall Dimension: 32" x 17" x 12" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net Weight: 21 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Game Room,,Overall Dimension:32" x 17" x 12" (L x W x H); ,Game Room,,,Brown,TY580385,shopify,90,1,deny,manual,85.99,110.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY580385/4in1_Combo_Game_Table_Set_Foosball_Billiards_Hockey_bn-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY580385/4in1_Combo_Game_Table_Set_Foosball_Billiards_Hockey_bn-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY580385/4in1_Combo_Game_Table_Set_Foosball_Billiards_Hockey_bn-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY580385/4in1_Combo_Game_Table_Set_Foosball_Billiards_Hockey_bn-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY580385/4in1_Combo_Game_Table_Set_Foosball_Billiards_Hockey_bn_size-5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY580385/4in1_Combo_Game_Table_Set_Foosball_Billiards_Hockey_bn-6.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/TY580385/4in1_Combo_Game_Table_Set_Foosball_Billiards_Hockey_bn-7.jpg,7
