 to assemble with detailed instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Sturdy Frame and Premium Rattan:</strong> Made of solid cross steel structure with anti-slip foot pads  each piece of this sofa set is super robust to hold up to 360 lbs. In addition  high-quality PE wicker offers high tensile strength and weather resistance  which is strong and durable to withstand all-weather variations for long-lasting use.<br /><strong>● Comfortable and Elegant Sofa Set:</strong> Featuring spacious seats  4" thick cushions and pillows filled with high-resilience sponge  the patio sofa set can provide great comfort for you. Besides  this simple yet modern wicker furniture set will add a sense of fashion to your outdoor space including poolside  patio  garden  balcony  etc. <br /><strong>● Waterproof and Easy to Clean:</strong> This patio conversation sofa set features waterproof PE wicker for easy wipe cleaning and maintenance. In addition  the zippered cushion covers are made of superior fabric cloth  which is durable and washable. You can simply zip off the cushion covers and give them a quick wash.<br /><strong>● Free and Flexible Combination:</strong> This 4-piece patio furniture comes with 2 corner sofas  1 armless sofa and 1 ottoman. The ottoman can serve as a coffee table after removing the cushion. Besides  each piece of this sofa set can be used separately and thanks to the lightweight design  it can be easily changed to different layouts based on your needs. <br /><strong>● Easy Assembly and Dimensions:</strong> Coming with all the necessary hardware and detailed instruction  it is easy to assemble the rattan sofa set. Corner sofa size: 29" x 29" x 25" (L x W x H); Armless sofa size: 29" x 25" x 25" (L x W x H); Ottoman size: 25" x 25" x 12.5" (L x W x H); Thickness of cushion: 4"; Weight capacity of each sofa: 360 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color of cushions: Red/turquoise/white</li> <li>Material: PE rattan  steel  spong