e with a regulator is included for the propane tank. But also functional as a convenient side table that goes well with modern outdoor furniture decor with its simple clean lines. Note: the tank is not included in the package.<br /><strong>● Safe and Warm Bonfire Party:</strong> Different from the traditional bonfire that produces large amounts of smoke and smog  this patio fire pit table is powered by propane fuel with a heat output- 50 000 BTU to provide stable and ample burning for a warm and romantic bonfire atmosphere. Passed ETL certification.<br /><strong>● Durable and Stable Craftsmanship:</strong> Made of sturdy and fire-retardant magnesium oxide  glass fibers  and stainless steel  this propane gas fire table set is built to last and effectively prevent cracking during a long-term fire. and a stainless steel burner bowl. Note: the lava rocks should not be more than 1/4 inch above the burner holes.<br /><strong>● Perfect Entertainment Area:</strong> Adopting the rustic and classic wood finish  a 48x27inch fire pit table provides a large enough surface to set your snack and drink and keep them warm as the evening lingers on. this outdoor propane gas fire pit set will be the centerpiece in your backyard  patio and balcony to conduct a private and warm conversation and enjoy meals while sitting around the fire.<br /><strong>● Easy to Use:</strong> Just install the AAA battery (included in the package) in the igniter  press it and simply turn the switch control to adjust flames that will be more real and safe with the radiation of the lava rocks to provide a pleasant ambiance. the waterproof cover will protect it from rain  snow  sun  dirt and crack in the cold after use.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Wood finish</li> <li>Material: Magnesium oxide  glass fibers  stainless steel</li> <li>Dimension of propane fire pit table: 48" x 27" x 13.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of tank hideaway holder: 16" x 16" x 21" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weigh