fied yarn-dyed fabric and heavy duty aluminum. It is equipped with high coefficient UV protection effect and sturdy anti rust umbrella bracket which is super durable and help maintain a long period using life.</li> <li><strong>360 Degree Pedal Rotation:</strong> The umbrella is designed with a feet pedal for 360 degree rotating the umbrella easily and effortless. It just needs to press the button by one foot and use your hands to control the angle as you need. And then  you can enjoy your time by yourself.</li> <li><strong>1 Button Control Umbrella:</strong> It is quite easy to open and close the umbrella by 1 button. After pressing the button  the umbrella will be opened or closed slowly and the opening and closing process will reduce the vibration effect as much as possible. More than that  the button can help clasp the pole tightly to add more stability.</li> <li><strong>Dual Vent & Injection Base:</strong> The umbrella has a dual vent which can help increase the air mobility for confronting various levels of wind and can stay stable. What's more  it has a convenient injection base for injecting sand  water or anything ease to keep the umbrella balance.</li> <li><strong>Large Shading Area for Wide Using:</strong> The umbrella has a large shading area for having an excellent shading effect all-round and ensuring no exposure under the sun. And the umbrella of fast-installing and easy-using functions can be widely used in garden  yard  background or other places.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Tan</li> <li>Material: powder-coated aluminum  polyester</li> <li>Umbrella diameter: 11 feet</li> <li>Net weight: 130 lbs</li> <li>Base weight: 220 lbs (fill with water)</li> <li>Base weight: 330 lbs (fill with sand and water)</li> <li>Box QTY: 2(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x outdoor offset umbrella</li> <li>1 x instruction manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Outdoor Umbrellas,,Umbrella diameter:11 feet; ,