d.) After use  it can be quickly deflated  then folded and stored in the carrying bag. ASTM Certificated. Warm tips: Please wait for the bouncer dry before rolling-up for storage.<br />●<strong> Safe Design and Sweet Accessories:</strong> The top of slide is surrounded by a comprehensive and breathable net to ensure the safety of kids while playing. It comes with a carrying bag  12 repair patches  a hose and 6 bouncer stakes for stability. It is suitable for both indoor and outdoor to play.<br /><strong>● Perfect Gift for Kids:</strong> The water park is spacious enough to accommodate 4 children from 4 to 12 years old to play. Kids can slide down the smooth slides  compete in the climbing wall and play in the splash pool with friends to release their athletic nature. They can learn to share while playing to enhance friendship.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Multicolor (As the picture shows)</li> <li>Material: Oxford cloth</li> <li>Overall dimension: 12.5' x 10.5' x 8' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Maximum weight capacity: 265 lbs</li> <li>Individual weight limit: 66 lbs</li> <li>Recommended age: 4-12 years old</li> <li>Maximum number of kids: 4</li> <li>Net weight: 32.5 lbs</li> <li>Recommend blower: <a href="https://www.costway.com/735-w-1-0-hp-air-blower-pump-fan-for-inflatable-bounce-house.html" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bolder; color: #c82a2e;">780W Blower</a></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Outdoor Play > Inflatable Water Slides,,Overall dimension:12.5' x 10.5' x 8' (L x W x H); ,Inflatable Water Slides,Drop Price,,Blue,OP70399,shopify,1146,1,deny,manual,229.99,459,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_692.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70399.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/