inflatable-water-slide-kids-bounce-house-with-water-cannons-and-hose-without-blower,Inflatable Water Slide Kids Bounce House with Water Cannons and Hose Without Blower,15746302,https://www.costway.com/inflatable-water-slide-kids-bounce-house-with-water-cannons-and-hose-without-blower.html?fee=152&fep=15893&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Includes water slide  climbing wall  built-in basketball rim  splash pool and water cannons for multiple fun<br />● Made of high-quality Oxford cloth  waterproof and wear-resistant<br />● With a mesh wall and cushioned landing pad to prevent children from being injured accidentally<br />● With bright colors and unique shape to attract children's attention<br />● Portable with lightweight and a carrying bag included<br />● Suitable for 4 kids aged 4-12 years old to play together<br />● Comes with complete accessories for convenient use<br />● Bouncer stakes for added stability and repair patches for easy maintenance</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Multiple Play Areas:</strong> This inflatable water park has a water slide  a large splash pool  a climbing wall and two water cannons  allowing children to enjoy multiple fun at the same time. In addition  bright colors and unique shapes can attract children to play for hours.<br /><strong>● Durable Materials:</strong> Made of high-quality Oxford cloth and combined with advanced sewing technology  this inflatable waterslide is wear-resistant and puncture-resistant  allowing children to jump and climb freely. It can hold up to 265 lbs and is suitable for 4 children to play together (Note: each child should better weigh no more than 80 lbs).<br /><strong>● Safety Protection Design:</strong> The mesh wall in the jumping area can ensure the safety of children when jumping and allow maximum ventilation. The cushioned landing pad at the bottom of the climbing wall can prevent children from being injured by accidental falls. In addition  the inflatable slide can be fixed on the ground by stakes to ensure safety and stability.<br /><strong>● Quick Inflation and Convenient Storage:</strong> The inflatable water park can be inflated in just a few minutes. After use  it can be quickly deflated through a long air outlet pipe and folded into the bag for carrying anywhere. (Suggest 750W air blower  excluded.) ASTM Certificated. Warm tips: Please wait for the bouncer to dry before rolling up for storage.<br /><strong>● Sweet Accessory:</strong> A repairing kit containing sewing supplies for accidental scratching. A water hose will provide added excitement. Six stakes for extra stability. With a durable carrying bag(random color)  you can carry this bounce house to anywhere conveniently take on-the-go.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Oxford cloth</li> <li>Overall dimension: 188" x 144" x 95.5" ( L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 37 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 265 lbs (every kid's weight should be under 80 lbs)</li> <li>Recommended age: 4 -12 years old</li> <li>Maximum number of kids: 4</li> <li>Recommend blower: <a href="https://www.costway.com/735-w-1-0-hp-air-blower-pump-fan-for-inflatable-bounce-house.html" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bolder; color: #c82a2e;">735W Blower</a></li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Inflatable waterslide</li> <li>6 x Bouncer stake</li> <li>1 x Repair kit</li> <li>1 x Carrying bag</li> <li>1 x Hose assembly kit</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Outdoor Play > Inflatable Water Slides,,Overall dimension:188" x 144" x 95.5" ( L x W x H); ,Inflatable Water Slides,Drop Price,,Blue,OP70401,shopify,433,1,deny,manual,259,518,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70401-10_1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70401-7_1.jpg,2,https://