al stools can be stacked into a compact size for easy storage when not in use. So these stools are very suitable for tight room and space. And these 6 stools only weigh 16.5 lbs  allowing you to move them anywhere without much effort.</li> <li><strong>6 Pack for Versatility:</strong> This set includes 6 backless stools to meet your various needs. They can be used as extra seats  plant stands or side tables. Combined with practicality and aesthetics  these stools are perfect for home  classroom  dorm  office  party and more.</li> <li><strong>Hollow-out Seat & Protective Foot Caps:</strong> Each stool features 8 holes for both decoration and ventilation. It will offer a comfortable seating experience even if you sit long in the soggy summer days. Besides  these backless stools are equipped with non-marking foot caps  which can protect the floor from scratches.</li> <li><strong>Humanized Design:</strong> These stools do not need to be installed for saving your time and energy. The 17.5" seat height is compatible with most standard size tables. In addition  the painted legs and PP seats are waterproof and easy to keep clean with damp cloth.</li> </ul> <p><br /><br /><br /></p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Steel + PP</li> <li>Product dimensions: 14.5" x 14.5" x 17.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 16.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of each stool: 220 lbs</li> <li>Package included:</li> <li>6 x Stackable stools</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Kitchen & Dining > Dining Chairs,,Product dimensions:14.5" x 14.5" x 17.5" (L x W x H); ,Dining Chairs,Clearance,,Black,HW64245BK,shopify,460,1,deny,manual,64.99,64.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW64245BK/Set_of_6_Portable_Plastic_Stack_Stools-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW64245BK/Set_of_6_