3-pcs-solid-wood-frame-patio-rattan-furniture-set,3 Pieces Patio Rattan Furniture Set with Washable Cushion and Acacia Wood Tabletop-Blue,36891502,https://www.costway.com/3-pieces-solid-wood-frame-patio-rattan-furniture-set.html?piid=9210100&fee=152&fep=15935&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This rattan furniture is made of tightly woven all-weather rattan meeting your needs of long term use. With a comfortable seat and durable frame  this furniture set provides the best place for you and your family to relax and enjoy outdoor time.</p> <p> </p> <p>The rattan conversation bistro set with acacia wood frame is weather-resistant and durable enough for long term use. And the sturdy structure enhances the stability and weight capacity. This chair has wide armrests and backrests with thick cushions to help you relax completely. What’s more  the bistro set includes a coffee table  which has 2 shelves for convenient use. The stylish design and classic appearance allow it suitable for any surroundings. You can use it in anywhere you like  such as a garden  balcony  or backyard. Besides  you don’t have to worry about the stains on the cushions  because you can remove the cover with the help of the zipper to wash. This patio dining chair set is an ideal gathering place for friends or family to have brunch on weekends.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you need a comfortable and durable rattan furniture set  this 3 pcs patio rattan furniture set can satisfy your requirements.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of tightly woven all-weather rattan to ensure durability</li> <li>Acacia wood frame and thickened legs provide powerful support</li> <li>The space-saving table can be used as an end table  side table  or coffee table</li> <li>Thick cushions filled with premium sponge offers a comfortable seat</li> <li>The cushion cover with zipper can be removed for cleaning</li> <li>The 2-tier coffee table provides sufficient storage space</li> <li>Ideal for your backyard  balcony  garden and other outdoors</li> <li>Easy to assemble  detailed instructions will be provided</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Sturdy and Durable Materials:</strong>  Combining high-quality rattan and durable acacia wood materials  this outdoor sofa set has good weather resistance to meet outdoor use. The armrests and legs of the chair are made of acacia wood to prevent deformation and improve stability. And the thick legs provide powerful support for you.<br />● <strong>Functional Coffee Table:</strong>  The bistro set includes a 2-tier coffee table for easy storage. The spacious acacia wood tabletop and the lower rattan shelf offer ample space for your drinks  snacks  or decorations. Besides  this versatile table can be used as a side table  coffee table  end table to satisfy your requirement.<br />● <strong>Upgraded Comfort with Thick Cushion:</strong>  This rattan furniture set chair has a large-sized seat and a wide backrest so that you can relax your body and relieve the fatigue of the day. Most importantly  we will also provide soft and thick cushions  these removable and washable cushions provide ultimate comfort to your back and hip.<br />● <strong>Stylish Design for Widely Use:</strong>  This patio sofa set with blue cushions is in a stylish and classical look  which can add a unique touch to your backyard. And the compact design makes it compatible with any outside space  perfect for small backyards or balconies. It is an ideal place for you to enjoy leisure time outdoors.<br />● <strong>Size of Patio Wicker Sofa Set:</strong> Table size: 20'' x19'' (L x H)  chair size: 26'' x 27.5'' x 31'' (L x W x H)  armrest height: 24''  seat height: 13''  cushion thickness: 3''  chair weight capacity: 360 lbs  table weight capacity: 90 lbs</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Rattan  Acacia wood  polyester fabric  sponge</li> <li>Dimension of chair: 26" x 27.5" x 31" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of table: 20" x 19" (L x H)</li> <li>Dimension of cushion: 22.5" x 22.5" x 3" (L x W xH)</li> <li>Armrest height: 24"</li> <li>Seat height: 13"</li> <li>Chair weight: 22 lbs</li> <li>Table weight: 9 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of chair: 360 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 90 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>2 x Sofa</li> <li>1 x Table </li> <li>2 x Seat cushion</li> <li>2 x Back cushion</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Dimension of chair:26" x 27.5" x 31" (L x W x H); Dimension of table:20" x 19" (L x H); Dimension of cushion:22.5" x 22.5" x 3" (L x W xH); ,Patio Conversation Sets,Clearance,,Blue,HW65226LB,shopify,365,1,deny,manual,149.99,169.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_503_17.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_457_16.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/11_281_13.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_482_14.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_398_16.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_484_14.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_454_16.jpg,7
patio-cantilever-offset-umbrella-base-with-wheels-for-garden-poolside-deck,Patio Cantilever Offset Umbrella Base with Wheels for Garden Poolside Deck,91702486,https://www.costway.com/patio-cantilever-offset-umbrella-base-with-wheels-for-garden-poolside-deck.html?fee=152&fep=15941&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Are you still looking for a sturdy and durable base to keep your cantilever offset umbrella stable under any conditions? This high-stability base with water or sand compartments to increase weight can hold your umbrella in place perfectly regardless of weather conditions or uneven surfaces.</p> <p> </p> <p>Constructed from durable materials with excellent molding technology  providing a long service life. The weight of the base can reach up to 330lbs after filling with wet sand to provide even greater stability. Each plate within the base has a large filling spout  which can facilitate quick filling with a funnel. In addition  the 4 built-in wheels make it easy to move from spot to spot as sun or weather demand. Its weather-resistant property allows it to be used all year round  and is perfect for outdoor places such as patios  courtyards  and terraces.</p> <p> </p> <p>Buy it and enjoy a better life!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Can be filled with water or sand for increased stability</li> <li>Made of high-quality iron and plastic to be more sturdy and durable</li> <li>Large diameter injection spouts for quickly filling with water or sand for extra weight</li> <li>Four smooth wheels for easy movement depending on where you need shade</li> <li>Easy to assemble with straight forward  illustrated assembly instructions</li> <li>Suitable for courtyards  gardens  terraces  and other places you need shade</li> <li>Designed with a foot pedal for even more convenient use</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Heavy-duty Construction:</strong> Made of high-quality iron and durable plastic  the base is rugged to provide stable support for cantilever offset umbrellas. In addition  with an excellent blow molding process  the base also has good weather resistance  which can prevent fading or aging due to sun and rain.<br /><strong>● Easy to Move with Smooth Wheels:</strong> There are four flexible wheels at the bottom of this umbrella base so that the base can be easily moved to any place such as the backyard  garden and deck. In addition  it is designed with a foot pedal to raise the base for convenient movement.<br /><strong>● Water and Sand Filling for Added Stability:</strong> The umbrella base is equipped with 5 built-in weight plates that can be filled with water or sand for greater stability  and each plate has a large diameter injection spout for easy filling and drainage. When filled with wet sand  the base can weigh up to 330 lbs.<br /><strong>● Wide Range of Application:</strong> Compared with the bulky concrete bases and unsightly sandbags  this umbrella base provides a more stylish look while ensuring excellent stability  making your outdoor space more attractive. The black finish can complement any decoration around. It is ideal for placing in the courtyard  garden or deck.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble and Maintain:</strong> With easy-to-follow assembly instruction  you are able to figure out how to put all parts together in a short time. The overall dimension of the base is 35" x 35" x 8" (L x W x H). The weather-resistant surface is easy to clean  dust and dirt left on it can be easily wiped with a damp cloth.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Plastic  iron</li> <li>Overall dimension: 35" x 35" x 8" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 66 lbs</li> <li>Weight of filled with water: 220 lbs</li> <li>Weight of filled with wet sand: 330 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Umbrella base</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Outdoor Umbrella Bases,,Overall dimension:35" x 35" x 8" (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Umbrella Bases,,,Black,OP70377NY-22,shopify,44,0,deny,manual,249,357,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_310_95.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_294_88.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_353_110.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_353_103.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_331_98.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_325_98.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_317_95.jpg,7
