 more  we offer the complete accessories and understandable installation guide  which can help you easily install the bench in short time.<br /><strong>● Dimensions of Acacia Wood Bench: </strong>Bench dimension: 52" (L) X 13.5" (W) X 17.5" (H)  max weight capacity of bench: 700 lbs. Package includes: outdoor wood bench x 1  instruction x 1.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Teak color</li> <li>Material: Acacia wood</li> <li>Overall dimension: 52" x 13.5" x 17.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 23.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 700 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Outdoor bench</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Outdoor Benches,,Overall dimension:52" x 13.5" x 17.5" (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Benches,Bestseller,,Brown,OP70391,shopify,438,1,deny,manual,89.99,137,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_327_18.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_314_59.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70391.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_324_19.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_261_55.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_290_58.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_306_60.jpg,7
inflatable-water-slide-kids-bounce-house-with-blower,Inflatable Water Slide Kids Bounce House with 740W Blower,84029763,https://www.costway.com/inflatable-water-slide-kids-bounce-house-with-blower.html?fee=152&fep=15963&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The extra durable  inflatable water park bouncy house is the best addition to your back yard to ensure your kids have the most fun summer!</p> <p> </p> <p>Its premium materials ensure that it's durable and super safe for kids. It can be affixed to the ground with the included stakes and mesh net for greater stability and safety for kids. With its climbing wall  slide  splash pool  and mounted squirt guns  children can enjoy various ways to play and stay cool while parents can have precious family time in a hot summer.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for an inflatable water slide bounce house like this  do not hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Suitable for kids from 3 - 10 years old and accommodates up to 3 kids</li> <li>Comes with a slide and a climbing wall and mounted squirt gun</li> <li>Easy to inflate and deflate very quickly and easily</li> <li>Mounted squirt guns and splash pool keep kids cool in the summer</li> <li>Made of premium materials and including ground stakes ensure durability</li> <li>Easy to carry and store with the included a carrying bag</li> <li>6 repair patches and a wire package are included for any needed repairs</li> <li>Mesh net provides added security  perfect for very young children</li> <li>Step under climbing wall for better security</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Durable Material:</strong> Made of heavy-duty puncture-resistant 420D oxford material with wear-resistant coating  this inflatable bouncer can be used for a long time and the slide is smooth.<br /><strong>● Enjoy Water Fun: </strong>Connect with the hose it can be used as a water park  children will have endless fun with this inflatable water slide. Sliding down the water slide with a sprinkler or lounging around in the splash pool  this water slide park brings a cool summer to the children.<br /><strong>● ProtectiveNetting:</strong> Let your children jump freely! Tall mesh walls surround the jumping area which will keep your kids safe while jumping and allow for maximum ventilation. Through mesh netting  you can keep an eye on all the actions.<br /><strong>● Quick Inflation and Deflation:</strong> Set this bouncer up no matter at the yard  park  lawn with a continuous-flow  heavy-duty blower (suggest 740W air blower  excluded). ASTM Certificated. Warm tips: Please wait for the bouncer to dry before rolling up for storage.<br /><strong>● Sweet Accessory:</strong> A repairing kit containing ground stakes for stability and firmness of the entire bouncer castle and sewing supplies for accidental scratching. With a durable carrying bag(random color)  you can carry this bounce house to anywhere conveniently take on the go.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As picture show</li> <li>Material: Oxford cloth</li> <li>Net weight: 39 lbs</li> <li>Bounce house dimension:13' x 10' x 8.5' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 444 lbs (every kid's weight should be under 100 lbs)</li> <li>Recommended blower wattage: 740W</li> <li>Recommended age: 3-10 years old</li> <li>Maximum number of kids: 3</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Inflatable bounce house</li> <li>1 x Blower</li> <li>1 x Carrying bag</li> <li>6 x Repair patch</li> <li>1 x Wire package</li> <li>4 x Bouncer stake</li> <li>4 x Blower stake</li> <li>1 x Hose assembly kit</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Outdoor Play > Inflatable Water Slides,,Bounce house dimension:13' x 10' x 8.5' (L x W x H); ,Inflatable Water Slides,,,Blue,OP70432,shopify,478,1,deny,manual,224.99,239.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_327_13.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70432.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_314_54.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_324_15.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_290_54.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_306_55.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_321_54.jpg,7
