 for a long leisure time. Also  the cover of the cushion with a smooth zipper is removable and washable.<br />● <strong>Classic Design for Outdoor or Indoor Use:</strong> The conversation bistro set with classic design adds a rustic flavor to your home and can be integrated with any furniture decoration or outdoor environment. The compact design is suitable for creating a cozy relaxation area for you and your friends or family at the poolside  backyard  balcony  porch  etc.<br />● <strong>Size of Patio Wicker Sofa Set:</strong> Table size: 20"x 20"x 19"(L x W x H)  chair size: 26" x 27.5"x31" (L x W x H)  armrest height: 22.5"  seat height: 13"  cushion thickness: 3"  chair weight capacity: 360 lbs  table weight capacity: 90lbs</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: Rattan  acacia wood  polyester fabric  sponge</li> <li>Dimension of chair: 26" x 27.5" x 31" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of table: 20" x 20" x 19" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of cushion: 22.5" x 22.5" x 3" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Armrest height: 22.5"</li> <li>Seat height: 13"</li> <li>Weight capacity of chair: 360 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 90 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>2 x Sofa</li> <li>1 x Table</li> <li>2 x Seat cushion</li> <li>2 x Back cushion</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Dimension of chair:26" x 27.5" x 31" (L x W x H); Dimension of table:20" x 20" x 19" (L x W x H); Dimension of cushion:22.5" x 22.5" x 3" (L x W x H); ,Patio Conversation Sets,Clearance,,Beige,HW70703BN,shopify,127,1,deny,manual,209.99,215.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_12__17_4.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/-/s-l1600_9__53_4.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cac