en and efficient way. The lights can maintain bright lighting in the day and night with no need of electricity or power cord. At night  you also can use the offset umbrella for convenience.</li> <li><strong>High-quality & Durable Composition:</strong> The sturdy powder-coated aluminum pole prevents the offset umbrella from being rusted or scratched. And the durable cover top is made of a water-  UV-  and fade-resistant polyester fabric  which can protect the umbrella from the elements for long term use.</li> <li><strong>360°Rotation & Effortless Adjustment:</strong> This patio umbrella can be rotated 360°easily. You can turn the pole with your hands according to your preferred position by simply stepping on the bottom pedal. Besides  the hand-crank lift and easy-tilt system offer the convenience for you to adjust the shade at different angles.</li> <li><strong>Dual Wind Vent and Large Shade Area:</strong> The dual wind vent design at the top of the umbrella keeps the cool air flowing  so you can feel more comfortable when sitting under the umbrella. And the large diameter umbrella can provide the large shade area to protect groups of people from the sun.</li> <li><strong>Installation & Notice:</strong> The detachable pole makes it easy to set up and storage in a short time. You can install the offset umbrella effortlessly. And this 10 ft patio umbrella comes with cross base  but it work better with base weight stand. You also can lay sandbags  blocks  or concrete onto the base to add more strength to the umbrella base.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Beige  tan  orange  burgundy</li> <li>Material: Steel  aluminum  polyester fabric</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 10" x 7.5" (L x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 30 lbs</li> <li>Number of ribs: 8</li> <li>Number of lights: 24</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x 10ft solar powered offset umbrella with cross base</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Outdoor