ion:</strong> This retractable awning features a powder-coated aluminum alloy and heavy-duty steel frame that is rust-resistant and corrosion-resistant for long-term use. The robust construction enhances its overall stability  making it can withstand winds up to level 5.<br /><strong>● Easy Installation:</strong> We provide all accessories and a detailed installation manual to help you reduce the installation time. These awnings are suitable for most houses and can be attached to 8.2-10 ft cement and brick walls. Note: The measuring tape  non-metallic tape  cross screwdriver  wrench  power drill  and pencil must be prepared by yourself.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown/Beige</li> <li>Material: Aluminum alloy  polyester fabric  steel</li> <li>Dimensions: 8' x 6.6' (L x W )</li> <li>Canopy inclination Range: 40-100°</li> <li>Net weight: 28 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1x Retractable awning</li> <li>1x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades,,Dimensions:8' x 6.6' (L x W ); ,Outdoor Shades,Drop Price,,Beige,OP70367BE,shopify,19,1,deny,manual,149.99,159.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_x_6_6_Feet_Patio_R_1781490550510318_310398.jpeg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_x_6_6_Feet_Patio_R_1781490551302889_865820.jpeg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_x_6_6_Feet_Patio_R_1781490552004805_481107.jpeg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_x_6_6_Feet_Patio_R_1781490552664722_551597.jpeg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_x_6_6_Feet_Patio_R_1781490553326212_351850.jpeg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/cata