-piece furniture. With compact size  it is suitable to be placed in your balcony as an additional lounge area for comfortable seating.<br />● <strong>Convenient to Install: </strong>It is easy to install the sofa set with detailed instructions and required accessories. You can finish it in a short time. The dimension of armless chair: 25.5'' x 29.5'' x 25.5'' (L x W x H). The sofa set can hold up to 710 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color of wicker: Brown</li> <li>Color of cushion：Navy</li> <li>Material: Steel  rattan  polyester fiber  sponge  aluminum</li> <li>Armless Chair Dimensions: 25.5" x 29.5" x 25.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity of one chair: 355 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of two chairs: 710 lbs</li> <li>Sofa set weight: 42 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Outdoor Sectionals,,Armless Chair Dimensions:25.5" x 29.5" x 25.5" (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Sectionals,Clearance,,Navy,HW68687NY,shopify,118,1,deny,manual,109.99,129.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_331_4.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_310_3.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_353_3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/11_171_5.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_329_3.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_317_5.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_294_3.jpg,7
