shoe-rack-bench-bamboo-with-storage-shelf-natural,Shoe Rack Bench Bamboo with Storage Shelf-Natural,34958021,https://www.costway.com/shoe-rack-bench-with-storage-shelf-for-entryway-hallway-bedroom.html?piid=9229100&fee=152&fep=16224&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The frame of rack is made of bamboo and the boards are connected with premium metal screws which ensure sturdiness and durableness.</p> <p> </p> <p>It is a combination of a shoe rack and a bench that can hold shoes and offer a seat when changing shoes. And under the seat  there is additional storage space for you sundries such as shoe brushes  umbrella and so on. The generous design will well match your furniture and suitable to be placed in the entryway  hallway  living room  bedroom  bathroom  and balcony  etc.</p> <p> </p> <p>Looking for a practical and stylish shoe rack for your home? Order this well-designed product!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Premium bamboo frame ensures firmness and wear-resistant</li> <li>Great load-bearing capacity which up to 330 lbs</li> <li>Ergonomic height adds a convenient seat to the shoe rack</li> <li>Additional storage space under the seat for umbrella and brush</li> <li>Lower shelf with the height of 6.5-inch for 2 pair of shoes</li> <li>Two handles help you to move the bench easily</li> <li>Suitable for entryway  bedroom with modern design</li> <li>Easy to assemble according the instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p>● Sturdy Bamboo Frame: Made of premium bamboo  the shoe rack is sturdy and durable for long time use. The boards are fixed with galvanized steel screws to ensure a firm and stable structure and can provide a weight capacity of up to 330 lbs. ● Compact Size with Additional Space: The dimension of the shoe rack is 24" x 13.5" x 20" (L x W x H). It won’t take up too much space. The lower shelf is enough to place 2 pairs of shoes. In addition  under the seat  the shoe rack has additional storage space for your sundries like an umbrella and shoe brush. ● Thick and Comfortable Cushion: The cushioned seat is filled with a high-density sponge  which has good elasticity for sitting to change shoes. And covered with breathable grey linen  the seat is comfortable to sit together and will not show the dirt. ● Multi-Scene Available: With the fashionable appearance and sufficient capacity  the shoe-changing stool is suitable for many occasions  such as bedroom  living room  porch  gym  etc. The versatile use of this rack allows the space to be fully utilized to become more clean and tidy. ● Easy to Assemble and Move: We will provide detailed instructions for your reference  as long as you follow the installation steps strictly  it will not take too much time. The handles on both sides also make it easy to move the shoe stool to different places.<p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Natural</li> <li>Material: Bamboo  MDF  sponge  linen cloth</li> <li>Overall dimension: 24" x 13.5" x 20" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Inner size of storage space: 17" x 112" x 2.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Product weight: 11 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 330 lbs</li> <li>Package Include:</li> <li>1 x Shoe rack</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Entryway > Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,Overall dimension:24" x 13.5" x 20" (L x W x H); Inner size of storage space:17" x 112" x 2.5" (L x W x H); ,Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,,Natural,HW65246NA,shopify,64,1,deny,manual,64.99,64.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_325_135.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_331_137.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_353_145.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/11_1