 back gardens and any other places of leisure</li> <li>Easy to assemble with our detailed instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Durable Construction & Selected Material:</strong> Made of cross steel structure with foot pads on the bottom  each sofa of this set is stable and has large weight capacity. Hand-woven PE wicker offers high tensile strength and weather resistance  which is strong to support anyone and withstand all-weather variations for a long-lasting use.</li> <li><strong>Stylish & Comfortable Sofa Set:</strong> Coming with wide seats  4-inch thick sponge padded cushions and soft pillows  the patio sofa set provides extraordinary comfort and relaxation for you. Besides  this modern outdoor conversation set will add a sense of fashion to your home and is suitable for entertaining your neighbors or friends.</li> <li><strong>Flexible Combination:</strong> This sectional sofa set comes with 2 corner sofas  1 armless sofa and 1 ottoman and 1 tempered glass top table. Each piece of this sofa set can be used separately and easily combined into different configurations based on your preference and geography. Fastener clips are included to keep the outdoor sofa set connected.</li> <li><strong>Coffee Table:</strong> The coffee table comes with a tempered glass which has high strength  stability and stain resistance  allowing you to place drinks  meals or decorative items on the spacious tabletop. And the thickness of tempered glass is 5mm  which is safe to use and ensures durability. What's more  smooth and flat tabletop is easy to clean.</li> <li><strong>Easy for Cleaning & Maintenance:</strong> This patio conversation set features waterproof wicker and removable tempered glass top for the coffee table  easy for wipe cleaning. And the zippered cushion covers are made of superior fabric  which is durable and washable. You can simply zip off the cushion covers and give them a quick wash.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul