-piece furniture. With compact size  it is suitable to be placed in your balcony as an additional lounge area for comfortable seating.<br />● <strong>Convenient to Install: </strong>It is easy to install the sofa set with detailed instructions and required accessories. You can finish it in a short time. The dimension of armless chair: 25.5'' x 29.5'' x 25.5'' (L x W x H). The sofa set can hold up to 710 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color of wicker: Brown</li> <li>Color of cushion：Blue</li> <li>Material: Steel  rattan  polyester fiber  sponge  aluminum</li> <li>Armless Chair Dimensions: 25.5" x 29.5" x 25.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity of one chair: 355 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of two chairs: 710 lbs</li> <li>Sofa set weight: 42 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Outdoor Sectionals,,Armless Chair Dimensions:25.5" x 29.5" x 25.5" (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Sectionals,Clearance,,Blue,HW68687TU,shopify,67,1,deny,manual,129.99,134.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/4/14_41_30.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/5/15_35_30.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/2/12_120_14.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/2/22_33_24.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/3/13_47_3.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/7/17_43_30.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/0/20_36_28.jpg,7
6-pcs-patio-rattan-furniture-set-with-sectional-cushion-blue,6 Pcs Patio Rattan Furniture Set with Sectional Cushion-Blue,43698701,https://www.costway.com/6-pieces-patio-rattan-furniture-set-with-sectional-cushion.html?piid=9210100&fee=152&fep=16261&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This 6 PCS rattan sofa set includes 2 corner sofas  1 armless sofa  1 single sofa  and 2 ottoman sofas. Powder-coated steel and premium PE wicker provide sturdiness and durability to this patio furniture set.</p> <p> </p> <p>Each component of this set can be used individually or in combination  easily changed to different layouts and combinations based on your need. You can also regard the ottoman as a coffee table by removing the cushion. Thick sponge-padded cushions with polyester fabric cover ensure comfort and durability. If the cushions get dirty by accident  you can simply zip off the cover and wash the covers. This set of rattan furniture can be placed in your courtyard  balcony  and poolside for you to have a gathering or conversation with drinks and food. So make this furniture set yours and be sure to share the best of times with your dear ones.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for this product  don't hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Durable rattan and sturdy steel materials are used to ensure a long lifespan</li> <li>Thick and soft cushions for comfortable (pillows not included)</li> <li>Removable and washable cushion cover with zipper</li> <li>Free and flexible combination to meet your different needs</li> <li>Ottoman can be used as a tempered glass coffee table for multi-use</li> <li>Come with-shape aluminum foot pads to protect the floor and add stability to the set</li> <li>Suitable for balcony  rooftop  backyard  poolside and any other places of leisure</li> <li>Easy to assemble with included instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Build to Last:</strong> Made of solid steel structure with reinforced cross design at the bottom  this outdoor sofa set is sturdy enough for a large weight capacity. Hand-woven PE wicker offers high tensile strength and weather resistance. Coming with aluminum L-shaped footpads  the outdoor conversation set offers added stability.<br /><strong>● Stylish and Comfortable Sofa Set:</strong> Featuring 4" thick sponge padded cushions (pillows not included)  this patio sofa set provides extraordinary comfort and relaxation for you. Besides  the modern cushion color and hand-woven rattan surface will add fashion sense to your outdoor space like a patio  garden  balcony  yard  and more.<br /><strong>● Flexible Combination and Free Conversion:</strong> This 6-piece patio furniture comes with 2 corner sofas  1 armless sofa  1 single sofa  and 2 ottomans. Removing the cushion  this ottoman can be changed to a glass coffee table because of an included tempered glass top. Each piece of this sofa set can be used separately or easily combined.<br /><strong>● Easy for Cleaning and Maintenance:</strong> Made of PE wicker and fabric which is waterproof  this patio conversation set is easy to clean and maintain. And the zippered cushion covers are made of superior polyester  which is durable and washable. You can simply zip off the cushion covers and give them a quick wash.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble and Dimensions:</strong> Coming with all the necessary parts and hardware  it is simple to assemble the rattan sofa set. Single sofa size: 33.5" (L) x 29.5" (W) x 25.5" (H)  corner sofa size: 29.5" (L) x 29.5" (W) x 25.5" (H)  armless sofa size: 29.5" (L) x 25.5" (W) x 25.5" (H)  ottoman size: 29.5" (L) x 29.5" (W) x 16.5" (H). Max weight capacity of each sofa: 360 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: PE Rattan  steel  sponge  polyester cloth  glass</li> <li>Corner sofa size: 30" x 30" x 25.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Armless sofa size: 30" x 25.5" x 25.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Ottoman size: 30" x 30" x 16.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Single sofa size: 33.5" x 30" x 25.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Thickness of cushion: 4" (H)</li> <li>Max weight capacity of each sofa: 360 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 3(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Armless sofa</li> <li>2 x Corner sofas</li> <li>2 x Ottomans</li> <li>1x Single sofa</li> <li>6 x Seat cushions</li> <li>1 x Back cushions</li> <li>1 x Tempered glass top</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Outdoor Sectionals,,Corner sofa size:30" x 30" x 25.5" (L x W x H); Armless sofa size:30" x 25.5" x 25.5" (L x W x H); Ottoman size:30" x 30" x 16.5" (L x W x H); Single sofa size:33.5" x 30" x 25.5" (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Sectionals,Clearance,,Blue,HW67883NY+,shopify,271,1,deny,manual,459.99,479.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_313_26.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_207_21.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/2/12_120_10.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_332_27.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_298_25.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_334_27.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_328_26.jpg,7
