ign of the tabletop can also avoid rainwater accumulation.<br />● <strong>6 Sturdy and Portable Armchairs: </strong>The dining set also includes 6 armchairs  which can provide enough seats to meet the needs of guests. Moreover  armchairs with solid steel frames and reinforced structures can withstand up to 400lbs. what's more  the plastic pads on the chair feet can prevent the scratches and slip.<br />● <strong>Ergonomic and Comfortable Cushions:</strong>  Each chair is equipped with a soft cushion filled with a high-density sponge  which can bring you comfortable seating experience. Also  the cushion cover with a zipper design makes cleaning very convenient. Meanwhile  the ergonomic wide backrest and armrest provide additional comfort.<br />● <strong>Modern Design for Wide Application:</strong>  In a classical and stylish appearance  this dining set can match any outside style and is a great supplement to outdoor space. You can invite your family or friends to enjoy a relaxing meal with this 7 pieces patio dining set in your backyard  balcony  garden  etc.<br />● <strong>Size Information of Patio Dining Set: </strong>Table size: 63'' x 35.5'' x 30'' (L x W x H)  chair size: 24.5'' x 22.5'' x 34'' (L x W x H)  height from floor to seat: 16.5''  height from floor to armrest: 25''  thickness of cushion: 1.5''  diameter of umbrella hole: 2.16''  table weight capacity: 170lbs  chair weight capacity: 400lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: PE wicker  acacia wood  steel  polyester  sponge</li> <li>Table size: 63" x 35.5" x 30" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Chair size: 24.5" x 22.5" x 34" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Diameter of umbrella hole: 2.16"</li> <li>Thickness of cushion: 2.5"</li> <li>Armrest height: 25"</li> <li>Seat height: 16.5"</li> <li>Weight of table: 40.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight of each chair: 11 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of chair: 400 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 170 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 3(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <l