 table which has a door with a magnetic clasp. Coming with a fixing ring at the bottom  it can be safely secured.<br /><strong>● Multi-Using Fire Table:</strong> When you do not use the fire pit table for heating  it can be easily converted into an outdoor side table  a casual bar or a simple storage table. Spacious fire pit tabletop can provide you with more space to place drinks and snacks  which is perfect for family gatherings.<br /><strong>● Modern Appearance:</strong> The stylish appearance with ceramic tabletop and embossed side panels will be a perfect addition to your outdoor space. Lava rocks are included to help disperse the warmth more evenly.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Steel</li> <li>Overall dimension: 42" x 20" x 25" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 65.5 lbs</li> <li>Heat output: 60 000 BTU</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Outdoor fire pit table</li> <li>1 x PVC cover</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Heating > Fire Pits > Fire Pit Tables,,Overall dimension:42" x 20" x 25" (L x W x H); ,Fire Pit Tables,Drop Price,,Black,OP70369,shopify,450,1,deny,manual,269,538,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/2/42_inch_60000_btu_propane_fire_pit_table-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70369/42_Inch_60000_BTU_Propane_Fire_Pit_Table-1.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/2/42_inch_60000_btu_propane_fire_pit_table-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70369/42_Inch_60000_BTU_Propane_Fire_Pit_Table-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70369/42_Inch