42-inch-60-000-btu-rectangular-propane-gas-fire-pit-table,42 Inch 60 000 BTU Rectangular Propane Fire Pit Table with Waterproof Cover,61032784,https://www.costway.com/42-inch-60-000-btu-rectangular-propane-gas-fire-pit-table.html?fee=152&fep=16264&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Including 1 Fire Pit Table  1x AAA Battery  1 PVC Cover  1 Bag of Lava Rocks  1 Instruction<br />● CSA certified burner and ETL certified table<br />● Sturdy and stable steel material provides strong durability<br />● 60 000 BTU heat output offers ample warmth for you in the outdoors<br />● Equipped with electronic ignition and in-built control panel<br />● Table cover with pull-tab for convenient<br />● Adjustable foot pads for added stability<br />● Multi-function design which can be used as a fire table or coffee table<br />● Lava rocks included to beautifully accent the flames<br />● Door with an elegant handle and magnetic clasp for hidden inner space<br />● Suitable for 20 lbs propane stove<br />● Waterproof PVC cover for easy storage<br />● Modern and elegant design with hollowed-out design<br />● Easy to assemble</p> <p><a href="https://youtu.be/eH7LMe0tuso" style="font-size: 14px; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bolder; color: #c82a2e;">Installation guide</a></p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Durable Material and Waterproof Cover:</strong> This outdoor fire table is made of a heavy-duty and stable steel frame  which can prevent the surface from being easily damaged and provides strong durability. In addition  this patio fire pit is equipped with a protective PVC cover which is waterproof for longer-term outdoor use.<br /><strong>● Safe Guaranteed and Convenience:</strong> The electronic ignition setting and the in-built control panel can keep stable and fully burned after ignition. The burner is CSA certified and the table is ETL certified. You can store the propane stove inside the table which has a door with a magnetic clasp. Coming with a fixing ring at the bottom  it can be safely secured.<br /><strong>● Warm and Healthy Bonfire Experience:</strong> Complete with a 60 000 BTU stainless steel burner  this fire table provides plenty of warmth for you in the outdoors. Besides  this outdoor fire pit table uses propane gas to support stable and clean-burning  which is both good for the environment and your health.<br /><strong>● Multi-purpose Fire Table:</strong> When you do not use the fire pit table for heating  it can be easily converted into an outdoor side table  a casual bar or a simple storage table. Spacious fire pit tabletop can provide you with more space to place drinks and snacks  which is perfect for family gatherings.<br /><strong>● Modern Appearance and Dimensions:</strong> The stylish appearance with a well-designed surface and lava rock can match with any outdoor furniture  which will be a perfect addition to your outdoor space. Dimension of fire pit table: 42" x 20" x 25" (L x W x H)  net weight of fire pit table: 53 lbs. Propane stove capacity: 20 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Steel  PVC</li> <li>Overall Dimension: 42" x 20" x 25" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of Lid: 23" x 7.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Heat Output: 60 000 BTU</li> <li>Net Weight: 53 lbs</li> <li>Suitable Gas Tank: 20 lbs</li> <li>Weight Capacity: 220 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Heating > Fire Pits > Fire Pit Tables,,Overall Dimension:42" x 20" x 25" (L x W x H); Dimension of Lid:23" x 7.5" (L x W); ,Fire Pit Tables,,,Black,OP70370,shopify,448,1,deny,manual,239.99,239.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70370/Propane_Fire_Pit_Table_for_Courtyard-2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70370/Propane_Fire_Pit_Table_for_garden-6.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/