kid-s-outdoor-wooden-pretend-cook-kitchen-playset-toy,Kid's Outdoor Wooden Pretend Cook Kitchen Playset Toy ,46278039,https://www.costway.com/kid-s-outdoor-wooden-pretend-cook-kitchen-playset-toy.html?fee=152&fep=16265&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Made of natural fir wood  the kitchen playset is sturdy and durable to use for a long time.</p> <p> </p> <p>Children always wants to learn the behavior of the parents in their childhood. Our kids kitchen can fully satisfy the child's curiosity  allowing them to "cook dishes". Imagine stewing a mud soup  making a sand cake and decorating it with leaves in the garden. Your will give full play to his/her imagination  developing their intelligence. It not only promotes the feelings between parents and children  but also provides the baby with an opportunity for self-expression!</p> <p> </p> <p>Our outdoor toddler kitchen is a good choice to accompany your child.Order it now!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of natural fir wood to sturdiness and durability</li> <li>Includes plastic basin and faucet with smooth surface</li> <li>Let children experience the real cooking</li> <li>Ideal for outdoor use  like patio  garden  lawn  etc</li> <li>Perfect educational gift for children over 3 years old</li> <li>Cook with parents or friends to enhance relationship</li> <li>Open shelves for storing toy kitchen utensils</li> <li>Remove the blue board to start games</li> <li>Exert their imagination to make mud pies and puddle pops</li> <li>Easy to assemble under the direction of the instruction</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Imaginative Kitchen Play:</strong> Let your child's imagination run to mix mud  sand and twigs for a perfect treat. Mud pies and puddle pops will be on the menu. Besides  kids can rotate the faucet to wash vegetables and fruits  pour the dirty water out of the basin and more.<br /><strong>● Safe and Premium Material:</strong> Made of natural solid fir wood  this kitchen cooking toy is environmentally friendly and durable for long-term use. It has no burr and will not hurt kids' skin. And the plastic tap and basin are non-toxic and odorless for safe use.<br /><strong>● Convenient Versatility:</strong> This kids play kitchen is very suitable for outdoor use  such as garden  backyard  park  etc. With this educational kitchen toy  children can be a chef to cook with their friends  improving the social skills and stimulating their imagination and creativity.<br /><strong>● Perfect Gift for Kids:</strong> This multifunctional outdoor play kitchen is an ideal childhood gift for children more than 3 years old. It gives toddlers infinite pleasure and learning desire. Parents can play with their children to improve good parent-child relationship.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble:</strong> This wooden mud kitchen comes with a clear and brief instruction  which has straight forward illustrations and descriptions. Each screw and part has its own code to let you easily understand the assembly progress  taking you little time and energy.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As shown in the figure</li> <li>Material: Fir wood  plastic</li> <li>Product dimension: 43" x 15" x 39.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Recommended age: Over 3 years old</li> <li>Net weight: 17 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Outdoor toddler kitchen</li> <li>1 x User guide</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Pretend Toys > Play Kitchen Sets,,Product dimension:43" x 15" x 39.5" (L x W x H); ,Play Kitchen Sets,Clearance,,Natural,TY327955,shopify,54,1,deny,manual,69.99,69.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_511_63.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_517_63.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/u/