5-pieces-patio-rattan-sectional-conversation-ottoman-furniture-set-blue,5 Pieces Patio Rattan Sectional Conversation Ottoman Furniture Set-Blue,75384102,https://www.costway.com/5-pieces-patio-sectional-rattan-furniture-set-with-ottoman-table.html?piid=9210100&fee=152&fep=16280&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Made of a sturdy steel inner frame and wrapped in hand-woven PE rattan  this 5pcs rattan sofa set includes 2 corner sofas  1 armless sofa and 2 ottoman sofas.</p> <p> </p> <p>Each component of this set can be used individually or in combination  easily changed to different layouts and combinations based on your need. You can also regard the ottoman as a coffee table by removing the cushion. Thick sponge padded cushions with polyester fabric covers ensure comfort and durability. And equipped with zippers  the waterproof covers of cushions are easy to remove and clean. Besides  the chic design is perfect for any outdoor space including yards  patios  gardens  porches or indoors. This sofa set is suitable for some people to eat and talk. Enjoy your outdoor leisure time with this 5-piece rattan sectional seating group! </p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for this product  don't hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Sturdy steel structure provides strong stability and large bearing capacity</li> <li>Durable and weather-resistant PE rattan provides a long service life</li> <li>Lofty sponge padded seat and back cushions for more comfort and relaxation</li> <li>Removable cushion cover with zipper makes it easy and convenient to clean</li> <li>Free and flexible combination to meet your different needs</li> <li>Ottoman can be used as a coffee table for multi-use</li> <li>L-shape aluminum foot pads provide added stability and floor protection</li> <li>Stylish and simple design fits well with your indoor & outdoor space</li> <li>Easy to assemble with included instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Durable Construction & Selected Material:</strong> Made of solid premium steel cross structure  this outdoor sofa set is sturdy enough for large weight capacity. Hand-woven PE wicker offers high tensile strength and weather resistance  which can withstand season variations for a long-lasting use.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Stylish & Comfortable Sofa Set:</strong> Coming with spacious seats and 4" thick sponge padded cushions  this patio sofa set provides extraordinary comfort and relaxation for you. Besides  the modern style and hand-woven rattan surface will add fashion sense to your outdoor space like patio  garden  balcony  yard and more.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Free Combination:</strong> This 5-piece patio furniture comes with 2 corner sofas  1 armless sofa and 2 ottomans. Each piece of this sofa set can be used separately and easily combined into different configurations according to your preference and needs. The ottoman can be changed to a side table when you remove the cushion.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Easy for Cleaning & Maintenance:</strong> Made of PE wickers which are waterproof  this patio conversation set is easy to clean and maintain. And the zippered cushion covers are made of superior fabric  which is durable and washable. You can simply zip off the cushion covers and give them a quick wash to have them looking brand new.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Easy to Assemble & Dimensions:</strong> Coming with all the necessary parts and hardware  it is simple to assemble the rattan sofa set. Corner sofa size: 29.5" (L) x 29.5” (W) x 25” (H)  armless sofa size: 29.5” (L) x 25.5” (W) x 25” (H)  large ottoman size: 29.5” (L) x 29.5” (W) x 12.5” (H)  small ottoman size: 25.5” (L) x 25.5” (W) x 12.5” (H).</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material: PE rattan  seel  sponge  polyester cloth</li> <li>Color: Blue</li> <li>Corner sofa size: 29.5" x 29.5" x 25" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Armless sofa size: 29.5" x 25.5" x 25" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Larger ottoman size: 29.5" x 29.5" x 12.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Smaller ottoman size: 25.5" x 25.5" x 12.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Height of cushion: 4"</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 3(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Armless sofa</li> <li>2 x Corner sofas</li> <li>2 x Ottomans</li> <li>5 x Seat cushions</li> <li>5 x Back cushions</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Outdoor Sectionals,,Corner sofa size:29.5" x 29.5" x 25" (L x W x H); Armless sofa size:29.5" x 25.5" x 25" (L x W x H); Larger ottoman size:29.5" x 29.5" x 12.5" (L x W x H); Smaller ottoman size:25.5" x 25.5" x 12.5" (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Sectionals,Clearance,,Blue,HW68678BTU+,shopify,10,1,deny,manual,359.99,374.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_466_9.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_458_9.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/2/12_198_72.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_485_9.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_464_9.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_440_8.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_352_18.jpg,7
