s in the darkness. The headlight can also be adjusted either up or down according to your kids' preference. Additionally  built-in music adds more fun and avoids boredom during driving.<br /><strong>● Drive Forward/Backward as Kids Want:</strong> Your kids can not imagine how simple the operation it is. Just turn on the general power button  choose the forward/reverse mode and press the foot pedal. Thanks to the rechargeable design  it enables longer driving time after a full charge  and less manual effort is required. The charging process is fairly easy as well.<br /><strong>● Freely Ride Indoor or Outdoor:</strong> The wear-resistant wheels allow your kids to ride on different kinds of ground such as brick road  wood floor  asphalt ground  plastic runway and more. In this way  with nearly no limitation of space  whether indoor or outdoor  kids are supposed to enjoy their happy driving time freely.<br /><strong>● Perfect Gift to Surprise Your Kids:</strong> A fond childhood memory is precious to both parents and kids. This chopper-style motorcycle is a perfect gift for your kids  as well as an active toy for boys and girls. Besides  it is worth mentioning that the motorcycle consists of safety enough materials are certificated by ASTM  so there is no worry about its using reliability.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As the picture shows</li> <li>Material: PP  iron</li> <li>Dimension: 36" x 19" x 25" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Speed: 2.5-3 km/h</li> <li>Battery: DC 6V  4.5AH</li> <li>Net weight: 14 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 66 lbs</li> <li>Recommended age: 3+ years old</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 X Chopper style motorcycle</li> <li>1 X Charger</li> <li>1 X User manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Ride On Toys > Powered Ride On Toys,,Dimension:36" x 19" x 25" (L x W x H); ,Powered Ride On Toys,,,Blue,TY327686BL,shopify,345,1,deny,manual,109.99,139.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/produ