nique design  which can make your child feel like a real princess. It is ideal to choose this vanity set as a birthday or Christmas gift for your little one.</li> <li><strong>Sturdy & Stable Construction:</strong> Our dressing table set is made of high quality durable MDF  which is sturdy enough without easy deformation or cracking. In addition  the legs of the table and stool are made of solid pine wood  which greatly enhances the bearing capacity and stability.</li> <li><strong>Detachable Tri-folding Mirror:</strong> The tri-folding mirror with high definition can clearly reflect the cute faces  allowing kids to observe their makeup and hairstyle in all directions. And the detachable top can be moved away so that your child can use it as a writing or reading desk if necessary.</li> <li><strong>Large Storage Space:</strong> The spacious tabletop provides enough space for your kids to display their favorite accessories. When the makeup time is over  hair clips  headbands  combs  nail polishes and other items can be neatly stored in the built-in large drawer.</li> <li><strong>Safe for Kids to Use:</strong> This vanity set will not affect children's health with non-toxic and odorless paint. The rounded corners and burr-free surface can prevent kids form from being injured accidentally. In addition  the table features an anti-tipping design and can be fixed to the wall for added safety.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Pink</li> <li>Material: MDF + pine</li> <li>Dimension of table: 27.5" x 13.5" x 37.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of stool: 12" x 12" x 12.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight of vanity set: 22.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 33 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of stool: 66 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Dressing table</li> <li>1 x Stool</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Toddler & Kids Furniture > Kids Vanities,,Dimension of table:27.5" x 13.5" x 37