ble and stool are made of solid pine wood  which greatly enhances the bearing capacity and stability.</li> <li><strong>Tri-folding Mirror & Functional Drawer:</strong> The tri-folding mirror with high definition can clearly reflect the cute faces  allowing kids to observe their makeup and hairstyle in all directions. When the makeup time is over  hair clips  headbands  combs  nail polishes  etc. can be stored in the built-in drawer or neatly placed on the spacious tabletop.</li> <li><strong>Versatile & Safe Design:</strong> The vanity table is designed with a detachable top so that your child can use it as a writing or reading desk if necessary. The rounded corners and burr-free surface can prevent kids form from being injured accidentally. In addition  the table features an anti-tipping design and can be fixed to the wall for added safety.</li> <li><strong>Perfect Gift for Little Girls:</strong> Every girl has a dream of being a princess to dress up beautifully. Our dressing table set has a beautiful and unique design with a crown above the mirror  which can make your child feel like a real princess. It is ideal to choose this vanity set as a birthday or Christmas gift for your little one.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble & Clean:</strong> Some simple assembly is required  all necessary hardware and detailed instructions are included  all you have to do is attach the legs and mirror. The smooth surface is easy to clean  and the stains left on it can be quickly wiped with a damp cloth.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Material: MDF + pine</li> <li>Dimension of table: 31.5" x 16.5" x 41.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of stool: 12" x 12" x 12.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight of vanity Set: 25.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 33 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of stool: 66 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Dressing table</li> <li>1 x Stool</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> <