ical curve of human body. When you're at your desk  this chair will make you feel more comfortable and relaxed. What's more  the chair also has the armrest that conforms to the manual study. The armrest fits the curve of the arm  supporting the arm comfortably.<br /><strong>● Durability:</strong> The chair leg with the strong steel tube  whose bearing performance is great. And it is conducive to improve the service life. Meanwhile  the surface of the chair is black PU  which is easy to clean when there is dirt on the surface. So it is good for maintenance. The seat and the back of the chair are supported by steel pipes  which are not easy to deform.<br /><strong>Contracted Style: </strong>This office chair adopts an integrated arch structure with a simple and elegant design. The chairs are in a minimalist and modern style which makes the meeting room look cleaner. At the same time  the simple and elegant lines of the chair's exterior make it easy to blend into any office space.<br /><strong>● Easy Assembly and Non-slip Pads:</strong> This kind of office desk is very easy to assemble. All you have to do is align the screw holes in the back of the chair with the threaded holes in the steel pipe. Then  you should turn the screws on and put the leather cover over the armrest. There are two non-slip pads  which can increase the friction and protect the floor.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Iron + PU leather</li> <li>Net weight of each chair: 20 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimension: 21" x 24" x 36" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Seat height: 18.5"</li> <li>Weight capacity: 265 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>2 x Office chairs</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Office Chairs > Conference Chairs,,Overall dimension:21" x 24" x 36" (L x W x H); ,Conference Chairs,,,Black,HW65402BK-2,shopify,153,1,deny,manual,179.99,179.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x