he parts together by following our installation instruction. You can complete a simple installation in very little time.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Blue/white</li> <li>Material: PE rattan  steel  polyester fabric</li> <li>Size of rattan lounge chair: 77" x 25.5" x 15"-39.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Adjustable height: 28.5"/32"/34"/36"/38"/39.5"</li> <li>Weight of rattan lounge chair: 36 LBS</li> <li>Weight capacity of rattan lounge chair: 355 LBS</li> <li>Thickness of cushion: 2”</li> <li>Package include: 1 x rattan lounge chair</li> <li>1 x seat cushion</li> <li>1 x instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Outdoor Chaise Lounges,,Size of rattan lounge chair:77" x 25.5" x 15"-39.5" (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Chaise Lounges,Clearance,,Turquoise,HW62360TU,shopify,156,1,deny,manual,135.99,155.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_556_96.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_579_80.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw62360color__1.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_620_82.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_587_87.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_541_74.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_562_68.jpg,7
2-pieces-patio-rattan-ottoman-set-with-removable-cushions-turquoise,2 Pieces Patio Rattan Ottoman Set with Removable Cushions-Turquoise,87142530,https://www.costway.com/2-pieces-patio-rattan-ottoman-set-with-removable-cushions.html?piid=9215700&fee=152&fep=16372&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This 2-piece rattan ottoman set  it is made to satisfy your expectations. Made of PE wicker and sturdy steel  the set has a large weight capacity and is weather resistant for durable use.</p> <p> </p> <p>The ottomans are equipped with soft and high-resilient cushion for a comfortable sitting experience. Besides  each cushion has a rope for fixing it with the ottoman to prevent it from slipping. What’s more  the covers of seat cushion are easy to be taken off and washed if it gets stained or dirty. The ottoman can be used as a single-seat  rearranged  or combined with other furniture set to get the best use of. So bring your home a beautiful ottoman set and enjoy the quality and comfort. This product is a 2 piece ottoman that is best in class having all the style  space  comfort and elegance.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for this product  don't hesitate to place an order.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Sturdy and solid steel frame ensures sturdiness and durability</li> <li>Premium and hand-woven rattan suitable for outdoor</li> <li>Premium cushions for maximum comfort</li> <li>Water-proof cushion cover is removable and washable</li> <li>Fixed by ropes to prevent the cushion from slipping</li> <li>Four wedged feet enhance stable</li> <li>Elegant yet casual designs perfect for any home decor</li> <li>Multifunctional  it can be used as a seat  footrest or a coffee table</li> <li>Easy to assemble with the instructions and hardware</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Durable & Sturdy Structure:</strong> The outdoor ottoman set is made of reinforced steel structure that makes it extremely durable. More  wrapped with hand-woven PE rattan  the 2pcs patio ottoman are suitable for years of outdoor use. It is worth mentioning that the four wedge foot give more stability to the ottoman and withstand large load capacity.</li> <li><strong>Upgraded Comfortable Cushions:</strong> The ottoman comes with 2 soft cushions which is filled with premium sponge that is cozy and not easy to collapse. And the cover of cushions are made of waterproof and fade resistant polyester  so the cushions suitable for outdoor use. More  the cushion is equipped with smooth zipper for removable and washable.</li> <li><strong>Multifunction & Attractive Design:</strong> The set of 2 patio ottoman features concise style in a gradient shade of brown creating awesome looks to décor the patio. And the ottoman set with detachable cushions is suitable for outdoor and indoor use. The ottoman is not only used as footrest but combines well with other patio sofa set.</li> <li><strong>Lightweight and Convenient Ottomans:</strong> Crafted with PE rattan and premium steel  the ottoman is solid yet lightweight to maneuver it easily from one place to another. What's more  the ottoman has built-in hollow-handle which plays 2 roles. Besides  the cushions can be fixed to the ottoman by tying it with the ropes. This prevents the cushion from slipping from its place.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Clean and Assemble:</strong> The rattan ottoman set is simple to assemble. Attach the feet to ottoman  and the process is easy with clear instruction and necessary hardware. Besides  with smooth rattan surface  it is easy to clean and maintain with wet cloth.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown/Beige</li> <li>Material: Steel & rattan</li> <li>Overall dimension: 16" x 16" x 18" (with cushion)</li> <li>Cushion thickness: 2.5"</li> <li>Net weight: 15lbs (set of 2)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 375lbs (single)</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li>2 x Ottoman</li> <li>2 x Cushion</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)