kids-princess-makeup-dressing-play-table-set-with-mirror-pink,Kids Princess Makeup Dressing Play Table Set with Mirror -Pink,64759213,https://www.costway.com/kids-princess-makeup-dressing-play-table-set-with-mirror.html?piid=9229300&fee=152&fep=16380&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>Made of density board and pine wood  the whole set is very stable and can be used for long time.</p> <p> </p> <p>This vanity set is a perfect present for little girl. Rounded corners and anti-slip pads are just some of the ways that we made our vanity set safe for your kids. Designed with wall anchor strap  the table is not easy to tip over. The dresser also has a drawer to help store small items such as hair ties  brushes  makeup  nail polish and other fun trinkets. What's more  the stool can provide comfortable sitting experience for your little one.</p> <p> </p> <p>Are you wondering what to give your kids as birthday or Christmas gift? Bring this set today and give your little one a big surprise!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of premium MDF for firmness and durability</li> <li>Heavy-duty pine legs for high load-bearing capacity</li> <li>Large drawer helps for storing hair ties  brushes  nail polish and other fun trinkets</li> <li>Equipped with anti-slip pads to enhance stability and prevent scratching the floor</li> <li>A real and high-definition mirror to reflect face clearly</li> <li>With a detachable top to be a writing or reading desk</li> <li>Easy to assemble with detailed instructions and complete accessories</li> <li>Ideal to be placed in kids' bedroom and playroom</li> <li>Can be secured to the wall to prevent tipping</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Sturdy & Stable Construction:</strong> This dressing table set is made of high quality and durable MDF  which is sturdy enough without easy deformation or cracking. In addition  the legs of the table and stool are made of solid pine wood  which greatly enhances the bearing capacity and stability.</li> <li><strong>Real Mirror & Functional Drawer:</strong> The mirror with high definition can clearly reflect the cute faces  allowing kids to observe their makeup and hairstyle conveniently. When the makeup time is over  hair clips  headbands  combs  nail polishes  etc. can be stored in the built-in drawer or neatly placed on the spacious tabletop.</li> <li><strong>Versatile Design with Detachable Top:</strong> The 2-in-1 vanity table is designed with a detachable top so that your child can use it as a writing or reading desk if necessary. Compact size and attractive appearance make it a perfect complement to the children's room and can realize the princess dream of little girls.</li> <li><strong>Safe for Kids to Use:</strong> This vanity set will not affect children's health with non-toxic and odorless paint. The rounded corners and burr-free surface can prevent kids form from being injured accidentally. In addition  the table features an anti-tipping design and can be fixed to the wall for added safety.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble & Clean:</strong> Some simple assembly is required  all necessary hardware and detailed instructions are included  all you have to do is attach the legs and mirror. The smooth surface is easy to clean  and the stains left on it can be quickly wiped with a damp cloth.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Pink</li> <li>Material: MDF  pine</li> <li>Dimension of table: 27.5" x 13.5" x 41.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of stool: 12" x 12" x 12.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight of vanity set: 25.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of table: 33 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of stool: 66 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Dressing table</li> <li>1 x Stool</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Toddler & Kids Furniture > Kids Vanities,,Dimension of table:27.5" x 13.5" x 41.5" (L x W x H); Dimension of stool:12" x 12" x 12.5" (L x W x H); ,Kids Vanities,,,Pink,HW64356PI,shopify,420,1,deny,manual,89.99,89.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_334_19.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_325_18.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw64356pi.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_336_37.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_274_10.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_319_18.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_340_19.jpg,7
foldable-high-chair-with-multiple-adjustable-backrest-black,Foldable High chair with Multiple Adjustable Backrest-Black,94823675,https://www.costway.com/foldable-high-chair-with-multiple-adjustable-backrests.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=16386&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<ul> <li>Freestanding available after folding</li> <li>Silent built-in real wheels for easily move</li> <li>5-point safety restraint system ensures baby's safe</li> <li>Foldable design for space saving  no installation required</li> <li>Detachable double tray for easily clean and maintain  top tray is dishwasher safe</li> <li>All the corners of highchair are smooth without sharp edges to avoid extra injury</li> <li>7 adjustable height positions  5 positions recline  adjustable footrest and 3 position adjustable trays</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● High Chair with Multiple Adjustable:</strong> Different with traditional high chair  this baby highchair has a multiple adjustable frame. The backrest is provided with 5 adjustable positions which is ideal for different use needs. And the footrest can also be adjusted into 3 different positions to meet baby's postures. The length of footrest has 3 levels to fit your baby's body. The trays have 3 adjustable positions and the trays are also easily detachable when you don't need.<br /><strong>● 7 Levels Height Adjustable Design:</strong> The baby highchair has a user-friendly design that the seat height is adjustable with 7 positions. You no longer need to choose various high chairs to match different height tables in your home. Just buy one  you will have a versatile baby high chair to meet your furniture. We also use durable iron pipes as main structure to provide stable protection and avoid rollover caused by playfulness or external force.<br /><strong>● Free Installation with Foldable Structure:</strong> How to storage things are often the daily trouble for the families which have babies. This high chair have scientific frame to fold for easily storage. The detachable trays also can be fixed on the legs for space saving. The highchair can stand freely after fold without additional support. No installation required is ideal for convenient use to save time and energy. There are two built-in rear wheels  mobile more convenient.<br /><strong>● Multi-use High Chair  Grow with Your Baby:</strong> Buying a baby highchair is actually an investment for families with a baby. The baby high chair is suitable for 0 to 5 years to give you a better return. With the multi-function frame  it can be used as eating chair  game chair  feeding chair or even a toddler chair (remove the trays ). The high chair can perfectly match the growth needs  seamlessly transitioning from newborn to toddler.<br /><strong>● Easy to Clean with Detachable Design:</strong> Cleanliness has always been a top concern for baby products. Contact with detachable trays and seat cushion  our baby high chair is easy to clean and maintain after daily use. The removable PP top tray is also dishwasher safe. And the PU leather cushion is waterproof that you just need to wipe the smudges with a clean cloth. 5-point safety harness ensures security for your little baby. All the corners of our baby highchair are smooth without sharp edges.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Net weight: 18.5 lbs</li> <li>Gross weight: 23 lbs</li> <li>Suitable ages: 0 to 5 years</li> <li>Max weight capacity: 50 lbs</li> <li>Oversize of tray: 52 x 31 (L x W)</li> <li>Folding size: 54 x 27x 85 (L x Wx H)</li> <li>Overall size: 54 x 75x 105 (L x Wx H)</li> <li>Materials: PP + Iron + PU Leather (seat cushion)</li> <li>Cleaning and maintain: Top dinner tray is dishwasher safe</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Nursery Furniture > High Chairs,,Oversize of tray:52 x 31 (L x W); Folding size:54 x 27x 85 (L x Wx H); Overall size:54 x 75x 105 (L x Wx H); ,High Chairs,Clearance