 used as a flower stand  becoming a good decoration for balconies  gardens  and flower shops.<br />● <strong>Easy to Assemble and Clean:</strong> The structure of this ladder bookcase is simple. Therefore  regarding the detailed instructions provided  the installation will be easy. Product dimension: 19" x 12.5" x 45"(L x W x H). Besides  it is coated with varnish to make it smooth and free of burrs  making it easy to clean.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown/Natural</li> <li>Material: Bamboo</li> <li>Dimension: 19" x 12.5" x 45" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight Capacity: 22 lbs per tier</li> <li>Net Weight: 9 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Garden > Plant Stands,,Dimension:19" x 12.5" x 45" (L x W x H); ,Plant Stands,On Sale,,Natural,HW65606NA,shopify,8,1,deny,manual,49.99,49.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/11_350_15.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_392_20.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_557_13.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/2/12_260_12.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_583_106.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_555_7.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_532_5.jpg,7
a-shaped-high-chair-with-4-lockable-wheels-black,A-Shaped High Chair with 4 Lockable Wheels-Black,40735962,https://www.costway.com/a-shaped-high-chair-with-4-lockable-wheels.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=16478&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This foldable high chair is made of superior material and has sturdy and durable construction.</p> <p> </p> <p>In order to provide you with comffortable using experience  we designed with 5-point safety harness and safety baffle which can effectively prevent the baby from slipping off.  And it has  4 lockable wheels can keep stable and safe. Besides that  4 360°wheels make this easier to moving in the house. And it provides you with large space for comfortable using. More than that  it is super easy to clean and fold. you can take it anywhere and it will accompany you for a long time.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for this product  don't hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Made of high-qualified material</li> <li>Equipped with a sturdy and durable construction</li> <li>Provide you with extra large space for using freely</li> <li>7 Adjustable height is suitable for various height tables</li> <li>Has a stable and secure support for preventing babies from slipping off</li> <li>5 Point safty haness for keeping baby right on place and safe</li> <li>Easy to fold and carry</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● A-Shaped Unique Highchair:</strong> How to keep this babies safe is a question we have been exploring. So we designed this A-shaped high chair to improve stability. On the basis of the ordinary triangular structure  2 sturdy supports are added on both sides of the highchair  which greatly increases the stability. At the same time  the 5-point safety harness and safety baffle can effectively prevent the baby from slipping off. We suggested the highchair should be used for babies of 0-36 months.<br /><strong>● 4 Lockable 360-degree Wheels:</strong> We made a lot of efforts to improve mom's convenience. This is a useful design that the high chair contains 4 lockable wheels. This allows the highchair to stand firmly and prevents sudden slithering from causing harm to the baby. Four 360 degree wheels make this easier to move from the living room to the kitchen if you want. Horseshoe-shaped leg design is safety and stability  greatly giving your baby more protection  but also do not hurt the floor.<br /><strong>● Detachable Large Storage Basket:</strong> Considering the trouble getting baby supplies for moms  we added an extra large mesh storage basket to the highchair. It’s helpful to store bibs  towels  baby toys for quick access. When the baby needs feeding or playing  it's handy for moms to pick up. The four hook makes storage basket easy for moms to remove and clean. The self-standing folding can be placed in the corner or next to the cupboard without taking up too much space when you're not using.<br /><strong>● Multi-Functional Adjustment:</strong> INFANS highchair could meet all your needs. 1. The seat height is adjustable with 7 positions to match different height tables. 2. The 3 position backrest provides the most comfortable space with your baby grows. 3. The 3-position footrest to meet baby's different postures. 4.The length of footrest has 3 levels to get the most comfortable position for baby's legs. 5. The 3-positions trays for babies of different ages to eat or play from newborn to toddler.<br /><strong>● Convenient to Clean:</strong> Do you always have trouble with cleanliness? INFANS highchair helped moms solve this problem. The highchair contains detachable double trays. The upper tray is dishwasher safe can be used for babies to feed or eat. The lower tray is the play area where the babies can enjoy playing time. The removable and waterproof PU cushion cover is easy to wipe and avoids the accumulation of dust. Our kids can enjoy a comfortable space with the soft and thicken and soft cushion.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Net weight: 16.6 lbs</li> <li>Suitable ages: 0-36 months</li> <li>Max weight capacity: 50 lbs</li> <li>Overall size: 22 x 26 x 32 ( max)</li> <li>Folding Size: 22" x 9" x 37"( L x W x H )</li> <li>Over Size of tray: 20.5" x 12" ( L x W )</li> <li>Material: Iron + PP + PU leather ( seat cushion)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Nursery Furniture > High Chairs,,Overall size:22 x 26 x 32 ( max); Folding Size:22" x 9" x 37"( L x W x H ); Over Size of tray:20.5" x 12" ( L x W ); ,High Chairs,,,Black,BB5585BK,shopify,426,1,deny,manual,109.99,109.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_365_9.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_328_4.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_307_4.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_277_4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_343_7.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_322_4.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_337_7.jpg,7
