efforts to improve mom's convenience. This is a useful design that the high chair contains 4 lockable wheels. This allows the highchair to stand firmly and prevents sudden slithering from causing harm to the baby. Four 360 degree wheels make this easier to move from the living room to the kitchen if you want. Horseshoe-shaped leg design is safety and stability  greatly giving your baby more protection  but also do not hurt the floor.<br /><strong>● Detachable Large Storage Basket:</strong> Considering the trouble getting baby supplies for moms  we added an extra large mesh storage basket to the highchair. It’s helpful to store bibs  towels  baby toys for quick access. When the baby needs feeding or playing  it's handy for moms to pick up. The four hook makes storage basket easy for moms to remove and clean. The self-standing folding can be placed in the corner or next to the cupboard without taking up too much space when you're not using.<br /><strong>● Multi-Functional Adjustment:</strong> INFANS highchair could meet all your needs. 1. The seat height is adjustable with 7 positions to match different height tables. 2. The 3 position backrest provides the most comfortable space with your baby grows. 3. The 3-position footrest to meet baby's different postures. 4.The length of footrest has 3 levels to get the most comfortable position for baby's legs. 5. The 3-positions trays for babies of different ages to eat or play from newborn to toddler.<br /><strong>● Convenient to Clean:</strong> Do you always have trouble with cleanliness? INFANS highchair helped moms solve this problem. The highchair contains detachable double trays. The upper tray is dishwasher safe can be used for babies to feed or eat. The lower tray is the play area where the babies can enjoy playing time. The removable and waterproof PU cushion cover is easy to wipe and avoids the accumulation of dust. Our kids can enjoy a comfortable space with the soft and thicken and soft cushion.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Net weight: 16.6 lbs</li> <li>Suitable ages: 0-36 months</li> <li>Max weight capacity: 50 lbs</li> <li>Overall size: 22 x 26 x 32 ( max)</li> <li>Folding Size: 22" x 9" x 37"( L x W x H )</li> <li>Over Size of tray: 20.5" x 12" ( L x W )</li> <li>Material: Iron + PP + PU leather ( seat cushion)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Baby & Kids > Nursery Furniture > High Chairs,,Overall size:22 x 26 x 32 ( max); Folding Size:22" x 9" x 37"( L x W x H ); Over Size of tray:20.5" x 12" ( L x W ); ,High Chairs,,,Navy,BB5585NY,shopify,279,1,deny,manual,146,292,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/1/01_14_17.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/6/06_13_34.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/b/bb5585ny_.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/3/03_17_19.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/4/04_16_19.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/2/02_15_19.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/0/5/05_14_34.jpg,7
5-position-folding-floor-gaming-chair-navy,5-Position Folding Floor Gaming Chair-Navy,62503749,https://www.costway.com/360-degree-swivel-folding-floor-gaming-chair-with-adjustable-backrest.html?piid=9221000&fee=152&fep=16488&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>High quality fabric covering is breathable  tear-resistant and durable for long term use.</p> <p> </p> <p>Sit in comfort with our adjustable swivel floor chair. This folding floor gaming chair is filled with high density sponge that is soft to touch. Compared with other common floor chairs  our uniquely designed floor gaming chair features 360-degree swivel design that will add much fun to your leisure time. 5 adjustable backrest angles enable you to find the most comfortable sitting position. Besides  this swivel floor chair is equipped with a removable base cover to protect your floor from scratching. It can be easily taken off for cleaning when getting dirty. The backrest of this chair is also foldable for easy storage. With its simple and modern appearance  it will perfectly match with any home styles.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for such a product  don't hesitate to place an order.</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>360-degree swivel base for all-around movement</li> <li>5 different backrest positions allow you to find the most suitable sitting position</li> <li>High density sponge padded seat is comfortable to sit on</li> <li>Heavy duty iron structure ensures its sturdiness and durability</li> <li>Removable base cover will protect your floor and is easy for cleaning</li> <li>High quality fabric covering is breathable and wear-resistant</li> <li>Foldable design is space-saving and convenient to store</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 360 Degrees Swivel Base:</strong> Unlike other common floor gaming chair  our folding floor gaming chair features a 360-degree swivel base that adds much fun to your leisure time. You can enjoy all-around movement as you like. Meanwhile  its simple and modern appearance will perfectly match various home styles.<br /><strong>● 5 Adjustable Backrest Positions:</strong> The backrest can be adjusted to 5 different positions to fit your body perfectly. Free angle adjustment enables you to lay the chair to take a nap  lounge to watch your favorite movie  or sit upright to play board games. Besides  ergonomic design will relieve back fatigue  allowing for a long time sitting.<br /><strong>● Solid Construction and Soft Padding:</strong> Filled with high-density sponge  this padded floor chair is of great resilience and soft to touch. When sitting on it  you could completely relax. The heavy-duty iron structure ensures the sturdiness and durability of the chair. It can bear a maximum weight of 300 lbs.<br /><strong>● Removable Base Cover and Breathable Fabric:</strong> This swivel floor chair is equipped with a removable base cover to protect your floor from scratching. It can be easily taken off when it gets dirty. Additionally  the whole chair is covered with superior fabric  which is breathable  tear-resistant and durable for long-term use.<br /><strong>● Foldable Design and Easy to Store:</strong> The backrest of our lazy sofa chair is foldable. If you want to make room for some indoor activities  you can just fold it up and tuck it under the table for easy storage. When you want to take a rest  just take it out  open it  and then you can sit comfortably on it.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Navy</li> <li>Material: Fabric + iron + sponge</li> <li>Net weight: 20 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimension: 23" (L) x 29.5" (W) x 32.5" (H)</li> <li>Folded size：23" (L) x 24.5" (W) x 22" (H)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 300 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Floor chair</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > Chairs > Floor Chairs,,Overall dimension:23" (L) x 29.5" (W) x 32.5" (H); Folded size:23" (L) x 24.5" (W) x 22" (H); ,Floor Chairs,Clearance,