7-x-4-5-feet-grill-gazebo-outdoor-patio-garden-bbq-canopy-shelter-brown,7 x 4.5 Feet Grill Gazebo Outdoor Patio Garden BBQ Canopy Shelter-Brown,43568207,https://www.costway.com/7-x-4-5-feet-grill-gazebo-outdoor-patio-garden-bbq-canopy-shelter.html?piid=9225200&fee=152&fep=16494&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Powder coated steel frame ensures the durability and sturdiness<br />● 8 anchors and reinforced structures enhance stability<br />● Storage metal shelf and 5 hooks can hold all kinds of items<br />● Made of polyester with PU coating  weather-resistant and waterproof<br />● The large size offers enough space and shade for you<br />● Stylish arch canopy can match any outdoor surroundings<br />● Perfect for hosting BBQs  picnics and parties<br />● Easy assembly with detailed instruction</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Sturdy and Durable Steel Frame:</strong> With a sturdy powder coated steel frame  this grill gazebo ensures durability and rust resistance for long-term use. Besides  the reinforced beams enhance the stability  which is perfect for outdoor use. Importantly  two anchors are provided for each leg to make it steadier.<br />● <strong>Waterproof and Stable Canopy:</strong> The canopy is made of durable polyester material  which has wear resistance and heat resistance to provide a cool environment for you and your family in hot summer. Moreover  the PU coating surface is more waterproof. Also  hook and loop fasteners can make the canopy fixed on the steel frame more firmly.<br />● <strong>Storage Shelf and 5 Utensil Hooks:</strong> Equipped with extra metal shelf  the grill gazebo provides enough space to place kinds of items for convenient use  such as grill accessories  tableware  beverages  food  etc. Besides  it also includes five hooks for hanging tools. And the small notch on the shelf can help you open the beer.<br />● <strong>Stylish Design for Widely Use:</strong> Combining aesthetics and functionality  this grill gazebo with classic style can be matched with any outdoor style. The fashionable arched canopy design is very easy to attract people's attention. What’s more  the practical gazebo is perfect for barbecue  picnic  party or rest.<br />● <strong>Large Space and Easy to Assemble:</strong> The overall size of this grill gazebo is 85” x 42.5” x 83” (L x W x H)  which can provide enough open space and shade for you and your friends in hot sun and rainy days. Besides  it can be assembled effortless with an easy to follow instruction and all accessories included in the package.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown</li> <li>Material: Steel + polyester</li> <li>Product dimension: 85" x 53" x 83z' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 31lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Grill gazebo</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Gazebos,,Product dimension:85" x 53" x 83z' (L x W x H); ,Gazebos,Drop Price,,Brown,OP70381CF,shopify,87,1,deny,manual,149.99,218.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_653_21.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_637_22.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/p/op70381cf.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_526_18.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_659_17.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_468_14.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_607_20.jpg,7
