ickened boards  the 2-door media cabinet promises endurance  sturdiness and stability. Thus  your belongings and decorative items can safely displayed or stored.</li> <li><strong>Contemporary Style:</strong> The wall-mounted hanging desk not only saves space but also adds a touch of contemporary elegance. Its floating design creates a visually appealing  perfect for creating the illusion of extra space.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black/White</li> <li>Material: Engineered Wood  MDF</li> <li>Overall Dimension: 42.5” x 13” x 12” (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of Open Cube: 8” x 12.5” x 11”(L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of Cabinet Door: 10” x 10.5”(L x W)</li> <li>Weight Capacity of Tabletop: 132 lbs</li> <li>Weight Capacity of Each Cube: 22 lbs</li> <li>Net Weight: 34 lbs</li> <li> </li> <li>Package Includes:</li> <li>1 x Floating Cabinet</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > Entertainment Centers & TV Stands,,Overall Dimension:42.5” x 13” x 12” (L x W x H); Dimension of Open Cube:8” x 12.5” x 11”(L x W x H); Dimension of Cabinet Door:10” x 10.5”(L x W); ,Entertainment Centers & TV Stands,,,White,HW59053WH,shopify,448,1,deny,manual,74.99,74.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW59053WH/Wall_Mounted_Floating_2_Door_Desk_Hutch_Storage_Shelves_White-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW59053WH/Wall_Mounted_Floating_2_Door_Desk_Hutch_Storage_Shelves_White-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW59053WH/Wall_Mounted_Floating_2_Door_Desk_Hutch_Storage_Shelves_White-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW59053WH/Wall_Mounted_Floating_2_Door_Desk_Hutch_Storage_Shelves_White-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/med