rful support and enhance robustness. In addition  the patio gazebo is also equipped with 8 ground stakes for fixing to enhance additional stability.<br /><strong>● Practical Netting Curtain:</strong> Featuring with 4 high-quality netting sidewalls  the gazebo can bring a cooler and more comfortable experience in summer. After the zipper is closed  it can keep you away from outside interference and add more privacy to bring you convenience and enjoyment with your family or friends. Of course  it can also be tied up to enjoy a spacious open space.<br /><strong>● Multi-purpose for Wide Application:</strong> This stylish gazebo is a perfect addition in any outdoor space. It is suitable for commercial or personal use and can accommodate many people. Whether you want to hold outdoor parties  family picnics  backyard barbecues  or other social gatherings in your garden or yards  the gazebo can meet your needs fully.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown</li> <li>Material: Polyester + steel</li> <li>Product dimension: 12" x 10" x 9.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 81lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Gazebo</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Gazebos,,Product dimension:12" x 10" x 9.5" (L x W x H); ,Gazebos,Clearance,,Brown,OP70382CF,shopify,308,1,deny,manual,209.99,269.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_366_11.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_321_78.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_336_84.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_342_85.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/11_17