15px;"></p><p><strong>● 2-Tiered Vented Durable Top:</strong> Made of PU-coating polyester material  the canopy is durable and weather-resistant enough for long term use. And the dual-tiered top design can provide ample airflow to ensure good air circulation for keeping cool in hot days. Besides  the waterproof fabric with a drain hole design can prevent water accumulation in rainy days.<br /><strong>● Sturdy and Stable Construction:</strong> The gazebo comes with a strong metal frame and 4 square panels  which ensure the stability and sturdiness. And the reinforced 8 legs and octagon design provide powerful support and make sure the high security. In addition  16 ground stakes are provided to fix the gazebo better in various weather conditions.<br /><strong>● Unique Design for Widely Use:</strong> The octagonal design with top decoration makes the gazebo more beautiful and has more space. With the classic appearance  the unique gazebo can match any outdoor space  which can be a great addition in your garden or patio. You can use it for outdoor parties  family picnics  backyard barbecues  and other social gatherings.<br /><strong>● Netting Curtain with Thoughtful Design:</strong> The gazebo feature with the netting sidewalls  which equipped with 4 2-way zipper design to keep you away from disturbing of outside and add more privacy to bring you convenience and enjoyment with your family or friends. Meanwhile  the straps and elastic ropes are designed to fasten the netting curtain.<br /><strong>● Large Space and Detailed Instruction:</strong> The 12' x 10' top offers a wide range of space to accommodate a group of people for social gathering. Besides  all parts and hardware in the package are clearly marked  so the patio gazebo can be assembled quickly and effortlessly by simply following the instruction. Canopy Shelter Double Top W/Netting Sidewalls</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown</li> <li>Material: Polyester + steel</li> <li>Product dimensio