>● Security Assurance:</strong> The kid's car is equipped with a slow start function to avoid the risk of sudden acceleration. Besides  4 wear-resistant wheels are made of superior PP material without leaking or tire burst. Its spring suspension system and seat with multi-point safety belt offer a safer driving experience.<br /><strong>● Real Driving Experience:</strong> This ride-on truck features a double door with a magnetic lock  a multi-media center  a shifter for forward and reverse  horn buttons  shining LED lights  and so on. Kids can switch modes and adjust the volume by pressing the button on the dashboard. These designs will give your kids an authentic driving experience.<br /><strong>● Perfect Gift for Kids:</strong> Thanks to 2 powerful drive motors  this car speed can reach 3-6 km/h to provide an exciting feeling for kids. With a cool and stylish look  this kid's ride-on car is a perfect gift for kids aged 3-7 years old. Your child can drive the car to race with friends  fully releasing their youthful energy.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Red</li> <li>Material: PP  iron</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 49" x 31" x 32" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 48 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 66 lbs</li> <li>Speed: 3-6 km/h</li> <li>Charge time: 8-12 hours</li> <li>Battery: 12 V 7 AH</li> <li>Recommended for ages: 3-7 years old</li> <li>Box QTY: 2(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Kids ride on car</li> <li>1 x 2.4 G remote control</li> <li>1 x Charger</li> <li>1 x MP3 cable</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Ride On Toys > Powered Ride On Toys,,Overall dimensions:49" x 31" x 32" (L x W x H); ,Powered Ride On Toys,Clearance,,Red,TY327745RE+,shopify,54,1,deny,manual,154.99,174.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/7/27_29_33.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27