casters for exceptional stability and free mobility</li> <li>Suitable for study room and office to contribute to work efficiency improvement</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Enjoy Comfortable Massage Experience:</strong> Comfortable massage experience can be easily realized by 6 vibration points distributed on the backrest and seat. In this way  the body with less fatigue helps your mind perform better  which will contribute to higher work efficiency. It also comes with a remote control that allows you set the massage intensity  mode and zone.<br />● <strong>Big and Tall Office Chair:</strong> The big and tall executive chair conforms to the ergonomic principle  reflected in the integrated headrest  humanized lumbar support  wide seat and padded armrest. It fits well with your body curve and thus takes the sitting comfortableness to the next level. Also  it is worth mentioning that it is designed with a rocking function  easier for to relax your body.<br />● <strong>Fairly Easy to Find Your Desired Height:</strong> Considering that individual requirements differ a lot in different occasions  the executive chair adopts height-adjustable design  to fulfill different needs. Therefore  you are capable of adjusting the seat to your desired height  according to either the desk height or your sitting posture  just by means of the right handle beneath the seat.<br />● <strong>High Resilience Sponge and Soft Leather:</strong> The selected sponge filled inside  with high resilience and density  is supposed to avoid discomfort even that you sit there for long time. Meanwhile  the breathable and durable faux leather upholstery will provide years of enjoyment for you  its smooth surface for easy clean-up as well. The chair can withstand up to 400 lbs and it is very easy to assemble and set up<br /><strong>● 360° Swivel and Smooth Rolling Casters:</strong> The massage computer chair is equipped with a 5-claw base  so as to evenly disperse the pressure for hi