big-tall-500lb-massage-office-chair-black,Massage Executive Office Chair with 6 Vibrating Points-Black,08416935,https://www.costway.com/massage-executive-office-chair-with-6-vibrating-points.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=16644&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● 6-point massage helps relax muscle tension and keeps you relaxed<br />● Adjustable height and 360° swivel seat cater to your individual needs<br />● Ergonomic support provided by the chair's high backrest and wide seat<br />● Neck support and padded armrests offer upgrade comfort<br />● 7-inch thick seat cushion with sponge filling offers a comfy seating experience<br />● PVC and PU leather upholstery is durable  wear-resistant and waterproof <br />● Enjoy ultimate relaxation with gentle rocking function <br />● Smooth rolling wheels for effortless mobility and convenience<br />● Sturdy 5-claw metal base and gas lift ensures 500 lbs max weight and safety<br />● Equipped with a remote control pocket and adapter pocket easy storage<br />● Height adjustment lever and tilt tension knob for easy adjustment</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong><span>● Massage Chair with 6 Points:</span></strong> The massage chair offers 6 massage points that target key areas of your body  providing relaxation and relief from muscle tension. With a remote control  you can set 2 intensities(high/low)  5 modes(pulse/press/wave/auto/normal)  and 3 massage zones(back/lumbar/thigh). Plus  the chair has a remote control pocket and an adapter pocket for easy storage.<br /><strong><span>● Big and Tall Design:</span></strong> Designed for big and tall individuals  our PU leather home office chair offers a spacious and comfortable seating area. Its stable construction features a 5-claw metal base and an SGS-certified class-4 gas lift that can support up to 500 lbs. No more worrying about feeling cramped or uncomfortable sitting for long periods of time!<br /><strong><span>● Adjustable Swivel Chair:</span></strong> The adjustable height feature allows you to find your perfect sitting position and maintain proper posture with seat height adjustment ranging from 20.5" to 24.5". The seat ensures 360° swivel in any direction. Additionally  the rocking function from 90° to 110° allows you to take a break from your tasks and indulge in a soothing back-and-forth motion.<br /><strong><span>● Ultimate Comfort and Support:</span></strong> The 7-inch thick seat cushion made of premium PU & PVC leather and high-density sponge offers softness and durability. The high backrest and neck support offer excellent support for your body  relieving tension and allowing you to focus on tasks. The sturdy armrests with soft padding take your comfort to the next level.<br /><strong><span>● Rolling Wheels for Mobility:</span></strong>  This executive massage chair is equipped with 5 rolling wheels that easily glide across different surfaces such as wooden floors  carpets  tiles and more. You can move effortlessly from one area of the office to another  enjoying seamless movement throughout the office space.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: PU PVC  Metal</li> <li>Dimension: 30" x 30" x 46" - 50" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Backrest size: 21" x 28.5" (L x W)</li> <li>Seat size: 22.5" x 21" (L x W)</li> <li>Seat Height: 20.5"-24.5"</li> <li>Armrest Height to Ground: 27"-31"</li> <li>Net weight: 51 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 500 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Office Chairs > Big and Tall Chairs,,Dimension:30" x 30" x 46" - 50" (L x W x H); Backrest size:21" x 28.5" (L x W); Seat size:22.5" x 21" (L x W); ,Big and Tall Chairs,Clearance,,Black,HW65331BK,shopify,205,1,deny,manual,174.99,189.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_349_29.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d