decors or other various items.<br />● <strong>4 Adjustable Bottom Feet:</strong> There are 4 handle knobs at the bottom of table to adjust the height slightly when the floor is not flat. And it can enhance the stability of end table. In addition  the knob can effectively prevent the floor from being scratched.<br />●<strong> Sturdy Frame for Durable Use:</strong> Made of heavy-duty steel and premium board  the frame of the side table is strong and not easy to sag or deform after putting something on. Plus  the weight capacity of top is about 45 lbs and the shelf is up to 25 lbs.<br />● <strong>Versatile Industrial Table:</strong> Without fancy decoration  the compact table is designed with industrial style. It can be placed in your living room or bedroom as side table or nightstand. And it can match really well with any style of decoration and the rest of your furniture or decors.<br />● <strong>Easy to Assemble and Maintain:</strong> The side table comes with instructions and all required accessories. You can assemble it conveniently in short time. What's more  the top of the table has veneer so that the surface is scratch proof and waterproof which is easy to clean.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Rustic brown</li> <li>Material: Particle board  steel</li> <li>Overall dimension: 16'' x 16'' x 22'' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Product weight: 9.5 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of top: 45 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of mesh shelf: 25 lbs</li> <li>Package include:</li> <li></li> <li>1 x Side table</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > End & Side Tables,,Overall dimension:16'' x 16'' x 22'' (L x W x H); ,End & Side Tables,,,Rustic Brown,HW65662,shopify,304,1,deny,manual,49.99,49.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_350_9.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08