ere is a spacious lower shelf under the table top  which not only easy accesses to items  but also increases the storage space and improves the utilization rate of space.<br /><strong>● Durable and Suitable for Outdoors:</strong> Used solid steel frame and high-quality PE rattan wicker  so that the sofa four-piece set has high stability and durability. The surface of the tea table made of toughened glass  which is smooth  safe and explosion-proof. The overall waterproof and sunscreen non-fading properties make the product suitable for outdoors.<br /><strong>● Dimension of the set:</strong> package include:2 single sofa 1 loveseat  1 coffee table  3 seat cushions and 4 back cushion. Single Sofa: 26" (L) x 24" (W) x 28.5" (H) Loveseat: 49" (L) x 24" (W) x 28.5" (H) Coffee Table: 36" (L) x 21.5" (W) x 17" (H) Cushion: 2.5" (T) Tempered Glass: 0.2" (T) Load-bearing Capacity: Single Sofa: 350lbs Loveseat: 700lbs Coffee Table: 110lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Material of sofa and coffee table: PE rattan  steel  tempered glass</li> <li>Material of cushion: D220 polyester fabric and high density sponge</li> <li>Overall dimension:</li> <li>Single sofa: 26" (L) x 24" (W) x 28.5" (H)</li> <li>Loveseat: 49" (L) x 24" (W) x 28.5" (H)</li> <li>Coffee table: 36" (L) x 21.5" (W) x 17" (H)</li> <li>Cushion : 2.5" (T)</li> <li>Tempered glass: 0.2" (T)</li> <li>Load-bearing capacity:</li> <li>Single sofa: 350LBS</li> <li>Loveseat: 700LBS</li> <li>Coffee table: 110 LBS</li> <li>Net weight：100LBS</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 3(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li></li> <li>2 x Single sofa</li> <li>1 x Loveseat</li> <li>1 x Coffee table</li> <li>3 x Seat cushions</li> <li>4 x Back cushions</li> <li>1 x Instructions</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,,Patio Conversation Sets,On Sale,,Brown,HW68640B+,shopify,26,1,deny,manual,349.99,349.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product