massage-gaming-chair-with-footrest-pink,Massage Gaming Chair with Footrest-Pink,84703512,https://www.costway.com/massage-gaming-chair-with-footrest.html?piid=9229300&fee=152&fep=16691&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This backrest can be changed to a maximum of 180° creating a similar sleeping feeling as on your bed!</p> <p> </p> <p>This gaming chair is all designed for your every need! When you playing games  the height and angle of armrest can be adjusted into a perfect position  making a successful competition. After blood-and-thunder gaming time  you can recline backrest angle and pull out the footrest pad to enjoy leisure time with TV or have a deep sleep. Supported by an iron frame and gas rod  it is stable enough to serve for years.</p> <p> </p> <p>If you are looking for massage gaming chair with footrest like this  don't hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Adjustable chair and armrest heights considered for different people</li> <li>Flexible backrest angle adjustment with a rotatable armrest to meet various needs</li> <li>Retractable footrest convenient for relaxing your leg  reducing fatigue</li> <li>Soft sponges guarantee a comfortable sitting feeling</li> <li>Iron frame with premium gas rod for extra stability</li> <li>Lumbar pillow with massage function for relax</li> <li>Smooth wheels for quiet and easy movement to any place</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Flexible Recline Angle and Adjustable Height:</strong> The angle of this multifunctional game chair can be adjusted from 90° to a maximum of 180° to provide you with a perfect relaxing position while playing games  reading  watching TV  or sleeping. Height can be changed within a range of 4 inches for different people.<br /><strong>● Multifunctional Armrest:</strong> The special armrest features a 3-inch height adjustment and 60° rotatable function  relaxing your arm and reducing your fatigue. With smooth line design and proper length  you are sure to enjoy your gaming time or have a good nap in the afternoon.<br /><strong>● Best Comfortable Service:</strong> Smooth leather surface is not only breathable to avoid stuffy feeling but durable enough to be used for years. The backrest and the headrest are stuffed with a soft sponge to serve as a comfortable seat. While the seat is filled with a high-quality sponge without easy deformation.<br /><strong>● Strong Support with Excellent Mobility:</strong> Heavy-duty metal frame with a five-point base supports a large weight capacity of 330 LBS. And our game chair is made of durable nylon wheels without rust  offering better support.<br /><strong>● More Humanized Design for Better Rest:</strong> Retractable footrest supported by metal tubes gives your legs enough resting space when sleeping on the reclining chair. Two motors in the waist pillow give you a massage experience for your health. A USB interface is included for various charging ways.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Pink</li> <li>Material: PVC+ PU+Sponge+ iron</li> <li>Overall dimension: 29'' x 27'' x 49''- 53'' (L x Wx H)</li> <li>Backrest dimension: 32'' x 22''(L x W)</li> <li>Seat dimension: 21'' x 19''(W x D)</li> <li>Armrest dimension: 11'' x 11'' - 14''(L x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 44 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 330 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Gaming chair</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Home Office > Gaming Chairs,,Overall dimension:29'' x 27'' x 49''- 53'' (L x Wx H); Backrest dimension:32'' x 22''(L x W); Seat dimension:21'' x 19''(W x D); Armrest dimension:11'' x 11'' - 14''(L x H); ,Gaming Chairs,Clearance,,Pink,HW66330PI,shopify,146,1,deny,manual,89.99,139.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/5/15_41_21.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/8/18_39_15.jpg,2,https: