3-pcs-patio-conversation-rattan-furniture-set-with-glass-top-coffee-table-and-cushions-gray,3 Pcs Patio Conversation Rattan Furniture Set with Glass Top Coffee Table and Cushions-Gray,45071892,https://www.costway.com/3-pieces-patio-conversation-rattan-furniture-set-with-glass-top-coffee-table-and-cushions.html?piid=9224700&fee=152&fep=16724&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>This 3 Pcs patio rattan bistro set can make your outdoor living become better. Made of weather-resistant rattan and sturdy steel materials  the chair is stable enough to hold around 360 Ibs weight.</p> <p> </p> <p>Thickened soft cushions can provide you with a comfortable seating experience. The cushions are covered with waterproof polyester cloth which is durable and easy to clean. Featuring with the curved armrest  this rattan chair can offer you extra support. You can put some drinks and snacks on the coffee table which is equipped with tempered glass. Installation is quite easy and speedy with all the accessories are provided. You can talk with your relatives and your family or just to have great relaxation with our 3 pieces of patio rattan furniture set.</p> <p> <br /><br />If you are looking for this product  don't hesitate to place an order!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Durable and sturdy rattan and steel materials for long service time</li> <li>The thick sponged cushion is soft and the cover is washable</li> <li>Weatherproof materials ensure the furniture set to be placed outside all year round</li> <li>The coffee table has a tempered glass top that is solid and easy to clean</li> <li>Good load-bearing capacity which can up to around 360 Ibs</li> <li>Rattan set is light enough for you to carry and transport</li> <li>Ample tabletop space for serving drinks  snacks  and fruits</li> <li>Ideal for placing in patio  lawn  garden  backyard and indoor</li> <li>Easy to install with detailed instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Reliable Stability and Durability:</strong> Made of a solid steel frame  this patio conversation set is sturdy and stable enough for long time use. Rattan materials are not easily deformed  which have a high weight capacity. Both tables and chairs are equipped with non-slip foot pads to protect your floor and add stability to the furniture.<br /><strong>● Soft Cushion & Practical Table:</strong> Featuring the soft sponge padded back and seat and cushion(pillow in the pic is not included)  these rattan chairs can provide you with a super comfortable sitting experience. Ergonomic backrest and armrests are designed for extra support. A coffee table with a tempered glass tabletop offers you a spacious place to get what you need easily.<br /><strong>● Best for Outdoor:</strong> All-weather rattan with a natural and modern look can match well with all your furniture  which is suitable for placing outdoor like patio  garden  and deck. The combination of 2 chairs and a table is perfect for close conversations or having relaxed afternoon tea with your family member.<br /><strong>● Easy to Clean and Assemble:</strong> The waterproof cover of the cushion is equipped with a zipper for easy cleaning. The table is equipped with removable tempered glass  which can be easily wiped off with a damp cloth if it is dirty. And you just need to put all the parts together by following the installation instruction.<br /><strong>● Dimensions of 3 Pieces Rattan Set:</strong> Size of chair: 25.5” x 28.8” x 33.5” (L x W x H)  size of table: 19.5’’ x 19.5’’ x 19.5’’ (L x W x H)  maximum load-bearing of chair: 360 Ibs  maximum load-bearing of the table: 90 Ibs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Rattan material: PE</li> <li>Materials: Polyester  sponge  steel  rattan</li> <li>Maximum load bearing of chair: 360 Ibs</li> <li>Maximum load bearing of the table: 90 Ibs</li> <li>Size of chair: 25.5" x 28.8" x 33.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Size of table: 19.5" x 19.5" x 19.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May