5-position-folding-floor-gaming-chair-gray,5-Position Folding Floor Gaming Chair-Gray,62503749,https://www.costway.com/360-degree-swivel-folding-floor-gaming-chair-with-adjustable-backrest.html?piid=9224700&fee=152&fep=16732&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● 360-degree swivel base for all-around movement<br />● 5 different backrest positions allow you to find the most suitable sitting position<br />● High density sponge-padded seat is comfortable to sit on<br />● Heavy duty iron structure ensures its sturdiness and durability<br />● Removable base cover will protect your floor and is easy for cleaning<br />● High quality fabric covering is breathable and wear-resistant<br />● Foldable design is space-saving and convenient to store</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 360 Degrees Swivel Base:</strong> Unlike other common floor gaming chair  our folding floor gaming chair features a 360-degree swivel base that adds much fun to your leisure time. You can enjoy all-around movement as you like. Meanwhile  its simple and modern appearance will perfectly match various home styles.<br /><strong>● 5 Adjustable Backrest Positions:</strong> The backrest can be adjusted to 5 different positions to fit your body perfectly. Free angle adjustment enables you to lay the chair to take a nap  lounge to watch your favorite movie  or sit upright to play board games. Besides  ergonomic design will relieve back fatigue  allowing for a long time sitting.<br /><strong>● Solid Construction and Soft Padding:</strong> Filled with high-density sponge  this padded floor chair is of great resilience and soft to touch. When sitting on it  you could completely relax. The heavy-duty iron structure ensures the sturdiness and durability of the chair. It can bear a maximum weight of 300 lbs.<br /><strong>● Removable Base Cover and Breathable Fabric:</strong> This swivel floor chair is equipped with a removable base cover to protect your floor from scratching. It can be easily taken off when it gets dirty. Additionally  the whole chair is covered with superior fabric  which is breathable  tear-resistant and durable for long-term use.<br /><strong>● Foldable Design and Easy to Store:</strong> The backrest of our lazy sofa chair is foldable. If you want to make room for some indoor activities  you can just fold it up and tuck it under the table for easy storage. When you want to take a rest  just take it out  open it  and then you can sit comfortably on it.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Gray</li> <li>Material: Fabric + iron + sponge</li> <li>Net weight: 20 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimension: 23" (L) x 29.5" (W) x 32.5" (H)</li> <li>Folded size：23" (L) x 24.5" (W) x 22" (H)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 300 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Floor chair</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > Chairs > Floor Chairs,,Overall dimension:23" (L) x 29.5" (W) x 32.5" (H); Folded size:23" (L) x 24.5" (W) x 22" (H); ,Floor Chairs,Clearance,,Gray,HW65592GR,shopify,11,1,deny,manual,119.99,119.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_690_4.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_631_27.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/w/hw65592gr.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/_/2/_2_92_16.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/7/_/7_595_15.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_650_4.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_601_27.jpg,7
