 training. Also  4-level height adjustable handlebar is suitable for family members in all ages. 2 resistance bands are included in the package for stretching and more.<br /><strong>● Easy and Quick to Assemble:</strong> The assembly is no longer troublesome with step-by-step instruction and premium hardware. There is no need to install bungee cords by yourself because they are pre-assembled. And the installation of leg tubes requires no screws  and you simply need to screw them in.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Green + Black</li> <li>Material: Metal + 420D Oxford Fabric</li> <li>Overall Dimension: 40" x 40" x 42.5"-51.5"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Folding Size: 30.5" x 13"(L x W)</li> <li>Adjustable Height: 42.5"/45.5"/48.5"/51.5"</li> <li>Jumping Area Height: 11"</li> <li>Jumping Area Diameter: 29.5"</li> <li>Resistance Band Length: 42"</li> <li>Weight Capacity: 330 lbs</li> <li>Net Weight: 16.5 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li></ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Outdoor Play > Trampolines,,Overall Dimension:40" x 40" x 42.5"-51.5"(L x W x H); Folding Size:30.5" x 13"(L x W); Jumping Area Diameter:29.5"; ,Trampolines,,,Green,TW10010GN,shopify,88,1,deny,manual,82.99,146.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/8/_/8_639_17.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_772_109.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/-/4-1_4.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_681_16.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_675_66.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_728_90.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/p