dian  your body will always be within the center of the rocking chair when you sway on it.</li> <li><strong>Ergonomic Design for Great Comfort:</strong> This porch rocker is designed with streamlined slat structure to effectively promote the heat dissipation  offering you the optimal sitting experience. Besides  the curved armrest and high backrest make it easy to relax your arms and back.</li> <li><strong>Elegant Style for Versatility:</strong> With unique look and stylish design  the rocking chair can add a touch of minimalism and elegance to any décor. You can seat on it to relax yourself and enjoy leisure time in the living room  garden  patio  balcony and other areas.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble & Clean:</strong> This rocking chair comes with a clear and brief instruction  which has straight forward illustrations and descriptions. Each part and screw has its own code to take you little time and energy. In addition  its smooth surface is easy to keep clean with a damp cloth.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Material: Rubber wood</li> <li>Overall dimension: 25.5" x 32.5" x 46.5"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Seat dimension: 21.5" x 19" (W x D)</li> <li>Height from the ground to the seat: 17.5"</li> <li>Net weight: 32lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 300 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Rocking chair</li> <li>1 x User manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Patio Rocking Chairs & Gliders,,Overall dimension:25.5" x 32.5" x 46.5"(L x W x H); Seat dimension:21.5" x 19" (W x D); ,Patio Rocking Chairs & Gliders,On Sale,,White,HW64492WH,shopify,128,1,deny,manual,124.99,129.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW64492WH/Rocking_Chair_with_Solid_Wooden_Frame_White-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb