4-pieces-patio-rattan-furniture-set-with-cushions-red,4 Pieces Patio Rattan Furniture Set with Cushions-Red,13890462,https://www.costway.com/4-pieces-patio-rattan-furniture-set-with-glass-table.html?piid=9210200&fee=152&fep=16770&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Rattan patio set includes one loveseat  two single chairs and one coffee table.<br />● Made of high-quality rattan with the strong built-in frame structure<br />● Functional and beautiful design perfect for garden  backyard and balcony<br />● Rattan coffee table with thick tempered glass top<br />● Thick padded cushions provide optimal comfort and relaxation<br />● The cover of the cushion is removable and washable with a smooth zipper.<br />● Concise design and exquisite workmanship add a touch of classic.<br />● Easy to assemble with clear instruction</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li><strong>Heavy Duty Construction:</strong> The frame of this patio furniture set is made of premium steel that is durable and sturdy for strong endurance and superior load-bearing capacity. Besides  high-quality rattan is weather-resistant and fade-resistant  which ensures that this furniture can serve you for a long time.</li> <li><strong>Cozy and Humanized Design:</strong> Comes with thick padded cushions  this 4-piece patio will provide you with an extraordinary comfort experience. And  with a smooth zipper  the cover of the cushion is removable and washable. Designed for ultra comfy  this patio furniture set has an Ergonomic design of wide armrests and curved backrests.</li> <li><strong>Functional Coffee Table:</strong> The strong detachable tempered glass on top of the coffee table adsorbs four suckers for added safety. More  Extra crossbar support under the table top ensures overall stability and durability. The large rectangular rattan coffee table is an ideal place to keep drinks  food and some decorations.</li> <li><strong>Free Combination Sofa Set:</strong> This 4-piece rattan patio furniture set includes two single sofas  one loveseat and one coffee table that can accommodate 4-5 persons with ease and comfort. Even better  with a lightweight and separate design  you can alter or change the positions or directions according to your needs and requirements.</li> <li><strong>Dimension of the Patio Set:</strong> The single sofa dimension is 23.5" x25" x31"(L x W x H)  the size of the double sofa is 43.5" x 25"x 31" (L x W x H)  and size of coffee table: 35" x 18" x 17.5" (L x W x H). Benefiting from quality materials and sturdy construction  the weight capacity of a coffee table is 165 lbs  the weight capacity of a single sofa is 400 lbs and the weight capacity of a bench is 800 lbs.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><table border="0"> <tbody> <tr> <td>Color:</td> <td>Red</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Material:</td> <td>PE Rattan  Polyester Fiber  Steel  Sponge</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Single Sofa Dimension:</td> <td> 23.5" x 25" x 31" (L x W x H)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Loveseat Dimension: </td> <td>43.5" x 25"x 31" (L x W x H)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Coffee Table Dimension: </td> <td>35" x 18" x 17.5" (L x W x H)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Net Weight:</td> <td>70 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Loveseat capacity:</td> <td>792 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Single chair capacity:</td> <td>400 lbs</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Coffee table capacity: </td> <td>165 lbs</td> </tr> <tr><td>Box Qty</td> <td>1(May vary by batch)</td> </tr> </tbody> </table>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Patio Furniture Sets > Patio Conversation Sets,,Single Sofa Dimension: 23.5" x 25" x 31" (L x W x H); Loveseat Dimension :43.5" x 25"x 31" (L x W x H); Coffee Table Dimension :35" x 18" x 17.5" (L x W x H); ,Patio Conversation Sets,Clearance,,Red,HW63238RE,shopify,1270,1,deny,manual,199.99,199.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/a/_/a_19.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78ea