h can prevent the accidental falls when your kids sleeping.</li> <li><strong>Sturdy Pine Wood Construction:</strong> Constructed by premium pine wood frame and reinforced hardware  the bunk bed ensures sturdiness and durability. And stable structure can prevent shaking when turning over  thus bringing you or your child a sweet sleep. Besides  10 thickened support slats make each bed can hold up to 360lbs.</li> <li><strong>Compact Full Bunk Bed with Trundle:</strong> This full bunk bed is design for rooms with limited space  which is ideal for families with two children or families who have guests visiting. More  the bunk bed comes with a trundle bed. In addition to being an extra bed to preparing for your kid's friends  it can also be used as a large storage compartment to store quilts or other items.</li> <li><strong>Modern Style for Wide Application:</strong> This bunk bed with a white appearance is in a modern style  which adds a unique charm to your bedroom. Meanwhile  the concise design allows the bunk bed to match a variety of home decorations. It can be used in bedrooms  children's rooms  dormitories  apartments or other places with compact space.</li> <li><strong>Separable Two Beds:</strong> The bunk bed can be configured into two separate twin beds and placed in different rooms. Multi-functional design can meet your requirements in different periods and places. In addition  the trundle bed with wheels is simple to pull or push. And with the help of the easy to follow instruction  you can easily assemble this bed in a short time.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White</li> <li>Material: Pine wood + MDF + plywood</li> <li>Overall dimension: 79.5" x 57" x 60" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Trundle dimension: 75.5" x 40.5" x 10.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity of upper bed: 360 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of lower bed: 360 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity of trundle: 270lbs</li> <li>Suitable mattress size: Full (mattress not included)</li> <l