 set has a high durability for longer use. The table is also added with a cross bar on each side and non-slip pads at the bottom for enhanced stability with a high load capacity.<br /><strong>● Superior Comfortable Stool:</strong> 4-sided footrest is provided to fully relax your leg  making it comfortable for you even sitting for a long period of time. The stool surface is specially curved to fit the buttock well  which can greatly disperse the pressure when sitting and keep you always feel comfortable.<br /><strong>● Stylish and Versatile Usage:</strong> A smooth tabletop with white legs adds a modern and stylish feeling to any living space as an attractive decoration. It is perfect for kitchen  dining room  restaurant as well as great breakfast nook  providing spacious space to enjoy dining time with friends and family.<br /><strong>● 3 Pieces Bar Table Set:</strong> 3pcs table set includes 1 pub table and 2 stools to comfortably accommodate 2 persons to have a simple dinner. It provides a perfect place for enjoying drinks  breakfast or meals with your friends or family  suitable for bar  dining room  kitchen  or office break room.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: As the picture shows</li> <li>Material: Rubber wood  MDF</li> <li>Pub table dimensions: 36” x 26” x 36.5” (L x W x H)</li> <li>Stool dimensions: 13” x 13” x 24.5” (L x W x H)</li> <li>Table weight capacity: 100 lbs</li> <li>Stool weight capacity: 300 lbs</li> <li>Net weight: 66 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Pub table</li> <li>2 x Stools</li> <li>1 x Instruction manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Kitchen & Dining > Dining Room Sets,,Pub table dimensions:36” x 26” x 36.5” (L x W x H); Stool dimensions:13” x 13” x 24.5” (L x W x H); ,Dining Room Sets,,,Brown,HW65218,shopify,91,1,deny,manual,209.99,209.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_364_50.jpg,1,https://a