h-quality materials and ASTM certification for safe use</li> <li>Has a gear-shift handle which corresponds to two forward gears and one reverse gear</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Two Optional Modes:</strong> This kid ride-on tractor can be easily operated in two ways via 2.4GHZ parent remote control mode and battery-operated mode. Parents can control the vehicle in the car by remote control to ensure the baby's safety while going outside. And baby can and children can play freely through the steering wheel while pressing the go and forward button to experience the thrill of speed.<br />● <strong>Safe Protection Devices:</strong> The four tires are shockproof and have a slow start design  enabling kids will not get alarmed when the electric vehicles suddenly get started. And the comfortable and large seat with a safety belt makes sure your children have fun at the same time to maximize the safety of your child.<br />● <strong>Funny Driving Experience:</strong> Turn on the power switch  select two forward / reverse gears  and then press the foot pedal to provide your child with a speed of 3-8 miles per hour. It's very simple to let your child drive this tractor and trailer to exercise your child's hand and foot coordination ability<br />● <strong>Detachable Large Trailer:</strong> This electric ride-on tractor comes with a large trailer  which can be used to transport toys  flowers  straws  etc for kids. Through riding this tractor  children can clean the garden with their parents and enjoy the happy parent-child time<br />● <strong>The Best Farm Gift:</strong> Children are always playing the role of adults. This lawn tractor with a trailer is perfect for children to play indoors and outdoors. Equipped with a built-in audio device  you can connect the music input from the mobile phone through a USB interface  and it can accompany the children for several hours while pretending to play.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Green/Pink/Red</li> <li>Material: PP + iron</li> <li>Size with trailer: 53'' x 20'' x 20.5'' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Size without trailer: 33.5'' x 19.5'' x 20.5'' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 29 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 66 lbs</li> <li>Battery: 12V 7AH x 1</li> <li>Charger: 12V 700MA~1000MA</li> <li>Speed: 3 - 8 km/h</li> <li>Suitable age: 3+ Years</li> <li>Charge time: 8 -12 hours</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Ride on tractor</li> <li>1 x Instruction<br /><br /></li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Ride On Toys > Powered Ride On Toys,,Size with trailer:53'' x 20'' x 20.5'' (L x W x H); Size without trailer:33.5'' x 19.5'' x 20.5'' (L x W x H); ,Powered Ride On Toys,Drop Price,,Green,TY327774US-GN,shopify,224,1,deny,manual,164.99,318,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_520_106.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_542_111.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/0/10_233_15.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/y/ty327774us-gn_55__1.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/y/ty327774us-gn-in.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_514_105.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_520_108.jpg,7
