cellent choice for people who pursue quality.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>High Security and Stability:</strong> This table has round corners  which vastly improve the safety of use. The cambered handle is easy to push and pull the drawer  and the protruding part will not scratch the body. These points are crucial for families with young children. The shape is designed in H-shaped which is stable and won’t shake easily.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Easy to Assemble and Clean:</strong> You can easily put all the parts together by following the installation instruction in a short period of time. The chairside table is lightweight so you can move it anywhere you want. Because of the smooth and flat surface  it is easy for you to clean with a duster cloth.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Walnut</li> <li>Material: MDF  rubber wood</li> <li>Size: 13'' x 22'' x 23'' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight: 25 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity :50 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>2 x End table</li> <li>2 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > End & Side Tables,,Size:13'' x 22'' x 23'' (L x W x H); ,End & Side Tables,Clearance,,Walnut,HW61983RE-2,shopify,88,1,deny,manual,139.99,149.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_Contemporar_1766380753973492_224392.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_Contemporar_1766380754826726_664389.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_Contemporar_1766380755631174_548954.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/s/e/Set_of_2_Contemporar_1766380756412464_873997.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5