 The spacious internal storage space under the seat can maximize the use of limited space  which is very suitable for storing toys  blankets  books  clothes  etc. It also comes with a small storage bin that can be adjusted and removed to meet your various needs.<br /><strong>● Comfortable Multifunctional Ottoman:</strong> Filled with a highly elastic sponge and covered with skin-friendly fabric  the upholstered seat brings an excellent sitting experience. This storage chest can be used as a bench or ottoman to release your fatigue  or as a clutter  organizer to keep the space tidy.<br /><strong>● Elegant and Stylish Appearance:</strong> Concise lines  classic color  and Chesterfield-style tufts create a unique charm  making this foldable storage ottoman an eye-catcher no matter where it is placed. It's suitable for the living room  bedroom  entryway  and other places.<br /><strong>● Easy to Assemble and Fold:</strong> Equipped with an instruction manual with intuitive images  you can quickly set up the upholstered storage ottoman in a short time. When not in use  it can be easily folded with little occupied space  which is an ideal storage solution for small spaces.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Dark grey</li> <li>Material: Oxford fabric + MDF + sponge</li> <li>Overall dimension: 31.5" x 16" x 16" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Inner dimension: 30.5" x 14.5" x 14" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Dimension of hanging box: 14" x 8" x 4" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 350 lbs</li> <li>Net weight: 15 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Foldable storage bench</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Entryway > Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,Overall dimension:31.5" x 16" x 16" (L x W x H); Inner dimension:30.5" x 14.5" x 14" (L x W x H); Dimension of hanging box:14" x 8" x 4" (L x W x H); ,Shoe Racks & Storage Benches,,,Dark Gray,HW65882GR,shopify,92,1,deny,manual,49.99,49.99,https://assets.costway.com/med