erior stability and high load-bearing. The folding chair is the best choice for hunting excursions  camping  a car traveling  fishing  tailgating  or the deck.<br /><strong>● Big No-sink Footpads</strong>: What’s more  the dark color of the chair’s cover is suitable for hiding in the wild and waiting for your prey. You can sit on it at any position since it can bear weight up to 330 lbs.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: Steel  fabric</li> <li>Overall Dimension: 22" x 21.5" x 36" （L x W x H）</li> <li>Load capacity: 330 lb</li> <li>Net qeight: 14.5 lb</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes：</li> <li>1 x Hunting chair</li> <li>1 x User's instruction</li> </ul> <p></p>,Costway,Outdoor > Camping > Camping Furniture,,Overall Dimension:22" x 21.5" x 36" ï¼L x W x Hï¼; ,Camping Furniture,,,Black,OP70412BK,shopify,606,1,deny,manual,64.99,113.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70412BK/Black_Swivel_Foldable_Mesh_Chair_with_Armrests-1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70412BK/Black_Swivel_Foldable_Mesh_Chair_with_Armrests-2.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70412BK/Black_Swivel_Foldable_Mesh_Chair_with_Armrests-3.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70412BK/Black_Swivel_Foldable_Mesh_Chair_with_Armrests-4.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70412BK/Black_Swivel_Foldable_Mesh_Chair_with_Armrests_size-5.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/o/OP70412BK/Black_Swivel_Foldable_Mesh_Chair_with_Armrests-6.jpg,6,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/prod