12v-2-seater-kids-ride-on-car-with-storage-room-white,12V 2-Seater Ride on Car Truck with Remote Control and Storage Room-White,78345096,https://www.costway.com/12v-2-seater-kids-ride-on-car-with-storage-room.html?piid=9220100&fee=152&fep=17077&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>●  Store kid's favorite toys in a back storage box and front engine<br />●  2-Seater design with safety belt  accommodates 2 kids at a time  for sharing pleasure<br />●  2 Optional modes  parental remote control mode  and battery operated mode<br />●  Speed and direction can be controlled by a 2.4G remote control or corresponding switch<br />●  3 Variable speeds in R/C mode  2 forward speeds  and 2 reverse speeds in B/O mode<br />●  Feel free to move forward or backward<br />●  Built-in music and story for a happy driving experience  USB  TF interface for more choices<br />●  Bright LED lights light up the dark surroundings and add more driving fun<br />●  Spring suspension equipped on rear wheels enables a smooth drive<br />●  Soft start and stop free your kids from potential danger caused by rapid speed<br />●  Suitable for different kinds of ground  such as the wood floor  asphalt roads  brick roads  etc<br />●  Equipped with a humanized handle to help you pull the car with ease<br />●  Tips: There are two boxes in total. Please wait patiently for both boxes delivered before the assembly</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● 2 Kids Drive Together for Endless Fun:</strong> There are 2 wide seats to accommodate 2 kids at a time so that kids can share driving fun together. Meanwhile  it is equipped with a safety belt and handrail  intended to provide protection for kids. Higher bearing capacity leaves you no worry about driving safety as well.<br /><strong>● Remote Control & Battery Operated Mode:</strong> Rechargeable ride on car enables your kids to enjoy a realistic driving experience by means of the power button  forward/reverse switch  high/low speed switch (2 forward speeds and 2 reverse speeds) and foot pedal. It also comes with a 2.4G remote control that allows parents to control moving direction and 3 variable modes.<br /><strong>● Multiple Functions Cheer up Kids:</strong> Bright LED lights and loud horns add more fun while the dynamic music boosts their vigor. Besides  there is a USB interface  TF slot  and AUX port  designed to provide a great number of music your kids prefer. Meanwhile  kids can store their favorite toys in the back storage box and front engine when they go outside.<br /><strong>● Steady Driving Experience:</strong> The rear wheels of this ride-on car adopt a shock absorber spring  minimizing the shock feeling and ensuring smooth driving. More  it is worth mentioning that its soft start and stop are capable of protecting kids from danger caused by too fast speed. Openable and lockable doors enable kids to get on and off easily.<br /><strong>● Anti-Slip Wheels Ride on Different Roads:</strong> The ride-on car is equipped with 4 wheels which feature excellent wear resistance and slip resistance so that your kids can drive it on all sorts of ground. Brick roads  asphalt roads  wood floors  plastic runways  and more are permissible.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: White/Red/Black/Pink</li> <li>Material: PP  iron</li> <li>Dimension: 48.5" x 31.5" x 31.5" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Seat Width: 19"</li> <li>Speed: 2.5-4 km/h</li> <li>Battery: 12 V 7 AH</li> <li>Charging output: 15 V 1000MA</li> <li>Net weight: 52 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 110 lbs</li> <li>Recommended age: 3+</li> <li>Box QTY: 2(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Ride on car</li> <li>1 x Remote control</li> <li>1 x Charger</li> <li>1 x User manual</li> </ul>,Costway,Toys & Hobbies > Ride On Toys > Powered Ride On Toys,,Dimension:48.5" x 31.5" x 31.5" (L x W x H); ,Powered Ride On Toys,Drop Price,,White,TQ10152US-WH+,shopify,788,1,deny,manual,199.99,254.99,https://assets.costway.com/med