steel-safety-toilet-rail-with-created-fixable-clamp,Steel Safety Toilet Rail with Created Fixable Clamp,68349217,https://www.costway.com/steel-safety-toilet-rail-with-created-fixable-clamp.html?fee=152&fep=17152&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>● Premium carbon steel pipe forms a stable frame</p> <p>● Adjustable height and width can be adapted to toilets of different sizes</p> <p>● Clips that can rotate 360° on both sides and the additional bandage can fit close to the side of the toilet</p> <p>● Soft and comfortable armrests absorb sweat and protect the palm</p> <p>● Sturdy structure allows it to withstand up to 300lbs</p> <p>● Tool-free installation  ready to use after deployment</p> <p>● Detailed instruction is convenient for you to install it in the bathroom</p> <p>● It can help the elderly  the disabled  and recovered patients to sit or stand easily</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Adjustable Height and Width:</strong> In order to adapt to the different size of the toilet  we designed this armrest to be adjustable. By adjusting different gears  you can get toilet armrests of different heights (25''-30'') and widths (22.5''/24.5''). In addition to being placed next to the toilet this handrails can also be used for squatting toilets.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>360° Rotating Anti-slip Clip:</strong> The bathroom safety rail has clips that can rotate 360° on both sides. By adjusting the angle and tightness of the clip  this armrests can be stably fixed next to the toilet without the risk of rollover.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>In Sitting and Rising:</strong> The free-standing bathroom safety rail can provide stable support and great convenience for users who need to use the toilet. The toilet armrests can help the elderly  the disabled  recovered patients or people with temporary mobility difficulties to sit or stand easily.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Sturdy Frame and High Load-bearing Capacity:</strong>