seat of this lounge chair is durable and comfortable. You will never feel sultry even in the midst of summer  which is perfect for outdoor use. Curved armrests and removable head pillow can provide you with better support.</li> <li><strong>Smooth Lockable Tilt System:</strong> This zero gravity chair is equipped with upgraded reclining locking system  which has a rotary knob for you to lock the position. Coming with the infinite regulation  you can lock the chair in any position you like. The seat tilts slightly and it forms a perfect angle with backrest  which can make you feel much more relaxed.</li> <li><strong>Foldable Design for Convenient:</strong> Thsi rattan zero gravity chair can be folded into a compact size when not in use  which occupies little space of your home. Because of the lightweight design  it is convenient for you to put this lounge chair to the trunk when you go out to enjoy leisure time with your family members.</li> <li><strong>No Assembly Needed & Easy Maintenance:</strong> This reclining chair is pre-installed so it doesn’t need to be assembled by yourself  which saves a lot of trouble. And the outdoor lounge chair requires less maintenance because of the premium rattan and steel materials.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color of steel: Black</li> <li>Color of rattan: Mix brown</li> <li>Material: Steel + rattan</li> <li>Net weight of each chair: 17 lbs</li> <li>Dimension of lounge Chair: 32~61” x 25.5” x 34~43.5” (L x W x H)</li> <li>The folding size of chair: 36'' x 25.5'' x 5.5'' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Weight capacity of lounge chair: 330 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>2 x Zero gravity lounge chair</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor & Patio Furniture > Outdoor Seating & Patio Chairs > Outdoor Chaise Lounges,,Dimension of lounge Chair:32~61” x 25.5” x 34~43.5” (L x W x H); The folding size of chair:36'' x 25.5'' x 5.5'' (L x W x H); ,Outdoor Chaise Lounges,Clearance,,Light 