30-inch-square-propane-gas-fire-pit-table-ceramic-tabletop,30 Inch Square Propane Gas Fire Pit Table Ceramic Tabletop,65842917,https://www.costway.com/30-inch-square-propane-gas-fire-pit-table-ceramic-tabletop.html?fee=152&fep=17201&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<ul> <li>● Made of the sturdy steel frame to ensure durability and stability</li> <li>● CSA-certified regulator and ETL-certified fire pit table</li> <li>● 50 000 BTU heat output can provide sufficient heat outdoors</li> <li>● Decorative lava rocks included can make the flame more evenly</li> <li>● Adjustable foot pads ensure extra stability</li> <li>● The 2-in-1 function can be used as a fire pit table or coffee table</li> <li>● The ignition device easily regulates the flame</li> <li>● Door with magnetic clasp to hide the internal space</li> <li>● Weather-resistant PVC cover for better storage</li> <li>● Ceramic tabletop and simulated rattan stripes increase aesthetics</li> <li>● Easy to assemble  detailed instructions will be provided</li> <li>● Ideal for your backyard  garden  balcony  etc</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Warm and Romantic Bonfire Experience:</strong> Unlike the traditional fire pit using firewood  this fire pit table uses propane gas to provide stable and clean combustion  which can protect you from ash and smog. Besides  equipped with a burner and lava rocks that can output 50 000BTU of heat  it can provide you with plenty of warmth and create a romantic bonfire atmosphere.<br /><strong>● Safe and Convenient Operation:</strong> This fire pit table is ETL certified  and the regulator is CSA certified  which can ensure your safety when using it. More  the propane stove can be stored inside the table with the magnetic clasp door. There is a fixing ring at the bottom for safe fixing. Also  the easy-to-operate ignition device is convenient to switch control and adjust the flame.<br /><strong>● Durable Materials for Outdoor Use:</strong> T