folding-garden-kneeler-and-seat-bench,Folding Garden Kneeler and Seat Bench,01798645,https://www.costway.com/folding-garden-kneeler-and-seat-bench.html?fee=152&fep=17203&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<ul> <li>● 2-in-1 design enables you to use it either as a garden kneeler or a garden seat bench</li> <li>● Soft EVA kneeling pad will reduce pressure on your knees</li> <li>● Handles offer excellent support for kneeling down or standing up</li> <li>● The heavy-duty steel frame ensures its durability and stability</li> <li>● 2 detachable tool pouches allow you to keep tools within reach</li> <li>● Easy to store and carry with its folding design and lightweight</li> <li>● Perfect gift for those enthusiastic gardeners</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>●<strong> Practical Gardening Aid with Dual Purpose:</strong> This versatile kneeler can be flipped over to convert it into a seat that allows you to prune branches comfortably or take a break when getting tired. Additionally  you can also lay it flat on the ground as a supportive kneeling pad to weed or plant flowers.<br />● <strong>Soft Foam Padded Cushion for Ultimate Comfort:</strong> Coming with an ultra-soft EVA foam pad  this garden kneeler will reduce pressure on your knees when kneeling and keep you away from dirt and grass stains. When you are sitting and gardening  the foam-padded cushion will keep you comfortable for long periods of time.<br />● <strong>Heavy-duty Steel Frame:</strong> Supported by a heavy-duty steel frame  this foldable garden kneeler is strong enough to bear a maximum weight of 260 lbs. No more do you need to put your palms on the grass to stand up. The sturdy metallic frame not only endows it with great strength and durability but also provides you with firm handles for kneeling down or standing up.<br />● <strong>Convenient Tool Pouches:</strong> This garden kneeler is equipped with 2 detachable tool pouches. Each tool pouch has 3 small pockets  which are very convenient to keep your tools within reach. You can use them to store clippers  spades  trowels  seeds  and others. Besides  the detachable design allows you to take pouches down anytime  which is also easy to clean.<br />● <strong>Foldable and Lightweight Design:</strong> Thanks to the handy folding design  this garden kneeler can be folded flat in just a blink. With a folded size of 23"(L) x 11"(W) x 5"(H)  you can easily tuck the kneeler in tight spaces to save space. Moreover  the weight of 6 lbs is light enough for you to carry it anywhere.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Green</li> <li>Material: EVA Foam + Steel</li> <li>Net weight: 6 lbs</li> <li>Overall dimension: 23" x 11" x 20"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Folded size: 23" x 11" x 5"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Size of cushion: 16" x 6"(L x W)</li> <li>Weight capacity: 260 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Garden kneeler</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Garden > Garden Tools,,Overall dimension:23" x 11" x 20"(L x W x H); Folded size:23" x 11" x 5"(L x W x H); Size of cushion:16" x 6"(L x W); ,Garden Tools,Bestseller,,Green,GT3510,shopify,1924,1,deny,manual,42.99,42.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/o/folding_garden_kneeler_seat-1_1.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/o/folding_garden_kneeler_seat-2_1.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/o/folding_garden_kneeler_seat-3_1.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/o/folding_garden_kneeler_seat-4_1.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/f/o/folding_garden_kneeler_seat_size-5_1.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/