  it is very easy to match with different types of beds or sofa. This design can also create a tilt by fixing 2 sides of the bed at different heights  making it safer to feed your baby without spilling milk.</li> <li><strong>Convenient for Baby Care:</strong> Smooth zipper makes it effortless for parents to drop down the sidebar. With a fastening belt  the baby crib will connect tightly with adults’ beds  allowing parents to care for the baby at night. The visible mesh also helps parents check the condition of the baby at any time. With a carrying bag  it is easy to store and carry.</li> <li><strong>Stable Structure & High Load Bearing:</strong> The supporting frame beneath the bed is made of iron while the side bracket is made of aluminum alloy  making it more stable and less likely to be damaged. It is also not easy to be out of shape  thus holding the baby under the weight of 20 lbs. The bottom of the retractable feet have wheels for easy movement.</li> <li><strong>Enjoyment at Sleeping Time:</strong> A toy rack and a music box have been attached to the baby crib  bringing much fun for the baby. Toys can help your baby practice grasping  while the music box with light and soothing vibration can ease baby into sleep without nursing and improve the cognitive ability of the baby.</li> <li><strong>Cozy Sleeping Space:</strong> The spacious inner sleeping space with a soft and comfortable padded mattress is the essential point of good night sleep. Peach skin fabric with the thick sponge and brushed fabric outside all make it a comfortable room for sound sleep. And it has ASTM and CPSIA certification and is safer to use.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Light grey  dark grey</li> <li>Material: Iron + aluminum alloy + polyester peach skin + oxford fabric + sponge + MDF board</li> <li>Overall size: 38'' x 28'' x 27'' - 33.5'' (L x W x H)</li> <li>Carrying bag size: 37.5" x 19.5" x 6" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Adjustable height: 27”  29.5”  31.5”  33.5