tered bar stool is equipped with an ergonomic footrest to provide a place to rest your feet.</li> <li><strong>Reinforced Metal Frame & Floor Protection:</strong> Made of powder-coated steel frame  the armless bar stools are sturdy and antirust for long-term use. It can withstand up to 265 lbs without wobbling. Moreover  non-slip footpads will effectively prevent the stools from overturning while protecting your floor from scratches.</li> <li><strong>Rustic Style for Versatility:</strong> With clean line and classic color  the set of 2 bar height stools can blend perfectly with various types of furniture. Vintage-inspired look will add a touch of elegance and fashion. The set is suitable for kitchen  bar  restaurant  bistro  coffee shop  etc.</li> <li><strong>Easy to Assemble:</strong> This set of 2 bar stools come with a clear and brief instruction  which has straight forward illustrations and descriptions. Each screw and part has its own code to let you easily understand the assembly progress  taking you little time and energy.</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Brown</li> <li>Material: Sponge  faux suede  steel</li> <li>Overall dimension: 19" x 18.5" x 40"(L x W x H)</li> <li>Seat height: 30"</li> <li>Weight capacity: 265 lbs</li> <li>Net weight: 29 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>2 x Bar stools</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Kitchen & Dining > Bar Stools,,Overall dimension:19" x 18.5" x 40"(L x W x H); ,Bar Stools,,,Brown,HW66387GD-2,shopify,36,0,deny,manual,129,218,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW66387GD-2/Set_of_2_Bar_Stool_Faux_Suede_Upholstered_Chairs_for_dining_room-2.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/h/HW66387GD-2/Set_of_2_Bar_Stool_Faux_Suede_Upholstered_Chairs_for_kitchen-6.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media