e mattress  and other odds and ends to keep your room tidy. In addition  the sweeping robot can pass under the bed without any obstacles.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>No Box Spring Needed:</strong> Featuring 12 sturdy metal slats  our bed frame eliminates the need for a box spring and can perfectly fit for latex  memory foam  and many other types of mattresses. Firmly fixed by screws  the slats can effectively prevent the mattress from sagging and will not make noise when you turn over.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Simple & Modern Design:</strong> Abandoning the complicated decoration  our bed frame adopts concise lines and classic finish to create a simple and stylish appearance. It can complement each other with a variety of decoration styles and add a unique charm to your bedroom.<br /><strong><strong>● </strong>Easy Assembly & Maintenance:</strong> With clear assembly instructions and all hardware provided  it is easy to set up your bed frame within a short time. The smooth surface reduces the accumulation of dust and you only need to wipe it with a soft rag when necessary.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black  silver</li> <li>Material: Steel</li> <li>Overall dimension: 77.5” x 41” x 35.5” (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 26 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 220 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Bedframe</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Bedroom > Beds & Bed Frames > Simple Bed Frame,,Overall dimension:77.5” x 41” x 35.5” (L x W x H); ,Simple Bed Frame,Clearance,,Black,HU10413DK,shopify,144,0,deny,manual,54.99,54.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/w/Twin_Size_Metal_Bed__1781240614143706_906731.jpeg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/t/w/Twin_Size_Metal_Bed__1781240614985171_347016.jpeg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog