ecorations  and a beautiful Halloween Christmas tree is finished.<br />● <strong>Sturdy Metal Stand:</strong> Compared with another cheap plastic base  the reinforced metal stand will provide the tree with greater support and ensure good stability. A foldable X-shaped stand can keep the tree standing upright and prevent the tree from falling. And non-slip foot pads can protect the floor from scratches.<br />●<strong> Simple and Unlit Tree:</strong> This is a Halloween Christmas tree with only branches and leaves that it has no lights or no extra decorations. You can use your imagination and unite your family and friends together to decorate the Christmas tree  which is more meaningful and impressive.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: PVC  Iron</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 3.7' x 6' (Dia x H)</li> <li>Number of tips: 1036</li> <li>Net weight: 16.8 lbs</li> <li></li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Halloween christmas tree</li> <li>1 x Metal stand</li> <li>1 x Instruction</li> </ul>,Costway,Decor > Holiday Decor > Christmas > Christmas Tree,,Overall dimensions:3.7' x 6' (Dia x H); ,Christmas Tree,,,Black,CM22824,shopify,24,0,deny,manual,59.99,59.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/4/_/4_383_32.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_366_20.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_407_32.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/1/11_212_52.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_384_30.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_300_20.jpg,6,https:/