inflatable-water-park-mighty-bounce-house-with-pool,Inflatable Water Park Mighty Bounce House with Pool and 780W Blower,54371980,https://www.costway.com/inflatable-water-park-mighty-bounce-house-with-pool.html?fee=152&fep=17370&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>It is time to cool down and have fun as summer is coming.</p> <p> </p> <p>The inflatable water park makes it possible to let kids enjoy infinite water fun without going to the amusement park. Share such fun with friends and neighbors' kids in your backyard. Quick inflation with a blower in minutes leaves you no worry about how to inflate it  and use a carrying bag to store deflated slide when not in use. Needless to say  the water cannon  large splashing pool  super tall slide and interesting climbing wall are sure to be kids' summer favorites. Let them run and slide through the water. It also adopts a so cute octopus style that kids will fall in love with it. And kids’ safety is first. That’s why it adopts high-quality 420D oxford cloth  which is certificated by ASTM  ensuring higher reliability.</p> <p> </p> <p>Bring it home to delight your kids all summer long!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Water cannon  splashing pool and sprinklers for an enjoyable water time</li> <li>Either wet or dry use as per your kids' preference</li> <li>780W blower for quick and easy inflation</li> <li>A carrying bag is provided for convenient storage and portability</li> <li>Mesh netting provides safety protection as well as good ventilation</li> <li>Super-tall slides enable kids to experience infinite sliding fun</li> <li>High-quality 420D oxford cloth  with lasting durability and ASTM certification</li> <li>A repair kit solves the problem of leakage for a longer service time</li> <li>Ground stakes and blower stakes for great stability</li> <li>Connect the water hose to the water park fixed with hoops to keep the hose organized</li> <li>The cute and eye-catching octopus design is sure to attract kids</li> <li>Perfect gift for boys and girls to bring them a hint of summer coolness</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p><strong>● Enjoy Infinite Splashing Water Fun:</strong> There are 2 sprinklers at the top of the slides and a water cannon next to the large splashing pool  which definitely brings endless summer fun to your kids during hot days. More  either wet or dry use has its own fun  so that kids can enjoy infinite happiness through 2 playing methods around all year.<br /><strong>● Experience Sliding and Climbing Playfulness:</strong> Designed with double super tall slides and a climbing wall  the inflatable water park enables kids to experience both sliding and climbing playfulness at the same time. Besides  kids can explore the crawl tunnel between the slide and climbing wall while the mesh netting provides maximum ventilation as well as safety protection.<br /><strong>● High-Quality Oxford Cloth for Safe Usage:</strong> Made of high-quality 420D oxford cloth  it lasts through many years of rough use. Its soft and smooth surface protects your children’s skin from damage. With ASTM certification  it ensures your child is 100% safe. Meanwhile  the repair kit provided helps you repair it when in need.<br /><strong>● Quick Inflation and Convenient Storage:</strong> It is fairly easy for you to inflate the castle in minutes. After all  what you need to do is inflate the water park by means of the blower included  connect the water hose and fix the castle with ground stakes. In addition  it comes with a carrying bag that brings much more convenience in storing the deflated castle.<br /><strong>● Cute Octopus Style Attracts Children:</strong> The kid's water park features a cute octopus style that shall attract kids' attention at first sight. Boys and girls are capable of playing in the backyard  park and lawn without going to the amusement park. They will love such a wonderful playing area. A perfect gift for kids  let them cheer the summer full of laughter.</p>