3-tier-side-table-nightstand-with-stable-structure-black,3-Tier Nightstand Sofa Side Table with Baffles and Round Corners-Black,79510624,https://www.costway.com/3-tier-nightstand-sofa-side-table-with-baffles-and-round-corners.html?piid=9220000&fee=152&fep=17471&utm_source=Dropship&utm_medium=Dropship&utm_campaign=Dropship,<p>The multifunctional nightstand is suitable for various rooms that need storage shelves or display space.</p> <p> </p> <p>Made of selected quality and spray-painted finish board  this side table is waterproof with durable construction. Comes with two open compartments  this side table offers enough storage space for flower vase  decorative lamp or various reading materials. Smooth surface of end table prevents children and the elderly from injuring. And it is a perfect decoration with elegant and stylish design. Plus  it is easy to assemble with instructions and required accessories.</p> <p> </p> <p>It is a side table or nightstand for your living room or bedroom!</p> <p> </p> <ul> <li>Premium MDF and reinforced bars assure durability and stability</li> <li>Painted surface is easy to maintain and waterproof</li> <li>3-tier ample space to meet different storage needs</li> <li>Pads at bottom prevents scratching of floor</li> <li>Simple and elegant appearance goes well with home decor</li> <li>Suitable for living room  bedroom  entryway  etc</li> <li>Easy to assemble with instructions</li> </ul><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><p>● <strong>Spacious Storage Space:</strong> Comes with a 3-tier storage compartment  this end table is convenient and easy to organize your daily supplies. Items can be placed on the desktop or on the lower shelves according to your different needs and preferences.<br />● <strong>Multifunctional Side Table:</strong> With its versatile and elegant design  it can be used as a nightstand  an end table  or a side table in your living room  which will be a perfect complement to your home.<br />● <strong>Stable and Durable Structure:</strong> Made of premium and spray-painted finish board  this side table has impeccable wear-resistance  anti-scratch  and waterproof performance. And the boards are connected to anti-rust and solid screws  which add stability to the side table.<br />● <strong>Easy to Assemble and Clean:</strong> It is provided with clear instructions and the required accessories to shorten installation time and you can easily assemble it by yourself. In addition  a smooth surface is convenient to clean and maintain  so that you can wipe the stain with a damp cloth.<br />● <strong>Considerate and Humanized Design:</strong> There are two bars on the side not only to prevent things from falling over the shelves but also to ensure a stable side table structure. There are several pads at the bottom of the side table to protect the floor from scratching.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Black</li> <li>Material: MDF</li> <li>Overall dimension: 16" x 16" x 24" (L x W x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 17 lbs</li> <li>Weight capacity: 45 lbs</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x Nightstand</li> <li>1 x User guide</li> </ul>,Costway,Furniture > Living Room > End & Side Tables,,Overall dimension:16" x 16" x 24" (L x W x H); ,End & Side Tables,Clearance,,Black,HW65689BK,shopify,61,1,deny,manual,49.99,54.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/2/_/2_685_77.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/5/_/5_630_33.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/b/k/bk_20.jpg,3,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/9/_/9_548_103.jpg,4,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_674_147.jpg,5,https://assets.costway.com/me