 />● <strong>Durable Material:</strong> The sturdy powder-coated aluminum pole prevents the offset umbrella from being rusted or scratched. The durable cover top is made of water-  UV-  and fade-resistant polyester fabric  which can prolong the service life.<br />● <strong>360° Rotation and Effortless Adjustment:</strong> You can turn the pole according to your preferred position by stepping on the bottom pedal. Besides  the hand-crank lift and easy-tilt system offer the convenience to adjust the shade at different angles.<br />● <strong>Dual Wind Vent and Large Shade Area:</strong> The dual wind vent design at the top of the large diameter umbrella keeps the air flowing  so you can feel more comfortable when sitting under the large shaded area.<br />● <strong>Installation and Notice:</strong> The detachable pole makes it easy to set up and store in a short time. This umbrella comes with a cross base  but it works better with a base weight stand. You also can lay sandbags  blocks or concrete onto the base to add more strength to the base.</p><p style="margin-top:15px;"></p><ul> <li>Color: Beige/tan/orange/burgundy</li> <li>Material: Steel  aluminum  polyester fabric</li> <li>Overall dimensions: 10'' x 7.5'' (L x H)</li> <li>Net weight: 30 lbs</li> <li>Number of ribs: 8</li> <li>Number of lights: 24</li> <li>Box Qty: 1(May vary by batch)</li><li>Package includes:</li> <li>1 x 10 ft solar powered offset umbrella with cross base</li> </ul>,Costway,Outdoor > Outdoor Shades > Outdoor Umbrellas,,Overall dimensions:10'' x 7.5'' (L x H); ,Outdoor Umbrellas,Clearance,,Blue,OP70282BL,shopify,537,1,deny,manual,104.99,104.99,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/6/_/6_384_28.jpg,1,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/3/_/3_410_30.jpg,2,https://assets.costway.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/thumbnail/530x/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/1/_/1_